<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PSA" style="id">- MAALE Full Bible</book>
  <para style="h">ዓይኑሞ ማፃኣፖ</para>
  <para style="toc1">ዓይኑሞ ማፃኣፖ</para>
  <para style="toc3">ዓይኑ.</para>
  <para style="toc2">ዓይኑሞ ማፃኣፖ</para>
  <para style="mt1">ዓይኑሞ ማፃኣፖ</para>
  <para style="imt">ዓይፆ ካሮ</para>
  <para style="ip">ሃና ዓይኑሞ ማፃኣፓ ጌኤዦ ማፃኣፖ ጋራ ዓኣ ማፃኣፖይዳፓ ቢያ ዺቢ ዓይሢ ዓኣ ዳልጊ ማፃኣፔኬ። ዬይ ሚርጌ ዓይኑማ ፔቴ ዓሲ ፔኤሮ፥ ጊንሣ ሃሣ ፔቱሞና ዓይናዻያ ሃሣ ናባባያኬ።</para>
  <para style="ip">ሃኖ ማፃኣፔሎ ጋራ ፄኤታና ዶንጊንታሚና ዓይኑሞ ዓኣኔ። ዬያ ዓይኑሞ ባሼሢ ፃኣፔሢ ካኣቲ ዳውቴኬ። ዬያ ዓይኑሞ ዎላ ቡኩሲ ጊኢጊሻኒ ሚርጌ ዎዴ ዔኬያ ማዓዛ ዒስራዔኤሌ ዴራ ፆኦሲ ካኣሽካ ዳምቦኮ ዬይ ኮሺ ኮይሳያ ማዔኔ። ዬያ ዓይኑሞፓ ፔቴ ፔቴ ዓይኑማ ዎዚጉዴ ዓንጋሞና፥ ሃሣ ዎዚም ዓይናዺንታንዳቴያ ዓይኑሞ ዓይናዻ ዓሶኮ ሱኡጋሢም ዬይ ፔኤሮ ዔርዛኔ። ኮኦኪንሢና ዓይኑሞ ማፃኣፖ ዓይሢ ዖይዶና ዖይዲታሚ ዶንጎናይዳ ዛጋኒ ዳንዳዓኔ። ዬያቶ ዓይኑሞይዳ ፆኦሲ ሄርሺሢ፥ ጋላቲሢ፥ ጉሙርቂሢ፥ ሃጊ ማዓ ዎዛ ጌሥሢ፥ ዻቢንቲ ማዺንቴ ጎሜ ዛላ ዖዪሢ፥ ፆኦሲኮ ጉሙርቂንታያ ማዒፆንታ ዒ ማኣዳ ማኣዲፆንታ፤ ዬያጉዴ ዼኤፒ ዼኤፒ ማዔ ጌኤዦ ማፃኣፖ ማሊፃ ዓኣያ ማዔኔ።</para>
  <para style="ip">ዬያ ዓይኑሞኮ ዼኤፖ ማሊፃ ዓሲ ፆኦሲ ዒናፓ ጉሙርቃንዳጉዲኬ፤ ዬያ ዓይኑሞ ፃኣፔ ዓሳ ፆኦሲ ጋላቲሢና፥ ጊንሣ ሃሣ ፔኤኮ ሜታሢያ ዒዛም ኬኤዚሢና ዔያቶኮ ዒኖ ማሊፆ ፔጋሲ ዔርዛኔ።</para>
  <para style="ip">ሚናኣ ዎዶና ዒስራዔኤሌ ዓሳ ዬያ ዓይኑሞ ዱማ ዱማ ጎይሢና ማዾይዳ ፔኤሻኔ፤ ዬይያ፦</para>
  <para style="ip">1. ዓይኑሞ ማፃኣፖኮ ዓይ. 105ይዳ ዓይናዺንቴ ጎይፆ ፆኦሲ ጋላታኒ፤</para>
  <para style="ip">2. ዓይኑሞ ማፃኣፖኮ ዓይ. 13ይዳ ዓይናዺንቴ ጎይፆ ዖዪሢ ዔርዛኒ፤</para>
  <para style="ip">3. ዓይኑሞ ማፃኣፖኮ ዓይ. 1ይዳ ዓይናዺንቴ ጎይፆ ዱማ ዱማ ባኣዚ ዔርዛኒ፤</para>
  <para style="ip">4. ዓይኑሞ ማፃኣፖኮ ዓይ. 72ይዳ ዓይናዺንቴ ጎይፆ ዒስራዔኤሌ ካኣታ ፒዙሞና ዎጋንዳጉዲ ሺኢጲሢሮ፤</para>
  <para style="ip">5. ዓይኑሞ ማፃኣፖኮ ዓይ. 47ይዳ ዓይናዺንቴ ጎይፆ ፆኦሲኮ ቢታንታ ዒ ማዤ ባኮ ቢያኮ ዑፃ ማዔሢ ዔርዛኒ፤</para>
  <para style="ip">6. ዓይኑሞ ማፃኣፖኮ ዓይ. 122ይዳ ዓይናዺንቴ ጎይፆ ዬሩሳላሜ ናሽካያ ማዒፆ ዔርዛኒ፤</para>
  <para style="ip">7. ዓይኑሞ ማፃኣፖኮ ዓይ. 126ይዳ ዓይናዺንቴ ጎይፆ ቦንቾ ኬሊያኣ ቦንቻኒኬ።</para>
  <para style="ip">ጎኔና ሚርጌ ዓይኑሞኮ ማሊፃ ፔቴ ማሊሢዳፓ ዑሣ ማዓኒ ዳንዳዓኔ። ኑ ጎዳ ዬሱስ ኪሪስቶሴ ቃኣሎ ኬኤዜያና፥ ጊንሣ ሃሣ ዱማ ዱማ ባኮ ዔርዜያና ዓይኑሞ ማፃኣፖፓ ዔኪ ዔኪ ሚርጌ ባኣዚ ኬኤዜኔ። ዓኮ ጫኣቁሞ ማፃኣፖ ፃኣፔ ዓሳኣ ሚርጌ ቤስካ ዬያ ዓይኑሞ ዔኪ ዔኪ ፃኣፔኔ። ዬያ ሌሊቱዋንቴ ቤርታዺ ኪሪስቶሴ ጉሙርቂ ዔኬ ዓሳኣ ፆኦሲ ዬሱስ ኪሪስቶሴ ዛሎና ማዼ ኮዦ ባኮ ዬያ ዓይኑሞና ኬኤዚ ኬኤዚ ፆኦሲ ካኣሽኬኔ። ዬያኮ ኮኦኪንሢ ማዓይ ዓይኑሞ ማፃኣፖ ዓይ. 118ኮ ፓይዲ 22ይዳ ዓኣ ማሊፃ ዓኮ ጫኣቁሞ ማፃኣፖይዳ ላሆ ማይንቲ ፃኣፒንቲፆኬ።</para>
  <para style="is2">ማፃኣፔላ ዱማ ዱማ ዓርቄ ባኮ</para>
  <para style="ip">ዓይኑሞ ማፃኣፓ ዻካ ዻካ ቤሲ ዶንጎ ፓቂንታኔ፤ ዬያቶይዳፓ ባሼዞንሢ ጌይፃ ቤርታሶና ላምዓሶ ማዒ ፓቂንቴ ማሊፆ ፃኣፔሢ ካኣቲ ዳውቴኬ። ሃይሣሶ ማዒ ፓቂንቴ ዓይኑሞ ፃኣፔሢ ዓሳኣፔ፥ ሃንጎ ቆሬኬ ጌይንታኔ።</para>
  <para style="ip">ዓይሢ 120—134 ሄላንዳኣና ዓኣ ዓይኑማ ቦንቾ ኬሊ ቦንቺንታኣና ዓይናዺንታ ዓይኑሞኬ። ሃካፓ ዴማ ዓይኑሞ ማፃኣፓ ዻካ ዻካ ዶንጎ ቤሲ ፓቂንቴ ጎይፃ ኬኤዚንታኔ፦</para>
  <para style="io1">ዓይኑሞ ማፃኣፖ ዓይ. 1—41</para>
  <para style="io1">ዓይኑሞ ማፃኣፖ ዓይ. 42—72</para>
  <para style="io1">ዓይኑሞ ማፃኣፖ ዓይ. 73—89</para>
  <para style="io1">ዓይኑሞ ማፃኣፖ ዓይ. 90—106</para>
  <para style="io1">ዓይኑሞ ማፃኣፖ ዓይ. 107—150</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PSA 1"/>
  <para style="ms">ቤርታሳ ፓቂፆ</para>
  <para style="mr">(ዓይኑሞ ማፃኣፖ ዓይ. 1—41)</para>
  <para style="s1">ኮሺ ዓሲና ፑርታ ዓሲናኮ ናንጊ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 1:1"/>ፑርቶ ዓሶ ዞሮ ዋይዙዋኣሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 1:1">ጎሞ ዓሳ ሃንታ ጎይፆ ሃንቱዋኣሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 1:1">ፆኦሲ ባኮ ቦሃ ዓሶና ፔቴ ማዒባኣሢ ዓንጂንቴያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 1:2"/>ዬያ ጉዴ ዓሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 1:2">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳኮ ዎጎና ዎዛዻኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 1:2">ዬያ ዎጎዋ ዋንቶና ሮኦሮና ፔ ዒኖና ማላኔ።<verse eid="PSA 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 1:3"/>ዒዚ፦</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 1:3">ዎዶና ዎዶና ዓኣፒ ዓኣፓያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 1:3">ዒላዣኣ ዲኢኑዋያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 1:3">ዓልቃ ዋኣሢ ዓሽካ ቱኪንቴ ሚሢጉዲ ማዓኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 1:3">ዒዚ ማዻ ባካኣ ቢያ ዒዛም ጊኢጋኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1፡3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 17:8">ዔር. 17፡8</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 1:4"/>ፑርቶ ማዻ ዓሳ ጋዓንቴ ያዺቱዋሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 1:4">ዢባሬ ፒፂ ዔኪ ዓኣዻ ዲልባጉዲኬ።<verse eid="PSA 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 1:5"/>ዬያሮ ፑርቶ ማዻ ዓሳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 1:5">ፆኦሲ ዎጎ ዎጋ ኬሎና ቶላዓኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 1:5">ጎሞ ዓሳኣ ፂሎ ዓሶ ባኣካ ጴዻዓኬ።<verse eid="PSA 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 1:6"/>ፂሎ ዓሳ ሃንታ ጎይፆ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዔራኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 1:6">ፑርቶ ማዻ ዓሶ ጎይፃ ጋዓንቴ ባይሲንታ ባንሢ ዔኪ ዓኣዻያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 1:6"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="PSA 2"/>
  <para style="s1">ፆኦሲ ዶኦሚ ካኣታሤ ካኣቲ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 2:1"/>ዴራ ዓይጎሮ ጉንዱማይ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:1">ዓሳኣ ጌኔ ማዻኒ ዓይጋ ዞርታይ?<verse eid="PSA 2:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 2:2"/>ዓጮ ካኣታ ዔቄኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:2">ዔያቶ ዎይሣ ዓሳኣ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:2">ዒዚ ዶኦሚ ካኣታሤ ካኣቲናም ጌኔ ማዻኒ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:2">ሂዚ ጌይ ዞርቴኔ፦ <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2፡2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 4:25-26">ዳኪ. ማዾ 4፡25-26</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 2:3"/>«ኑና ዔያታ ቱኬ ዓንጎ ዱፆ ቶካፓ ኑ ቲቆም፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:3">ሱዞዋ ዱኡዚ ኑኡኒ ኬኤሮም» ጌዔኔ።<verse eid="PSA 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 2:4"/>ጫሪንጫ፥ ካኣቱሞ ቤዛ ዴዔሢ ዔያቶ ሚኢጫኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:4">ዬያ ዔያቶኮ ፓሡዋ ማሊፆ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ቶኦቻኔ።<verse eid="PSA 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 2:5"/>ሃካፓ ሴካ ዒዚ ፔ ዻጎና ዔያቶ ጎራንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:5">ታሞጉዴ ዻጎና ዔያቶ ዒዚ ዒጊቻንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 2:6"/>«ታኣኮ ዱማዼ ፂዮኔ ዹኮይዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:6">ታኣኒ ዶኦሜ ካኣቲ ታ ካኣታሤኔ» ጋዓንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 2:7"/>«ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ጌዔ ባኮ ዒላቲ ታ ኬኤዛንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:7">ዒዚ ታኣም ሂዚ ጌዔኔ፦</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:7">‹ኔኤኒ ታኣኮ ናዓሢኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:7">ታ ኔና ሃኖ ሾዔኔ፤ <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2፡7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:33">ዳኪ. ማዾ 13፡33</ref>፤ <ref loc="HEB 1:5">ዔብ. 1፡5</ref>፤ <ref loc="HEB 5:5">5፡5</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 2:8"/>ታና ሺኢቄ፤ ዴራ ቢያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:8">ኔ ቢታንቶ ዴማ ዎርቃንዳጉዲ ታ ማሃንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:8">ዓጪ ማዔ ካራና ቢያ ኔ ዴኔ ማዓንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 2:9"/>ዓንጊ ኮኦሎና ኔ ዔያቶ ጳርቃንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:9">ዓጪና ማዢንቴ ሜሄጉዲ ኔ ዔያቶ ጋኣጫንዳኔ› » ጌዔኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2፡9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 2:26-27">ዮሃ. ፆፔዻ 2፡26-27</ref>፤ <ref loc="REV 12:5">12፡5</ref>፤ <ref loc="REV 19:15">19፡15</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 2:10"/>ዒንሢ፥ ካኣታ ማሊ ጶቂሡዋቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:10">ዒንሢ፥ ዓጮ ዎይሣ ዓሳ ዒንሢና ዔሩዋቴ።<verse eid="PSA 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 2:11"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳም ዒጊቹሞና ማዹዋቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:11">ጎጋይቂ ጎጋይቂያኣ ዒዛ ቢታንቶ ዴማ ዎርቁዋቴ።<verse eid="PSA 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 2:12"/>ዻጋ ዒዛኮ ዔኤታንዳሢኮ ቤርታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:12">ዒንሢያ ዒ ባይዙዋንቴ ቤርታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:12">ጎጋይቂ ጎጋይቂ ናዓሢም ዳዲ ባዑዋቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:12">ዒዛ ፑኖ ካይዚ ማሃዞንሢ ቢያ ዓንጂንቴያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 2:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="PSA 3"/>
  <para style="s1">ዳውቴ ፔ ናኣዚ ዓብሴሎሜፓ ቶላኒ ጳሽኬያና ዓይናዼ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="d">ማኣዶሮ ጉቴና ሺኢቂንቴ ሺኢጲሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 3:1"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ሞርካ ታኣኮ ዎዚ ሚርጌዖ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 3:1">ዓኣፒኒ ዓሲ ታ ዑፃ ፑርቱሞና ዔቄዖ!<verse eid="PSA 3:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 3:2"/>ሜርጌ ዓሳ፦ «ፆኦሲ ዒዛ ዓውሲንዱዋሴ» ጌይ ጌይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 3:2">ታ ዛሎ ጌስታኔ።<verse eid="PSA 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 3:3"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ኔኤኒ ታኣኮ ጊቲማሢኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 3:3">ታ ባሻንዳጉዲ ማሂ ቦንቾ ታኣም ዒንጌሢ ኔናኬ።<verse eid="PSA 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 3:4"/>ታኣኒ ዑኡዞ ዼጊዲ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ባንሢ ዒላታኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 3:4">ዒዚያኣ ፔኤኮ ዱማዼ ዹኮ ዑፃ ማዒ ታ ዒላቶ ዋይዛኔ።<verse eid="PSA 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 3:5"/>ታ ላሃኔ፥ ጊንዓኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 3:5">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዋንቶ ቢያ ታና ካፔሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 3:5">ጊንዓስካፓኣ ጊንሣ ታኣኒ ጴጫኔ።<verse eid="PSA 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 3:6"/>ዓጮ ታኣኮ ማንጊ ዓኣ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 3:6">ፓይዲንቱዋ ታ ሞርኮ ታኣኒ ዒጊጩዋሴ።<verse eid="PSA 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 3:7"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ዔቄ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 3:7">ታ ፆኦዛሢዮ! ሙኪ ታና ዓውሴ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 3:7">ታ ሞርኮኮ ባንጋሎ ሜንሤ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 3:7">ዓጮዋ ዔያቶኮ ኬይሴ።<verse eid="PSA 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 3:8"/>ዓሲ ዓውሳይ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 3:8">ፆኦሲዮ! ዓንጃ ኔኤሲ ኔ ዴሮም ማዖንጎ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3፡8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 15:13-17:22">2ሳሙ. 15፡13—17፡22</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 3:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="PSA 4"/>
  <para style="s1">ዓይኑሞ ሱኡጋሢ ዓይሣ ጎይፆና ጎኦላና ዓይናዺንታ ዳውቴ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="d">ፆኦሲ ጉሙርቂ ሺኢቂንታ ሺኢጲሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 4:1"/>ታኣኮ ፂሎ ፆኦዛሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 4:1">ታኣኒ ዔኤላ ዎዶና ታኣም ዬሄ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 4:1">ሚርጌና ታ ዋኣያ ዋኣዪፆፓ ታና ሃውሺሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 4:1">ታና ማኣሬ፥ ሺኢጲፆዋ ታኣሲ ዋይዜ።<verse eid="PSA 4:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 4:2"/>ዒንሢ፥ ሃይ ዓሳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 4:2">ዎማ ሄላንዳኣና ታና ዒንሢ ቶኦቻይ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 4:2">ዓይዴ ሄላንዳኣና ፓሡዋ ባኣዚ ዒንሢ ናሽካይ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 4:2">ዎማ ሄላንዳኣናዳዖ ሉኡዙሞ ዒንሢ ኮዓሢ?<verse eid="PSA 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 4:3"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ጉሙርቂንታ ዓሶ ፔኤም ማሂ ዶኦሬሢ ዔሩዋቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 4:3">ዬያሮ ታኣኒ ዒዛ ሺኢቃ ዎዶና ዒዚ ታኣም ዋይዛኔ።<verse eid="PSA 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 4:4"/>ዎዚ ዒንሢ ዻጋዼቴያ ጎሜ ማዺፖቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 4:4">ዒንሢ ላሃ ቤዛ ዓኣዖ ዚቲ ጌይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 4:4">ዒኖ ዒንሢኮ ኮሺ ማሂ ዛጉዋቴ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4፡4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:26">ዔፕ. 4፡26</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 4:5"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳም</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 4:5">ፒዜ ማዔ ዒንጎ ባኣዚ ሺኢሹዋቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 4:5">ዒዛ ጉሙርቁዋቴ።<verse eid="PSA 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 4:6"/>«ዓይጌ ኑና ኮሺ ባኣዚ ዻዋንዳይ?»</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 4:6">ጋዓ ዓሳ ሚርጌኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:6">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 4:6">ኔ ዓኣፖ ካሮ ፖዓ ኑኡም ፖዖንጎ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4፡6 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ኔ ዓኣፖ ካሮ ፖዓ ኑኡም ፖዖንጎ </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ጋዓዞ፦ ዒስራዔኤሌ ዓሳ ፆኦሲፓ ዓንጆ ዴንቃኒ ኮዓዖ ሂዚ ጌይ ሺኢቃ ሺኢጲሢኬ።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 4:7"/>ሜሌ ዓሳ ሃኣኮንታ ዎይኖ ዓኣፖዋ ዴንቃዖ ዎዛዻ ዎዛፓ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 4:7">ኔኤኒ ታ ዒኖ ዎዛሴሢ ባሼኬ።<verse eid="PSA 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 4:8"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 4:8">ኮሺ ናንጊ ታና ናንጊሻሢ ኔናታሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 4:8">ሂርጋ ባኣያ ታ ላሃኔ፥ ጊንዒያ ታ ጊንዓኔ።<verse eid="PSA 4:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="PSA 5"/>
  <para style="s1">ዓይኑሞ ሱኡጋሢ ዓይሣ ጎይፆና ሹሉንጎና ዓይናዺንታ ዳውቴ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="d">ፆኦሲ ማኣዳንዳጉዲ ሺኢቂንታ ሺኢጲሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 5:1"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ታ ዑኡዞ ዋይዜ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:1">ጋርሲና ታ ዚኢሊንቲ ጋዓ ባኮ ዔኬ።<verse eid="PSA 5:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 5:2"/>ታ ካኣቲዮ፥ ታኣኮ ፆኦዛሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:2">ታ ኔና ሺኢቃሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:2">ታና ኔ ማኣዳንዳጉዲ ታ ዒላታ ዒላቶ ዋይዜ።<verse eid="PSA 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 5:3"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:3">ጉቶ ጉቶ ታ ሺኢቃ ሺኢጲፆ ዋይዜ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:3">ኔኤኒ ታኣም ዎዚ ጋዓቴያ ጉሙርቂ ታ ካፓኔ።<verse eid="PSA 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 5:4"/>ኔኤኒ ፑርታ ማዾና ዎዛዻ ፆኦሲቱዋሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:4">ፑርቶ ማዻ ዓሳኣ ኔኤና ዎላ ናንጉዋሴ።<verse eid="PSA 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 5:5"/>ዖቶርቃ ዓሳ ኔ ቤርታ ዔቁዋሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:5">ፑርቶ ማዻ ዓሶዋ ቢያ ኔኤኒ ዒፃኔ።<verse eid="PSA 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 5:6"/>ሉኡዙሞ ጌስታ ዓሶ ቢያ ኔ ባይዛኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:6">ዓሲ ዎዻ ዓሶንታ ጌሻ ዓሶዋ ኔኤኒ ሻኣኪንታኔ።<verse eid="PSA 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 5:7"/>ታኣኒ ጋዓንቴ ኔኤኮ ዼኤፖ ማኣሪፆና ኔ ማኣሪ ጌላንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:7">ኔኤም ዱማዼ ጌኤዦ ማኣሮ ባንሢያ ቦንቾና ታ ዚጋንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 5:8"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ታኣኮ ሚርጌ ሞርኬ ዓኣሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:8">ኔ ፂሉሞና ኔኤኒ ታና ዔኪ ዓኣዼ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:8">ኔ ጎይፆዋ ኔኤኒ ታኣም ኮሼ።<verse eid="PSA 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 5:9"/>ዔያታ ጌስታ ጌኤዞይዳ ጎኑሞ ባኣሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:9">ማሊፆ ዔያቶሲዳ ጌኔ ኩሜያኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:9">ቆርጫ ዔያቶሲ ሲንሢንቲባኣ ዱኡፒ ዔቴጉዲኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:9">ዻንጋ ዔያቶሲያኣ ዓሲ ጌሻያኬ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5፡9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 3:13">ሮሜ 3፡13</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 5:10"/>ፆኦሲዮ! ዔያቶ ዒንሢ ዻቢንቴያኬ ጌዔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:10">ጌኖ ማዻ ዔያቶሲ ዔያቶ ባይዞንጎ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:10">ዔያቶኮ ጎማ ሚርጌሢሮ ዔያቶ ባይዜ።<verse eid="PSA 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 5:11"/>ኔና ፑኖ ካዮ ማሃዞንሢ ቢያ ዎዛዾንጎ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:11">ናንጊና ዔያታ ዒላሾንጎ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:11">ሱንፆ ኔኤኮ ናሽካ ዓሳ ቢያ ዒናፓ ዎዛዻንዳጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:11">ኔኤኒ ዔያቶኮ ጊቲማ ማዒ ካፔ።<verse eid="PSA 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 5:12"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ኔኤኒ ፂሎ ዓሶ ዓንጃኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:12">ኔኤኮ ሚጪንቲፆና ጊቲማ ማዒ ኔ ዔያቶ ዓውሳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 5:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="PSA 6"/>
  <para style="s1">ዓይኑሞ ሱኡጋሢ ዓይሣ ጎይፆና ሳሊ ሻሺ ጎኦላና ዓይናዺንታ ዳውቴ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="d">ሜቶ ዎዴና ሺኢቂንታ ሺኢጲሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 6:1"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ኔ ዻጎና ታና ጎሪፖ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:1">ኔኤኮ ታሞጉዴ ዻጎና ታጊዳ ሜቶ ዓጊፖ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6፡1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 38:1">ዓይኑ. 38፡1</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 6:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 6:2"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ታኣኒ ላኣፓታሢሮ ታና ሚጪንቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:2">ሜጌፃ ታኣኮ ኮልኮልቄሢሮ ሃዳራ ታና ዓውሴ።<verse eid="PSA 6:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 6:3"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:3">ሼምፓሢ ታኣኮ ጉቤ ካራ ባይዚ ሜታዼኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:3">ኔኤኒ ማኣዱዋዖ ዴዓሢ ዎማ ሄላንዳኣናዳይ?<verse eid="PSA 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 6:4"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ጊንሣ ማዒ ታና ዓውሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:4">ኔኤኮ ናንጊና ናንጋ ናሹሞና ታና ፓሤ።<verse eid="PSA 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 6:5"/>ሃይቄ ዓሶይዳፓ ኔና ማሊ ጶቂሣይ ባኣሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:5">ዱኡኪንቴ ቤዛ ዓኣዖ ኔና ጋላታይ ዖናዳይ?<verse eid="PSA 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 6:6"/>ዖዪፆ ሚርጊፆፓ ዔቄያና ታኣኒ ላቤኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:6">ዬኤፓ ታኣኮ ሚርጌሢሮ ዋንቶ ሻኣላ ታኣኮ ዎዓኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:6">ኬራኣ ታኣኮ ማስኪንታኔ።<verse eid="PSA 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 6:7"/>ታ ሞርኮኮ ማኪፃፓ ዔቄያና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:7">ሚርጌ ታ ዬኤኬሢሮ ዓኣፓ ታኣኮ ዴይ ዔቴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:7">ዴንቃኒያ ታኣኒ ዳንዳዑዋሴ።<verse eid="PSA 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 6:8"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዬኤፖ ዒላቶ ታኣኮ ዋይዜሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:8">ዒንሢ ፑርቶ ማዻ ዓሳ ታ ኮራፓ ባይቁዋቴ! <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6፡8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:23">ማቲ. 7፡23</ref>፤ <ref loc="LUK 13:27">ሉቃ. 13፡27</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 6:9"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ሺኢጲፆ ታኣኮ ዋይዜኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:9">ታ ሺኢቄ ሺኢጲፆዋ ዒዚ ዔኬኔ።<verse eid="PSA 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 6:10"/>ሞርካ ታኣኮ ቢያ ቦርሲንታንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:10">ማሊባኣዖ ዻውሲንቲ ጊንሢም ዔያታ ጳሽካንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 6:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="PSA 7"/>
  <para style="s1">ዳውቴ ቢኢኒያሜ ዓሢ ኩዛ ዛሎ ፆኦሲም ዓይናዼ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="d">ፒዚ ዎጌ ዎጊንታንዳጉዲ ሺኢቂንቴ ሺኢጲሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 7:1"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ማዔ ታ ፆኦዛሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:1">ኔኤኒ ታኣኮ ዓኣሺንቲ ቶሎ ካያሢኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:1">ታና ዳውሳ ዓሶ ቢያሢፓ ማኣዲ ዓውሴ።<verse eid="PSA 7:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 7:2"/>ኔኤኒ ዬያይዲባኣያ ማዔቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:2">ዔያታ ታና ዓዳ ዞቢጉዲ ሾኦላንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:2">ዓውሳ ዓሲባኣ ቤስካ ዳርዚ ታና ዔያታ ላኣላንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 7:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3-4" style="v" sid="PSA 7:3-4"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ማዔ ታ ፆኦዛሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:3-4">ፔቴ ዓሲምታዎ ፑርታ ባኣዚ ታ ማዼቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:3-4">ታ ላጋሢ ታኣም ማዼ ኮዦ ባኮ ዛሎ ፑርታ ማዺ ታ ማሄቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:3-4">ታ ሞርካሢ ዚቲ ጋዓዖ ታኣኒ ቡሬያ ማዔቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:3-4">ዬያ ባኮ ቢያይዳፓ ፔቴማታዎ ታ ማዼያታቴ፥<verse eid="PSA 7:3-4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 7:5"/>ታ ሞርካሢ ዳውሲ ታና ዓርቆንጎ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:5">ሲላሎይዳ ኮላሲ ቦንቾ ታኣኮ ባይዞንጎ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:5">ዒዚ ታና ዎዎዾንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 7:6"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ኔ ዻጎና ዔቄ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:6">ታ ሞርኮኮ ዻጎ ኔኤኒ ባይዜ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:6">ዎጋ ፒዜ ማዓንዳጉዲ ኔኤኒ ዓይሤ ጎይፆና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:6">ታና ማኣዳኒ ዔቄ።<verse eid="PSA 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 7:7"/>ሜሌ ዴሮ ኔ ባንሢ ቡኩሲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:7">ዑፃ ዔያቶኮ ካኣቲ ማዒ ዎይሤ።<verse eid="PSA 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 7:8"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ሜሌ ዴሮ ዑፃ ዎጋኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:8">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ታ ፂሉሞጉዴያ ታኣም ዎጌ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:8">ዼኤፖ ፆኦዛሢዮ! ታ ፒዙሞጉዴያ ታኣም ዒንጌ።<verse eid="PSA 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 7:9"/>ዓሲኮ ዒኔና ማሊሢና ዛጋ ፂሎ ፆኦዛሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:9">ፑርቶ ዓሶኮ ዋይዞ ዒፂፆ ባይዜ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:9">ፂሎ ዓሶ ጋዓንቴ ኔኤኒ ካፔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7፡9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 2:23">ዮሃ. ፆፔዻ 2፡23</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 7:10"/>ታኣኮ ጊቲማሢ፥ ዼኤፖ ፆኦዛሢኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:10">ዒኖ ፒዜ ዓሶ ዒዚ ዓውሳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 7:11"/>ፆኦሲ ፂሎ ዎጌ ዎጋያኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:11">ዻጎዋ ፔኤሲ ኬላ ኬላ ፔጋሲ ዻዋያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 7:12"/>ዓሲ ፔኤኮ ጎሞ ቡኡፂ ሃሹዋያ ማዔቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:12">ዒዚ ጬንቾ ዓፓሮ ፔኤሲ ዋርቃኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:12">ሂኢዦዋ ፔኤኮ ዓኣሣኔ።<verse eid="PSA 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 7:13"/>ዒዚ ፔኤኮ ዎዻ ዖሎ ዓንጋሞ ኮሻኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:13">ታሚጉዲ ዔኤታ ሂኢዦዋ ጊኢጊሻኔ።<verse eid="PSA 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 7:14"/>ፑርቱሞ ማሊ ማሊ ዓኣ ዓሲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:14">ጌኔ ማዾ ጎጳዺ፥ ሉኡዙሞ ሾዓኔ።<verse eid="PSA 7:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 7:15"/>ሜሌ ዓሲም ኬሴ ዔቴ ቦኦካ ዓሲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:15">ዬያ ዒ ቦኦኬ ዔታ ፔኤሮ ጌላኔ።<verse eid="PSA 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 7:16"/>ዒዚ ማዼ ጌኖ ማዻ ዒዛም ማዓኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:16">ዒ ማዼ ፑርቶ ባካ ዒዛ ቶኦካ ኬዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 7:17"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳኮ ፂሉሞሮ ታ ዒዛ ጋላታንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:17">ዼኤፖ ፆኦዛሢ ሱንፆ ቦንቺ ጋላታ ዓይኑሞ ታ ዓይናዻንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 7:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="PSA 8"/>
  <para style="s1">ዓይኑሞ ሱኡጋሢ ዓይሣ ጎይፆና ሹሉንጎና ዓይናዺንታ ዳውቴ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="d">ፆኦሲ ዼኤፑሞና ዓሲኮዋ ቦንቾ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 8:1"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ማዔ ኑ ፆኦዛሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:1">ሱንፃ ኔኤኮ ሳዖ ቢያይዳ ዼኤፒ ዔርቴያኬ።</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:1">ኔኤኮ ቦንቻኣ ጫሪንጮኮ ዑፃ ማዒ ዼጌኔ።<verse eid="PSA 8:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 8:2"/>ኔ ሞርኮኮ ዻንጎ ባይዛኒ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:2">ዻኮ ናኣቶንታ ዻንፆ ዻንቃ ናኣቶንታ ኔና ጋላታንዳጉዲ ኔ ማሄኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8፡2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 21:16">ማቲ. 21፡16</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 8:3"/>ኔ ማዤ ጫሪንጮ ታ ዛጋኣና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:3">ፔ ቤዛ ቤዛ ኔኤኒ ጌሤ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:3">ዓጊኖንታ ዦኦጋሢንታ ታ ዛጋኣና<verse eid="PSA 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 8:4"/>ኔ ማሊ ጶቂሣንዳጉዲ ዓሲንሢ ዓይጎ ባኣዚዳይ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:4">ሃሣ ኔ ዔያቶ ዛሎ ማላንዳጉዲ ዓሲ ዓይጌንዴዳይ? <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8፡4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 7:17-18">ዒዮ. 7፡17-18</ref>፤ <ref loc="PSA 144:3">ዓይኑ. 144፡3</ref>፤ <ref loc="HEB 2:6-8">ዔብ. 2፡6-8</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 8:5"/>ኪኢታንቻ ዓኣ ጎይፃፓ ዻካሮ ኔ ዔያቶ ኬይሴቴያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:5">ቦንቾና ዼኤፑሞና ኔ ዔያቶም ዒንጌኔ።<verse eid="PSA 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 8:6"/>ኔ ማዤ ባኮኮ ቢያ ዑፃ ማሂ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:6">ዔያቶ ኔኤኒ ዶኦሬኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:6">ቢያ ባኮ ዔያታ ዎይሣንዳጉዲ ኔኤኒ ማሄኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8፡6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 15:27">1ቆሮ. 15፡27</ref>፤ <ref loc="EPH 1:22">ዔፕ. 1፡22</ref>፤ <ref loc="HEB 2:8">ዔብ. 2፡8</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 8:7"/>ማራቶንታ ባኣቶንታ፥ ካዮ ቦዖዋ ዓይሱዋዖ<verse eid="PSA 8:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 8:8"/>ጫሪንጮ ካፖንታ ባዞ ሞላሢንታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:8">ባዞ ዋኣፆ ዴማ ናንጋ ባኮ ቢያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:8">ዔያታ ዎይሣንዳጉዲ ኔኤኒ ማሄኔ።<verse eid="PSA 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 8:9"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ማዔ ኑ ፆኦዛሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:9">ሱንፃ ኔኤኮ ሳዖ ቢያይዳ ዼኤፒ ዔርቴያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 8:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="PSA 9"/>
  <para style="s1">ዓይኑሞ ሱኡጋሢ ዓይሣ ጎይፆና «ናኣዚ ሃይቦና» ጌይ ዓይናዾ ዳውቴ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="d">ፒዜ ዎጋያ ማዔ ፆኦሲም ሺኢካ ጋላታ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 9:1"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ጉቤ ዒናፓ ታ ኔና ጋላታኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:1">ኔኤኮ ዲቃሢ ሄርሺሳ ማዾ ዛሎ ቢያ ታኣኒ ኬኤዛኔ።<verse eid="PSA 9:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 9:2"/>ኔኤና ዔኤቢ ታኣም ኮሽካሢሮ ታ ዎዛዻኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:2">ዼኤፖ ፆኦዛሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:2">ኔ ሱንፆ ጋላታ ዓይኑሞና ታ ሄርሻኔ።<verse eid="PSA 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 9:3"/>ኔኤኒ ፔጋዺ ጴዻኣና ታ ሞርካ ጊንሢም ማዓንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:3">ዹቂንቲ ሎኦሚ ኔ ቤርታፓ ዔያታ ባይቃንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 9:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 9:4"/>ኔኤኮ ካኣቱሞ ዖይቶይዳ ኔኤኒ ዴዒ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:4">ፒዜ ዎጌ ዎጋያኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:4">ታ ጌኤዞዋ ጌስቲ ፒዜና ኔ ታኣም ዎጋንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 9:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 9:5"/>ሜሌ ዴሮ ኔኤኒ ጎሬኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:5">ፑርቶ ማዻ ዓሶዋ ኔ ባይዜኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:5">ሱንፆዋ ኔ ዔያቶኮ ናንጊና ዲርካቺ ባይዜኔ።<verse eid="PSA 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 9:6"/>ሞርካ ኑኡኮ ናንጊና ባይቄኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:6">ካታሞዋ ኔ ዔያቶኮ ዶይሲ ጋፒሴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:6">ማሊ ዔያቶ ጶቂሦ ባኣዚ ባኣያ ማዒ ባይቄኔ።<verse eid="PSA 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 9:7"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ጋዓንቴ ካኣታዺ ናኣናና ናንጋኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:7">ካኣቱሞ ዖይቶዋ ዒኢካ ዴዒ ዎጋኒ ዒዚ ጊኢጊሼኔ።<verse eid="PSA 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 9:8"/>ዓጮም ዒዚ ፂሉሞና ዎጋንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:8">ሜሌ ዴሮዋ ፒዙሞና ዒ ዎይሣንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 9:9"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ሄርቂንቲ ዎርቃ ዓሶም ፑኖ ካይዚኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:9">ሜታሢ ዎዶና ዼጌ ቤዞ ማዒ ዒዚ ማኣዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 9:10"/>ሱንፆ ኔኤኮ ዔራ ዓሳ ኔና ጉሙርቃኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:10">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ኔና ኮዓ ዓሶዋ ኔ ሃሹዋሴ።<verse eid="PSA 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 9:11"/>ፂዮኔይዳ ናንጋ፥ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳም</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:11">ጋላታ ዓይኑሞ ዓይናዹዋቴ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:11">ዒዛኮ ዲቃሢ ሄርሺሳ ማዾዋ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:11">ዴሮ ባኣካ ኬኤዙዋቴ!<verse eid="PSA 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 9:12"/>ሱጉፆ ማሃሢ ዔያቶም ማሌኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:12">ሄርቂንቲ ዎርቃ ዓሶኮ ዒላቶ ዒዚ ዋሊባኣሴ።<verse eid="PSA 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 9:13"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:13">ታኣኮ ሞርካ ታና ሜታሳ ሜቶ ዛጌ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:13">ታኣም ሚጪንቴ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:13">ሃይቦ ቤዛፓኣ ዔኪ ታና ማሄ።<verse eid="PSA 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 9:14"/>ዬያ ኔኤኒ ታኣም ማዼቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:14">ፂዮኔይዳ ዓሳ ቡካ ቤዛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:14">ዼጊዲ ታ ኔና ጋላታንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:14">ኔኤኒ ታና ዓይሴሢሮዋ ታ ዎዛዻንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 9:15"/>ሜሌ ዴራ ፔ ቦኦኬ ዔታ ፔኤሮ ሎኦሜኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:15">ዔያታ ዓኣቺ ፒሬ ፒራሢዳ ቶካ ዔያቶኮ ዓዺንቴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 9:16"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ፒዜ ዎጊሢና ዔርቴያኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:16">ፑርቶ ማዻ ዓሳ ፔኤኮ ፑርቶ ማዾ ፒራሢና ዓዺንቴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 9:17"/>ፑርቶ ማዻ ዓሳ ሃይቄ ዓሶ ዓጮ ዴንዳንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:17">ፆኦሲ ዋሊ ሃሻ ዓሳኣ ቢያ ዒማዒ ማዓንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 9:18"/>ሜታዻ ዓሳ ጋዓንቴ ቢያ ዎዴ ዋሊንቲንዱዋሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:18">ማንቆ ዓሶኮ ሃጊ ማዓ ዎዛኣ ናንጊና ጉሪ ማዒ ዓቱዋሴ።<verse eid="PSA 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 9:19"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ዓሲ ፔ ዶዱሞና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:19">ኔጊዳፓ ዑሣ ዎልቃዻንጉዲ ማሂፖ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:19">ኔኤኒ ዔቄ፥ ሜሌ ዴሮ ዑፃ ኔ ዎጌ።<verse eid="PSA 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 9:20"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:20">ዲቃሣ ባኣዚ ዔያቶ ዑፃ ኬይሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:20">ዔያታ ዓሲ ማዒ ማዢንቴሢያ ኔኤኒ ዔያቶ ዔርዜ።<verse eid="PSA 9:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="PSA 10"/>
  <para style="s1">ፒዜ ዎጌ ዎጊንታንዳጉዲ ሺኢቂንቴ ሺኢጲሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 10:1"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:1">ዓይጎሮ ኔኤኒ ሃያይዲ ሃኪ ዔቄይ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:1">ሜታሢ ዎዶና ዓይጋ ኔ ዓኣሺንታይ?<verse eid="PSA 10:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 10:2"/>ፑርቶ ማዻ ዓሳ ዖቶርቃኔ፥ ማንቆ ዓሶዋ ዔያታ ዳውሳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:2">ሜሌ ዓሶም ዔያታ ፒራ ፒራሢዳ ፔኤሮ ዓዺንቶንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 10:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 10:3"/>ፑርቶ ዓሳ ፔኤኮ ፑርቶ ዓፁሞና ሄርሺንታኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:3">ዔኤቢ ጊዴኔ ጎዑዋ ጎጋይቂ ሺራ ዓሶ ዔያታ ዓንጃኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:3">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዔያታ ጫጫሽካኔ።<verse eid="PSA 10:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 10:4"/>ፑርቶ ማዻ ዓሳ ፆኦሲ ዔኤቢኬ ጎዑዋሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:4">ዔያታ ፔ ዖቶርሙሞና ፆኦሲ ባኣሴ ጌይ ማላኔ።<verse eid="PSA 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 10:5"/>ፑርቶ ዓሶም ዔኤቢ ቢያ ዎዴ ጊኢጋኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:5">ፆኦሲ ዎጎ ዔያታ ዔራኒ ዳንዳዑዋሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:5">ዬያሮ ዒዚ ፔ ሞርኮ ሚሚኢጫኔ።<verse eid="PSA 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 10:6"/>ዔያታ ፔ ማሊፆና፦ «ኑና ዓጊሣንዳይ ባኣሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:6">ዓይጎ ሜታኣ ባኣያ ቢያ ዎዴ ኑ ዎዛዻንዳኔ» ጋዓኔ።<verse eid="PSA 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 10:7"/>ዔያታ ጌስታ ጌኤዞይዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:7">ጋዳማንታ ሉኡዙሞንታ ዚርቂሢያ ኩሜያኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:7">ጌኔ ባኣዚንታ ፑርቱሞዋ ዔያቶ ዻንጋኬ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10፡7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 3:14">ሮሜ 3፡14</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 10:8"/>ጉርዶኮ ጎይፆ ዓጫ ካቲ ዔያታ ዴዓኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:8">ፂሎ ዓሶዋ ዉቱንቃ ካርካ ዔያታ ዎዻኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:8">ዓኣፓ ዔያቶኮ ማንቆ ዓሶ ፑርቱሞና ዛጋኔ።<verse eid="PSA 10:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 10:9"/>ካይዚዳ ናንጋ ዞቢጉዲ ዓኣሺንቲ ዔያታ ዴዓኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:9">ማንቆ ዓሶ ዓርቃኒ ዒኢካ ካታኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:9">ዔያቶኮ ፒራሢና ዓይሢ ጎቺ ዔያታ ዔካኔ።<verse eid="PSA 10:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 10:10"/>ማንቆ ዓሶ ጳርቂ ዔያታ ኬኤራኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:10">ማኣዳይ ባኣ ላቤ ዓሳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:10">ዔያቶ ኩጮ ጋሮ ጌሊ ሎኦሚ ዓታኔ።<verse eid="PSA 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 10:11"/>ፑርታ ማዻ ዓሲ ፔ ዒኖና፦</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:11">«ፆኦሲ ታና ዋሌኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:11">ዓኣፖ ካሮ ፔኤኮ ካንቂ ታና ዴንቁዋሴ!» ጋዓኔ።<verse eid="PSA 10:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 10:12"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ ዔቄ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:12">ፆኦዛሢዮ ኔኤኮ ዎልቆ ኩጮ ዔቂሴ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:12">ሄርቂንቲ ዎርቃ ዓሶ ዋሊፖ።<verse eid="PSA 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 10:13"/>ፑርቶ ማዻ ዓሳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:13">ፆኦሲ ዑፃ ዓይጋ ፑርታ ጌስታይ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:13">ፔ ዒኖና፦</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:13">«ታ ማዻ ባኮሮ ዒ ታጊዳ ሜቶ ዓጋዓኬ» ዓይጋ ጋዓይ?<verse eid="PSA 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 10:14"/>ፆኦሲዮ! ኔኤኒ ጋዓንቴ ሜቶና ዋኣዮና ዛጊ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:14">ዬያ ሼሌዒሶንዶ ጎይሢ ጊኢጊሻኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:14">ሜታዼ ዓሳ ፔና ኔኤም ሃሻኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:14">ዜኤሮ ናኣቶዋ ኔኤኒ ማኣዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 10:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 10:15"/>ጎሞ ዓሶንታ ፑርቶ ዓሶንታኮ ዎልቆ ላቢሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:15">ሃካፓ ሴካ ፑርታ ባኣዚ ዔያታ ማዹዋጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:15">ዔያታ ማዻ ፑርቶ ማዾሮ ሜቶ ዔያቶይዳ ዓጌ።<verse eid="PSA 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 10:16"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ካኣቲ ማዒ ናኣናና ናንጋኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:16">ሜሌ ፆኦዞም ዚጋ ሜሌ ዴራ ጋዓንቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:16">ሳዖይዳፓ ጋፒ ባይቃንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 10:17"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:17">ኔኤኒ ማንቆ ዓሶኮ ሺኢጲፆ ዋይዛኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:17">ዔያታ ሺኢቃ ሺኢጲፆ ዋይዚ ኔ ዔያቶ ዶዲሻኔ።<verse eid="PSA 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 10:18"/>ሳዖይዳ ዓሲ ማዒ ማዢንቴ ዓሲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:18">ሜሌ ዓሶ ዲቃሡዋጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:18">ዜኤሮ ናኣቶንታ ሄርቂንቲ ዎርቃ ዓሶንታ ዛሎ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:18">ኔኤኒ ሞኦታኔ።<verse eid="PSA 10:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="PSA 11"/>
  <para style="s1">ዓይኑሞ ሱኡጋሢ ዓይሣ ጎይፆና ዓይናዺንታ ዳውቴ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="d">ፆኦሲ ጉሙርቂሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 11:1"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ታኣኮ ፑኖ ካያሢኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 11:1">ዓካሪ ዒንሢ ታኣኮ ሼምፔሎ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 11:1">«ካፒጉዲ ዹኮ ባንሢ ባራኒ ዓኣሺንቴ» ዓይጎሮ ጋዓዖ?<verse eid="PSA 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 11:2"/>ፑርቶ ማዻ ዓሳ ሃይሾ ቆኦዞ ፔኤኮ ዴንሤኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 11:2">ዒና ፒዜ ማዔዞንሢ ዹሞና ዔያታ ዱካኒ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 11:2">ሂኢዦ ዔያታ ዓኣሤኔ።<verse eid="PSA 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 11:3"/>ፃጲ ማዔ ባካ ዶዓዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 11:3">ፂሎ ዓሲ ዓይጎ ዎኦታኒ ዳንዳዓይ?<verse eid="PSA 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 11:4"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ፔኤኮ ዱማዼ ማኣራ ዓኣኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 11:4">ካኣቱሞ ዖይታ ዒዛኮ ጫሪንጮይዳኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 11:4">ዒዚ ዓሶ ቢያ ዛጋኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 11:4">ጊዥ ጌይ ዛጊፆና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 11:4">ዓሳ ዓይጎ ማዻቴያ ዓኣፓ ዒዛኮ ዴንቃኔ።<verse eid="PSA 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 11:5"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 11:5">ፂሎ ዓሶንታ ጎሞ ዓሶዋ ዎይታቴያ ዛጋኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 11:5">ፑርቱሞ ናሽካ ዓሶ ጋዓንቴ ዒዚ ዒዒፃኔ።<verse eid="PSA 11:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 11:6"/>ዒዚ ፑርቶ ማዻ ዓሶ ዑፃ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 11:6">ታሚ ቄንሢና ሙርቁንሢና ኬይሳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 11:6">ዔያቶም ዓጊንቴ ባካ ታሚጉዲ ሼሼኤላ ዢባሬኬ።<verse eid="PSA 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 11:7"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ፂሎ ማዔሢሮ ፂሉሞ ማዾ ዒ ናሽካኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 11:7">ፒዜ ማዾ ማዻ ዓሲ ቢያ ዒዛኮ ዓኣፖ ካሮ ዛጋንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 11:7"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="PSA 12"/>
  <para style="s1">ዓይኑሞ ሱኡጋሢ ዓይሣ ጎይፆ ሳሊ ሻሺና ዴንሦ ጎኦላና ዓይናዺንታ ዳውቴ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="d">ማኣዶ ዴንቃኒ ሺኢቂንቴ ሺኢጲሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 12:1"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ማኣዴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 12:1">ዓሶ ባኣካ ፔቴታዖ ጉሙርቂንታ ዓሲ ጴዹዋሴ።<verse eid="PSA 12:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 12:2"/>ዎሊም ዔያታ ሉሉኡቃኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 12:2">ላምዖ ዒኔና ማዒ ዎሊ ጌሺ ዔያታ ጌስታኔ።<verse eid="PSA 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 12:3"/>ጌሺሢ ጌሻ ዻንጋንታ ሃይሴ ሚርጊሻ ዒንዲርሲያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 12:3">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ባይዞንጎ!<verse eid="PSA 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 12:4"/>ዔያታ፦ «ኑኡኒ ጌስቲፆና ኮዔ ባኣዚ ዴንቃንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 12:4">ሼኔ ጌዔ ጎይሢያኣ ኑኡኒ ጌስታንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 12:4">ላኣጋኒ ኑና ዳንዳዓሢ ዖናዳይ?» ጋዓኔ።<verse eid="PSA 12:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 12:5"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ጋዓንቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 12:5">«ሜታዼ ዓሳ ካራ ባይዜኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 12:5">ዳውሲንቴ ዓሳኣ ሜታሢ ዺቡሞፓ ዔቄያና ዚኢሊንታኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:5">ዬያሮ ዔያቶ ሄላ ባካፓ ጎኦቢ ቃዛኒ ታ ዔቃንዳኔ» ጋዓኔ።<verse eid="PSA 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 12:6"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳኮ ሃጊ ማዓንዳ ዎዞ ቃኣላ ጉሙርቂንታያኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 12:6">ናኣቦ ታሚዳ ላንካይ ማይንቲ ሼኤሾና ቢራ ዓንጊጉዲ ጌኤሺኬ።<verse eid="PSA 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 12:7"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 12:7">ኔኤኒ ቢያ ዎዴ ኑና ካፔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 12:7">ፑርታ ማዔ ሃያ ዎዶ ዓሶይዳፓ ኔ ኑና ዓውሴ።<verse eid="PSA 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 12:8"/>ፑርታ ማዺሢ ዓሲ ጋላቲሳ ዎዴይዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 12:8">ፑርቶ ማዻ ዓሳ ዖቶርቂ ታኣካኔ።<verse eid="PSA 12:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="PSA 13"/>
  <para style="s1">ዓይኑሞ ሱኡጋሢ ዓይሣ ጎይፆና ዓይናዺንታ ዳውቴ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="d">ማኣዶ ዴንቃኒ ሺኢቂንቴ ሺኢጲሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 13:1"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 13:1">ዎማ ሄላንዳኣና ኔኤኒ ታና ዋላይ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 13:1">ናኣናና ጋፒ ኔ ታና ዋላንዳ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 13:1">ዎማ ሄላንዳኣና ታ ዓኣፓፓ ኔኤኒ ኔና ሺርሻይ?<verse eid="PSA 13:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 13:2"/>ታ ማሊፆና ታኣኒ ሞኦቲንታሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 13:2">ታ ዒኖና ሮኦሮ ጉቤ ታኣኒ ዖያሢ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 13:2">ዓይዲ ሄላንዳኣናዳይ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 13:2">ዓይዲ ሄላንዳኣና ታ ሞርካሢ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 13:2">ታና ባሺ ናንጋንዳይ?<verse eid="PSA 13:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 13:3"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ማዔ ታ ፆኦዛሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 13:3">ሃዳራ ታና ዛጌ፥ ታ ጋዓ ባኮ ዋይዜ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 13:3">ሃይቄያ ማዒ ጊንዒ ታ ዓቱዋጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 13:3">ዶዱሞ ታኣም ዒንጌ።<verse eid="PSA 13:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 13:4"/>ታ ሞርካ፦ «ኑ ዒዛ ባሼኔ» ጌይ ሄርሺንታንዳጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 13:4">ታ ሎኦሚፆና ዔያቶ ዎዛሲፖ።<verse eid="PSA 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 13:5"/>ታኣኒ ኔኤኮ ጋፑዋ ናሹሞ ጉሙርቃኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 13:5">ዒና ታኣኮ ኔ ዓውሴሢሮ ዎዛዻኔ።<verse eid="PSA 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 13:6"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 13:6">ኔኤኒ ታኣም ኮሺ ባኣዚ ማዼሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 13:6">ኔ ቦንቾም ታ ዓይናዻኔ።<verse eid="PSA 13:6"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="PSA 14"/>
  <para style="s1">ዓይኑሞ ሱኡጋሢ ዓይሣ ጎይፆና ዓይናዺንታ ዳውቴ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="d">ዓሲኮ ፑርቱሞ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="PSA 53">ዓይኑ. 53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 14:1"/>ዔኤዮ ዓሳ ፔ ዒኖና፦ «ፆኦሲ ባኣሴ» ጋዓኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:1">ዬያጉዴ ዓሳ ማኣሳኔ ዓሲኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:1">ዔያታ ሻኣካ ማዾ ማዻኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:1">ዔያቶ ባኣኮይዳ ኮሺ ባኣዚ ማዻ ዓሲ ፔቴታዖ ባኣሴ።<verse eid="PSA 14:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 14:2"/>ማሊ ጶቂሣ ዓሲንታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:2">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ኮዓ ዓሲያኣ ዓኣቶ ዴንቃኒ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:2">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ጫሪንጫፓ ሊካ ዓሶ ዛጌኔ።<verse eid="PSA 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 14:3"/>ጋዓንቴ ዓሳ ቢያሢ ዣኣሌኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:3">ጉቤሢ ፔቴ ማዒ ፑርቴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:3">ዔያቶይዳፓ ፔቴ ዓሲታዎ ኮሺ ማዻይ ባኣሴ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14፡3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 3:10-12">ሮሜ 3፡10-12</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 14:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 14:4"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ፦ «ፆኦሲ ዔሪ ሺኢቁዋ ዓሶኮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:4">ታኣኮ ዴሮ ዓዳ ካሣጉዲ ሙዓ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:4">ፑርቶ ማዻ ዓሶኮ ማሊ ጶቂሣ ዒኔ ባኣዓዳ?» ጋዓኔ።<verse eid="PSA 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 14:5"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ፂሎ ዓሶ ባኣካ ዓኣሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:5">ዔያታ ዓኣ ቤዛ ዓኣዖ ዲቃቲ ጋፔኔ።<verse eid="PSA 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 14:6"/>ዒንሢ ማንቆ ዓሶኮ ማሊፆ ዹቃኒ ማሌያታቴያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:6">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ጋዓንቴ ዔያቶኮ ጊቲማሢኬ።<verse eid="PSA 14:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 14:7"/>ዒስራዔኤሌ ዓሶም ዻቂንታ ፂዮኔይዳፓ ሙካቴ ዓይጎ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:7">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ፔ ዴሮኮ ዲዒንቴ ባኮ ማሃ ዎዶና</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:7">ያይቆኦቤ ዎዛዻንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:7">ዒስራዔኤሌ ዴራኣ ዒላሻንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 14:7"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="PSA 15"/>
  <para style="s1">ዳውቴ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="d">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዓሲዳፓ ኮዓ ባኣዚ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 15:1"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 15:1">ኔኤኮ ጌኤዦ ማኣሪ ጌላኒ ዖኦኒ ዳንዳዓይ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:1">ኔኤኮ ዱማዼ ዹኮይዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 15:1">ናንጋኒ ዳንዳዓሢ ዖናዳይ?<verse eid="PSA 15:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 15:2"/>ሃይ ፓጬኔ ጌይሳ ባኣዚ ባኣ ዓሲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 15:2">ፂሎ ማዾ ማዻ ዓሲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 15:2">ዒናፓ ጎኔ ማዔ ባኣዚ ጌስታ ዓሲ፥<verse eid="PSA 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 15:3"/>ጌስታ ጌኤዞና ዓሲ ጌሹዋ ዓሲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 15:3">ፔ ላጎም ፑርታ ባኣዚ ማዹዋ ዓሲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 15:3">ፔ ዓሺኖ ዾንኩዋ ዓሲ፥<verse eid="PSA 15:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 15:4"/>ፑርቶ ማዻ ዓሶኮ ማሊፆ ዔኩዋ ዓሲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 15:4">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳም ዓይሢንታ ዓሶ ጋዓንቴ ቦንቻ ዓሲ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:4">ዎዚ ዴኤፃያ ማዔታቴያ ጫኣቄ ጫኣቁሞ ማዺ ኩንሣ ዓሲ፥<verse eid="PSA 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 15:5"/>ሚኢሾ ፔኤሲ ሾይቺና ዔካኒ ታልዑዋ ዓሲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 15:5">ፂሎ ዓሶ ሜቶይዳ ዓጋኒ ዴሜና ሚኢሼ ዔኩዋ ዓሲ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:5">ያኣዼ ማዔ ዓሲ ፔቴታዖ ዓጊፃዓኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 15:5">ኮሺ ናንጊ ናንጋንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 15:5"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="PSA 16"/>
  <para style="s1">ዳውቴ ካላሎ</para>
  <para style="d">ፆኦሲ ጉሙርቂ ሺኢቂንቴ ሺኢጲሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 16:1"/>ፆኦሲዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:1">ታኣኒ ኔና ጉሙርቃሢሮ ታና ካፔ።<verse eid="PSA 16:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 16:2"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳም ታኣኒ፦ «ኔኤኒ ታኣኮ ጎዳኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:2">ኔኤፓ ዓታዛ ኮሺ ባኣዚ ታኣም ባኣሴ» ጌዔኔ።<verse eid="PSA 16:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 16:3"/>ፆኦሲም ዱማዼያ ማዒ ሳዖይዳ ናንጋ ዓሳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:3">ቦንቺንቴያኬ፤ ታኣኒያኣ ዔያቶ ዛጋዖ ዎዛዻኔ።<verse eid="PSA 16:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 16:4"/>ሜሌ ፆኦዞ ካኣሽካ ዓሶ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:4">ሚርጌ ዖዪሳ ባኣዚ ሄላንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:4">ታኣኒ ዬያጉዴ ሜሌ ፆኦዞ ሹኪ ዑሻዓኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:4">ዬያቶም ታኣኒ ዚጊያኣ ካኣሽካዓኬ።<verse eid="PSA 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 16:5"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ታኣኮ ዴናሢንታ ዑዣሢያ ኔናኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:5">ታ ዛላ ባኣዚ ቢያ ኔ ኩጮ ጋራኬ።<verse eid="PSA 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 16:6"/>ታኣም ዴኖ ፓቃኒ ዓጊንቴ ሱዛ ኮሺ ቤስካ ኬዴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:6">ጎኔና ታና ዎዛሳ ኮሺ ዴኔ ታና ሄሌኔ።<verse eid="PSA 16:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 16:7"/>ታና ዞራ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ታኣኒ ጋላታኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:7">ዋንቶ ማዔቴያ ዒና ታኣኮ ፒዜ ማዔ ባኣዚ ታና ዔርዛኔ።<verse eid="PSA 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 16:8"/>ቢያ ዎዴ ታኣኒ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ቤርታሳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:8">ዒዚ ታኣኮ ሚዛቆ ዛሊናታሢሮ ታኣኒ ዓጊፃዓኬ።<verse eid="PSA 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 16:9"/>ዬያሮ ዒና ታኣኮ ኮሺ ዎዛዻኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:9">ዑፃኣ ታኣኮ ሂርጋ ባኣያ ሃውሻኔ።<verse eid="PSA 16:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 16:10"/>ኔኤኒ ሼምፓሢ ታኣኮ ዱኡፖ ዔታ ሃሺንዱዋሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:10">ኔኤም ዱማዼሢያኣ ኔኤኒ ዎዒሲንዱዋሴ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16፡10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:35">ዳኪ. ማዾ 13፡35</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 16:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 16:11"/>ኔኤኒ ናንጊ ጎይሢ ታና ዻዋንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:11">ኔ ኮራ ሚርጌ ዎዛ ኩሜያኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:11">ኔኤኮ ሚዛቆ ዛላ ናንጊና ሃውሺሢያኣ ዓኣኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16፡11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:25-28">ዳኪ. ማዾ 2፡25-28</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 16:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="PSA 17"/>
  <para style="s1">ዳውቴ ሺኢጲፆ</para>
  <para style="d">ጌኤሺ ዓሲኮ ሺኢጲሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 17:1"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:1">ፒዜ ዎጌ ታኣም ዎጊንታንዳጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:1">ታ ሺኢቃ ሺኢጲፆ ዋይዜ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:1">ዒላቶዋ ታኣኮ ዒና ዔኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:1">ጌሺሢናቱዋንቴ ጎኔና ታ ኔና ሺኢቃሢ ዋይዜ።<verse eid="PSA 17:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 17:2"/>ዓኣፓ ኔኤኮ ታ ፒዙሞ ዴንቃኒ ዳንዳዓሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:2">ኔኤኒ ሌሊ ታኣም ዎጋኒ ዳንዳዓኔ።<verse eid="PSA 17:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 17:3"/>ዒኖ ኔ ታኣኮ ዛጌያታቴያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:3">ዋንቶ ኔ ታና ሙኪ ዖኦጬቴያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:3">ታ ዎይታቴ ኔኤኒ ዛጌቴያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:3">ፑርቱሞ ታኣፓ ኔኤኒ ዴንቃዓኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:3">ዻንጋ ታኣኮ ዻቢንታያቱዋሴ።<verse eid="PSA 17:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 17:4"/>ዓሳ ማዻ ጎይፆቱዋንቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:4">ኔኤኒ ኬኤዛ ቃኣሎ ጎይፆና</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:4">ዋይዞ ዒፃ ዓሳ ሃንታ ጎይፃፓ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:4">ታኣኒ ታና ካፔኔ።<verse eid="PSA 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 17:5"/>ቢያ ዎዴ ኔ ጎይፆ ታ ሃንታኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:5">ቶካ ታኣኮ ኔ ጎይፃፓ ኬስኪ ዣኣሊባኣሴ።<verse eid="PSA 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 17:6"/>ፆኦሲዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:6">ሺኢጲፆ ኔ ታኣኮ ዋይዛሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:6">ኔና ታኣኒ ሺኢቃኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:6">ዋዮ ኔኤሲ ታ ባንሢ ማሄ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:6">ታኣኒ ጋዓ ባኮ ዋይዜ።<verse eid="PSA 17:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 17:7"/>ፔ ሞርኮፓ ቶላኒ ኔና ፑኖ ካይዚ ማሃዞንሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:7">ኔኤኮ ሚዛቆ ኩጮና ዓውሳ ፆኦዛሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:7">ናንጊና ናንጋ ናሹሞ ኔኤሲ ዲቃሢ ሄርሺሳ ጎይሢና ፔጋሲ ዻዌ።<verse eid="PSA 17:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 17:8"/>ዓኣፒኮ ጪልሼ ካፖማጉዲ ታና ካፔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:8">ኔኤኮ ጋኣዞ ዴማ ታና ዓኣቼ።<verse eid="PSA 17:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 17:9"/>ታና ሜታሳ ፑርቶንሢዳፓ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:9">ዎዻኒ ታና ማንጌ ታኣኮ ሞርካፓ ታና ዓኣቼ።<verse eid="PSA 17:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 17:10"/>ሚጪንቱዋያ ማዒ ዒኖ ዔያታ ፔኤሲ ዎዺ ሃሼኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:10">ዻንጋ ዔያቶሲ ዖቶርሙሞ ጌስታኔ።<verse eid="PSA 17:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 17:11"/>ዳውሲ ዔያታ ታና ሄሌኔ፥ ማንጊያኣ ማንጌኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:11">ዎዺ ሳዓ ዔያታ ታና ሚጫኒ ጎዚ ዔቄኔ።<verse eid="PSA 17:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 17:12"/>ዔያታ ዓርቂ ዔካኒ ኮዓ ዞቢጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:12">ዓኣሺንቲ ካቲ ዴዔ ሃጊ ዔቃ ዞቢጉዲኬ።<verse eid="PSA 17:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 17:13"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ዔቂ ዔያቶ ዓርቂ ዓጌቴራ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:13">ኔኤኮ ጬንቾ ዓፓሮና ፑርቶ ዓሶፓ ታና ዓውሴ።<verse eid="PSA 17:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 17:14"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:14">ዔያታ ናንጋ ናንጋ ሃያ ዓጮ ባኣዚም ሌሊ ማዔ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:14">ዓሶ ኩጫፓ ታና ዓውሴ።</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:14">ኔኤኒ ናሽካ ዓሶም ሙኡዚ ዒንጌ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:14">ናኣታ ዔያቶኮ ሚርጎንጎ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:14">ናኣቶኮ ናኣቶም ማዓንዳ ሙኡዚ ዔያቶም ዒንጌ።<verse eid="PSA 17:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 17:15"/>ታኣኒ ፂሉሞና ዓኣፖ ካሮ ኔኤኮ ዛጋንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:15">ጊንዓሢፓ ታኣኒ ጴጫዖ ኔኤኮ ዓውካሮ ዛጊ ዎዛዻንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 17:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="PSA 18"/>
  <para style="s1">ዓይኑሞ ሱኡጋሢ ዓይሣ ጎይፆና ዓይናዺንታ ፆኦሲ ዓይላሢ ዳውቴ ዓይኑሞ፤ ፆኦሲ ሳኣዖኦሌና ዒዛኮ ሞርኮናይዳፓ ዒዛ ቶሊሴያና ፆኦሲ ቦንቾም ዓይናዺንቴያኬ።</para>
  <para style="d">ዳውቴ ባሺሢ ዴንቃዖ ዓይናዼ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 22:1-51">2ሳሙ. 22፡1-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 18:1"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:1">ታኣም ዎልቄ ዒንጋሢ ኔናታሢሮ ታ ኔና ናሽካኔ።<verse eid="PSA 18:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 18:2"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ታኣኮ ላላሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:2">ታኣኮ ዹካሢንታ ታና ዓውሳሢያኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:2">ታ ፆኦዛሢ ታኣኮ ዓኣሺንቶ ካያሢኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:2">ዒዚ ታኣኮ ጊቲማሢና ጉራናሢኬ።<verse eid="PSA 18:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 18:3"/>ጋላታ ኮይሳ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ታኣኒ ሺኢቃኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:3">ዒዚ ታ ሞርኮይዳፓ ታና ዓውሳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 18:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 18:4"/>ሃይቢ ካራ ባይዚ ታና ሜታሴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:4">ባይሲንታ ዲጲያ ታና ዱኡኬኔ።<verse eid="PSA 18:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 18:5"/>ዱኡፒ ሱሲ ታና ማሬኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:5">ሃይቢ ፒሮጉዲ ታኣም ፒሪንቴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 18:6"/>ታኣኒ ሜታዼ ዎዶና ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዔኤሌኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:6">ታና ዒ ማኣዳንዳጉዲ ታ ፆኦሲ ታኣኒ ሺኢቄኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:6">ዒዚያ ፔኤኮ ጌኤዦ ማኣራ ዓኣዖ ዑኡዞ ታኣሲ ዋይዜኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:6">ታኣኮ ዒላቶዋ ዒዚ ዒና ዔኬኔ።<verse eid="PSA 18:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 18:7"/>ሳዓ ዚምባሪ ጎጋይቄኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:7">ዹኮኮዋ ፃጳ ዓጊፂፆና ኮሬኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:7">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዻጋዼሢሮ ዔያታ ዓጊፄኔ።<verse eid="PSA 18:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 18:8"/>ዒዛኮ ሲኢዻፓ ዻጎ ጩባ ኬስኬኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:8">ዻንጋፓ ዒዛኮ ሙሙዓ ታሚ ሎስቶና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:8">ሚሚቻ ቄንሢያኣ ኬስኬኔ።<verse eid="PSA 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 18:9"/>ጫሪንጮ ዳርዚ ሊካ ዒ ኬዴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:9">ዒዛኮ ቶኮ ዴማ ዲም ጌዔ ሻኣሬ ዓኣኔ።<verse eid="PSA 18:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 18:10"/>ዒዚ ኪሩቤኤሎ ዑፃ ዴይ ባራኔኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:10">ዢባሮ ጋኣዞና ባራኒ ሌካ ዒ ኬስኬኔ።<verse eid="PSA 18:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 18:11"/>ፔና ዒዚ ዹሞና ዓኣቼኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:11">ካርሤ ሻኣራኣ ዒዛ ካንቂ ዓኣኔ።<verse eid="PSA 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 18:12"/>ዒዛኮ ዓኣ ፖዖፓ ዔቄያና ሻቺንታ ታሚ ፖዒንታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:12">ዲም ጌዔ ሻኣሮ ባኣኪና ሶፒ ኬስኬኔ።<verse eid="PSA 18:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 18:13"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ጫሪንጫፓ ጉጉንሤኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:13">ዼኤፖ ፆኦዛሢ ዑኡዞ ፔኤሲ ማኣሚሴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 18:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 18:14"/>ዒዚ ሂኢዦ ፔኤሲና ዱኪ ሞርኮ ላኣሊሼኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:14">ጉጉንፆ ሚርጊሺ ካራ ባይዚ ዔያቶ ዳውሴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 18:15"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:15">ኔኤኒ ኔኤኮ ሞርኮ ጎሬ ዎዶና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:15">ዻጎ ዑኡዞ ኔኤኮ ኔ ዋይዚሴ ዎዶና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:15">ዼኤፖ ባዞኮ ዴማ ፔጋዺ ጴዼኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:15">ሳዖኮዋ ማዢንቶ ዓይፆ ካራ ፔጋ ኬስኬኔ።<verse eid="PSA 18:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 18:16"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ሎኦፓ ኩጮ ዳኪ ታና ዓርቄኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:16">ሚርጌና ዔቴ ማዔ ዋኣፆፓ ጎቺ ታና ዒ ኬሴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 18:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 18:17"/>ታጊዳፓ ዎልቆና ባሼ ማዔ ታ ሞርኮፓ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:17">ታና ዒዚ ዓውሴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:17">ታና ዒፃ ዓሶ ቢያሢ ኩጫፓ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:17">ዒዚ ታና ዓይሴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 18:18"/>ዔያታ ታኣኒ ሜታዼ ዎዶና ታኣኮ ሞርኬ ማዒ ዔቄኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:18">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ጋዓንቴ ታና ካፔኔ።<verse eid="PSA 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 18:19"/>ዒዚ ታና ዳልጊ ቤሲ ኬሴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:19">ዒዛ ታኣኒ ዎዛሴሢሮ ዒ ታና ዓውሴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 18:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 18:20"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ታኣም ታ ፂሉሞጉዲ ጪጋንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:20">ታ ጌኤሹሞጉዲያኣ ማሂ ታኣም ዒንጋንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 18:21"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳኮ ጎይፆ ታ ሃንቴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:21">ፑርታ ባኣዚ ማዻኒ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:21">ታ ዓኣፖ ካሮ ታ ፆኦዛሢ ቤርታፓ ሺርሺባኣሴ።<verse eid="PSA 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 18:22"/>ዒዛኮ ዎጎ ቢያ ታኣኒ ማዺ ኩንሣኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:22">ዳምቦዋ ታ ዒዛኮ ቦንቺፆ ሃሺባኣሴ።<verse eid="PSA 18:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 18:23"/>ዒዚ ታና ዛጌ ጎይፆ ታኣኒ ፂሎኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:23">ጎሜይዳፓ ታና ታኣኒ ካፔኔ።<verse eid="PSA 18:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 18:24"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ታኣኮ ፂሉሞጉዴያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:24">ኩጫኣ ታኣኮ ጌኤሺ ማዔሢጉዴያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:24">ታኣም ኮይሳ ባኮ ዒዚ ጪጌኔ።<verse eid="PSA 18:24"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 18:25"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ኔኤም ጉሙርቂንታዞም</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:25">ኔኤኒያኣ ጉሙርቂንታያኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:25">ጎኔ ዓሲ ማዔዞንሢም ኔኤኒያኣ ጎኔ ማዓያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 18:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 18:26"/>ጌኤዦ ዓሶም ኔኤኒ ጌኤሺኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:26">ዎቦ ዓሶም ጋዓንቴ ዔያቶም ኮይሳሢ ኔ ዒንጋኔ።<verse eid="PSA 18:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 18:27"/>ዒኖ ሼሌዔ ዓሶ ኔኤኒ ዓውሳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:27">ዖቶርቃዞንሢ ጋዓንቴ ኔኤኒ ዻውሲሳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 18:27"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 18:28"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ታኣኮ ኔኤኒ ፖዓሢኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:28">ታ ፆኦዛሢዮ! ዹሞ ታኣኮ ኔ ፖዒሣኔ።<verse eid="PSA 18:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 18:29"/>ኔ ዎልቆና ዖሎ ዖላ ዓሶ ባሺ ታኣኒ ሄርቄኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:29">ኔ ዎልቆና ኬኤሎ ዲሮና ጱሊ ታ ጌሌኔ።<verse eid="PSA 18:29"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 18:30"/>ፆኦሲ ጎይፃ ሃይማ ፓጬኔ ጌይሳ ባኣዚ ባኣያ ፒዜኬ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:30">ቃኣላኣ ዒዛሲ ጌኤሺኬ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:30">ዒዛና ካናዻ ዓሶም ዒዚ ጊቲማሢኬ።<verse eid="PSA 18:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 18:31"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳፓ ዓታዛ ዖናዳይ ፆኦሲ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:31">ዒዛይዳፓ ዓታዛ ላሌ ማዓሢ ዖናዳይ?<verse eid="PSA 18:31"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 18:32"/>ታኣም ዶዱሞ ዒንጋሢንታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:32">ጎይፆዋ ታኣኮ ፒዚሳሢ ፆኦሲኬ።<verse eid="PSA 18:32"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 18:33"/>ዒዚ ቶኮ ታኣኮ ዎሾ ቶኪጉዲ ዶዲሻኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:33">ጌሜሮይዳ ሂርጋ ባኣያ ታና ዒዚ ዔቂሳኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18፡33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HAB 3:19">ዒምባ. 3፡19</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 18:33"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 18:34"/>ኩጮ ታኣኮ ዒ ዖልዚ ዖሎንዶ ጎይሢ ዔርዛኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:34">ኩጫ ታኣኮ ሞኦኖ ዓንጎ ቆኦዞ ጎቻንዳጉዲ ዒ ዶዲሻኔ።<verse eid="PSA 18:34"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 18:35"/>ኔኤኮ ባሺፆ ጊቲሞ ኔኤኒ ታኣም ዒንጌኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:35">ኔኤኮ ሚዛቆ ኩጫኣ ታና ካፓኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:35">ኔኤኒ ታና ማኣዳኒ ሙኪ ዼኤፒ ማዾ ማዼኔ።<verse eid="PSA 18:35"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 18:36"/>ታ ሃንታንዳ ጎይፆ ኔኤኒ ታኣም ዳልጊሼኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:36">ቶካኣ ታኣኮ ዹቂንቲባኣሴ።<verse eid="PSA 18:36"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 18:37"/>ሞርኮ ታኣኮ ታኣኒ ዳኪ ዓርቄኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:37">ጋፒሲ ባይዙዋዖ ጊንሢም ታኣኒ ማዒባኣሴ።<verse eid="PSA 18:37"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 18:38"/>ላሚ ጊንሣ ዔያታ ዔቁዋጉዲ ታኣኒ ዔያቶ ጋኣጬኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:38">ዔያታ ታኣኮ ቶኮ ዴማኣ ሎኦሜኔ።<verse eid="PSA 18:38"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 18:39"/>ዖላንዳጉዲ ዎልቄ ኔኤኒ ታኣም ዒንጌኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:39">ታ ሞርኮ ታ ቶኮ ዴማ ኔኤኒ ጉምዓሤኔ።<verse eid="PSA 18:39"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 18:40"/>ታ ሞርካ ጊንሢም ባሺንቲ ጳሽካንዳጉዲ ኔ ማሄኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:40">ታኣኒያ ታና ዒፃዞንሢ ጋፒሲ ባይዜኔ።<verse eid="PSA 18:40"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 18:41"/>ዔያቶ ማኣዳ ዓሲ ኮይ ዔያታ ዒላቴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:41">ጋዓንቴ ዔያታ ዴንቂባኣሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:41">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ባንሢ ዔያታ ዒላቴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:41">ዒዚ ጋዓንቴ ዔያቶም ዋይዚባኣሴ።<verse eid="PSA 18:41"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 18:42"/>ዢባሬ ፒፂ ዔኪ ዓኣዻ ሲላሊ ማዓንዳያ ሄላንዳኣና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:42">ታኣኒ ዔያቶ ጋኣጬኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:42">ጎይሢዳ ዓኣ ዾቃሌጉዲ ታ ዔያቶ ሄርቄኔ።<verse eid="PSA 18:42"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 18:43"/>ዋይዞ ዒፃ ዴሮይዳፓ ኔኤኒ ታና ዓውሴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:43">ዴሮ ዑፃ ኔ ታና ዶኦሬኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:43">ታኣኒ ዔሩዋ ዴሬ ታ ቢታንቶ ዴማ ዎርቃኔ።<verse eid="PSA 18:43"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 18:44"/>ፃንጎ ማዔ ዓሳ ታኣም ዚጋኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:44">ታ ማዻ ባኮ ዋዋይዛዖ ታኣም ዔያታ ዓይሢንታኔ።<verse eid="PSA 18:44"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 18:45"/>ዒጊቹሞና ካራ ዔያታ ባይዛኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:45">ፔኤኮ ዋርዲዮ ቤዛፓ ጎጋይቂ ጎጋይቂ ኬስኪ ሙካኔ።<verse eid="PSA 18:45"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 18:46"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ባይቁዋያኬ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:46">ታ ፆኦዛሢ፥ ታኣኮ ላላሢ ቦንቺንቶንጎ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:46">ታና ዓውሴ ዎልቆ ፆኦዛሢ ዼግ ዼግ ጎዖንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 18:46"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 18:47"/>ዒዚ ታ ሞርኮ ኮሜ ኮፃኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:47">ዴሮዋ ታ ዴማ ማሂ ታኣም ዒ ዎይሣኔ።<verse eid="PSA 18:47"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 18:48"/>ዒዚ ታኣኮ ሞርካፓ ታና ዓውሳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:48">ታ ሞርኮኮ ዑፃ ማሂ ኔኤኒ ታና ዼጊሳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:48">ጎርቲኖ ማዻ ዓሶይዳፓ ኔ ታና ዓውሳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 18:48"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="PSA 18:49"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ዬያሮ ዴሮ ባኣካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:49">ታኣኒ ኔና ጋላታኔ፥ ሱንፆዋ ታ ኔኤኮ ዓይኑሞና ሄርሻኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18፡49 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 15:9">ሮሜ 15፡9</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 18:49"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="PSA 18:50"/>ዒዚ ካኣታሤ ካኣቲም ዼኤፒ ባሺሢ ዒንጋንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:50">ዒ ፔኤሮ ዶኦሜ ካኣቲም ናንጊና ናሹሞ ፔኤሲ ዒ ቤኤዛንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:50">ዳውቴና ዜርፆናም ናንጊና ዬያ ዒ ማዻንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 18:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="PSA 19"/>
  <para style="s1">ዓይኑሞ ሱኡጋሢ ዓይሣ ጎይፆና ዓይናዺንታ ዳውቴ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="d">ማዢንታ ቢያ ፆኦሲኮ ቦንቾ ፔጋሲ ዔርዛያ ማዒፆ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 19:1"/>ጫሪንጫ ፆኦሲኮ ቦንቾ ኬኤዛኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:1">ሳዓፓ ሌካ ዼጌ ቤዛኣ ዒዛኮ ማዾ ዒላቲ ዋይዚሳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 19:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 19:2"/>ፔቴ ኬላ ሜሌ ኬሎም ዬያ ኬኤዛኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:2">ዋንታኣ ሄላ ዋንቶም ዔራቶ ዒዛሲ ሃይሳታኔ።<verse eid="PSA 19:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 19:3"/>ዔያታ ጌስታ ሃይሴንታ ሙኡቺያ ባኣሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:3">ዔያቶኮ ዑኡሲያ ዋይዚንቱዋሴ።<verse eid="PSA 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 19:4"/>ያኣዼ ማዔቴያ ዔያቶኮ ኪኢታ ዓጮ ቢያ ሄላኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:4">ሳዓ ማዔ ካሮ ሄላንዳኣና ዋይዚንታኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:4">ፆኦሲ ጫሪንጮይዳ ዓቢም ማኣሪ ማዤኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19፡4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 10:18">ሮሜ 10፡18</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 19:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 19:5"/>ዑኡቱሞ ማርካፓ ዑኡታ ኬስካሢጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:5">ዓቢያኣ ጌኤሺ ማዒ ፆርቃኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:5">ጳሺ ጳሽካ ዓሲ ሄሌሎ ጳሽካኒ ዎዛዻሢጉዲ ዎዛዻኔ።<verse eid="PSA 19:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 19:6"/>ዓባ ፆርቃሢ ጫሪንጮኮ ዓይፆ ካራፓኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:6">ሺሪ ዴንዲ ጌላሢ ባጎ ዛሎ ጋፖይዳኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:6">ዬያኮ ሩኡጶ ዖይዻፓ ቶሊ ዓታኒ ዳንዳዓይ ባኣሴ።<verse eid="PSA 19:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳኮ ዎጎ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 19:7"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዎጎኮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:7">ሃይማ ፓጬኔ ጌይሳ ባኣዚ ባኣያኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:7">ሼምፔ ማሂ ጊንሣ ዓካሳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:7">ዓይሢፃ ዒዛኮ ጉሙርቂንታያኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:7">ዔኤዮ ዓሶ ዔሮ ማሃኔ።<verse eid="PSA 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 19:8"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳኮ ዎጋ ፒዜኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:8">ዓሲኮ ዒና ዎዛሳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:8">ዓይሢፃ ዒዛኮ ጌኤሺኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:8">ዓሲኮ ዓኣፒማኣ ፖዒ ማዓኔ።<verse eid="PSA 19:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 19:9"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዒጊጪሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:9">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጌኤሹሞኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:9">ዒ ዎጋ ዎጊፃ ፔቴ ፔቴሢ ጎኔ፥ ሃሣ ፂሎኬ።<verse eid="PSA 19:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 19:10"/>ዬይ ዒ ዎጋ ዎጋ ጌኤሺ ዎርቄፓ ባሼ ዋኣጌ ኬሳያኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:10">ዔኤሲ ፆሎሊዳፓ ባሼ ዓኣፃያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 19:11"/>ኔኤም ማዻሢ ዬይ ዎጋ ዞራኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:11">ዬያ ካፒሢና ዼኤፒ ባኣዚ ዒዚ ዴንቃኔ።<verse eid="PSA 19:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 19:12"/>ፔ ዻቢንቲ ዴንቃ ዓሲ ባኣሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:12">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:12">ታኣኮ ዓኣሺንቴ ዺቢንቶፓ ታና ጌኤሼ።<verse eid="PSA 19:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 19:13"/>ታኣኒ ኔኤኮ ዓይላሢ ጫርቂ ማዻ ጎሞይዳፓ ታና ካፔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:13">ዬይ ጎማ ታና ቆሉዋጉዲ ኔኤኒ ታና ማኣዴ።</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:13">ኔኤኒ ያዺዴያታቴ ታኣኒ ዻቢንቲ ባኣያ ማዓንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:13">ዼኤፖ ዻቢንቶይዳፓኣ ታኣኒ ጌኤሽካንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 19:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 19:14"/>ታኣኮ ላላሢንታ ታና ዓውሳ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:14">ታኣኮ ጌኤዞንታ ዒኖ ማሊፆንታ ኔኤም ኮሽካያ ማዖንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 19:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="PSA 20"/>
  <para style="s1">ዓይኑሞ ሱኡጋሢ ዓይሣ ጎይፆና ዓይናዺንታ ዳውቴ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="d">ባሺሢ ዴንቃኒ ሺኢቂንቴ ሺኢጲሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 20:1"/>ኔኤኒ ሜታዻኣና ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ኔኤኮ ሺኢጲፆ ዋይዞንጎ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:1">ያይቆኦቤ ፆኦዛሢ ኔና ካፖንጎ!<verse eid="PSA 20:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 20:2"/>ፔኤኮ ጌኤዦ ማኣራፓ ማኣዶ ኔኤም ዒ ዳኮንጎ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:2">ፂዮኔ ዹካፓ ኔና ዒ ማኣዶንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 20:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 20:3"/>ኔ ዒዛም ዒንጋ ባኮ ቢያ ኔኤኮ ዒ ዔኮንጎ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:3">ኔ ሚቺ ዒንጋ ባኮናኣ ዒዚ ዎዛዾንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 20:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 20:4"/>ኔ ዒና ዓፃዺ ማላ ባኮ ኔኤም ዒዚ ዒንጎንጎ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:4">ማሊፆ ኔኤኮ ቢያ ዒ ኩንሦንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 20:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 20:5"/>ኔኤኮ ባሺፆና ኑኡኒ ዎዛዻኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:5">ኑ ፆኦዛሢ ሱንፆና ባንዲሮ ዼጊዲ ኑ ዓርቃኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:5">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ኔ ሺኢቃ ባኮ ቢያ ኔኤም ኩንሦንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 20:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 20:6"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዶኦሚ ካኣታሤ ካኣቲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:6">ዒዚ ማኣዳንዳሢ ታኣኒ ዔራኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:6">ዒዛኮ ሚዛቆ ኩጮና ዒዛ ኔኤኒ ባሺሲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:6">ኔኤም ዱማዼ፥ ጫሪንጫፓ ሺኢጲፆ ኔ ዒዛኮ ዋይዛንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 20:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 20:7"/>ፔቴ ፔቴ ዖሎ ዓሳ ፔኤኮ ዖሎ ሳርጌሎ ዖይቶና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:7">ዓቴ ዓሳ ሃሣ ፔኤኮ ፓራሢና ሄርሺንታኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:7">ኑኡኒ ጋዓንቴ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ማዔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:7">ኑ ፆኦዛሢ ዎልቆ ጉሙርቃኔ።<verse eid="PSA 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 20:8"/>ዔያታ ዹቂንቲ ሎኦማንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:8">ኑኡኒ ጋዓንቴ ዔቃንዳኔ፥ ዶዲያኣ ኑ ዓታንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 20:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 20:9"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:9">ካኣታሢ ዒዛኮ ሞርኮ ኩጫፓ ዓውሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:9">ኑኡኒያኣ ኔና ዔኤላ ዎዶና ኑኡም ዋይዜ።<verse eid="PSA 20:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="PSA 21"/>
  <para style="s1">ዓይኑሞ ሱኡጋሢ ዓይሣ ጎይፆና ዓይናዺንታ ዳውቴ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="d">ባሼ ባሺሢሮ ጋላቲንቴ ጋላታ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 21:1"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:1">ዎልቄ ኔ ዒዛም ዒንጌሢሮ ካኣቲ ዎዛዼኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:1">ኔ ዒዛ ባሺሴሢሮዋ ሚርጌና ዒዚ ዎዛዻኔ።<verse eid="PSA 21:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 21:2"/>ዒዛኮ ዒና ማሌ ባኮ ኔ ዒዛም ዒንጌኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:2">ዒዚ ኔና ሺኢቄ ባኮዋ ኔ ዒዛ ላኣጊባኣሴ።<verse eid="PSA 21:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 21:3"/>ሚርጌ ዓንጆ ኔ ዒዛም ዒንጊ ሾኦቺንሢ ዔኬኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:3">ዒዛኮ ቶኦኮይዳ ጌኤሺ ዎርቄና ኮሺንቴ ቦንቾ ባኮ ኔ ዓጌኔ።<verse eid="PSA 21:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 21:4"/>ናንጊ ዒዛም ኔኤኒ ዒንጋንዳጉዲ ዒዚ ኔና ሺኢቄኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:4">ኔኤኒ ዒዛም ዖዶሲ ሌዔንታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:4">ጋፑዋ ናንጊያኣ ዒንጌኔ።<verse eid="PSA 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 21:5"/>ኔ ዒዛ ባሺሴሢሮ ቦንቻ ዒዛኮ ዼኤፒ ማዔኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:5">ቦንቾንታ ዼኤፑሞንታ ኔኤኒ ዒዛም ዒንጌኔ።<verse eid="PSA 21:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 21:6"/>ናንጊና ጋፑዋ ዓንጆ ኔ ዒዛም ዒንጌኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:6">ኔኤኒ ዒዛና ዎላ ማዒፆና ዒዛ ኔኤኒ ዎዛሳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 21:7"/>ካኣታሢ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ጉሙርቃኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:7">ዼኤፖ ፆኦዛሢ ጋጋፑዋ ናሹሞና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:7">ዒዛ ናሽኬሢሮ ዒዚ ዓጊፂንዱዋሴ።<verse eid="PSA 21:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 21:8"/>ኔ ኩጫ ኔኤኮ ሞርኮ ቢያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:8">ኔኤኮ ሚዛቆ ኩጫኣ ኔና ዒፃዞንሢ ቢያ ዓርቃንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 21:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 21:9"/>ፔጋዺ ኔኤኒ ጴዻ ዎዶና ናኣቦፓ ኬስካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:9">ታሚ ላኣፁሚጉዲ ኔ ዔያቶ ሚቻንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:9">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳኮ ዻጎ ሼኤላኣ ዔያቶ ጋውላንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:9">ታማኣ ዔያቶ ሙዓንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 21:10"/>ዜርፆ ኔኤኒ ዔያቶኮ ሳዖይዳፓ ባይዛንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:10">ሜሌ ዴሮ ባኣካፓ ዱማሲ ኔ ዔያቶ ዎዺ ኩርሳንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 21:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 21:11"/>ኔኤም ፑርታ ማዻኒ ዔያታ ማሌያታቴያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:11">ጌኔ ማሊሢያኣ ማሊ ቱኬቴያ ዔያቶም ጊኢጋዓኬ።<verse eid="PSA 21:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 21:12"/>ዔያታ ሙኬ ጎይፆና ማሂ ኔኤኒ ዔያቶ ጳሻንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:12">ኔኤኮ ሂኢዦናኣ ዔያቶ ኔ ዱካንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 21:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 21:13"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:13">ኔኤኒ ኔ ዶዱሞና ዼግ ዼጊ ጌዔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:13">ዎልቆ ኔኤኮ ኑኡኒ ሄርሻኔ፥ ዓይናዺያ ኑ ዓይናዻኔ።<verse eid="PSA 21:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="PSA 22"/>
  <para style="s1">ዓይኑሞ ሱኡጋሢ ዓይሣ ጎይፆና ካሪፆ ዎልቄ ዛላ ዓይናዺንታ ዳውቴ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="d">ዖዪሢ ዒላቲና ጋላታ ዓይኑሞና</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 22:1"/>ታ ፆኦዛሢዮ! ታ ፆኦዛሢዮ! ኔ ታና ዓይጋ ሃሼይ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:1">ኔኤኒ ታና ዓውሲፆ ሃሺ ሃኬሢ ዓይጎሮዳይ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:1">ታኣኮ ዚኢሊንቲፆ ዑኡዞይዳፓ ዓይጋ ኔ ሃኬይ? <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22፡1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:46">ማቲ. 27፡46</ref>፤ <ref loc="MRK 15:34">ማር. 15፡34</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 22:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 22:2"/>ታ ፆኦዛሢዮ! ሮኦሮ ታ ኔ ባንሢ ዒላታኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:2">ኔኤኒ ጋዓንቴ ታኣም ዋይዙዋሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:2">ዋንቶዋ ታ ዔኤሊንታኔ፥ ሃውሺያ ታኣኮ ባኣሴ።<verse eid="PSA 22:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 22:3"/>ኔኤኒ ጋዓንቴ ዒስራዔኤሌ ዓሳ ኔና ጋላታያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:3">ኔኤኮ ካኣቱሞ ዖይቶይዳ ዴዒ ዎይሣ ዱማዼ ፆኦሲኬ።<verse eid="PSA 22:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 22:4"/>ኑኡኮ ቤርታኣ ዓዶንሢ ኔና ጉሙርቄኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:4">ዔያታ ኔና ጉሙርቄም ኔኤኒያ ዔያቶ ዓውሴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 22:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 22:5"/>ኔ ማኣዳንዳጉዲ ዔያታ ኔ ባንሢ ዒላቴ ዎዶና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:5">ኔኤኒ ዔያቶ ዓውሴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:5">ዔያታ ኔና ጉሙርቄሢሮ ኔ ዔያቶ ቦርሲሲባኣሴ።<verse eid="PSA 22:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 22:6"/>ታኣኒ ጋዓንቴ ዓሲዳፓ ቢያ ላኣፓ፥ ዛኣሌ ማዔያኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:6">ዓሳ ታና ሚኢጫኔ፥ ዓሲ ባኣካ ታኣኒ ቶኦቺንቴያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 22:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 22:7"/>ታና ዛጋ ዓሳ ቢያ ቦሂ ሺራኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:7">ዔያታ ቶኦኮ ፔኤሲ ዓጊሢ ዓጊሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:7">ሂዚ ጌዒ ታና ሚኢጫኔ፦ <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22፡7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:39">ማቲ. 27፡39</ref>፤ <ref loc="MRK 15:29">ማር. 15፡29</ref>፤ <ref loc="LUK 23:35">ሉቃ. 23፡35</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 22:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 22:8"/>«ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዒዛ ዓውሳንዳኔ ጌዒ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:8">ዒዚ ጎዳ ጉሙርቃኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:8">ሂንዳ ዒዚ ዒዛ ናሽካያታቴ ዓውሶንጎ» ጋዓኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22፡8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:43">ማቲ. 27፡43</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 22:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 22:9"/>ኮሺና ታ ሾይንታንዳጉዲ ማሄሢ ኔናኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:9">ናይ ማዒ፥ ታ ዒንዶኮ ዻንፆ ታ ዻንቃንቴያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:9">ታ ጉሙርቄሢ ኔናኬ።<verse eid="PSA 22:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 22:10"/>ታ ዒንዶ ጎጳፓ ኬስካዖ ኔ ዑፃ ታ ሃሺንቴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:10">ታ ዒንዳ ታና ሾዔማፓ ዓርቃዖ ታኣኮ ኔ ፆኦዛሢኬ።<verse eid="PSA 22:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 22:11"/>ታና ሜታ ሄላኒ ዑኬሢሮ፥ ሃሣ ታና ማኣዳያኣ ባኣሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:11">ሃዳራ ኔኤኒ ታ ኮራፓ ሃኪፖ!<verse eid="PSA 22:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 22:12"/>ሚርጌ ሞርካ ዓዳ ዹዋ ጌማይጉዲ ታና ማንጌኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:12">ዎልቆና ዓኣ ባኣሳኔ ዓጮ ዚዮ ጌማቶጉዲ ማንጊ ታና ዔቄኔ።<verse eid="PSA 22:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 22:13"/>ኬሚ ዎዺ ሾኦሊ ሙዓንዳ ዞቢ ጉዻሢጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:13">ዻንጎ ፔኤኮ ዔያታ ታ ዑፃ ሻዔኔ።<verse eid="PSA 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 22:14"/>ዎልቃ ታኣኮ ላቢ ዓዳ ዋኣሢ ማዔኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:14">ሜጌፃኣ ታኣኮ ቢያ ጪጊጫፓ ኮልኮልቄኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:14">ጋሮይዳ ዒና ታኣኮ ሾፒጉዲ ዓልቄኔ።<verse eid="PSA 22:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 22:15"/>ዎልቃ ታኣኮ ሃይቄ ቦኦቆ ሜቂሢጉዲ ዶዴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:15">ዒንዲርዛ ታኣኮ ፃኣዺ ሆንጎላሢዳ ዓዺንቴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:15">ኔኤኒ ታና ሃይቄ ዓሲጉዲ ሲላሎይዳ ሃሼኔ።<verse eid="PSA 22:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 22:16"/>ፑርቶ ማዻ ዓሳ ካኒ ቡኪ ማንጋሢጉዲ ታና ማንጌኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:16">ዞባ ታኣኮ ኩጮንታ ቶኮንታ ፔ ፁንጎና ፃጴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 22:17"/>ሜጌፃ ቢያ ታኣኮ ፓይዲንታያ ማዒ ፔጋዺ ጴዼኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:17">ታ ሞርካ ታና ጊዥ ጌዒ ቶኦቺሢና ዛጌኔ።<verse eid="PSA 22:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 22:18"/>ዓፒሎ ዔያታ ታኣኮ ጊሽቲ ዔኬኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:18">ታኣኮ ዖዶዞ ዓፒሎይዳኣ ዱማሲ ዔሮ ባኮ ዓጌኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22፡18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:35">ማቲ. 27፡35</ref>፤ <ref loc="MRK 15:24">ማር. 15፡24</ref>፤ <ref loc="LUK 23:34">ሉቃ. 23፡34</ref>፤ <ref loc="JHN 19:24">ዮሃ. 19፡24</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 22:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 22:19"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ታ ኮራፓ ሃኪፖ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:19">ታና ማኣዳሢዮ! ታና ማኣዳኒ ዑካዼ።<verse eid="PSA 22:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 22:20"/>ሼምፓሢ ታኣኮ ጬንቾ ዓፓሮና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:20">ዬያቶ ካናቶ ዎልቆናፓ ዓውሴ።<verse eid="PSA 22:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 22:21"/>ዞቦ ዻንጋፓ ታና ዓይሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:21">ጫርጋ ሜኤኖ ጉራናፓ ታና ካፔ።<verse eid="PSA 22:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 22:22"/>ኔ ሱንፆኮ ዼኤፑሞ ታ ዒጊኖም ታ ኬኤዛንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:22">ዔያታ ቡኪንቴ ቤዛ ታ ኔና ጋላታንዳኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22፡22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 2:12">ዔብ. 2፡12</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 22:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 22:23"/>ዒንሢ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዒጊጫ ዓሳ ጋላቱዋቴ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:23">ዒንሢ ያይቆኦቤ ዜርፃ ቢያ ዒዛ ቦንቹዋቴ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:23">ዒንሢ ዒስራዔኤሌ ዜርፃ ቢያ ዒጊቹሞና ዒዛ ዼግ ዼጊዱዋቴ!<verse eid="PSA 22:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 22:24"/>ዒዚ ሄርቂንቲ ዎርቃ ዓሶኮ ሜቶ ቶኦቺባኣሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:24">ዬያ ዔያቶኮ ዒ ዛጊ ሻኣኪንቲባኣሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:24">ፔኤኮ ዓኣፖ ካሮዋ ዔያቶይዳፓ ዒ ሺርሺባኣሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:24">ጋዓንቴ ፔና ማኣዳንዳጉዲ ዒላታ ዒላቶ ዋይዜኔ።<verse eid="PSA 22:24"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 22:25"/>ኔኤኒ ማዼ ኮዦ ማዾሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:25">ሚርጌ ኔ ዴራ ቡኬ ቤዛ ታ ኔና ጋላታንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:25">ኔና ዒጊጫ ዓሶ ቤርታ ታ ዔቂ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:25">ታኣኒ ናኣቤ ናኣቦ ኩንሣንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 22:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 22:26"/>ማንቆ ዓሳ ሚሽካንዳያ ሄላንዳኣና ሙዓኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:26">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ኮዓዞንሢያ ዒዛ ጋላታኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:26">ዒና ዔያቶኮ ዔያታ ናንጋ ዎዶ ቢያይዳ ዎዛዻኔ።<verse eid="PSA 22:26"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 22:27"/>ዓጮኮ ጋፖ ሄላንዳኣና ዓኣ ዓሳ ቢያ ማሊ ጶቂሥሢና</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:27">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ባንሢ ማዓኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:27">ዓጮይዳ ዓኣ ዴራ ቢያ ዒዛም ዚጋንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 22:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 22:28"/>ቢታንቶ ቢያ ኔኤሮኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:28">ዴሬ ቢያ ኔኤም ዎርቃኔ።<verse eid="PSA 22:28"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 22:29"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ሚርጌ ቆሎ ዓኣ ዓሳ ቢያ ኔኤም ዚጋንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:29">ሃይቂ ዱኡታኒ ዑኪ ዓኣሢያ ቢያ ሙኪ ኔ ቤርታ ጉምዓታንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 22:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 22:30"/>ሙካንዳ ሾይንታ ዒዛም ማዻንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:30">ሴካ ቤርታኣ ሾይንቶማኣ ፆኦሲ ባኣዚ ኬኤዚንታንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 22:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 22:31"/>ሃጊ ሾይንቲባኣ ዴሬም</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:31">ዔያታ ዒዛኮ ፂሉሞ ማዾ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:31">«ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዴሮ ፔኤሲ ዓውሴኔ» ጌዒ ጌዒ ኬኤዛንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 22:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="PSA 23"/>
  <para style="s1">ዳውቴ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="d">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ኮሺ ሄንቃያ ማዒፆ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 23:1"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ታና ሄንቃሢኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 23:1">ፔቴታዖ ታኣም ፓጫ ባኣዚ ባኣሴ።<verse eid="PSA 23:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 23:2"/>ዒዚ ታና ዋሻሌ ቤስካ ቃኣቲሳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 23:2">ኮሺ ማዔ ዎታ ዎርዚ ባንሢ ዔኪ ዓኣዻኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23፡2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 7:17">ዮሃ. ፆፔዻ 7፡17</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 23:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 23:3"/>ናንጎ ዒ ታኣኮ ዓኪ ማሃኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 23:3">ፔ ሱንፆሮ ጌዒ ፂሎ ጎይሢ ታና ዔኪ ዓኣዻኔ።<verse eid="PSA 23:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 23:4"/>ሻኔ ዹሚ ማዔ ዶኦቺናታዖ ታ ዓኣዼታቴያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 23:4">ኔኤኒ ታኣና ዎላ ማዔሢሮ ዓይጎ ፑርታ ባኣዚ ታ ዒጊጫዓኬ።</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 23:4">ኔኤኮ ኮኦላ ታና ዶዲሻኔ።<verse eid="PSA 23:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 23:5"/>ታ ሞርካ ዛጋንቴ ሙኡዚ ኔ ታኣም ጊኢጊሻኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 23:5">ቶኦኮዋ ኔ ታኣኮ ዛይቶ ቲዦና ቲሽካኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 23:5">ታኣኮ ዑዦ ዓንጎ፥ ዑዣ ኩሚ ላኣሊንታኔ።<verse eid="PSA 23:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 23:6"/>ታ ናንጎ ዎዶ ቢያይዳ ኮሹሞና ናሹሞና ዓኣያ ማዓንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 23:6">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ማኣራ ቢያ ዎዴ ታ ናንጋንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 23:6"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="PSA 24"/>
  <para style="s1">ዳውቴ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="d">ዼኤፖ ካኣታሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 24:1"/>ሳዖንታ ዒኢካ ዓኣ ባካ ቢያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:1">ዓጮንታ ጋሮይዳ ዓኣ ባካ ቢያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:1">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሮኬ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24፡1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 10:26">1ቆሮ. 10፡26</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 24:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 24:2"/>ዒዚ ሳዖ ባዞ ዑፃ ማዤኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:2">ዬያ ዋኣፆ ዑፆይዳ ዶዲሺ ዲይሤሢያ ዒዛኬ።<verse eid="PSA 24:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 24:3"/>ሌካ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳኮ ዹኮ ዖኦኒ ኬስካንዳይ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:3">ዒዛኮ ዱማዼ ቤዞይዳ ዖ ዔቃንዳይ?<verse eid="PSA 24:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 24:4"/>ዬያ ማዻኒ ዳንዳዓሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:4">ጌኤሺ ኩቺና ፒዜ ዒኔና ዓኣያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:4">ሜሌ ፆኦዞ ካኣሽኩዋያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:4">ሉኡዙሞና ጫኣቁዋዞንሢኬ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24፡4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:8">ማቲ. 5፡8</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 24:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 24:5"/>ዬይ ዓሳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:5">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳይዳፓ ዓንጆ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:5">ዻቂሻያ ማዔ ፔ ፆኦዛሢዳፓ ማኣዶዋ ዴንቃንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 24:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 24:6"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ባንሢ ዑካንዳዞንሢና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:6">ያይቆኦቤ ፆኦዛሢ ኮዓንዳዞንሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:6">ዬንሢጉዴ ዓሶንሢኬ።<verse eid="PSA 24:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 24:7"/>ዒንሢ ዼኤፖ ዓሳ ጌሎ ካሮ ቡሉዋቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:7">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጌሎ ካራ ቡሊንቶንጎ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:7">ቦንቺንቴ ካኣታሢያ ጌሎንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 24:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 24:8"/>ዬይ ቦንቺንታ ካኣቲ ዖናዳይ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:8">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:8">ዒዚ ዶዳሢና ዖሎናኣ ዔርቴሢኬ።<verse eid="PSA 24:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 24:9"/>ዒንሢ ዼኤፖ ዓሳ ጌሎ ካሮ ቡሉዋቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:9">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጌሎ ካራኣ ቡሊንቶንጎ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:9">ቦንቺንታ ካኣታሢያ ጌሎንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 24:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 24:10"/>ዬይ ቦንቺንታ ካኣታሢ ዖናዳይ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:10">ዬይ ቦንቺንታ ካኣቲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:10">ቢያ ባኮ ዎይሣ ጎዳሢኬ።<verse eid="PSA 24:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="PSA 25"/>
  <para style="s1">ዳውቴ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="d">ሜቶ ዎዴና ሺኢቂንቴ ሺኢጲሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 25:1"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:1">ታኣኮ ዒኖ ማሊፆ ታ ኔኤም ሺኢሻኔ።<verse eid="PSA 25:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 25:2"/>ታ ፆኦዛሢዮ! ታኣኒ ኔና ጉሙርቃኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:2">ታ ሞርካ ታና ባሻንዳጉዲ ማሂ ታና ቦርሲሲፖ።<verse eid="PSA 25:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 25:3"/>ኔና ጉሙርቃዞንሢ ቦርሲንቱዋሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:3">ቦርሲንታዞንሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:3">ኔኤም ዋይዞ ዒፆሮ ሩኡራዞንሢኬ።<verse eid="PSA 25:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 25:4"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ኔ ኮጲዞ ታና ዔርዜ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:4">ኔ ጎይፆዋ ኔኤኒ ታና ዻዌ።<verse eid="PSA 25:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 25:5"/>ኔኤኒ ታና ዓውሳ ፆኦዛሢኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:5">ኔኤኮ ጎኑሞ ጊንፆ ሃንቲ ናንጋንዳጉዲ ታና ዔርዜ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:5">ታኣኒ ቢያ ዎዴ ጉሙርቃሢ ኔናኬ።<verse eid="PSA 25:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 25:6"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:6">ሚናፓ ዓርቃዖ ኔ ዻዋ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:6">ሚጪንቲፆንታ ናንጊና ናንጋ ናሹሞዋ ማሌ።<verse eid="PSA 25:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 25:7"/>ታኣኒ ዼጌ ዓኣዖ ማዼ ጎሞ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:7">ዻቢንቶዋ ታኣኮ ማሊፖ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:7">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ኔኤኮ ኮሹማ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:7">ሚርጌ ጎይፆ፥ ኔ ሚጪንቲፆጉዲያኣ ታኣም ማሌ።<verse eid="PSA 25:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 25:8"/>ፆኦሲ ኮሺ፥ ሃሣ ፒዜ ማዔሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:8">ጎሞ ዓሳ ዓኣዻኒ ኮይሳ ጎይፆ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:8">ዒዚ ዔዔርዛኔ።<verse eid="PSA 25:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 25:9"/>ሼሌዔ ማዔዞንሢ ፒዜ ጎይሢ ዒ ዔኪ ዓኣዻኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:9">ጎይፆዋ ዔያቶ ዒ ዔርዛኔ።<verse eid="PSA 25:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 25:10"/>ዒዛኮ ጫኣቁሞና ዳምቦና ካፓዞንሢም</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:10">ጎይፃ ቢያ ናሹሞና ጉሙርቂንቲሢናኬ።<verse eid="PSA 25:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 25:11"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ጎማ ታኣኮ ዼኤፒታሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:11">ኔኤኮ ሱንፆ ቦንቾሮ ጌዒጋፓ ዓቶንጎ ታኣም ጌዔ።<verse eid="PSA 25:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 25:12"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዒጊጫሢ ዖናዳይ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:12">ዔያታ ሃንታኒ ኮይሳ ጎይፆ ዶኦራንዳጉዲ ዒዚ ዔያቶ ዔርዛኔ።<verse eid="PSA 25:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 25:13"/>ዬይ ዓሳ ዎዶ ቢያ ዖርጎቹሞና ናንጋንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:13">ዔያቶኮ ናኣታኣ ሳዖ ዔካንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 25:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 25:14"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዒዛም ዓይሢንታዞንሢኮ ቢያ ላጌኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:14">ዔያቶም ዒዚ ጫኣቄ ጫኣቁሞዋ ዶዲሻኔ።<verse eid="PSA 25:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 25:15"/>ዒዚ ታና ፒራሢዳፓ ቢያ ዓውሴሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:15">ቢያ ዎዴ ታ ዒዛ ባንሢ ዛጋኔ።<verse eid="PSA 25:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 25:16"/>ታኣኒ ታኣሮ ሌሊ ማዒ ሜታዻያ ማዔሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:16">ታ ፆኦዛሢዮ! ኔ ሃንጋ ታ ባንሢ ማዔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:16">ታኣም ኮሺ ባኣዚያ ማዼ።<verse eid="PSA 25:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 25:17"/>ታኣኮ ዒኖ ሜታሢ ሚርጌኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:17">ዋኣዪፃፓኣ ታና ሃውሺሴ።<verse eid="PSA 25:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 25:18"/>ታኣኮ ዋኣዪፆንታ ሜታሢንታ ኔ ዛጌ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:18">ጎሞዋ ቢያ ኔ ታኣም ዓቶም ጌዔ።<verse eid="PSA 25:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 25:19"/>ሞርካ ታኣኮ ዎማጉዲ ሚርጌቴያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:19">ዔያታ ታና ዎማይዲ ዒፃቴያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:19">ኔኤኒ ሂንዳ ዛጌ።<verse eid="PSA 25:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 25:20"/>ሼምፓሢ ታኣኮ ካፔ፥ ታና ዓውሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:20">ኔና ታኣኒ ታኣኮ ፑኖ ካያሢ ማሄሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:20">ታና ቦርሲሲፖ።<verse eid="PSA 25:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 25:21"/>ታኣኒ ኔና ሃጊ ማዓ ዎዛ ማሂ ጌሤሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:21">ፂሉሞንታ ፒዙሞንታ ታና ካፓንዳጉዲ ማሄ።<verse eid="PSA 25:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 25:22"/>ፆኦዛሢዮ! ዒስራዔኤሌ ዓሶ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:22">ሜቶ ቢያይዳፓ ዓውሴ!<verse eid="PSA 25:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="PSA 26"/>
  <para style="s1">ዳውቴ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="d">ጌኤሺ ዓሲ ሺኢጲሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 26:1"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ፒዙሞና ሴካ ሃንጋ ዓጊፁዋዖ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:1">ኔና ጉሙርቂ ታ ናንጌሢሮ ታኣም ዎጌ።<verse eid="PSA 26:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 26:2"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ታ ዒና ዎማዺታቴያ ዓጊሢ ዛጌ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:2">ታኣኒ ሱኡካዻ ሱኡኮንታ ታኣኮ ማሊፆዋ ዛጊ ዔሬ።<verse eid="PSA 26:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 26:3"/>ኔኤኮ ጋፑዋ ናሹማ ታ ዓኣፓፓ ባይቁዋሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:3">ቢያ ዎዴ ታና ዔኪ ዓኣዻሢ ኔኤኮ ጉሙርቂንቲፆኬ።<verse eid="PSA 26:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 26:4"/>ጌሻ ዓሶና ዎላ ታኣኒ ላጋቲባኣሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:4">ፔና ጌኤሺ ማሃ ዓሶና ዎላ ታ ሶኦሪባኣሴ።<verse eid="PSA 26:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 26:5"/>ፑርቶ ማዻ ዓሶኮ ቡኪንቶ ታኣኒ ዒፄኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:5">ዬያ ዓሶና ዎላ ታ ዴዓኒያ ናሽኩዋሴ።<verse eid="PSA 26:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 26:6"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:6">ታኣኒ ጌኤሺ ማዔሢ ዔርዛኒ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:6">ኩጮ ታኣኮ ታኣኒ ማስታኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:6">ዒንጎ ባኮ ኔኤም ሺኢሾ ቤዞኮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:6">ዓጮ ታ ሺሪ ሺሪ ኔና ካኣሽካኔ።<verse eid="PSA 26:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 26:7"/>ጋላታ ዓይኑሞ ዓይናዺ ዓይናዺ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:7">ኔ ዎልቆና ማዺንታ ዓኮ ባኮ ቢያ ታ ኬኤዛኔ።<verse eid="PSA 26:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 26:8"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:8">ኔኤኒ ናንጋ ማኣሮና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:8">ቦንቻኣ ኔኤኮ ጴዻ ቤዞ ታ ናሽካኔ።<verse eid="PSA 26:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 26:9"/>ሼምፓሢ ታኣኮ ሱጉፆ ላኣላ ዓሶሲና ዎላ ዔኪፖ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:9">ናንጎዋ ታኣኮ ዓሶ ዎዻ ዓሶና ዎላ ባይዚፖ።<verse eid="PSA 26:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 26:10"/>ዬያቶኮ ኩጫ ጌኔ ማዾ ማዻኒ ዔቄያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:10">ሚዛቆ ኩጫኣ ዔያቶኮ ዴሜና ዒንጎ ሚኢሼ ቡኩሳያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 26:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 26:11"/>ታኣኒ ታ ዛሎና ፓጬ ባኣዚባኣ ፒዜ ናንጊ ናንጋኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:11">ታና ሚጪንቴ፥ ዓውሲያ ዓውሴ!<verse eid="PSA 26:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 26:12"/>ቶካ ታኣኮ ባኣሲንቲ ጊኢጌ ቤሲዳ ዔቄኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:12">ሚርጌ ቡኬ ኔ ዓሶ ባኣካ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ታ ጋላታኔ።<verse eid="PSA 26:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="PSA 27"/>
  <para style="s1">ዳውቴ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="d">ጋላታ ሺኢጲሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 27:1"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ታኣኮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:1">ፖዓሢና ዼኤሻሢናታሢሮ ዖናኣ ታ ዒጊጩዋሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:1">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ታ ናንጎኮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:1">ሺባሢታሢሮ ዖኦኒያ ታና ዒጊቹዋሴ።<verse eid="PSA 27:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 27:2"/>ፑርቶ ማዻ ዓሳ ባሺ ታና ዎዻኒ ማላኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:2">ጋዓንቴ ፔኤሮ ዔያታ ዹቂንቲ ሎኦማኔ።<verse eid="PSA 27:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 27:3"/>ሚርጌ ዖላ ዓሳ ታና ማንጌታቴያ ታኣኒ ዒጊጩዋሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:3">ታኣኮ ሞርካ ታና ዖሌታቴያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:3">ታኣኒ ፆኦሲ ጉሙርቂፆ ሃሻዓኬ።<verse eid="PSA 27:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 27:4"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ታኣኒ ፔቴ ባኣዚ ሺኢቃኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:4">ዬና ታ ሺኢቃዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:4">ታ ናንጎ ዎዶ ቢያይዳ ፆኦሲ ማኣራ ናንጋኒ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:4">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳኮ ዲቃሢ ሄርሺሳያ ማዒፆዋ ዛጋኒ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:4">ዒዛኮ ጌኤዦ ማኣሮይዳኣ ሺኢቃኒ ዳንዳዓንዳጉዲኬ።<verse eid="PSA 27:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 27:5"/>ሜታሢ ኬሎና ዒዚ ታና ፔ ሺቦ ዴማ ዓኣቻኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:5">ዬያ ዒዛ ማኣሮኮ ጋሮይዳ ታና ዒ ጌልዚ ጌሣኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:5">ላሌ ሹቺዳኣ ዼጊዲ ታና ዔቂሳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 27:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 27:6"/>ሃሢ ታ ኮሮይዳ ዓኣ ታ ሞርኮ ዑፃ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:6">ታኣኒ ታና ዼግ ዼጊዴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:6">ዎዛና ታ ዒላሺ ዒላሺ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:6">ዒዛኮ ጌኤዦ ማኣሮይዳ ዒንጎ ዒንጊሢ ታ ሺኢሻንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:6">ዓይናዺ ዓይናዺ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ጋላታንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 27:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 27:7"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:7">ዑኡዞ ታኣኒ ዼጊዲ ዒላታኣና ኔኤኒ ዋይዜ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:7">ማኣሪያ ታና ማኣሬ፤ ሺኢጲፆዋ ታኣኮ ዋይዜ!<verse eid="PSA 27:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 27:8"/>ዒና ታና «ዒዛኮ ዓኣፖ ካሮ ኮዔ» ጌዔኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:8">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ታኣኒ ኔኤኮ ዓኣፖ ካሮ ኮዓኔ።<verse eid="PSA 27:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 27:9"/>ኔኤኮ ዓኣፖ ካሮ ታጊዳፓ ማሂፖ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:9">ዻጋዺ ኔ ዓይላሢ፥ ታና ኔኤፓ ሃኪሲፖ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:9">ዎይቴቴያ ኔኤኒ ታኣኮ ማኣዳሢኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:9">ታና ዓውሳ ታ ፆኦዛሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:9">ታና ኬኤሪፖ፥ ሃሺያ ሃሺፖ።<verse eid="PSA 27:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 27:10"/>ታ ዓዶና ታ ዒንዶና ታና ሃሼቴያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:10">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ታ ቶኦኮ ዛጋንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 27:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 27:11"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ጎይፆ ኔኤሲ ታና ዔርዜ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:11">ታኣኮ ሚርጌ ሞርኬ ዓኣሢሮ ኮሺ ጎይሢና ታና ዔኪ ዓኣዼ።<verse eid="PSA 27:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 27:12"/>ሉኡዙሞና ማርካዻ ዓሳ ፑርቱሞ ጌስቲ ጌስቲ ታ ዑፃ ዔቄሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:12">ታ ሞርካ ኮዓ ጎይፆ ዓኣሢ ታና ኔ ዔያቶም ዒንጊፖ።<verse eid="PSA 27:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 27:13"/>ሼምፓሢና ዓኣ ዓሳ ናንጋ ሳዔሎይዳ ታ ዓኣ ዎዶና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:13">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳኮ ኮሹሞ ታ ዛጋንዳሢ ጉሙርቃኔ።<verse eid="PSA 27:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 27:14"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ጉሙርቄ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:14">ዶዴ፥ ዎዛ ቲቂፖ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:14">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ጉሙርቄ።<verse eid="PSA 27:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="PSA 28"/>
  <para style="s1">ዳውቴ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="d">ማኣዶ ዴንቃኒ ሺኢቂንቴ ሺኢጲሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 28:1"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ኔ ባንሢ ታ ዒላታኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:1">ታኣኮ ላላሢዮ፥ ዋይዜዖ ታኣም ዋይዚባኣያ ማዒፖ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:1">ኔኤኒ ታኣም ዚቲዮ ጌዔያታቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:1">ዔቴይዳ ዱኡኪንቴ ዓሲ ታኣኒ ማዓንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 28:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 28:2"/>ማኣዶሮ ኔ ባንሢ ታ ዒላታ ዎዶና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:2">ኔኤኮ ዱማዼ ጌኤዦ ማኣሮ ባንሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:2">ኩጮ ታኣኮ ታ ዔቂሳኣና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:2">ሺኢጲፆ ታኣኮ ዋይዜ።<verse eid="PSA 28:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 28:3"/>ዔያቶኮ ዒኖ ጋራ ጌኔ ባኣዚ ዓኣታንቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:3">ፔ ላጎና ዎላ ኮሺ ጌስታ ፑርቶ ማዻ ዓሶና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:3">ዋይዞ ዒፃ ዓሶና ዎላ ጎቺ ታና ዔኪ ዓኣዺፖ።<verse eid="PSA 28:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 28:4"/>ዔያቶኮ ማዾ ጉዴያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:4">ዔያታ ማዼ ፑርቱሞ ጉዴያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:4">ዔያቶም ጪጌ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:4">ዔያታ ማዼሢ ጉዴያ ዔያቶም ማሂ ዒንጌ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28፡4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 22:12">ዮሃ. ፆፔዻ 22፡12</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 28:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 28:5"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዔያታ ዔኤቢኬ ጎዑዋሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:5">ዒዚ ማዼ ማዾዋ ዔያታ ማሉዋሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:5">ዒዚ ዔያቶ ሻሃንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:5">ጊንሣ ማሂያ ዒ ዔያቶ ኮሻዓኬ።<verse eid="PSA 28:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 28:6"/>ታኣኮ ሺኢጲፆ ዒዚ ዋይዜሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:6">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዓንጂንቴያ ማዖንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 28:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 28:7"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ታኣኮ ዎልቃሢና ጊቲማሢናኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:7">ዒና ታኣኮ ዒዛ ጉሙርቃኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:7">ዒዚያ ታና ማኣዴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:7">ዒና ታኣኮ ኮሺ ዋዛዼኔ፥ ዓይኑሞናኣ ታ ዒዛ ጋላታንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 28:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 28:8"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ፔ ዴሮኮ ዎልቃሢኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:8">ዒዚ ዶኦሚ ካኣታሤሢማኣ ዻቂንታ ማዓ ዼጌ ዹካሢኬ።<verse eid="PSA 28:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 28:9"/>ዴሮ ኔኤኮ ዓውሴ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:9">ኔኤሮ ማዔ ዓሶዋ ዓንጄ፥ ዔያቶ ሄንቃሢ ኔና ማዔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:9">ናንጊና ዔያቶ ቶኦኮ ዛጋያ ማዔ።<verse eid="PSA 28:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 28"/>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="PSA 29"/>
  <para style="s1">ዳውቴ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="d">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዑኡዞኮ ዎልቆ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 29:1"/>ዒንሢ ፆኦሲ ኪኢታንቻ! ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳም ዒንጉዋቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:1">ቦንቾና ዶዱሞና ዒዛሮኬ ጎዑዋቴ።<verse eid="PSA 29:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 29:2"/>ዒዛኮ ሱንፆም ኮይሳ ቦንቾ ዒንጉዋቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:2">ዒዛኮ ዱማዼ ዼኤፑሞሮዋ ዒዛም ዚጉዋቴ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29፡2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 96:7-9">ዓይኑ. 96፡7-9</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 29:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 29:3"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳኮ ዑኡዛ ዋኣፆ ዑፃ ማኣማኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:3">ቦንቺንታ ፆኦዛሢያ ጉጉንሣኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:3">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዼኤፖ ዋኣፆ ዑፃ ጉኡማኔ።<verse eid="PSA 29:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 29:4"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳኮ ዑኡዛ ዎልቄና ዓኣያኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:4">ዒዛኮ ዑኡዛ ዼኤፒ ዲቃሣያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 29:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 29:5"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳኮ ዑኡዛ ዴኤሎ ዚቢቆ ሜንሣኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:5">ዑኡዛ ዒዛኮ ሊባኖኦሴ ሚፆዋ ሾኦላኔ።<verse eid="PSA 29:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 29:6"/>ሊባኖኦሴ ዹኮ ማርሶ ዻንቄ ናኣሪጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:6">ሲሪዮኔ ዹኮዋ ዖሶ ናይጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:6">ዎዛሲ ፂኪሳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 29:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 29:7"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳኮ ዑኡዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:7">ታሚ ሎስቶጉዲ ፖዓኔ።<verse eid="PSA 29:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 29:8"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳኮ ዑኡዛ ዓሲ ናንጉዋ ዳውሎ ዓጊሣኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:8">ቃዴሴኮዋ ዓሳ ናንጉዋ ሳዖ ጎቃይሳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 29:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 29:9"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳኮ ዑኡዛ ዶቆዞ ሾይዣኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:9">ሚፆኮዋ ዋላዦ ዲኢኒሻኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:9">ዒዛኮ ዱማዼ ቤዞይዳ ዓኣዞንሢ ዑኡዞ ዒዛሲ ዋይዛዖ፦</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:9">«ቦንቾ ፆኦሲም ማዖንጎ!» ጋዓኔ።<verse eid="PSA 29:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 29:10"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዼኤፖ ዋኣፆ ዎይሣሢኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:10">ዒዚ ናንጊና ካኣታዺ ዬያ ዑፃ ዴዓኔ።<verse eid="PSA 29:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 29:11"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ፔ ዴሮም ዎልቄ ዒንጋኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:11">ዒዚ ዴሮ ፔኤሲ ኮሹሞና ዓንጃኔ።<verse eid="PSA 29:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 29"/>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="PSA 30"/>
  <para style="s1">ጌኤዦ ማኣሮ ዓንጂ ማዾም ጊኢጊሾ ኬሎ ዓይናዺንቴ ዳውቴ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="d">ጋላታ ሺኢጲሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 30:1"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ሂርኬ ቤዛፓ ኔ ታና ዔቂሴሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:1">ታ ሞርካ ታኣኮ ሜቶና ዎዛዻንዳጉዲ ኔ ማሂባኣሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:1">ታ ኔና ዼግ ዼጊዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 30:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 30:2"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ማዔ ፆኦዛሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:2">ኔ ታና ማኣዳንዳጉዲ ታ ኔና ዔኤሌም</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:2">ኔኤኒያ ታና ፓሤኔ።<verse eid="PSA 30:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 30:3"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ሼምፓሢ ታኣኮ ሄሊንቱዋያ ማዔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:3">ዹሞ ዔታፓ ኔኤኒ ኬሴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:3">ሊካ ዱኡፖ ዔቶ ኬዲፆይዳፓ ኔ ታና ካፔኔ።<verse eid="PSA 30:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 30:4"/>ዒንሢ ዒዛም ጉሙርቂንታያ ማዒ ማዻዛንሢ ቢያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:4">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዓይኑሞና ጋላቱዋቴ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:4">ዒዛኮ ዱማዼ ሱንፆማኣ ጋላታ ሺኢሹዋቴ።<verse eid="PSA 30:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 30:5"/>ዒዚ ዻጋዻሢ ቃሚሢ ዎዴምኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:5">ኮሹማ ዒዛኮ ጋዓንቴ ናንጊና ናንጋያኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:5">ዋንቶ ዬኤኬ ጎይሣ ዎርቂንቴቴያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:5">ጉቶ ዎዎዛዺንታኔ።<verse eid="PSA 30:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 30:6"/>ታና ጉሙርሳ ዓሢ ታኣኒ ዔራሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:6">«ፔቴታዖ ታ ባሺንታዓኬ» ጌዔኔ።<verse eid="PSA 30:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 30:7"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ኔ ዼኤፑሞና ዹካ ታኣሲ ዶዴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:7">ኔኤኮ ዓኣፖ ካሮ ታ ጊዳፓ ኔ ማሄ ዎዶና ዒና ታኣኮ ዲቃቴኔ፤<verse eid="PSA 30:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 30:8"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ኔና ታ ዔኤላኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:8">ኔ ባንሢ ሂዚ ጌዒያ ታ ሺኢቄኔ፦<verse eid="PSA 30:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 30:9"/>ታኣኮ ዱኡኪንቲፆና ሃይቦና ዓይጎ ኔና ማኣዳንዳይ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:9">ዓጪ ኔና ጋላታ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:9">ኔኤኒ ጉሙርቂንታያ ማዔሢ ዓጫ ኬኤዛንዳ?<verse eid="PSA 30:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 30:10"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ታኣም ዋይዜ፥ ታና ሚጪንቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:10">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ታና ማኣዳሢ ኔና ማዔ።<verse eid="PSA 30:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 30:11"/>ዖዪፆ ኔኤኒ ታኣኮ ዎዛና ላኣሜኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:11">ሲዮ ፓቲሎ ኔኤኒ ታኣኮ ጉሲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:11">ፓልሞ ኔ ታና ማይሴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 30:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 30:12"/>ዬያያሮ ታኣኒ ዚቲ ጋዓዓኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:12">ጋላታ ዓይኑሞ ኔኤም ታ ዓይናዻንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:12">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ኔኤኒ ታ ፆኦዛሢኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:12">ዬያሮ ናንጊና ታኣኒ ኔና ጋላታንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 30:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 30"/>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="PSA 31"/>
  <para style="s1">ዓይኑሞ ሱኡጋሢ ዓይሣ ጎይፆና ዓይናዺንታ ዳውቴ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="d">ሜቶ ዎዴና ፆኦሲ ጉሙርቂ ሺኢቂንታ ሺኢጲሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 31:1"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:1">ኔኤኒ ታኣኮ ፑኖ ካያሢ ማዓንዳጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:1">ታ ኔ ባንሢ ሙኬኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:1">ዬያሮ ታና ቦርሲሲፖ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:1">ኔኤኮ ፂሉሞና ታና ዓውሴ።<verse eid="PSA 31:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 31:2"/>ዋዮ ኔኤኮ ታ ባንሢ ማሂ ታኣም ዋይዜ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:2">ዑካዺ ሙኪ ታና ዓውሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:2">ታኣኮ ጌኤቂንቲ ዔቆ ላላሢ ማዔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:2">ታና ዓውሳኒ ታኣኮ ዶዶ ዋርዲዮ ቤዛሢያ ማዔ።<verse eid="PSA 31:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 31:3"/>ኔኤኒ ታኣኮ ዓኣሺንቶ ዋርዲዮ ቤዛሢኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:3">ኔኤኮ ሱንፆሮ ጌዒጋፓ ታና ዔኪ ዓኣዼ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:3">ታኣኒ ዓኣዻንዳ ጎይፆዋ ኔ ታና ቤኤዜ።<verse eid="PSA 31:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 31:4"/>ኔኤኒ ታኣኮ ፑኖ ካያሢ ማዔሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:4">ታ ሞርካ ታኣም ዓኣቺ ፒሬ ፒራሢዳፓ ታና ኔ ቶሊሴ።<verse eid="PSA 31:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 31:5"/>ጎኑሞ ፆኦሲ ማዔ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:5">ታኣኮ ሼምፓሢ ታ ኔኤም ሃሼኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:5">ታና ኔኤኒ ዓውሴ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31፡5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 23:46">ሉቃ. 23፡46</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 31:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 31:6"/>ዔኤቢ ፓሡዋያ ማዔ ሜሌ ፆኦዞም</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:6">ዚጋዞንሢ ቢያ ኔኤኒ ዒዒፃኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:6">ታኣኒ ጋዓንቴ ኔና ጉሙርቃኔ።<verse eid="PSA 31:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 31:7"/>ኔኤኮ ናንጊና ናንጋ ናሹማ ታና ዎዎዛሳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:7">ሚርጌናኣ ታ ዎዛዻኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:7">ሜታሢ ኔ ታኣኮ ዛጌኔ፥ ዋኣዪፆዋ ታኣኮ ኔ ዔራኔ።<verse eid="PSA 31:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 31:8"/>ሞርኮም ዓኣሢ ኔ ታና ዒንጊባኣሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:8">ጋዓንቴ ኔኤኒ ታኣም ዳልጊ ጎይሢ ጲሼኔ።<verse eid="PSA 31:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 31:9"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ታኣኒ ሜቶይዳታሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:9">ታና ሚጪንቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:9">ዓኣፓ ታኣኮ ዖዪፆና ላቤኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:9">ሼምፓሢንታ ዑፆንታ ታኣኮ ዶጬኔ።<verse eid="PSA 31:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 31:10"/>ታኣኮ ናንጋ ሜቶና፥ ሌዓኣ ታኣኮ ዚኢሊንቲሢና ጋፔኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:10">ሜታ ታኣኮ ሚርጌሢሮ ዎልቄ ታኣኮ ባይቄኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:10">ሜጌፃኣ ታኣኮ ላቤኔ።<verse eid="PSA 31:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 31:11"/>ታኣኒ ታኣኮ ሞርኮም ሚኢቺ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:11">ታኣኮ ዓሺኖማኣ ዲቃሣያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:11">ታና ዔራ ዓሶም ታኣኒ ዒጊቻያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:11">ጎይፃ ታና ዔያታ ዴንቃዖ ታ ጋይቴ ዓዓኣሺንታኔ።<verse eid="PSA 31:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 31:12"/>ዓዳ ሃይቄ ዓሲጉዲ ታኣኒ ዋሊንቴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:12">ሃይቄም ኬኤሮና ቦኦቆና ዖቲናጉዲ ታ ማዔኔ።<verse eid="PSA 31:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 31:13"/>ሚርጌ ዓሲ ካሽካሻንቴ ታኣኒ ዋይዜኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:13">ጉቤ ባንፆና ዒጊቻያ ማዔኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:13">ታና ባይዛኒ ዔያታ ዎሊና ጌስታኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:13">ዎዻኒያ ዎላ ዔያታ ዞርታኔ።<verse eid="PSA 31:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 31:14"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ኔኤኒ ታኣኮ ፆኦዛሢኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:14">ታኣኒ ኔና ጉሙርቃኔ።<verse eid="PSA 31:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 31:15"/>ታኣኒ ቢያ ዎዴ ኔ ኩጫኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:15">ታኣኮ ሞርኮና ዒፂ ታና ዳውሳዞንሢናፓ ቢያ ታና ዓውሴ።<verse eid="PSA 31:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 31:16"/>ኔኤኮ ዓይላሢ፥ ታና ጌኤሺ ዓኣፒ ካራና ዛጌ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:16">ኔኤኮ ጋፑዋ ናሹሞና ታና ዓውሴ።<verse eid="PSA 31:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 31:17"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:17">ታኣኒ ኔና ዔኤላ ዎዶና ኔ ታና ቦርሲሲፖ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:17">ፑርቶ ማዻ ዓሳ ጋዓንቴ ቦርሲንቶንጎ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:17">ዔያታ ዓጊፁዋያ ማዒ ሊካ ዹሞ ዔታ ሎኦሞንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 31:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 31:18"/>ፂላሢዳ ዔያታ ሆኦሊንቲሢና ዖቶርሙሞና ጌስታሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:18">ዔያቶኮ ሉኡቃ ዻንጎ ዚቲዴ።<verse eid="PSA 31:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 31:19"/>ኔ ዴማ ዓታኒ ኔ ባንሢ ዑካዞንሢም</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:19">ዓሶ ቢያ ቤርታ ኔ ዒንጋ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:19">ኔና ዒጊጫዞንሢም ኔ ጊኢጊሼ ኮሹማ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:19">ዎዚ ዼኤፓይ!<verse eid="PSA 31:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 31:20"/>ዓሳ ዔያቶ ባይዛኒ ዞርታሢዳፓ ኔ ማኣሮ ዴማ ኔ ዔያቶ ዓኣቼኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:20">ማርማሢዳፓ ዔያቶ ዓውሳኒ ኔ ኬኤፆ ጋሮ ኔ ዔያቶ ጌልዜኔ።<verse eid="PSA 31:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 31:21"/>ማንጊንቴ ካታሜሎ ጋራ ታኣኒ ዓኣንቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:21">ዲቃሢ ሄርሺሳ ናሹሞ ኔኤኒ ታና ዻዌኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:21">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዓንጂንቶንጎ!<verse eid="PSA 31:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 31:22"/>ታኣኒ ሚርጌና ዲቃቴሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:22">ኔ ዓኣፓፓ ኔ ታና ጋፒ ሂዔያ ታኣም ማሌኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:22">ጋዓንቴ ታ ኔ ባንሢ ማኣዳሢ ኮዒ ዒላታዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:22">ዒላቶ ኔ ታኣሲ ዋይዜኔ።<verse eid="PSA 31:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 31:23"/>ዒንሢ ዒዛም ዱማዼ ዓሳ ቢያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:23">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ናሽኩዋቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:23">ዒዚ ጉሙርቂንታዞንሢ ካፓኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:23">ዖቶርቃዞንሢም ጋዓንቴ ሜቶ ዒ ዓጋኔ።<verse eid="PSA 31:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 31:24"/>ዒንሢ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ሃጋኣ ዎዛ ማሂ ጌሣ ዓሳ ቢያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:24">ዒጊጪፖቴ፤ ዒናኣ ዒንሢኮ ዶዶንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 31:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 31"/>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="PSA 32"/>
  <para style="s1">ዳውቴ ኬኤዚ ዔርዜ ባኮ</para>
  <para style="d">ጎሜ ቡኡፂ ማኣሪንቲሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 32:1"/>ጎሞ ዓቶም ጌይንቴዞንሢና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:1">ዻቢንቶዋ ካንቆና ዓሳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:1">ዓንጂንቴያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 32:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 32:2"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ጎሞ ዒዛኮ ዓርቂባኣሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:2">ሉኡዙሞ ሉኡቁዋ ዓሲያ ዓንጂንቴያኬ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32፡2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 4:7-8">ሮሜ 4፡7-8</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 32:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 32:3"/>ጎሞ ታኣኮ ታኣኒ ቡኡፁዋዖ ሃሼ ዎዶና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:3">ሮኦሮ ጉቤ ታኣኒ ዚኢሊንታሢሮ ዑፃ ታኣኮ ላቤኔ።<verse eid="PSA 32:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 32:4"/>ሮኦሮና ዋንቶና ኔ ታና ኮሺ ሜታሴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:4">ሎጪ ባኣዚኮ ሎጩማ ዖጎሢና ሜላሢጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:4">ዎልቃ ታኣኮ ጋፒ ባይቄኔ።<verse eid="PSA 32:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 32:5"/>ጎሞ ታኣኮ ታኣኒ ኔኤም ቡኡፄኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:5">ዻቢንቶዋ ታኣኮ ታኣኒ ዓኣቺባኣሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:5">ጎሞ ታኣኮ ቢያ ኔኤም ታ ቡኡፃኒ ማሌኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:5">ኔኤኒያ ጎሞ ታኣኮ ቢያ ዓቶም ጌዔኔ።<verse eid="PSA 32:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 32:6"/>ዬያሮ ፂሎ ዓሲ ቢያ ሜቶ ዎዴና ኔና ሺኢቆንጎ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:6">ዎልቄና ዓኣ ዶዲ ዲጲ ኩሚ ሙካ ዎዶና</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:6">ዬይ ዲጳ ዒዛ ዔኤቢ ዎኦታዓኬ።<verse eid="PSA 32:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 32:7"/>ኔኤኒ ታኣኮ ፑኖ ካያሢኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:7">ሜታስካፓ ኔ ታና ካፓንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:7">ኔኤኒ ታና ዓውሴሢሮ ዒላቲ ዎዛና ታኣኒ ዓይናዻኔ።<verse eid="PSA 32:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 32:8"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ታኣም፦ «ታኣኒ ኔና ዔርዛንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:8">ኔኤኒ ሃንታንዳ ጎይፆዋ ታ ኔና ዻዋንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:8">ታ ኔና ዞራንዳኔ፥ ካፒያ ካፓንዳኔ» ጌዔኔ።<verse eid="PSA 32:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 32:9"/>ዔያቶ ዓርቂ ቃዛኒ፥ ቢፃልቂያ ጫኣናኒ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:9">ጎቺ ዓኣዾ ፓሮና ባቁሎናጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:9">ጊኢጉዋያ ማዒፖቴ።</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:9">ፓሮና ባቁሎና ዒንሢ ዬያይዲባኣቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:9">ዒንሢ ባንሢ ዑካዓኬ።<verse eid="PSA 32:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 32:10"/>ጎሞ ዓሶኮ ሜታሢ ሚርጌኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:10">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ጉሙርቃ ዓሳ ጋዓንቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:10">ዒዛኮ ናንጊና ናንጋ ናሹሞና ካንቂንታንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 32:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 32:11"/>ፂሎ ዓሲዮቴ! ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳና ዎዛዹዋቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:11">ዒኖ ፒዜዞንሢዮቴ! ዒላሹዋቴ።<verse eid="PSA 32:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 32"/>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="PSA 33"/>
  <para style="s1">ጋላታ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 33:1"/>ዒንሢ ፂሎ ዓሳ! ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ማዼ ባኮሮ ዎዛዹዋቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:1">ፒዜዞንሢ ዒዛ ጋላታንዳያ ኮይሳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 33:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 33:2"/>ጎኦላ ዋርቂ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ጋላቱዋቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:2">ታጶ ሻዦ ዴንሢ ዋርቆ ጎኦሎናኣ ዒዛም ዓይናዹዋቴ።<verse eid="PSA 33:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 33:3"/>ዓኪ ዓይኑሞ ዒዛም ዓይናዹዋቴ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:3">ጎኦሎ ሚዛጲሲ ዴንሢ ዋርቁዋቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:3">ዎዛናኣ ዒላሹዋቴ።<verse eid="PSA 33:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 33:4"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳኮ ቃኣላ ጎኔ ቃኣላኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:4">ማዻኣ ቢያ ዒዛኮ ጉሙርቂንታያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 33:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 33:5"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ፂሉሞና ፒዜ ዎጊሢና ናሽካኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:5">ዒዛኮ ናንጊና ናንጋ ናሹማ ሳዖ ኩማኔ።<verse eid="PSA 33:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 33:6"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢ ቃኣሎና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:6">ጫሪንጫ ማዢንቴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:6">ዒዛኮ ዑኡዞና ዓቦንታ ዓጊኖንታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:6">ዦኦጋሢያ ማዢንቴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 33:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 33:7"/>ባዞ ዋኣፆ ቢያ ዒ ፔቴ ቤስካ ቡኩሲ ዴይሤኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:7">ዼኤፖ ዔቶ ባዞ ዋኣፆማኣ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:7">ዴዓንዳ ቤሲ ዒዚ ጊኢጊሼኔ።<verse eid="PSA 33:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 33:8"/>ሳዖይዳ ናንጋ ዓሳ ቢያ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዒጊጩዋቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:8">ዓጮይዳ ዓኣ ሜሌ ዴራ ቢያ ዒዛ ቦንቹዋቴ።<verse eid="PSA 33:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 33:9"/>ዒዚ «ማዖም» ጋጋዓዛ ሳዓ ማዢንቴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:9">ዒዛኮ ዓይሢፆና ቢያ ባካ ዶዲ ዔቄኔ።<verse eid="PSA 33:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 33:10"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:10">ዴሮኮ ጌኖ ማሊፆ ቱኡዞ ሁርዲሳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:10">ዔያቶኮ ማሊፆዋ ፓሡዋያ ማሃኔ።<verse eid="PSA 33:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 33:11"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ቱኬ ቱኡዛ ናንጊና ዶዲ ናንጋያኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:11">ዒዛኮ ማሊፃኣ ሾይንቲፓ ሜሌ ሾይንቲ ሄላያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 33:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 33:12"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ማዔ ፆኦዛሢ ዓሲ ማዔያና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:12">ዒዚ ፔ ዓሲ ማሂ ዶኦሬ ዴሬ ዓንጂንቴያኬ!<verse eid="PSA 33:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 33:13"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ጫሪንጫፓ ሊካ ዛጋኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:13">ዓሲ ዜርሢ ቢያ ዒ ዴዴንቃኔ።<verse eid="PSA 33:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 33:14"/>ዒዚ ፔኤኮ ካኣቱሞ ዖይታ ዴዒ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:14">ሳዖይዳ ዓኣ ዓሶ ቢያ ዛጋኔ።<verse eid="PSA 33:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 33:15"/>ዒዚ ቢያሢኮ ዒኖ ማዤሢኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:15">ዔያታ ማዻ ባኮዋ ቢያ ዛጋኔ።<verse eid="PSA 33:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 33:16"/>ካኣታ ፔ ዖሎ ዓሶ ሚርጉሞና ዖሊ ባሹዋሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:16">ዖሎና ዔርቴሢ ፔኤኮ ዼኤፖ ዎልቆና ሃይባፓ ቶሉዋሴ።<verse eid="PSA 33:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 33:17"/>ፓራሢና ዖሊ ባሻንዳኔ ጌዒ ዎዛ ጌሥሢ ጉሪኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:17">ዔያታ ዬያ ዎልቆና ዖናኣ ዓውሳኒ ዳንዳዑዋሴ።<verse eid="PSA 33:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 33:18"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዒዛ ዒጊጫዞንሢና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:18">ዒዛኮ ናንጊና ናንጋ ናሹሞ ሃጋኣ ዎዛ ማሃዞንሢ ዛጋኔ።<verse eid="PSA 33:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 33:19"/>ሃይቦይዳፓ ዒዚ ዔያቶ ዬያና ዓውሳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:19">ናዮ ዎዶናኣ ሼምፔና ዒዚ ዔያቶ ዓይሳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 33:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 33:20"/>ሼምፓሢ ኑኡኮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:20">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ሃጊ ማዓ ዎዛ ማሂ ካፓኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:20">ኑና ማኣዳሢና ኑኡኮ ጊቲማሢያኣ ዒዛኬ።<verse eid="PSA 33:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 33:21"/>ዒዛኮ ዱማዼ ሱንፆ ኑ ጉሙርቃሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:21">ዒዚ ኑና ዎዛሳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 33:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 33:22"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:22">ኑኡኮ ሃጊ ማዓ ዎዞ ኔና ኑ ማሄ ጎይፆና</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:22">ኔኤኮ ጋፑዋ ናሹማ ኑኡም ማዖንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 33:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 33"/>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="PSA 34"/>
  <para style="s1">ዳውቴ ዓቤሜሌኬ ቤርቶ ዣኣዦ ማሊ ሙኬሢሮ ዳውሴም ዒ ጳሽካዖ ዓይናዼ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="d">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳኮ ኮሹሞሮ ጋላቲንታ ጋላታ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 34:1"/>ታኣኒ ቢያ ዎዴ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ጋላታኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:1">ታ ዒዛ ጋላቴ ጎይሣ ዴዓኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34፡1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 21:13-15">1ሳሙ. 21፡13-15</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 34:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 34:2"/>ታኣኒ ታኣኮ ጉቤ ዒናፓ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳና ሄርሺንታኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:2">ዒኖ ሼሌዞንሢ ዬያ ዋይዚ ዎዛዻኔ።<verse eid="PSA 34:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 34:3"/>ሃኒ ሙኩዋቴ፥ ታኣና ዎላ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ኑ ቦንቾም፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:3">ኑኡኒ ዎላ ሱንፆ ዒዛኮ ዼግ ዼጊዶም።<verse eid="PSA 34:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 34:4"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ታና ማኣዳንዳጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:4">ታኣኒ ኮዓዛ ዒ ታኣም ዋይዜኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:4">ታ ዒጊጫ ባኮ ቢያይዳፓ ታና ዒ ዓውሴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 34:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 34:5"/>ዒዛ ባንሢ ዛጋ ዓሶኮ ቢያ ዓኣፖ ካራ ፖዔኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:5">ፔቴታዖ ቦርሲንቲ ዔያታ ቦርሲንቱዋሴ።<verse eid="PSA 34:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 34:6"/>ሜታዺ ማኣዶ ኮዓ ዓሢ ዒላቴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:6">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳኣ ዒዛኮ ዬያ ዋይዜኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:6">ሜታሢዳፓኣ ቢያ ዒዛ ዓውሴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 34:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 34:7"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳኮ ኪኢታንቻሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:7">ፆኦሲ ዒጊጫ ዓሶኮ ዓጮ ማንጊ ዔቂ ካፓኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:7">ዔያቶኮ ኮይላ ማዒ ፑርታ ሜቶይዳፓ ዓውሳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 34:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 34:8"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳኮ ኮሹሞ ሂንዳ ዛጉዋቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:8">ዒዛ ፔኤኮ ጊቲማ ማሃ ዓሳ ዓንጂንቴያኬ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34፡8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 2:3">1ጴፂ. 2፡3</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 34:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 34:9"/>ዒንሢ ዱማዼ ዓሳ ዒዛ ዒጊጩዋቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:9">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዒጊጫ ዓሶም ፓጫ ባኣዚ ባኣሴ።<verse eid="PSA 34:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 34:10"/>ዞባ ካራ ባይዛኒና ናይዺንታኒያ ዳንዳዓኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:10">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ኮዓዞንሢም ጋዓንቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:10">ኮሺ ባኣዚ ፔቴታዖ ፓጫዓኬ።<verse eid="PSA 34:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 34:11"/>ታ ናይዮቴ! ሃኒ ሙኪ ዋይዙዋቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:11">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዒጊጮንዶ ጎይሢ ታ ዒንሢ ዔርዛንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 34:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 34:12"/>ዒንሢዳፓ ናንጊ ናንጋኒ ናሽካያና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:12">ሚርጌ ዎዴ ኮሺ ባኣዚ ዛጋኒ ኮዓሢ ዖናዳይ?<verse eid="PSA 34:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 34:13"/>ያዺ ማዔቴ ዻንጎ ኔኤኮ ፑርታ ባኣዚ ጌስቱዋጉዲ ዓርቄ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:13">ዒንዲርዛ ኔኤኮ ሉኡዙሞ ባኣዚ ጌስቱዋጉዲ ካፔ።<verse eid="PSA 34:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 34:14"/>ፑርታ ባኣዚዳፓ ሺኢኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:14">ኮሺ ባኣዚ ማዼ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:14">ኮሹሞ ኮዔ፥ ጊንፆማ ዒዞኮ ዓኣዼ።<verse eid="PSA 34:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 34:15"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢኮ ዓኣፓ ፂሎንሢ ባንሢ ዛጋኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:15">ዋያ ዒዛሲ ዒላቶ ዔያቶኮ ዋይዛኒ ቡሊንቴያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 34:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 34:16"/>ሳዓፓ ዔያቶ ማሊሲ ጶቂሣ ባኣዚ ባይዛኒ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:16">ዓኣፓ ዒዛኮ ፑርቶ ማዻዞንሢዳኬ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34፡16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 3:10-12">1ጴፂ. 3፡10-12</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 34:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 34:17"/>ፂሎ ዓሳ ዒላታዛ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዋይዛኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:17">ዔያቶኮ ዓኣ ሜታስካፓ ዒ ዔያቶ ዓውሳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 34:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 34:18"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዒኖ ሜቂ ማላዞንሢም ዑኬኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:18">ካራ ባይቂ ማላዞንሢያ ዒ ዓውሳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 34:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 34:19"/>ፂሎ ዓሶኮ ሜታ ሚርጌኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:19">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ጋዓንቴ ዬያ ቢያይዳፓ ዔያቶ ዓውሳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 34:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 34:20"/>ዔያቶኮ ሜጌፆ ቢያ ዒ ካፓሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:20">ዬያቶይዳፓ ፔቴ ሜጌሢታዖ ሜቁዋሴ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34፡20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 19:39">ዮሃ. 19፡39</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 34:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 34:21"/>ፑርቶ ማዻ ዓሶ ፑርቱማ ዎዻኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:21">ኮዦ ዓሶ ዒፃ ዓሳ ሜቶ ዛጋንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 34:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 34:22"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዒዛም ማዻዞንሢኮ ሼምፓሢ ዓውሳንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:22">ዒዛ ጉሙርቃ ዓሶ ፑርታ ባኣዚ ሄላዓኬ።<verse eid="PSA 34:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 34"/>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="PSA 35"/>
  <para style="s1">ዳውቴ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="d">ሜታዼ ዓሲ ሺኢቄ ሺኢጲሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 35:1"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ታና ዒፂ ማካ ዓሶ ኔ ማኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:1">ታና ዖላ ዓሶዋ ኔኤኒ ዖሌ።<verse eid="PSA 35:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 35:2"/>ኔኤኮ ዖሎ ዓንጋሞንታ ጊቲሞንታ ዓርቄ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:2">ሙኪያ ታና ማኣዴ።<verse eid="PSA 35:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 35:3"/>ዒፂ ታና ዳውሳ ዓሶም</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:3">ኔኤኮ ዎርፆንታ ጬንቾ ዓፓሮንታ ቱጊ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:3">«ታኣኒ ኔና ዓውሳሢኬ» ጌዒ ጎናሲ ኬኤዜ።<verse eid="PSA 35:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 35:4"/>ታና ዎዻኒ ኮዓዞንሢም ቢያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:4">ቦርሲንቲና ዻውሲንቲና ማዖንጎ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:4">ታኣም ፑርታ ማዻኒ ዎሊና ዞርታዞንሢ ቢያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:4">ዻውሲንቲ ጊንሢም ማዖንጎ!<verse eid="PSA 35:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 35:5"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳኮ ኪኢታንቻ ዔያቶ ዳውሳኣና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:5">ዢባሬ ፒፂ ዔኪ ዓኣዻ ዱባጉዲ ዔያታ ማዖንጎ!<verse eid="PSA 35:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 35:6"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳኮ ኪኢታንቻ ዔያቶ ዳውሳኣና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:6">ጎይፃ ዔያቶሲ ዹሜያና ሃሊፃያና ማዖንጎ!<verse eid="PSA 35:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 35:7"/>ታኣኒ ዔኤቢ ፑርቲሴ ባኣዚ ባኣንቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:7">ፒሮ ዔያታ ታኣም ዓኣቺ ፒሬኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:7">ታና ሎንሣኒ ዔቴያ ቦኦኬኔ።<verse eid="PSA 35:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 35:8"/>ዔያታ ማሊባኣ ባይሲንታ ዔያቶ ሄሎም፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:8">ዔያታ ዓኣቼ ፒራሢ ዔያቶ ዓርቆም፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:8">ዔያታ ቦኦኬ ዔቶይዳ ፔኤሮ ሎኦሞንጎ!<verse eid="PSA 35:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 35:9"/>ሼምፔላ ታኣኮ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢና ዎዛዻኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:9">ዒዚ ዓውሴሢሮ ሚርጌና ዎዛዻኔ።<verse eid="PSA 35:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 35:10"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ኔኤኒ ማዤ ታኣኮ ዑፃ፦</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:10">«ሄርቂንቲ ዎርቃ ዓሶ ሄርቃ ዓሶይዳፓ ዓውሳያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:10">ማንቆ ዓሶንታ ሜታዻ ዓሶንታ ቡራ ዓሶይዳፓ ካፓያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:10">ኔጉዴያ ዖኦኒ ዓኣይ?» ጋዓኔ።<verse eid="PSA 35:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 35:11"/>ፑርቶ ዓሳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:11">ታኣኒ ማዺባኣ ዻቢንቲሮ ዎጌና ታና ዓይሢሴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:11">ታኣኒ ዔሩዋ ባኣዚ ሉኡዙሞና ታ ዑፃ ማርካዼኔ።<verse eid="PSA 35:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 35:12"/>ታኣኒ ኮሺ ማዼሢ ዛሎ ፑርታ ታኣም ዔያታ ማሄኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:12">ታና ታኣሮ ሌሊ ማሂ ዔያታ ሃሼኔ።<verse eid="PSA 35:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 35:13"/>ታኣኒ ጋዓንቴ ዔያታ ሃርጊንቴ ዎዶና ሲዬ ፓቲሌ ማይንቴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:13">ታኣኮ ዑፆዋ ሙዖ ሃሾ ዳምቦና ታ ዖኦፒሴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:13">ታኣኒ ሺኢቄ ሺኢጲፃ ዋይዚንቱዋያ ማዒ ዓቴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 35:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 35:14"/>ታኣኒ ዖዬ ዖዪፃ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:14">ታኣኮ ላጌም ጊንሣ ሃሣ ጌርሲም ዖያያጉዲኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:14">ዒንዳ ሃይቄ ዓሲ ዖያሢጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:14">ታኣኒ ሱሊ ዴዒ ዬኤኬኔ።<verse eid="PSA 35:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 35:15"/>ታኣኒ ዹቂንቴ ዎዶና ዔያታ ዎዛና ቡኬኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:15">ታኣኒ ዔሩዋ ጌኔ ማዻ ዓሲ ሙኪ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:15">ታና ሚኢጫዖ ጋፒ ዒፄኔ።<verse eid="PSA 35:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 35:16"/>ፑርቶ ማዻ ዓሳ ማዻ ጎይፆ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:16">ፑርቱሞና ታና ሚኢጪ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:16">ሃኣሚያ ታኣም ዔያታ ዻዔኔ።<verse eid="PSA 35:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 35:17"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:17">ዎማ ሄላንዳኣና ዚቲዮ ጌይ ኔ ታና ዛጋይ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:17">ዔያቶኮ ፑርቶ ማዻፓ ታና ዓውሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:17">ሃንሢ ዞቦጉዲ ቂኢሮንሢዳፓ ኔ ታና ካፔ!<verse eid="PSA 35:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 35:18"/>ሚርጌ ቡኬ ኔ ዴሮ ባኣካ ታኣኒ ኔና ጋላታንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:18">ዬያ ቡኬ ዓሶ ቤርታ ታ ኔና ቦንቻንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 35:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 35:19"/>ዔኤቢ ማዺንቴ ባኣዚ ባኣንቴ ታና ዒፃ ታ ሞርካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:19">ታ ሜቶ ዛጊ ዎዛዻንዳጉዲ ማሂፖ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:19">ዔያታ ታና ዓኣፒ ዎዺ ዓማሊ ሺራንዳጉዲ ሃሺፖ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35፡19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:4">ዓይኑ. 69፡4</ref>፤ <ref loc="JHN 15:25">ዮሃ. 15፡25</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 35:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 35:20"/>ዔያታ ጌስታ ጌኤዛ ሞርኬ ጌስታንዳ ጌኤሲኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:20">ኮሺ ዓሲ ዑስካ ጌኔ ማሊሢ ማሊ ዔያታ ቱካኔ።<verse eid="PSA 35:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 35:21"/>«ሂዮ! ቃራ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:21">ኑኡኒ ኑ ቶኦኪና ኔ ማዼሢ ዛጌኔ!»</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:21">ጌዒ ጌዒ ዒላቲና ቶኦኪ ዔያታ ታኣኮ ባይዜኔ።<verse eid="PSA 35:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 35:22"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:22">ኔኤኒ ዬያ ዛጌኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:22">ዬያሮ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:22">ኔኤኒ ዚቲዮ ጌዒፖ! ታ ኮራፓኣ ሃኪፖ!<verse eid="PSA 35:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 35:23"/>ታኣኮ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ማዔ ፆኦዛሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:23">ታ ዛሎ ኔኤኒ ሞኦቲንቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:23">ዎጊያ ታኣም ዎጌ።<verse eid="PSA 35:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 35:24"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ማዔ ታ ፆኦዛሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:24">ኔኤኮ ፂሉሞጉዴያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:24">ጎኑሞና ታኣም ዎጌ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:24">ታ ሞርካ ታ ሜቶና ዎዛዻንዳጉዲ ማሂፖ።<verse eid="PSA 35:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 35:25"/>«ሂዮ! ቃራ! ኑ ማሊፆጉዲ ማዔኔ!» ጌዒ ዔያታ ማላንዳጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:25">ጊንሣ ሃሣ «ኑኡኒ ዒዛ ባሼያንቴ!» ኔኤኒ ዔያቶ ጌይሲፖ።<verse eid="PSA 35:25"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 35:26"/>ታና ሄሌ ሜታሢና ዎዛዺ ቶኦቺሢና ዛጋ ዓሳ ቢያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:26">ቦርሲንቶንጎ፥ ዔርቶ ዒፂ ካራ ዔያቶም ባይቆንጎ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:26">ታ ዑፃ ፔና ዼግ ዼጊዳዞንሢ ቢያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:26">ቦርሲንቲ ዻውሲንቶንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 35:26"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 35:27"/>ታኣኮ ባሺፃ ዎዛሳ ዓሳ ቢያ ዎዛዾንጎ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:27">«ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዼኤፒኬ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:27">ዒዛም ማዻ ዓይላሢም ዔባ ቢያ ጊኢጋዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:27">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳኣ ዎዎዛሳኔ!» ጎዖንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 35:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 35:28"/>ታኣኮ ዻንጋ ሮኦሮ ጉቤ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:28">ኔኤኮ ፂሉሞና ጋላቶና ዛላ ኬኤዛኔ።<verse eid="PSA 35:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 35"/>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="PSA 36"/>
  <para style="s1">ዓይኑሞ ሱኡጋሢ ዓይሣ ጎይፆና ዓይናዺንታ ፆኦሲ ዓይላሢ ዳውቴ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="d">ጎሞ ዓሶኮ ፑርቱሞና ፆኦሲኮዋ ኮሹሞ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 36:1"/>ፑርታ ባኣዚ ማዻ ዓሲ ፔ ዒኖና ዬያ ፑርቱሞ ማላኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:1">ፆኦሲ ዒጊጩዋሴ፥ ቦንቺያ ቦንቹዋሴ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36፡1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 3:18">ሮሜ 3፡18</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 36:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 36:2"/>ፑርቶ ማዻ ዓሢ ዒዛኮ ፑርቱማ ሳልማሳሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:2">ፔኤኮ ጎሞ ዛጋኒታቴያ ዒፃኒ ኮዑዋሴ።<verse eid="PSA 36:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 36:3"/>ጌኤዛ ዒዛኮ ጌኔ ማሊሢና ሉኡዙሞና ኩሜያኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:3">ማሊ ጶቂሥሢና ኮሺ ባኣዚ ማዺሢያ ዒዛ ባሼኔ።<verse eid="PSA 36:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 36:4"/>ላሄ ቤዛ ዓኣዖ ጌኔ ባኣዚ ማሊ ቱካኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:4">ፔና ዒ ፑርታ ጎይሢ ዔኪ ዓኣዻኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:4">ፑርቱሞ ባኮዋ ፔ ኮራፓ ሃኪሱዋሴ።<verse eid="PSA 36:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 36:5"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:5">ኔኤኮ ናንጊና ናንጋ ናሹማ ጫሪንጮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:5">ጎኑማኣ ኔኤኮ ሻኣሮ ዴንዲ ሄላኔ።<verse eid="PSA 36:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 36:6"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:6">ዓሶንታ ቆልሞንታ ሜቶይዳፓ ኔኤኒ ዓውሳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:6">ፂሉማ ኔኤሲ ዓዳ ዹኮጉዲ ኮሺ ዼግ ጌዔያኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:6">ኔኤኮ ዎጋ ባዚ ዔታዻጉዲ ዔታዻያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 36:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 36:7"/>ፆኦዛሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:7">ኔኤኮ ናንጊና ናንጋ ናሹማ ዎዚ ቦንቺንታያዳይ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:7">ዓሶ ኔኤኒ ካፓሢሮ ኔ ዴማ ካፒንቲ ዴዓኔ።<verse eid="PSA 36:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 36:8"/>ኔ ማኣራ ጊዲ ዑሣ ዓኣዻ ሙኡዚ ዔያታ ሙዓኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:8">ኔኤኮ ዎዛሳ ዎራፓ ዋኣፆ ዔያቶ ኔ ዑሻኔ።<verse eid="PSA 36:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 36:9"/>ኔኤኒ ናንጊኮ ቢያ ዓልቃ ካራኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:9">ኔኤኮ ፖዓ ፖዓሢሮ ኑ ዛጋኔ።<verse eid="PSA 36:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 36:10"/>ኔና ዔራዞንሢም ናንጊና ናንጋ ናሹማ ኔኤኮ ጋፖፓ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:10">ዓውሲፃኣ ኔኤኮ ዒኖ ፒዜዞንሢም ጋፑዋያ ማዖንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 36:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 36:11"/>ዖቶርቃ ዓሶኮ ቶካ ታና ሄርቃንዳጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:11">ፑርቶ ማዻ ዓሳ ዎልቃዺ ታና ዳውሳንዳጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:11">ታና ሃሺፖ።<verse eid="PSA 36:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 36:12"/>ፑርቶ ማዻ ዓሳ ዎማይዲ ሎኦሚ ላሄቴያ ዛጌ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:12">ዔያታ ኬኤሪንቴኔ፥ ዔቃኒያ ያፓ ዳንዳዑዋሴ።<verse eid="PSA 36:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 36"/>
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="PSA 37"/>
  <para style="s1">ዳውቴ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="d">ፑርቶ ዓሶንታ ኮዦ ዓሶዋ ካፒ ዓኣ ባኣዚ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 37:1"/>ፑርቶ ማዻ ዓሶ ዛጊ ዻጋዺፖ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:1">ጎሞ ማዻ ዓሶሲ ዛጊ «ዔያቶም ዬይ ዓይጋ ማዔይ!» ጌይ ማሊፖ።<verse eid="PSA 37:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 37:2"/>ዔያታ ማኣቲጉዲ ዑኬና ሜላንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:2">ዋላሺጉዲያኣ ሹሊ ዲኢናንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 37:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 37:3"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ጉሙርቂ ኮሺ ባኣዚ ማዼ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:3">ዓጮይዳ ኮሺና ኔኤኒ ናንጋንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 37:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 37:4"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳና ዎዛዼ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:4">ዒዚያ ኔኤኮ ዒና ኮዓ ባኮ ዒንጋንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 37:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 37:5"/>ዒዚ ኔና ዔኪ ዓኣዻንዳጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:5">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳም ሃዳርሲ ኔና ዒንጌ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:5">ዒዛ ጉሙርቄ፥ ዒዚ ኔና ማኣዳንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 37:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 37:6"/>ዒዚ ፂሉሞ ኔኤኮ ፖዒጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:6">ኔኤም ዎጊንታ ዎጎዋ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:6">ዓቢ ዹኡሲጉዲ ፖዒሳንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 37:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 37:7"/>ጊቢ ዳንዳዒሢና ዶዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:7">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ማዻ ባኮ ዛጋኒ ካፔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:7">ሜሌ ዓሶኮ ፑርቶ ማሊፃ ዔያቶም ጊኢጌያ ማዔቴያ ሮኦጋዺፖ።<verse eid="PSA 37:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 37:8"/>ዻጋ ፑርታ ባኣዚዳ ሄሊሳሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:8">ዻጋይዳፓ ኔና ማሄ፥ ሮኦጋዺሢዳፓኣ ካፒንቴ።<verse eid="PSA 37:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 37:9"/>ፑርቶ ማዻ ዓሳ ዎዺንታንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:9">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ጉሙርቃዞንሢ ጋዓንቴ ሳዖ ዔካንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 37:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 37:10"/>ዻካ ዎዴም ማዓንዳፓዓቴም</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:10">ፑርቶ ማዻ ዓሳ ሩኡሪና ባይቃንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:10">ኔኤኒ ዔያቶ ኮዔያታቴያ ዴንቃዓኬ።<verse eid="PSA 37:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 37:11"/>ዒኖ ሼሌዔዞንሢ ዓጮ ዔካንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:11">ዖርጎቹሞና ኮሹሞና ዴንቂ ዔያታ ዎዛዻንዳኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37፡11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:5">ማቲ. 5፡5</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 37:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 37:12"/>ፑርቶ ማዻ ዓሢ ኮዣሢ ባይዛኒ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:12">ሜሌ ዓሶ ፑርቱሞና ዒዛ ዑፃ ዔቂሳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:12">ዒዛ ዒፂሢና ሃኣሚ ዻዓኔ።<verse eid="PSA 37:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 37:13"/>ፑርቶ ማዻ ዓሳ ባይቃንዳ ኬላ ዑኬሢ ዔራሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:13">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዔያቶ ሚኢጫኔ።<verse eid="PSA 37:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 37:14"/>ፑርቶ ማዻ ዓሳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:14">ማንቆ ዓሶንታ ሜታዻ ዓሶዋ ዎዻኒ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:14">ኮዦ ማዾ ማዻዞንሢያ ሹካኒ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:14">ፔኤኮ ጬንቾ ዓፓሮ ቱጋኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:14">ሂኢዦዋ ፔኤኮ ጊኢጊሻኔ።<verse eid="PSA 37:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 37:15"/>ጋዓንቴ ዔያቶኮ ጬንቾ ዓፓራ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:15">ዔያቶ ሳዞ ማዒ ጫርጋንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:15">ሂኢዣኣ ዔያቶሲ ሜቃንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 37:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 37:16"/>ፑርታ ማዻ ዓሲኮ ሚርጌ ቆሎይዳፓ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:16">ኮሺ ዓሲኮ ዻኮ ቆሎንሢ ባሼኬ።<verse eid="PSA 37:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 37:17"/>ፑርቶ ማዻ ዓሶኮ ቃሳ ሜቃንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:17">ፂሎ ዓሶ ጋዓንቴ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዶዲሻንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 37:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 37:18"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ፂሎ ዓሳ ናንጋንዳ ዎዶ ዔዔራኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:18">ዴና ዔያቶሲ ዔያቶም ማዒ ቢያ ዎዴ ናንጋንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 37:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 37:19"/>ፑርታ ኬሊ ሙኬቴ ሜታ ዔያቶ ሄላዓኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:19">ሉማሢ ዎዶና ሙኡዚ ዴንቂ ዔያታ ሚሽካንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 37:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 37:20"/>ፑርቶ ማዻ ዓሳ ጋዓንቴ ባይቃንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:20">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳኮ ሞርካ ቡኒጉዲ ዲኢናንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:20">ዓዳ ጩቢ ባይቃሢጉዲ ዓኣፓፓ ባይቃንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 37:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 37:21"/>ጎሜ ማዻ ዓሲ ዓሲዳፓ ታታልዓኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:21">ጋዓንቴ ማሂ ዬያ ጪጉዋሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:21">ፂሎ ዓሲ ጋዓንቴ ሚጪንታኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:21">ማሂያኣ ዒንጋኔ።<verse eid="PSA 37:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 37:22"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዓንጄ ዓሳ ሳዖ ዔካንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:22">ዒዚ ጋዳንቄ ዓሳ ጋዓንቴ ባይቃንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 37:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 37:23"/>ዓሲኮ ናንጊ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዎዛሳያ ማዔቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:23">ዒዚ ዬያ ዓሢኮ ናንጋ ፒዜ ማዒፆ ጎናሳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 37:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 37:24"/>ዬይ ዓሢ ዹቂንቴቴያ ሎኦማዓኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:24">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ፔ ኩጮና ኬኤሊንቂ ዒዛ ዓርቃንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 37:24"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 37:25"/>ዼጋቶይዳፓ ጋርቻንዳያ ሄላንዳኣና ታ ናንጌኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:25">ዬያይዳ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ኮሺ ዓሲ ሃሼም</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:25">ናኣታ ዒዛኮ ሙኡዚ ባይዚ ሺኢቃንቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:25">ፔቴታዖ ታኣኒ ዛጊባኣሴ።<verse eid="PSA 37:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 37:26"/>ኮሺ ዓሲ ቢያ ዎዴና ዓሲም ዔኤቢ ጉሪ ዒዒንጋኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:26">ዒዛኮ ናኣታኣ ዓንጂንቴያ ማዓንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 37:26"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 37:27"/>ፑርታ ማዾፓ ሃኬ፥ ኮሺ ባኣዚ ማዼ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:27">ናንጊና ኔኤኒ ናንጋንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 37:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 37:28"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ፒዜ ዎጌ ናሽካኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:28">ዒዛም ጉሙርቂንታዞንሢ ዒ ሃሹዋሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:28">ናንጊና ዔያቶ ዒ ካፓኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:28">ፑርቶ ማዻ ዓሶኮ ዜርፃ ጋዓንቴ ባይቃንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 37:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 37:29"/>ሳዓ ፂሎ ዓሶም ዓታንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:29">ዒዞይዳ ዔያታ ናንጊና ናንጋንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 37:29"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 37:30"/>ፂሎ ዓሲ ፔ ዻንጋፓ ዔራቶ ኬሳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:30">ዒንዲርዛ ዒዛኮ ፒዙሞ ጌስታኔ።<verse eid="PSA 37:30"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 37:31"/>ዒዛ ፆኦዛሢኮ ዎጋ ዒዛኮ ዒናኣኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:31">ቶካ ዒዛኮ ቡኡዲንቱዋሴ።<verse eid="PSA 37:31"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 37:32"/>ፑርታ ማዻ ዓሲ ፂላሢ ካታኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:32">ዎዻኒያ ዒዛ ዒ ኮዓኔ።<verse eid="PSA 37:32"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 37:33"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ጋዓንቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:33">ዒዛኮ ሞርኮም ዓኣሢ ዒንጊንዱዋሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:33">ዓሲ ቡካ ቤዞይዳ ሞኦቶና ዓሳ ዒዛ ላሢንዱዋሴ።<verse eid="PSA 37:33"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 37:34"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳኮ ማኣሮ ካራ ዴዔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:34">ጎይፆዋ ዒዛሲ ካፔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:34">ዒዚ ሳዖ ኔኤም ዻካልሲ ኔና ቦንቺሳንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:34">ፑርቶ ዓሳ ባይቃንቴ ኔ ዛጋንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 37:34"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 37:35"/>ፑርታ ማዻያና ቂኢሮ ዓሲስኬይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:35">ዓዳ ሊባኖኦሴ ሚፆጉዲ ዋርቂ ዓኣንቴ ታ ዛጌኔ፤<verse eid="PSA 37:35"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 37:36"/>ጊንሣ ሃሣ ሜሌ ዓቢና ዒኢና ታ ዓኣዻንቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:36">ዒኢካ ዬይ ሚፃሢ ባኣሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:36">ኮዒያ ታ ዒዛ ዴንቂባኣሴ።<verse eid="PSA 37:36"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 37:37"/>ኮሺ ማዔ ዓሢና ፒዜ ማዔሢያ ዒናፓ ዛጌ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:37">ኮሺ ማዔ ዓሲኮ ሃጊ ማዓ ዎዛ ዓኣኔ።<verse eid="PSA 37:37"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 37:38"/>ጎሞ ማዻ ዓሳ ጋዓንቴ ጋፒ ሃይቃንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:38">ዜርፃኣ ዔያቶሲ ባይቃንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 37:38"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 37:39"/>ፂሎ ዓሲኮ ዻቂንታ ሙካንዳሢ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳፓኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:39">ሜታሢ ዎዶና ፑኖ ካያሢ ዔያቶኮ ዒዛኬ።<verse eid="PSA 37:39"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 37:40"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዔያቶ ማኣዳኔ፥ ዓውሲያ ዓውሳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:40">ፑርቶ ማዻ ዓሶ ኩጫፓ ዔያቶ ዒ ኬሳንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:40">ዔያታ ዒዛ ፔኤኮ ፑኖ ካያሢ ማሄሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:40">ዒዚ ዔያቶ ዓውሳንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 37:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 37"/>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="PSA 38"/>
  <para style="s1">ዓይሁዶኮ ሃውሾ ኬሎ ማሊ ጶቂሢ ዓይናዾ ዳውቴ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="d">ሜቶ ዎዴና ሺኢቂንታ ሺኢጲሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 38:1"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ኔ ዻጎና ታና ጎሪፖ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:1">ኔኤኮ ዼኤፖ ዻጎና ታጊዳ ሜቶ ዓጊፖ።<verse eid="PSA 38:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 38:2"/>ኔ ሂኢዦና ኔ ታና ዱኬኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:2">ኔኤኮ ዶዶ ኩጮና ኔ ታና ጳርቄኔ።<verse eid="PSA 38:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 38:3"/>ኔኤኒ ጎሪንቴሢሮ ዑፃ ታኣኮ ኮሺቱዋሴ።</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:3">ታ ጎማፓ ዔቄያና ዒቢሊ ታኣኮ ባኣሴ።<verse eid="PSA 38:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 38:4"/>ዻቢንታ ታኣሲ ታና ዴኤፃያኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:4">ዬይ ታኣኒ ኬዳኒ ዳንዳዓሢፓ ዑሣኬ።<verse eid="PSA 38:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 38:5"/>ታኣኮ ዔኤያቶና ታ ማዼ ዻቢንቶሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:5">ኪፃ ታኣኮ ጊኢሽኪ ዛዓኔ።<verse eid="PSA 38:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 38:6"/>ታኣኒ ጊኢራፓ ዎቤኔ፥ ሚርጌና ታ ኩንቲ ሃንቴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:6">ኬሎ ቢያ ዖዪሢና ታ ፔኤቄኔ።<verse eid="PSA 38:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 38:7"/>ጊኢራ ታኣኮ ታሚጉዲ ዔኤቴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:7">ዑስካኣ ታኣኮ ኮሽኩዋሴ።<verse eid="PSA 38:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 38:8"/>ሚርጌና ታ ላቤኔ፥ ጋፒ ታኣኒ ሺኢቴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:8">ዒና ታኣኮ ሜታዼያታሢሮ ታ ዚኢሊንታኔ።<verse eid="PSA 38:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 38:9"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ታ ጎዳሢዮ! ታኣኒ ኮዓ ባኮ ቢያ ኔ ዔራኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:9">ታኣኮ ዚኢሊንቲፃ ኔኤም ዓኣሺንቴያቱዋሴ።<verse eid="PSA 38:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 38:10"/>ሳዛ ታኣኮ ዑኮ ዑኮ ዹዓኔ፥ ቆሳኣ ታኣኮ ጌላኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:10">ዓኣፓ ታኣኮ ዛጎ ዒፄኔ።<verse eid="PSA 38:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 38:11"/>ታኣኮ ዒጊኖንታ ላጎንታ ኪፆ ታኣኮ ሻኣኪንቴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:11">ታ ዒጊና ታ ኮራፓ ሃኬኔ።<verse eid="PSA 38:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 38:12"/>ታ ሼምፓሢ ባይዛኒ ኮዓዞንሢ ፒሮ ታኣም ፒራኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:12">ፑርታና ታና ሜታሳኒ ማላዞንሢያ ባይዛኒ ታኣም ዚርቃኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:12">ሮኦሮ ጉቤ ታና ባይዛኒ ጌኔ ማሊሢ ሱካኔ።<verse eid="PSA 38:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 38:13"/>ታኣኒ ዋይዚ ባይቄያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:13">ጌስታኒያ ዳንዳዑዋያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:13">ዻንጋ ባይቄ ዓሲጉዲኬ።<verse eid="PSA 38:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 38:14"/>ጎኔና ዋይዚ ባይቄ ዓሲና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:14">ዻንጋ ቡሊንቲ ጌስቱዋ ዓሲጉዲ ታ ማዔኔ።<verse eid="PSA 38:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 38:15"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ኔና ታ ጉሙርቃኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:15">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ማዔ ታ ፆኦዛሢዮ! ኔ ታኣም ማሂ ኬኤዛንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 38:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 38:16"/>«ሞርካ ታኣኮ ቶኦቺ ታና ዛጋንዳጉዲና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:16">ቶካ ታኣኮ ሃሊፄም ፔና ዔያታ ጎኦቢሣንዳጉዲ ማዺፖ!»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:16">ጌዒ ታ ኔና ሺኢቃኔ።<verse eid="PSA 38:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 38:17"/>ሎኦማኒ ታ ዑኬኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:17">ታኣኮ ዋኣዪፆይዳፓ ፔቴታዖ ታ ኬስኪባኣሴ።<verse eid="PSA 38:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 38:18"/>ዻቢንቶ ታኣኮ ታ ቡኡፃኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:18">ጎማ ታኣኮ ታና ሜታሴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 38:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 38:19"/>ታኣኮ ዶዶ ሞርካ ሚርጌኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:19">ታ ዔኤቢ ዎኦቲባኣንቴ ታና ዒፃዞንሢኮ ፓይዲ ባኣሴ።<verse eid="PSA 38:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 38:20"/>ታኣኒ ኮሺ ማዾ ማዼሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:20">ዬያ ኮዦ ማዾ ዛሎ ፑርታ ታኣም ማዺ ማሃ ዓሳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:20">ታኣኮ ሞርኬ ማዒ ዔቄኔ።<verse eid="PSA 38:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 38:21"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ታና ሃሺፖ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:21">ታ ፆኦዛሢዮ! ታ ኮራፓ ሃኪፖ።<verse eid="PSA 38:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 38:22"/>ታ ዼኤሻሢ ማዔ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:22">ታና ዑካዺ ማኣዴ።<verse eid="PSA 38:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 38"/>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="PSA 39"/>
  <para style="s1">ዓይኑሞ ሱኡጋሢ ዓይሣ ጎይፆና ዔዶታሜ ዛሎ ዓይናዺንቴ ዳውቴ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="d">ዓሲ ሜታ ሄላዛ ዔልቃሚጉዲ ሺኢቃ ሺኢጲሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 39:1"/>ታኣኒ፦ «ታ ማዾንታ ዒንዲርዞዋ ጎሜፓ ካፓንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:1">ፑርቶ ማዻ ዓሳ ታ ኮራ ዓኣ ዎዶና ዻንጎ ታኣኮ ታ ቢፃልቃንዳኔ»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:1">ጌዒ ታ ጫኣቄኔ።<verse eid="PSA 39:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 39:2"/>ዻንጋ ባይቄ ዓሲጉዲ ዚቲ ታ ጌዔኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:2">ኮሺ ባኣዚ ጌስታኒታዖ ዻንጎ ታኣሲ ታ ዓርቄኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:2">ዬይ ያዺ ማዔታቴያ ሜታሢ ታኣኮ ሃቺም ሚርጌኔ።<verse eid="PSA 39:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 39:3"/>ዒና ታኣኮ ጋራ ዖይዼኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:3">ማሊፆ ታ ማሌሢሮ ዬይ ታማ ዔኤቴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:3">ዬካፓ ዻንጎ ቡሊ ሂዚ ጌይ ታ ኬኤዜኔ፦<verse eid="PSA 39:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 39:4"/>«ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:4">ናንጎኮ ታኣኮ ጋፒንፆ ሌዖኮዋ ፓይዶ ታና ዔርዜ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:4">ታኣኒ ዓኣዻያና ባይቃያ ማዔሢ ታ ዔሮም።»<verse eid="PSA 39:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 39:5"/>«ሃይሾ ታኣኒ ናንጋንዳ ዎዶ ኬኤላና ዋርቂ ኔ ዛጊ ሃሼኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:5">ታኣኒ ናንጋ ሌዓ ኔ ቤርታ ዔኤቢ ማዒ ፓይዲንቱዋሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:5">ጎኔና ዓሲኮ ናንጊ ቢያ ዓዳ ሱኡሌጉዴያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 39:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 39:6"/>ዓሲ ናንጊ ሺቢዳፓ ዱማቱዋሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:6">ጉሪ ላቢንታኔ፥ ቆሎዋ ቡኩሳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:6">ጋዓንቴ ዬይ ቆላ ዖኦም ማዓንዳቴያ ዔሩዋሴ።»<verse eid="PSA 39:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 39:7"/>«ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:7">ሂዴቴ ታኣኮ ሃጊ ማዓ ዎዛሢ ዖናዳይ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:7">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳቱዋዓዳ?<verse eid="PSA 39:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 39:8"/>ታኣኮ ጎማፓ ቢያ ታና ዓውሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:8">ዔቦ ዔሩዋ ዓሶም ሚኢቺ ታና ማሂፖ።<verse eid="PSA 39:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 39:9"/>ሃያ ቢያ ማዼሢ ኔናታሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:9">ታኣኒ ዚቲዮ ጋዓንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:9">ዻንጎዋ ታኣኮ ታ ቡላዓኬ።<verse eid="PSA 39:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 39:10"/>ቃሶ ኔኤኮ ታ ዑፃፓ ዔቂሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:10">ኩጫ ኔኤኮ ታና ጳርቄሢሮ ሚርጌና ታ ላቤኔ።<verse eid="PSA 39:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 39:11"/>ዓሶ ዔያቶኮ ጎሞ ዛሎሮ ሜታሳኒ፥ ኔ ዔያቶ ጎራኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:11">ቆሎዋ ኔ ዔያቶኮ ቢሎና ባይዛኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:11">ጎኔና ዓሲኮ ናንጊ ሱኡሌይዳፓ ባሼቱዋሴ።»<verse eid="PSA 39:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 39:12"/>«ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:12">ሺኢጲፆ ታኣኮ ዋይዜ፥ ዒላቶዋ ዔኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:12">ታ ዬኤካኣና ዑኬና ታና ማኣዴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:12">ዻካ ዎዴም ታ ኔኤኮ ሾኦቺኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:12">ታኣኒ ታኣኮ ቤርታኣ ዓዶንሢጉዲ ቤሲባኣያ ማዒ ናንጌያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 39:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 39:13"/>ሃይቂ ታኣኒ ማዑዋ ቤዞ ዓኣዻንዳሢኮ ቤርታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:13">ሃዳራ ታ ዎዛዻንዳጉዲ ዻካ ታኣም ጌዔቴራ።»<verse eid="PSA 39:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 39"/>
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="PSA 40"/>
  <para style="s1">ዓይኑሞ ሱኡጋሢ ዓይሣ ጎይፆና ዓይናዺንታ ዳውቴ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="d">ጋላታ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 40:1"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ታና ማኣዳንዳጉዲ ጊቢ ዳንዳዒ ታ ካፔኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:1">ዒዚያ ታ ባንሢ ሺሪ፥ ሺኢጲፆ ታኣኮ ዋይዜኔ።<verse eid="PSA 40:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 40:2"/>ዓጊፃ ጫሬና ቶኦጶ ማዔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:2">ሃሊፃ ዔታፓ ዒ ታና ኬሴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:2">ቶኮ ታኣኮ ላሎ ሹጮ ዑፃ ዔቂሲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:2">ዶዲ ታ ዔቃንዳ ቤሲ ዒ ታኣም ዒንጌኔ።<verse eid="PSA 40:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 40:3"/>ታ ዻንጎይዳ ዓኪ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:3">ኑ ፆኦዛሢም ጋላታ ዓይኑሞ ታኣም ዒ ዒንጌኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:3">ዬያ ሚርጌ ዓሳ ዒጊጪ ዛጊ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:3">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ጉሙርቃንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 40:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 40:4"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ሌሊ ጉሙርቃዞንሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:4">ሜሌ ፆኦዞ ካኣሽኪሮ ሺሩዋዞንሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:4">ዬያ ሜሌ ፆኦዞ ጊንፆ ሃንታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:4">ዋይዞ ዒፃ ዓሶና ዎላ ፔቴ ማዑዋዞንሢ ዓንጂንቴያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 40:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 40:5"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ማዔ ታ ፆኦዛሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:5">ኔኤኒ ሚርጌና ዲቃሢ ሄርሺሳ ባኣዚ ኑም ማዼኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:5">ዖኦኒያ ኔኤና ቤቃይ ባኣሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:5">ኔኤኒ ኑም ማሌ ኮዦ ባኮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:5">ዖኦኒያ ፓይዲ ዔራኒ ዳንዳዑዋሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:5">ኬኤዛኒና ሃይሳዻኒ ታ ዓርቄታቴያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:5">ፓይዳ ታኣም ዔርቱዋያ ማዓንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 40:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 40:6"/>ኔኤኒ ሚቺ ዒንጎ ዒንጊፆንታ ሜሌ ዒንጊፆዋ ኮዑዋሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:6">ቆልማ ሚቺ ዒንጎ ቤዞይዳ ሚቺንታንዳጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:6">ጊንሣ ሃሣ ጎሞ ጌኤሻኒ ዒንጊንታ ዒንጊፃኣ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:6">ኔኤም ዒንጊንታንዳጉዲ ኔ ኮዑዋሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:6">ዬያ ማዾንዶ ቤዞ ዓይሢፆ ኔኤኮ ዋይዚ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:6">ኔኤም ታ ማዻንዳጉዲ ኔ ታና ማሄኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40፡6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 10:5-7">ዔብ. 10፡5-7</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 40:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 40:7"/>ዬያሮ ታኣኒ፦ «ዎጎ ማፃኣፖይዳ ታ ዛሎ ፃኣፒንቴ ጎይፆና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:7">ሃይሾ ታኣኒ ሙኬኔ።<verse eid="PSA 40:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 40:8"/>ታ ፆኦዛሢዮ! ማሊፆ ኔኤሲ ማዺ ኩንሣኒ ታ ኮዓኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:8">ዎጋኣ ኔኤኮ ታ ዒኖይዳኬ» ጌዔኔ።<verse eid="PSA 40:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 40:9"/>ዼኤፖ ቡኪንቶ ቤዛ ፒዜ ባኣዚ ታ ኬኤዜኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:9">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ኔኤኒ ዔራሢጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:9">ታ ኬኤዛ ባኮ ኬኤዚፆ ሃሻዓኬ።<verse eid="PSA 40:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 40:10"/>ኮሹሞ ኔኤሲ ታ ዒና ታ ዓኣቻዓኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:10">ኔኤኒ ጉሙርቂንታያና ዓውሳያ ማዔሢ ታ ኬኤዜኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:10">ዬያ ዼኤፖ ቡኪንቶ ቤዛ ኔኤኮ ናንጊና ናንጋ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:10">ናሹሞንታ ጎኑሞንታ ታ ዓኣቺባኣሴ።<verse eid="PSA 40:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 40:11"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ኔ ማኣሪፆ ታጊዳፓ ሃኪሲፖ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:11">ኔኤኮ ናሹሞንታ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጉሙርቂንቲፃኣ ናንጊና ታና ካፖንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 40:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 40:12"/>ሚርጌ ሜታ ታና ዋኣዪሳኔ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:12">ዻቢንታ ታኣኮ ሚርጌሢሮ ዛጋኒ ታ ዳንዳዑዋሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:12">ዬይ ታኣኮ ቶኦኮ ጋፓናፓ ባሻያኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:12">ዬያሮ ታ ዒና ታና ዒፂ ሃሼኔ።<verse eid="PSA 40:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 40:13"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ሃዳራ ታና ዓውሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:13">ፆኦዛሢዮ! ዑካዺ ታና ማኣዴ።<verse eid="PSA 40:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 40:14"/>ታና ዎዻኒ ኮዓ ዓሳ ቢያ ቦርሲንቶንጎ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:14">ዔርቶ ዒፂ ካራ ዔያቶም ባይቆንጎ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:14">ታና ፑርታ ባኣዚ ሄላንዳጉዲ ማላዞንሢም ቢያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:14">ቦርሲንቲ ማዖንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 40:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 40:15"/>ታ ሎኦሜሢሮ፦ «ሂዮ! ማዳ!» ጋዓዞንሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:15">ፔኤሮ ቦርሲንቲና ዲቃቶንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 40:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 40:16"/>ኔና ኮዓዞንሢ ጋዓንቴ ቢያ ዎዛዾንጎ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:16">ኮሺ ዑሣ ዓኣዼያ ዎዛዾንጎ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:16">ቢያ ዎዴ ኔ ዓውሲፆ ናሽካዞንሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:16">«ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዼኤፒኬ!» ጎዖንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 40:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 40:17"/>ታ ፆኦዛሢዮ! ታኣኒ ሜታዼ ዓሲኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:17">ጋዓንቴ ኔኤኒ ታና ዋሊባኣሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:17">ኔኤኒ ታኣኮ ማኣዳሢና ዓውሳሢ ማዔ ጎይፆና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:17">ሃሢያ ዑኬና ታና ማኣዴ።<verse eid="PSA 40:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 40"/>
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="PSA 41"/>
  <para style="s1">ዓይኑሞ ሱኡጋሢ ዓይሣ ጎይፆና ዓይናዺንታ ዳውቴ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="d">ዓሲ ሃርጊንታዖ ሺኢቃ ሺኢጲሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 41:1"/>ማንቆ ዓሶ ማኣዳ ዓሳ ዓንጂንቴያኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:1">ዔያታ ሜታዼ ዓቦና ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዔያቶ ማኣዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 41:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 41:2"/>ዒዚ ዔያቶ ካፓኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:2">ሼምፔናኣ ጌሣኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:2">ሳዖይዳ ዔያቶ ዓንጃኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:2">ዔያቶኮ ሞርኮማኣ ዓኣሢ ዒንጉዋሴ።<verse eid="PSA 41:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 41:3"/>ሃርጊንቲ ዔያታ ላሃዛ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዔያቶ ማይሣኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:3">ፓሢያ ዔያቶ ፓሣኔ።<verse eid="PSA 41:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 41:4"/>ታኣኒያ፦ «ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:4">ታ ዻቤሢሮ ታና ሚጪንቲ ማኣሬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:4">ሃርጎይዳፓኣ ታና ፖዒሴ» ጌዔኔ።<verse eid="PSA 41:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 41:5"/>ታ ሞርካ ታ ዑፃ ፑርቱሞ ጌስታዖ፦</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:5">«ዓይዲ ዒዚ ሃይቃንዳይ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:5">ሱንፃ ዒዛኮ ሳዖይዳፓ ዋሊንታንዳሢ ዓይዲ ናንዳይ» ጋዓኔ።<verse eid="PSA 41:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 41:6"/>ታና ዔያታ ዖኦጫኒ ሙካሢ ዒናፓቱዋሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:6">ታ ዑፃ ፑርታ ባኣዚ ጌስታኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:6">ዱማ ዱማ ቤዞ ሃንቲ ሃንቲ ሱንፆ ዔያታ ታኣኮ ፑርቲሳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 41:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 41:7"/>ሞርካ ታኣኮ ዎላ ፔቴ ማዒጋፓ ታ ዑፃ ካሽካሻኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:7">ፑርታ ታና ሄላንዳጉዲ ፑርቱሞ ማላኔ።<verse eid="PSA 41:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 41:8"/>ዔያታ ማላዖ፦ «ዒዚ ሃርጊንቲ ሃይቃኒ ዑኬኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:8">ማይ ላሄ ቤዛፓ ዒዚ ዔቃዓኬ» ጋዓኔ።<verse eid="PSA 41:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 41:9"/>ታኣኮ ካሦ ታኣና ዎላ ሙዔሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:9">ታ ጉሙርቃ ዑኬ ማዔ ላጋሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:9">ዬይያ ዓቱዋዖ ሞርኬ ማዒ ታ ጊዳ ዔቄኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41፡9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:23">ማቲ. 26፡23</ref>፤ <ref loc="MRK 14:18">ማር. 14፡18</ref>፤ <ref loc="LUK 22:21">ሉቃ. 22፡21</ref>፤ <ref loc="JHN 13:18">ዮሃ. 13፡18</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 41:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 41:10"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ኔኤኒ ጋዓንቴ ታና ሚጪንቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:10">ታ ሞርኮ ኮሜ ታ ኮፃንዳጉዲ ታና ፓሤ።<verse eid="PSA 41:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 41:11"/>ታ ሞርካ ታና ባሺፆና ዎዛዺ ዴዒንዱዋሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:11">ዬያና ኔኤኒ ታና ናሽካያ ማዔሢ ታ ዔሬኔ።<verse eid="PSA 41:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 41:12"/>ታኣኮ ፂሉሞሮ ኬልቂ ኔ ታና ዓርቄኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:12">ናንጊና ኔ ኮራ ኔኤኒ ታና ናንጊሻንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 41:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 41:13"/>ናንጊና ናንጊ ሄላንዳኣና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:13">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ማዔ ዒስራዔኤሌ ፆኦዛሢ ጋላቲንቶንጎ! <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41፡13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 106:48">ዓይኑ. 106፡48</ref>።</char></note></para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 41:13"/>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:13">ዓኣሜን! ዓኣሜን!<verse eid="PSA 41:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 41"/>
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="PSA 42"/>
  <para style="ms">ላምዓሳ ፓቂፆ</para>
  <para style="mr">(ዓይኑ. ማፃ ዓይ. 42—72)</para>
  <para style="s1">ዓይኑሞ ሱኡጋሢ ዓይሣ ጎይፆና ቆሬ ናኣታ ኬኤዚ ዔርዜ ባኮ</para>
  <para style="d">ዒፂ ዳውሶ ዎዴና ሺኢቆ ሺኢጲሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 42:1"/>ሮኦቶ ዼኤቢንቲ ዓልቃ ዋኣሢ ዴንቃኒ ኮዓሢጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:1">ፆኦሲዮ! ታ ሼምፓሢያ ኔና ዴንቃኒ ዼኤቢንቲ ኮዓኔ።<verse eid="PSA 42:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 42:2"/>ታ ሼምፓሢ ፆኦሲ፥ ናንጊና ባይቁዋ ፆኦዛሢ ዼኤቤኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:2">ዓይዲ ታኣኒ ሄሊ ፆኦሲኮ ዓኣፖ ካሮ ዛጋንዳይ?<verse eid="PSA 42:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 42:3"/>ዓሳ ቢያ፦ «ፆኦዛሢ ኔኤኮ ዎካዳዖ?» ጋዓ ዎዶና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:3">ዓቢፃ ታኣኮ ሮኦሮንታ ዋንቶዋ ሙኡዚ ማዔኔ።<verse eid="PSA 42:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 42:4"/>ታኣኒ ዓሶኮ ዓርና ማዒ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:4">ሚርጌ ዓሶና ዎላ ፆኦሲ ማኣሪ ዴንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:4">ቦንቾ ኬሎ ቦንቻ ዓሳ ዓይኑሞና ዒላሺሢና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:4">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ጋላታኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:4">ዬያ ታኣኒ ሚናኣ ናንጎ ማላዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:4">ዒና ታኣኮ ዖዪሢና ዋኣፃኔ።<verse eid="PSA 42:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 42:5"/>ታኣኒ ዓይጎሮ ዎዛ ቲቃንዳይ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:5">ዓይጌንዴሮ ታ ሜታዻንዳይ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:5">ታኣኒ ፆኦሲ ጉሙርቃኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:5">ዒዚ ታና ማኣዳሢሮዋ ታ ጋላታኔ።<verse eid="PSA 42:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 42:6"/>ታ ፆኦዛሢዮ! ታ ዎዛ ቲቄኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:6">ሼምፔላ ታኣኮ ዖዬኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:6">ዬያሮ ዮርዳኖሴንታ ዓርሞኒዔሜ ዓጮይዳ ዓኣ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:6">ሚዛሬ ዹካ ዴዒ ታ ኔና ማላኔ።<verse eid="PSA 42:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 42:7"/>ኔኤኮ ሶኦሪንታ ዋኣፆኮ ጉኡሚፃፓ ዔቄያና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:7">ፔቴ ቁልባ ባጎ ቁልቦ ዔኤላኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:7">ኔኤኮ ዋኣፆ ጉዳሢ ዢባራ ዱኡኪ ታና ባይዜኔ።<verse eid="PSA 42:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 42:8"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ፔ ማኣሪፆ ሮኦራ ዳካኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:8">ዋንቶ ታ ዒዛም ዓይናዻ ዓይኑሞ ታኣኮ ዓኣኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:8">ታ ናንጎኮ ፆኦዛሢያ ታ ሺኢቃኔ።<verse eid="PSA 42:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 42:9"/>ታኣኒ ታ ፆኦዛሢ፥ ታኣኮ ላላሢም፦</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:9">«ኔኤኒ ታና ዓይጋ ዋሌይ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:9">ሞርካ ታና ዋኣዪሴም ዓይጋ ታ ዖዪ ሃንታዖ?» ጋዓንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 42:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 42:10"/>ሞርካ ታኣኮ ቢያ ዎዴ፦ «ፆኦዛሢ ኔኤኮ ዎካ ዓኣዖ?» ጌዒ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:10">ቶኦቻ ዎዶና ሜጌፃኣ ታኣኮ ዓቱዋዖ ቆፃኔ።<verse eid="PSA 42:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 42:11"/>ታኣኮ ሼምፔሌ ዓይጋ ኔ ዖያይ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:11">ዓይጋ ኔኤኒ ሻሊንታይ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:11">ጉሙርቂፆ ዎዞ ኔኤኮ ፆኦዛሢዳ ማሄ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:11">ታና ዓውሳያ ማዔ ታ ፆኦዛሢ ሃጋኣ ታኣኒ ጋላታንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 42:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 42"/>
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="PSA 43"/>
  <para style="s1">ዒፂ ዳውሶ ዎዴና ሺኢቆ ሺኢጲሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 43:1"/>ፆኦሲዮ! ታኣም ዎጌ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 43:1">ኔና ጉሙርቁዋ ሜሌ ዴሮና ዎላ ታ ዛሎ ሞኦቲንቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 43:1">ፑርቶ ማዻ ዓሶና ጌሻ ዓሶናይዳፓ ታና ዓውሴ።<verse eid="PSA 43:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 43:2"/>ታ ፆኦዛሢዮ! ኔኤኒ ታኣኮ ዶዶ ዋርዲያሢኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 43:2">ኔኤኒ ታና ዓይጋ ሃሻይ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:2">ሞርካ ታና ዓይጋ ሮኦጋሲ ዖዪሳይ?<verse eid="PSA 43:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 43:3"/>ኔኤኮ ፖዖና ጎኑሞና ታኣም ዳኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 43:3">ዔያታ ታና ዔኪ ኔኤኮ ዱማዼ ዹኮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 43:3">ኔኤኮ ዎርቆ ማኣሮዋ ታና ሄሊሶንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 43:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 43:4"/>ታኣኒ ፆኦሲም ዒንጎ ባኮ ሺኢሾ ቤዞ ዓኣዻንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 43:4">ሃይማ ፓጬኔ ጌይሱዖ ዎዛሳ ፆኦዛሢ ባንሢ ታ ዴንዳንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 43:4">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ማዔ ታ ፆኦዛሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 43:4">ሚርጌ ሻዦ ዴንሦ ጎኦሎ ዋርቂ ዋርቂ ታ ኔና ጋላታንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 43:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 43:5"/>ታኣኮ ሼምፔሌ ዓይጋ ኔ ዖያይ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 43:5">ዓይጋ ኔኤኒ ሻሊንታይ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:5">ጉሙርቂፆ ዎዞ ኔኤኮ ፆኦዛሢዳ ማሄ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 43:5">ታና ዓውሳሢ ማዔ ፆኦዛሢ ሃጊ ታ ጋላታንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 43:5"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 43"/>
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="PSA 44"/>
  <para style="s1">ዓይኑሞ ሱኡጋሢ ዓይሣ ጎይፆና ቆሬ ናኣታ ኬኤዚ ዔርዜ ባኮ</para>
  <para style="d">ማኣዶ ኮዒ ሺኢቆና ሺኢጲሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 44:1"/>ፆኦሲዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:1">ሚናኣ ዎዶና ኔኤኒ ማዼ ባኮ ቢያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:1">ኑኡኒ ኑ ዋዮና ዋይዜኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:1">ኑኡኮ ቤርታኣ ዓዶንሢ ዔያቶ ዎዶና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:1">ኔኤኒ ዔያቶም ማዼ ዲቃሣ ዓኮ ባኮ ኑም ኬኤዜኔ።<verse eid="PSA 44:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 44:2"/>ሚናኣ ዎዶና ኔኤኒ ማዼ ባኮ ቢያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:2">ኑ ዓዶንሢ ኑም ኬኤዜኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:2">ዬይያ፦ ኑ ዓዶንሢ ቤዞ ጌልዛኒ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:2">ሜሌ ዴሮ ኔኤኒ ዳውሴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:2">ዔያቶ ጊኢጊሺ ዴይሣኒ ቤርታ ዒኢካ ናንጋ ዓሶ ኔ ባይዜኔ።<verse eid="PSA 44:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 44:3"/>ዓጬሎ ዔያታ ዓርቄሢ ዔያቶኮ ጬንቾ ዓፓሮና ዖሊቱዋሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:3">ባሺ ዔያታ ዔኬሢያ ዔያቶ ዎልቄናቱዋሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:3">ዬያ ቢያ ዔያታ ማዼሢ ኔኤኒ ዔያቶ ናሽኬሢሮና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:3">ዔያቶና ዎላ ማዒ ኔኤኮ ዎልቆና ዶዱሞና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:3">ዔያቶ ኔ ማኣዴሢሮኬ።<verse eid="PSA 44:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 44:4"/>ኔኤኒ ታኣኮ ካኣቲኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:4">ጊንሣ ሃሣ ኔ ታኣኮ ፆኦዛሢኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:4">ያይቆኦቤ ዜርፆ ማዔ ኔ ዴራ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:4">ባሻንዳጉዲ ማዼሢ ኔናኬ።<verse eid="PSA 44:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 44:5"/>ኔ ኑና ማኣዴም ኑ ሞርኮ ኑ ባሻኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:5">ኑ ዑፃ ዔቃ ዓሶ ኔ ሱንፆና ኑ ዻውሲሳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 44:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 44:6"/>ታኣኒ ታኣኮ ሂኢዦ ጉሙርቁዋሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:6">ታኣኮ ጬንቾ ዓፓራኣ ታና ዓውሱዋሴ።<verse eid="PSA 44:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 44:7"/>ኑ ሞርካፓ ኑና ዓውሳንዳሢ ኔናኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:7">ኑና ዒፃ ዓሶ ቦርሲሳንዳሢያ ኔናኬ።<verse eid="PSA 44:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 44:8"/>ፆኦሲዮ! ኔኤና ኑ ሄርሺንታኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:8">ሱንፆዋ ኑ ኔኤኮ ናንጊና ጋላታኔ።<verse eid="PSA 44:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 44:9"/>ሃሢ ጋዓንቴ ኔ ኑና ኬኤሬኔ፥ ቦርሲሲያ ቦርሲሴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:9">ኑኡኮ ዖሎ ዓሶና ዎላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:9">ኔኤኒ ኬስኪፆዋ ሃሼኔ።<verse eid="PSA 44:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 44:10"/>ኑኡኮ ሞርኮ ቤርታፓ ዓኣሺንቲ ጳሽካንዳጉዲ ኔ ኑና ማሄኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:10">ኑ ሞርካኣ ኑኡኮ ዓኣ ባኮ ቢያ ቡሬኔ።<verse eid="PSA 44:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 44:11"/>ኔ ኑና ሹኪንታ ማራይጉዲ ማሄኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:11">ሜሌ ዴሮ ዓጫ ኔ ኑና ዜርቄኔ።<verse eid="PSA 44:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 44:12"/>ዴሮ ኔኤኮ ኔ ዻካ ሚኢሼም ሻንቼኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:12">ዬያ ኔ ሻንቺፆና ቃሲ ዴንቄ ባኣዚ ባኣሴ።<verse eid="PSA 44:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 44:13"/>ኑኡኮ ዓሺና ኑና ጫሽካንዳጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:13">ኑ ኮሮይዳ ዓኣ ዓሶማኣ ኑ ሚኢቺ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:13">ሃሣ ዓማሊ ባኣዚ ማዓንዳጉዲ ኔ ማዼኔ።<verse eid="PSA 44:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 44:14"/>ዴሬ ኑ ዛላ ጌስቲ ዓማላያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:14">ቶኦቺሢና ቶኦኮዋ ፔኤኮ ዓጊሣንዳጉዲ ኔ ማዼኔ።<verse eid="PSA 44:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 44:15"/>ቢያ ኬላ ዓኣፖ ካራ ታኣኮ ዻውሲንቲናኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:15">ቢያ ባኣዚና ታ ቦርሲንታያ ማዔኔ።<verse eid="PSA 44:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 44:16"/>ታኣኒ ያዺ ማዔሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:16">ሞርካ ታኣኮ ኮሞ ኮፃ ዎዶና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:16">ሜሌ ዓሳ ቄኤዺ ታና ቶኦቻሢ ዋይዜሢሮኬ።<verse eid="PSA 44:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 44:17"/>ዬይ ቢያ ኑና ሄሌሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:17">ኔና ኑ ዋሊባኣንቴ፥ ኔኤኮ ጫኣቁሞ ኑ ሃሺ ሻሂባኣንቴኬ።<verse eid="PSA 44:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 44:18"/>ዒና ኑኡኮ ኔኤም ጉሙርቂንታ ጎይሣ ዓኣንቴኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:18">ቶካኣ ኑኡኮ ኔ ጎይፃፓ ኬስኪባኣሴ።<verse eid="PSA 44:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 44:19"/>ኔኤኒ ጋዓንቴ ቦዓ ፔኤቃ ቤዛ ሜንሢ ኑና ኬኤሬኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:19">ሻኔ ዹሚና ኔ ኑና ባይዜኔ።<verse eid="PSA 44:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 44:20"/>ኑ ፆኦዛሢኮ ሱንፆ ኑ ዋሊ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:20">ኩጮዋ ሜሌ ፆኦዞ ባንሢ ዔቂሴያ ኑ ማዔቴ፥<verse eid="PSA 44:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 44:21"/>ኑ ፆኦዛሢ ዬያ ዔሩዋዓዳ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:21">ዒዚ ዒናይዳ ዓኣ ባኣዚ ዔዔራያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 44:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 44:22"/>ጋዓንቴ ኔ ዛሎ ኬላ ኬላ ኑ ሃይቄዖ ዓቲ ዓቲ ዓኣኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:22">ሹኪንታ ማራይጉዲያ ኑ ፓይዲንቴኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44፡22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:36">ሮሜ 8፡36</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 44:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 44:23"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ዔቄ! ዓይጋ ኔ ጊንዓይ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:23">ዔቄ! ናንጊና ኑና ኔ ኬኤሪ ሃሺፖ!<verse eid="PSA 44:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 44:24"/>ኔኤኮ ዓኣፖ ካሮ ኑ ጊዳፓ ኔ ዓይጋ ሺርሻይ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:24">ኑኡኮ ሜታዺፆና ሄርቂንቲ ዎይፆዋ ዓይጋ ኔ ዋላይ?<verse eid="PSA 44:24"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 44:25"/>ሳዖ ኬዲ ሄላኒ ዑኪ ኑ ኩንቴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:25">ዒኢካ ኑ ሎኦሚ ላሄኔ።<verse eid="PSA 44:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 44:26"/>ዔቂጋፓ ኑና ማኣዳኒ ሙኬ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:26">ኔኤኮ ናንጊና ናንጋ ናሹሞሮ ጌይጋፓ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:26">ጊንሣ ማሂ ኑና ሻንቂ ዔኪ ዓውሴ!<verse eid="PSA 44:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 44"/>
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="PSA 45"/>
  <para style="s1">ዓይኑሞ ሱኡጋሢ ዓይሣ ጎይፆና ዛዬና ዓይናዺንቴ ቆሬ ናኣታ ዔርዜ ባኮ</para>
  <para style="d">ናሹሞ ዛላ ካላሊ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 45:1"/>ዒና ታኣኮ ኮሺ ማሊሢ ኬሳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:1">ታኣኒ ጊኢጊሼ ካላሎ ካኣቲም ዋይዚሳንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:1">ዻንጋ ታኣኮ ዔሮ ዓሲ ዓርቂ ፃኣፓ ቢዒሬጉዲኬ።<verse eid="PSA 45:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 45:2"/>ሚዛጱማ ኔኤሲ ዓሲዳፓ ቢያ ባሼኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:2">ኔኤኒ ጌስታ ጌኤዛኣ ሄርሺሳያኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:2">ዬያሮ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ኔና ዓንጄኔ።<verse eid="PSA 45:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 45:3"/>ቦንቾና ዲቃሥሢና ኩሜ ዎልቆ ካኣቲዮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:3">ጬንቾ ዓፓሮ ኔኤሲ ቱኬ።<verse eid="PSA 45:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 45:4"/>ጎኑሞንታ ፒዜ ዎጌንታ ፂሉሞንታ ዛላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:4">ኔኤኮ ዲቃሣ ፑኡፑሞና ባሻኒ ቱኡቲ ኬስኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:4">ሚዛቆ ኩጫ ኔኤኮ ዲቃሣ ዓኮ ባኮ ማዾንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 45:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 45:5"/>ሂኢዣ ኔኤሲ ዋርቂንቴያኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:5">ኔ ሞርኮኮ ሳዞ ዱካንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:5">ዓጮ ካኣታ ባሺንቲ ኔ ቢታንቶ ዴማ ሎኦማንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 45:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 45:6"/>ፆኦዛሢዮ! ኔኤኮ ካኣቱሞ ዖይታ ናንጊና ናንጋኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:6">ካኣቱሞ ኔኤሲ ፒዙሞና ኔ ዎይሣያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 45:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 45:7"/>ፂሉሞ ኔኤኒ ናሽካኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:7">ዋይዚ ዒፂሢ ኔኤኒ ናሽኩዋሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:7">ዬያሮ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ማዔ ፆኦዛሢ ኔና ዶኦሬኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:7">ኔ ላጎይዳፓ ባሼ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:7">ቶኦኮ ኔኤኮ ዎዛ ዛይቴና ዒ ቲሽኬኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45፡7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 1:8-9">ዔብ. 1፡8-9</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 45:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 45:8"/>ኬርቤንታ ዒሬቴንታ ቢሬጉዴንታፓ ኮሺንቴ ሳውቃ ባካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:8">ኔኤኮ ካኣቱሞ ዓፒሎይዳ ፑኡኪንቴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:8">ዳርዞ ዓጮና ሚዛጲሶና ካኣቱሞ ማኣራ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:8">ሚርጌ ሻዦ ዴንሢ ዋርቆ ጎኦሎ ዋርቆዛ ኔና ዎዛሳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 45:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 45:9"/>ኔኤኮ ካኣቱሞ ማኣራ ዓኣ ዉዱሮ ናኣቶ ባኣካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:9">ካኣቶ ናኣቶ ማዔ ዉዱራሢ ዓኣኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:9">ጌኤሻ ጌኤሺ ዎርቄና ሚዛጲሶና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:9">ሚዛጲ ዓፒላ ማይንቲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:9">ኔኤኮ ካኣቱሞ ዖይቶኮ ሚዛቆ ዛላ ዔቄኔ።<verse eid="PSA 45:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 45:10"/>ኔኤኒ ታ ናዔሌ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:10">ታኣኒ ኔኤም ጋዓ ባኮ ዋይዜ፥ ሃይሶዋ ታኣኮ ዒናፓ ዋይዜ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:10">ኔኤኮ ዓዶ ማኣሮንታ ዴሮንታ ዋሊ ሃሼ።<verse eid="PSA 45:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 45:11"/>ሚዛጱማ ኔኤኮ ካኣቲ ዒኖ ባይዜኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:11">ጋዓንቴ ዒዚ ኔኤኮ ጎዳታሢሮ ዒዛ ቦንቼ።<verse eid="PSA 45:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 45:12"/>ፂሮሴኮ ዉዱሮ ናኣታ ዒንጎ ባኣዚ ኔኤም ዔኪ ዬዓኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:12">ዖርጎጮ ዓሳኣ ቃይሺ ኔና ሺራኔ።<verse eid="PSA 45:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 45:13"/>ካኣቲኮ ናኣ ቶኦካፓ ቶኮ ሄሊ ፓልሚ ዑኡቱሞ ማኣራ ዓኣኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:13">ማኣዓሢያ ዒዞኮ ዎርቄ ሌሊኬ።<verse eid="PSA 45:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 45:14"/>ዒዛ ፔኤኮ ሚዛጶ ማኣዓሢ ማኣዒ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:14">ካኣቲ ኮራ ዔውቲ ዓኣዻኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:14">ዒዞኮ ዔርጎና ዉዱራሢያኣ ዒዞ ጎኦቢሣኔ።<verse eid="PSA 45:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 45:15"/>ኮሺ ዎዛዺ ዎዛዺ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:15">ካኣቲ ማኣሪ ዎላ ዔያታ ጌላንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 45:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 45:16"/>ዓቲንቆ ናኣታ ኔኤኮ ዓዶንሢ ቤዞ ካኣቱሞ ጌላንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:16">ዎይሣንዳ ዓሶ ማሂ ዓጮ ቢያይዳ ኔ ዔያቶ ዶኦራንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 45:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 45:17"/>ሱንፆ ታ ኔኤኮ ሾይንቶ ቢያሢም ማላታ ማሃንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:17">ዬያሮ ዴሬ ናኣናና ኔና ሄርሼ ጎይሣ ናንጋንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 45:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 45"/>
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="PSA 46"/>
  <para style="s1">ዓይኑሞ ሱኡጋሢ ዓይሣ ጎይፆና ዓላሞዜሦ ዓይናዺንታ ቆሬ ናኣቶ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="d">ፆኦሲኮ ኑኡና ዎላ ማዒፆ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 46:1"/>ፆኦሲ ኑኡኮ ፑኖ ካያሢና ዎልቃሢናኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:1">ኑና ሄላ ሜታሢና ቢያ ኑኡኮ ዑኬ ማዒ ማኣዳሢኬ።<verse eid="PSA 46:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 46:2"/>ዬያሮ ሳዓ ዓጊፄቴታዖ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:2">ዹካኣ ዔቶ ባዛ ዔኤዺንቴቴያ ኑ ዒጊጩዋሴ።<verse eid="PSA 46:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 46:3"/>ባዞ ዋኣፃ ጉኡሚ ዓጊፄቴያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:3">ዹካ ዬያ ዋኣፆ ኩሚፃፓ ዔቄያና ዓጊፄቴያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:3">ኑኡኒ ዲቃታዓኬ።<verse eid="PSA 46:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 46:4"/>ፆኦሲኮ ካታሞ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:4">ዼኤፖ ፆኦዛሢኮ ዱማዼ ማኣሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:4">ዎዛሳያ ማዔ ዎታ ዋኣሢ ዓኣኔ።<verse eid="PSA 46:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 46:5"/>ፆኦሲ ዬኖ ካታሜሎ ባኣካኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:5">ዒዛ ዓጊፂያ ዓጊፃዓኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:5">ጉቶ ዓማ ዒዞ ዒ ማኣዳንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 46:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 46:6"/>ዴሬ ዎኦቶንዶ ካራ ባይዜኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:6">ካኣታኣ ሎኦሜኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:6">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዑኡዞ ፔኤሲ ዋይዚሴ ዎዶና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:6">ሳዓ ዓልቃኔ።<verse eid="PSA 46:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 46:7"/>ቢያ ባኮ ዎይሣ ጎዳ ኑኡና ዎላኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:7">ያይቆኦቤ ፆኦዛሢ ኑኡኮ ፑኖ ካያሢኬ።<verse eid="PSA 46:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 46:8"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳኮ ማዾ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:8">ሳዖይዳኣ ዒ ማዼ ዓኮ ባኮ ዛጋኒ ሃኒ ሙኩዋቴ።<verse eid="PSA 46:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 46:9"/>ዓይፃፓ ዴንዲ ጋፖ ሄላንዳኣና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:9">ሳዓፓ ዖልዚ ዒ ባይዛንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:9">ሂኢዦ ሜንሣንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:9">ዎርፆዋ ጋኣጫንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:9">ጊቲሞዋ ታሚና ሚቻንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 46:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 46:10"/>ሃውሹዋቴ፥ ታኣኒ ፆኦሲ ማዔሢያ ዔሩዋቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:10">ታኣኒ ዴሮ ቢያ ባኣካ ዼግ ዼጊ ጋዓንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:10">ሳዖ ዑፃኣ ታኣኒ ፑኡፒ ጴዻንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 46:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 46:11"/>ቢያ ባኮ ዎይሣ ጎዳሢ ኑኡና ዎላኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:11">ያይቆኦቤኮ ፆኦዛሢ ኑኡኮ ፑኖ ካያሢኬ።<verse eid="PSA 46:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 46"/>
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="PSA 47"/>
  <para style="s1">ዓይኑሞ ሱኡጋሢ ዓይሣ ጎይፆና ዓይናዺንታ ቆሬ ናኣቶ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="d">ፆኦሲ ዓጮኮ ቢያ ካኣቲ ማዔሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 47:1"/>ዴሬዮቴ ቢያ ኩጮ ዒንሢኮ ባዑዋቴ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 47:1">ዑኡዞዋ ዒንሢኮ ዼጊዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 47:1">ፆኦሲም ዒላሹዋቴ!<verse eid="PSA 47:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 47:2"/>ዓጮ ቢያይዳ ዼኤፒ ማዔ ካኣታሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 47:2">ዼኤፒ ማዔ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዒጊቻያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 47:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 47:3"/>ዒዚ ዴሮ ኑ ቢታንቶ ዴማ ማሄኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 47:3">ካኣታ ኑ ዴማ ማዒ ዎርቃንዳጉዲ ማዼኔ።<verse eid="PSA 47:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 47:4"/>ዒዚ ናሽካ ያይቆኦቤም ቦንቾ ማዔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 47:4">ኑኡኮ ዴኔሎዋ ዒዚ ኑም ዶኦሬኔ።<verse eid="PSA 47:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 47:5"/>ዓሳ ዒላሻኣና፥ ዛያሢያኣ ዋርቃኣና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 47:5">ፆኦሲ ፔ ካኣቱሞ ዖይቶ ቤዞ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 47:5">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ሌካ ዒ ዴዓ ቤዞ ኬስኬኔ።<verse eid="PSA 47:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 47:6"/>ዓይናዹዋቴ፥ ኑ ፆኦዛሢም ዓይናዹዋቴ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 47:6">ዓይናዹዋቴ፥ ኑ ካኣቲም ዓይናዹዋቴ!<verse eid="PSA 47:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 47:7"/>ኑ ፆኦዛሢ ዓጮ ቢያኮ ካኣቲኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 47:7">ዬያሮ ጋላታ ዓይኑሞ ዒዛም ዓይናዹዋቴ!<verse eid="PSA 47:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 47:8"/>ፆኦሲ ፔኤኮ ዱማዼ ካኣቱሞ ዖይታ ዴዔኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 47:8">ዓጮ ዴሮዋ ዎይሣሢ ዒዛኬ።<verse eid="PSA 47:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 47:9"/>ዓብራሃሜ ፆኦዛሢ ዴሮና ዎላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 47:9">ዓጮ ዴሮኮ ሱኡጋ ቡኪንቴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 47:9">ዓጮ ካኣታኣ ዒዛሮኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 47:9">ዒዚያ ኮሺ ዼግ ዼጊ ጌዔያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 47:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 47"/>
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="PSA 48"/>
  <para style="s1">ቆሬ ናኣቶ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="d">ፆኦሲ ካታሞ ማዔ ፂዮኔ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 48:1"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዼኤፒኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:1">ኑ ፆኦዛሢ ካታሞይዳ፥ ዒዛም ዱማዼ ዹካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:1">ዼጊ ጌዔ ጋላታ ዒዛም ጋላቲንታንዳያ ኮይሳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 48:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 48:2"/>ዓጮ ቢያኮ ዎዛ ማዔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:2">ኬዶ ባንፆና ሃኬና ጴዻ ዼጌ ቤዞይዳ ሚዛጳ ፂዮኔ ዹካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:2">ዼኤፖ ካኣታሢ ካታሞኬ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48፡2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:35">ማቲ. 5፡35</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 48:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 48:3"/>ፆኦዛሢ ዒዞኮ ዋርዲዮ ጋራ ማዒ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:3">ዒዞኮ ጊቲማሢ ማዒፆ ማርካሴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 48:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 48:4"/>ካኣታ ዎላ ቡኪንቲ ሙኬኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:4">ዔያታ ዎሊ ዑፃ ዖሎሮ ጎዔኔ።<verse eid="PSA 48:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 48:5"/>ጋዓንቴ ዔያታ ዬኖ ካታሜሎ ዛጋዖ ዲቃቴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:5">ዒጊጪያ ጳሽኬኔ።<verse eid="PSA 48:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 48:6"/>ሾይቺ ዓርቄ ላኣሊጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:6">ዒኢካ ጎጋይቂ ዔያታ ዚኪንቴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 48:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 48:7"/>ዓባ ኬስካ ባንፆ ዢባራ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:7">ቴርሴሴ ዓጮኮ ዋኣፆ ካኣሚሎ ሜንሣሢጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:7">ኔኤኒያ ዔያቶኮ ዎልቆ ላቢሲ ጎቃይሴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 48:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 48:8"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ማዼ ባኮ ኑ ዋይዜሢጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:8">ቢያ ባኮ ዳንዳዓ ጎዳሢ ካታማ ዬኖ ጎይፆ ማዓንቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:8">ኑ ዓኣፒና ኑ ዛጌኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:8">ዒዚ ዬኖ ካታሜሎ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:8">ናንጊና ዶዲሺ ዴይሣንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 48:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 48:9"/>ፆኦሲዮ! ኑኡኒ ኔኤኮ ጌኤዦ ማኣሮይዳ ማዒ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:9">ኔኤኮ ማኣሪፆ ኑ ማላኔ።<verse eid="PSA 48:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 48:10"/>ፆኦዛሢዮ! ኔና ጋላቲፃ ዓጫ ማዔ ካሮና ሄሌሢጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:10">ሱንፃኣ ኔኤኮ ዒማ ጎይፆ ማዔኔ።<verse eid="PSA 48:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 48:11"/>ኔኤኒ ፒዜ ዎጋያ ማዔሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:11">ፂዮኔይዳ ናንጋ ዴራ ዎዛዻኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:11">ዪሁዳ ካታማ ናንጋ ዓሶዋ ዎዛሳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 48:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 48:12"/>ዎሊ ጊንፆ ኬስኪ ፂዮኔ ሺሩዋቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:12">ዒዞ ዴዒ ካፖ ሴኤሎዋ ፓይዱዋቴ።<verse eid="PSA 48:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 48:13"/>ዒንሢ ሙካ ሾይንቶም ኬኤዛኒ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:13">ዒዞኮ ዶዶ ኬኤሎ ዲፆዋ ማሊ ጶቂሡዋቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:13">ዋርዲዮ ቤዞዋ ዛጉዋቴ።<verse eid="PSA 48:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 48:14"/>ዒንሢ ዔያቶም ኬኤዛንዳሢ፦ «ፆኦሲ ያዺኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:14">ኑ ፆኦዛሢ ናንጊና ናንጋያኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:14">ሴካ ቤርቲማኣ ዒ ኑና ዔኪ ዓኣዻንዳኔ» ጌዒኬ።<verse eid="PSA 48:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 48"/>
  <chapter number="49" style="c" sid="PSA 49"/>
  <para style="s1">ዓይኑሞ ሱኡጋሢ ዓይሣ ጎይፆና ዓይናዺንታ ቆሬ ናኣቶ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="d">ቆሎ ጉሙርቂሢ ዔኤዩሞ ማዒፆ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 49:1"/>ዓሳ ቢያሢ ዋይዙዋቴ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:1">ዓጮይዳ ናንጋ ዴራ ቢያ ዋይዙዋቴ!<verse eid="PSA 49:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 49:2"/>ዒንሢ ሂርኬ ዓሶንታ ዼጌ ዓሶንታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:2">ዖርጎጮንታ ማንቆንታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:2">ሃያ ዋይዙዋቴ።<verse eid="PSA 49:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 49:3"/>ዻንጋ ታኣኮ ዔራቶ ጌኤሲ ጌስታኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:3">ታኣኮ ዒኖ ማሊፃኣ ማሊ ጶቂሥሢ ዔርዛኔ።<verse eid="PSA 49:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 49:4"/>ዋዮ ታኣሲ ታኣኒ ኮኦኪንሦ ባንሢ ማሃንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:4">ታኣኮ ዓኣቺፆዋ ሚርጌ ሻዦ ዴንሢ ዋርቆ ጎኦሎ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:4">ዋርቂ ታ ፔጋሳንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 49:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 49:5"/>ፑርታ ኬሊ ሙኬም ፑርቶ ዓሳ ታና ማንጋኣና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:5">ታኣኒ ዓይጋ ዒጊጫይ?<verse eid="PSA 49:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 49:6"/>ዬያጉዲ ሃሣ ፔኤኮ ቆሎ ጉሙርቃዞንሢና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:6">ፔ ዖርጎቹሞና ሄርሺንታ ፑርቶ ዓሳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:6">ታና ማንጌቴያ ዓይጋ ታ ዒጊጫዖ?<verse eid="PSA 49:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 49:7"/>ሜሌሢኮ ሼምፓሢ ማሂ ሻንቂ ዓውሳኒ ዳንዳዓ ዓሲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:7">ጊንሣ ሃሣ ዬያ ማሂፆ ሚኢሾ ፆኦሲም ጪጋኒ ዳንዳዓ ዓሲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:7">ፔቴታዖ ባኣሴ።<verse eid="PSA 49:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 49:8"/>ዓሲኮ ሼምፔ ዛላ ሚኢሼ ጪጊሢ ሚርጌ ሜቶኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:8">ዎዚጉዴ ሚርጌ ሚኢሼ ጪጊንቴቴያ ጊዱዋሴ።<verse eid="PSA 49:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 49:9"/>ሃይቁዋጉዲ፥ ዱኡኪንቱዋጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:9">ናንጊና ናንጋያ ማሃኒ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:9">ዎዚጉዴ ሚርጌ ሚኢሼ ጪጊንቴቴያ ጊዱዋሴ።<verse eid="PSA 49:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 49:10"/>ዔሮ ዓሳ ሃይቃያ ማዔሢ ዔርቴያኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:10">ዬይ ዔሮ ዓሳ ዔኤዮና ቤልፆ ዓሶና ዎላ ሄኮ ሃይቃኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:10">ዬያታ ቢያ ቆሎ ፔኤኮ ሃሺ ዴንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 49:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 49:11"/>ሚርጌ ዴኖም ዔያታ ፔ ሱንሢ ሱንሢ ጌሢ ዔኤሌታቴያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:11">ዔያቶኮ ዱኡፓ ናንጊና ናንጎ ማኣሮ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:11">ሾይንታፓ ሾይንቲ ሄላንዳኣና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:11">ዬይ ዔያቶኮ ናንጎ ቤዞ ማዓንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 49:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 49:12"/>ዓሲ ፔኤኮ ቆሎና ቦንቺንቴ ጎይሣ ጋፒንሢ ሄሉዋሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:12">ጴዺ ባይቃ ቆልሞ ማላኔ።<verse eid="PSA 49:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 49:13"/>ዬይ ፔና ጉሙርቃ ዔኤዮ ዓሶና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:13">ዔያታ ጋዓ ባኮ ዋይዚ ዔካ ዓሶናኮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:13">ጋፒንፆ ካሮኬ።<verse eid="PSA 49:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 49:14"/>ማራይጉዲ ሳዓ ዴሜም ዔያታ ጊኢጌያኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:14">ሃይቢ ዔያቶ ማራይ ሄንቆሢጉዲ ሄንቃንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:14">ፒዜ ዓሳ ጉቴና ዔያቶ ዎይሣንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:14">ፔኤኮ ቦንቺንቴ ማኣራፓ ሃኪ ሳዖ ዴማ ዔያታ ዎዓንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 49:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 49:15"/>ፆኦሲ ጋዓንቴ ሼምፓሢ ታኣኮ ሳዖ ዴማፓ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:15">ማሂ ሻንቂ ዔካንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:15">ጎኔና ዒዛ ቤርታ ታኣኒ ዔርቴያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 49:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 49:16"/>ዓሲ ዖርጎቺ ማዓዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:16">ዖርጎቹማኣ ሚርጊ ሚርጊ ዓኣዻዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:16">ዒዛ ዒጊጪፖ።<verse eid="PSA 49:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 49:17"/>ዒዚ ሃይቄ ዎዶና ዔኪ ዓኣዻንዳ ፔቴ ባኣዚታዖ ባኣሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:17">ዬይ ቆላ ዒዛና ዎላ ዱኡቲንዱዋሴ።<verse eid="PSA 49:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 49:18"/>ዓሲ ፔኤኮ ናንጋ ዎዶማና ዎዛዼያታቴያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:18">ቢያ ባካ ዒዛም ጊኢጌሢሮ ዒ ጋላቲንታያ ማዔቴያ፥<verse eid="PSA 49:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 49:19"/>ሃይቂ ላሚ ዒ ፖዒ ዛጉዋ ቤሲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:19">ፔኤኮ ቤርታኣ ዓዶንሢ ባንሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:19">ዒዚ ዓኣዻንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 49:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 49:20"/>ማሊ ጶቂሥሢ ባኣ ዖርጎቺ ዓሲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:20">ካይዚ ቦዖጉዲ ጉሪ ሃይቂ ባይቃያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 49:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 49"/>
  <chapter number="50" style="c" sid="PSA 50"/>
  <para style="s1">ዓሳኣፔ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="d">ፆኦሲ ዎዛሳ ጎኔ ካኣሺ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 50:1"/>ዼኤፖ ፆኦዛሢ ማዔ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ኬኤዛኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:1">ዓባ ኬስካ ካራፓ ዴንዲ ጌላ ካሮ ሄላንዳኣና</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:1">ሳዖይዳ ዓኣ ዓሶ ቢያ ዒዚ ዔኤላኔ።<verse eid="PSA 50:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 50:2"/>ፆኦሲ ሚርጌና ሚዛጳያ ማዔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:2">ፂዮኔ ካታማፓ ሼኤሪ ፖዓኔ።<verse eid="PSA 50:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 50:3"/>ኑ ፆኦሲ ሙካንዳኔ፥ ዚቲ ጋዓዓኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:3">ዒዛኮ ቤርታ ዔኤታ ታሚ ዓኣኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:3">ኮሮይዳኣ ዎልቄና ዓኣ ዓልጎ ዢባሬ ዓኣኔ።<verse eid="PSA 50:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 50:4"/>ዒዚ ፔ ዴሮ ዎጋ ዎዶና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:4">ጫሪንጮንታ ሳዖንታ ማርካ ማሂ ዔኤላንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 50:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 50:5"/>«ዒንጎ ባኮ ታኣም ሺኢሺፆና ታኣና ዎላ ጫኣቄ ዓሶ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:5">ታኣም ጉሙርቂንታያ ማዔ ታ ዓሶ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:5">ታ ቤርታ ቡኩሱዋቴ» ጋዓኔ።<verse eid="PSA 50:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 50:6"/>ፆኦሲ ፔኤሮ ዎጋያ ማዔሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:6">ጫሪንጫ ዒዛኮ ዼጊ ጌዔ ፂሉሞ ኬኤዛኔ።<verse eid="PSA 50:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 50:7"/>«ዒስራዔኤሌ! ታ ኔ ዑፃ ማርካዾም፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:7">ዒንሢ ታ ዴራ! ዋይዙዋቴ ታ ኬኤዞም፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:7">ታኣኒ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ማዔ ኔ ፆኦዛሢኬ።<verse eid="PSA 50:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 50:8"/>ኔኤኒ ታኣም ዒንጋ ዒንጊፆሮ ታ ኔና ቦሁዋሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:8">ቢያ ዎዴ ሚቺ ኔ ዒንጋ ዒንጊፃ ታ ቤርታ ጴዻኔ።<verse eid="PSA 50:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 50:9"/>ታኣኒ ጋዓንቴ ኔኤኮ ሞኦፃፓ ዚዮ ጌማቶ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:9">ኔኤኮ ባርታፓ ኮላቶ ኮዑዋሴ።<verse eid="PSA 50:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 50:10"/>ካዮ ቦዓ ቢያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:10">ዹካ ሄንቃ፥ ሺያና ፓይዲንታ ቆልማ ታኣሮኬ።<verse eid="PSA 50:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 50:11"/>ጫሪንጮ ካፖ ቢያ ታኣኒ ዔራኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:11">ዓሳ ናንጉዋ ዳውሎይዳ ዓኣ ቦዓኣ ታኣሮኬ።<verse eid="PSA 50:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 50:12"/>ሳዖንታ ዒኢካ ዓኣ ባካ ቢያ ታኣሮታሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:12">ዔያታ ናይዺንቴቴያ ታ ኔኤም ኬኤዙዋሴ።<verse eid="PSA 50:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 50:13"/>ታኣኒ ዚዮ ጌማቶኮ ዓሽኮ ሙዓ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:13">ኮላቶ ሱጉፆዋኣ ታኣኒ ዑሽካ?<verse eid="PSA 50:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 50:14"/>ፆኦሲም ጋላታ ዒንጊሢ ሺኢሼ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:14">ናኣቦዋ ኔኤኮ ዼኤፖ ፆኦዛሢም ዒንጌ።<verse eid="PSA 50:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 50:15"/>ሜታ ኔና ሄሌ ዎዶና ታና ዔኤሌ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:15">ታኣኒ ኔና ዓውሳንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:15">ዬካፓ ኔ ታና ጋላታንዳኔ» ጋዓኔ።<verse eid="PSA 50:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 50:16"/>ጎሞሲም ጋዓንቴ ፆኦሲ፦</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:16">«ኔኤኒ ታኣኮ ዎጎ ናባባኒ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:16">ታኣኮ ጫኣቁሞ ኔ ዻንጎና ኬኤዛኒ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:16">ዓይጎ ዔራቶ ኔኤኮ ዓኣይ?<verse eid="PSA 50:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 50:17"/>ጎሪ ታ ኔና ዞራ ዞሮ ኔ ዒፃኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:17">ቃኣሎ ታኣሲ ጊንሢም ኬኤራኔ።<verse eid="PSA 50:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 50:18"/>ዉሲ ዓሲ ኔ ዴንቃዖ ዎላ ጳሽካኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:18">ዞኦዛ ኮኦማ ዓሶና ዎላ ፔቴ ኔ ማዓኔ።»<verse eid="PSA 50:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 50:19"/>«ኔ ዻንጋ ፑርታ ባኣዚ ጌስታንዳጉዲ ኔ ሃሻኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:19">ጌኤዛ ኔኤኮ ቢያ ጌሺሢ ሌሊኬ።<verse eid="PSA 50:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 50:20"/>ዴዒጋፓ ኔኤኒ ኔ ጌርሲ ዾንካኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:20">ኔ ዒንዶ ናዖኮዋ ሱንፆ ፑርቲሳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 50:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 50:21"/>ዬያ ኔ ማዼንቴያ ታኣኒ ዚቲዮ ጌዔኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:21">ዬያሮ ታኣኒ ኔጉዲ ማዔያ ኔኤም ማላኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:21">ሃሢ ጋዓንቴ ፔጌና ታ ኔና ጎሪ ዞራኔ። »<verse eid="PSA 50:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 50:22"/>«ዒንሢ ታና ቶኦቻ ዓሳ ቢያ ሃያ ዒና ዔኪ ዋይዙዋቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:22">ሃንጎ ታ ዒንሢ ባይዛንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:22">ዒንሢ ዓውሳንዳያኣ ባኣሴ።<verse eid="PSA 50:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 50:23"/>ታኣም ጋላታ ዒንጊሢ ሺኢሻሢ ታና ቦንቻኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:23">ጎይፆ ፔኤሲ ፒዚሳሢም</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:23">ፆኦሲኮ ዓውሲፆ ታኣኒ ቤኤዛንዳኔ» ጋዓኔ።<verse eid="PSA 50:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 50"/>
  <chapter number="51" style="c" sid="PSA 51"/>
  <para style="s1">ዓይኑሞ ሱኡጋሢ ዓይሣ ጎይፆና ዓይናዺንታ ዳውቴ ዓይኑሞ፤ ዳውቴ ቤርሳቤሄ ዒኢሴያና ፆኦሲ ማሊፆ ኬኤዛ ናኣታኔ ሙኪ ዒዛ ጎሬኔ።</para>
  <para style="d">ማኣሪንታኒ ሺኢቂንቴ ሺኢጲሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 51:1"/>ፆኦሲዮ! ኔኤኮ ኮሹሞጉዴያ ታና ማኣሬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:1">ኔኤኮ ሚጪንቲፆ ሚርጉሞና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:1">ዻቢንቶ ታኣኮ ዓቶም ጌዔኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">51፡1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 12:1-15">2ሳሙ. 12፡1-15</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 51:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 51:2"/>ዻቢንቶ ታኣኮ ጋፒሲ ማስኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:2">ታ ጎማፓ ታና ጌኤሼ።<verse eid="PSA 51:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 51:3"/>ታኣኒ ታኣኮ ዻቢንቶ ዔራኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:3">ቢያ ዎዴ ጎማ ታኣሲ ታ ቤርታ ታኣም ጴዻኔ።<verse eid="PSA 51:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 51:4"/>ታኣኒ ዋይዞ ዒፄሢ ኔኤምኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:4">ታ ኔ ቤርታ ፑርታ ባኣዚ ማዼኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:4">ኔኤኒ ዒፃ ባኮ ታ ማዼኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:4">ዬያሮ ኔኤኒ ታኣም ዎጌ ዎጊፆና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:4">ሜታሢያ ሄሊሴሢ ፒዜኬ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">51፡4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 3:4">ሮሜ 3፡4</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 51:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 51:5"/>ታ ዒንዳ ታና ጎጳዼማፓ ታኣኒ ጎሜናኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:5">ሾይቴማፓ ዓርቃዖ ታ ዻቢንቴያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 51:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 51:6"/>ኔኤኒ ፒዜ ማዒሢና ጎኑሞና ናሽካሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:6">ኔ ዔራቶኮ ዓኣሺንቴ ባኮ ታና ዔርዜ።<verse eid="PSA 51:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 51:7"/>ሂሶጴ ዒላዦና ታና ኮርዴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:7">ታኣኒያ ጌኤሽካንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:7">ታና ማስኬ፥ ሻቺዳፓ ባሼ ታኣኒ ቦኦራንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 51:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 51:8"/>ዎዛ ዑኡሲ ኔ ታና ዋይዚሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:8">ኔ ታኣኮ ሜንሤ ሜጌፃ ዎዛዻንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 51:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 51:9"/>ታኣኮ ጎሞ ዛጊፖ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:9">ዻቢንቶዋ ታኣም ዓቶም ጌዔ።<verse eid="PSA 51:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 51:10"/>ታ ፆኦዛሢዮ! ጌኤሺ ዒና ታኣም ዒንጌ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:10">ፒዜ ማዔ ዓያና ጋራ ታኣኮ ጌሤ።<verse eid="PSA 51:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 51:11"/>ኔ ቤርታፓ ታና ሺኢሺፖ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:11">ኔኤኮ ዱማዼ ዓያኖዋ ታጊዳፓ ዔኪፖ።<verse eid="PSA 51:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 51:12"/>ኔኤኒ ታና ዓውሴ ዎዶና ዒንጌ ዎዞጉዴ ዎዛ ታኣም ዒንጌ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:12">ዓይሢንታያ ማዓንዳጉዲ ታና ማኣዴ።<verse eid="PSA 51:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 51:13"/>ዬካፓ ታኣኒ ዓይሢፆ ኔኤኮ ካፑዋ ዓሶ ዔርዛንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:13">ጎሞ ዓሳኣ ኔ ባንሢ ማዓንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 51:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 51:14"/>ታኣኮ ዼኤሻሢ ማዔ ታ ፆኦዛሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:14">ዓሲ ዎዺሢዳፓ ታና ኔ ካፔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:14">ኔኤኒ ዓውሳያ ማዔሢሮ ጋላታ ዓይኑሞ ታ ዓይናዻኔ።<verse eid="PSA 51:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 51:15"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ዻንጎ ታኣኮ ቡሌ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:15">ታኣኒያ ኔና ጋላታንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 51:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 51:16"/>ዎንዴ ኔ ዒንጎ ባኣዚ ናሽካያ ማዔቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:16">ታኣኒ ኔኤም ዒንጌያ ናንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:16">ሚቺ ዒንጎ ዒንጊፃኣ ኔና ዎዛሱዋሴ።<verse eid="PSA 51:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 51:17"/>ፆኦሲም ዒንጊንታ ዒንጊሢ ሜቄ ዒኔኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:17">ሜቄያና ሂርኪ ጌዔ ዒና ዒዚ ቦሁዋሴ።<verse eid="PSA 51:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 51:18"/>ፆኦዛሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:18">ፂዮኔ ማኣዳኒ፥ ዬሩሳላሜኮዋ ኬኤሎ ዲፆ ኮሻኒ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:18">ሃዳራ ኔኤኒ ጌዔሢጉዲ ማዖንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 51:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 51:19"/>ዬማ ዎዶና ፒዜ ዒንጎ ዒንጊፆንታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:19">ሚቺ ዒንጎ ዒንጊፆናኣ ኔኤኒ ዎዛዻንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:19">ኑኡኒያ ኔኤም ዒንጎ ባኮ ዒንጎ ቤዛ ዚዮ ጌማቶ ሺኢሻንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 51:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 51"/>
  <chapter number="52" style="c" sid="PSA 52"/>
  <para style="s1">ዓይኑሞ ሱኡጋሢ ዓይሣ ጎይፆና ዔራቶና ካላሊንታ ዳውቴ ካላሎ፤ ዔዶኦሜ ዓሢ ዶይቄ ሳኣዖኦሌ ኮራ ሙኪ፥ «ዳውቴ ዓቤሜሌኬ ማኣሪ ሙኬኔ» ጌይ ኬኤዜያና ዓይናዺንቴያኬ።</para>
  <para style="d">ፆኦሲኮ ዎጎና ኮሹሞና</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 52:1"/>ዔዞ ዎልቆሶ ፑርቱሞና ዓይጋ ኔ ጪኢዺንታይ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:1">ፆኦሲ ዓኣፓ ኔኤኒ ቶኦቺንቴያታዖ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:1">ቢያ ዎዴ ዎይቲ ኔ ዖቶርቃይ? <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">52፡1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 22:9-10">1ሳሙ. 22፡9-10</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 52:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 52:2"/>ኔኤኒ ጌሺሢ ታኣኮ ማዾኬ ጌዒ ዓርቄሦ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:2">ዻንጋ ኔኤኮ ዓጬ ሺጊሬጉዲ ባይሲንታ ሱኪ ሺራኔ።<verse eid="PSA 52:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 52:3"/>ኮሹሞይዳፓ ባሼ ፑርቱሞ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:3">ጎኑሞይዳፓ ሉኡዙሞ ባሼ ኔኤኒ ዶኦራኔ።<verse eid="PSA 52:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 52:4"/>ኔኤኒ ዓሶ ጌሻ ዓሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:4">ዓሲ ማኣሳንሦንዶ ጎይሢ ጌስታኒ ናሽካኔ።<verse eid="PSA 52:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 52:5"/>ዬያሮ ፆኦሲ ኔና ጋፒ ባይዛንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:5">ኔ ማኣራፓ ኬሲ ኔና ዒዚ ዳውሳንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:5">ዓሳ ናንጋ ሳዓፓ ኔና ቱጊ ኬኤራንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 52:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 52:6"/>ፂሎ ዓሳ ዬያ ዛጊ ዒጊጫንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:6">ሚኢቺያ ሂዚ ጌዒ ዔያታ ሚኢጫንዳኔ፦<verse eid="PSA 52:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 52:7"/>«ፆኦሲ ፔኤኮ ጊቲማጉዲ ማሂባኣ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:7">ፔ ቆሎ ሚርጉሞና ሄርሺንቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:7">ፔ ፑርቱሞናኣ ዶዴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:7">ሃያ ዓሢ ዛጉዋቴ።»<verse eid="PSA 52:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 52:8"/>ታኣኒ ጋዓንቴ ፆኦሲ ማኣሮይዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:8">ዋርቂ ዓኣ ዛይቶ ሪሚቶጉዲኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:8">ዒዛኮ ጋፑዋ ናሹሞ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:8">ናኣናና ታ ጉሙርቄ ጎይሣ ናንጋንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 52:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 52:9"/>ፆኦሲዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:9">ኔኤኒ ማዼ ኮዦ ባኮሮ ቢያ ናንጊና ታ ኔና ጋላታኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:9">ሱንፃ ኔኤኮ ኮሺታሢሮ ኔ ሱንፆ ታ ሃጋኣ ዎዛ ማሃኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:9">ኔኤም ዱማዼ ዓሶ ባኣካ ታ ኔና ጋላታኔ።<verse eid="PSA 52:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 52"/>
  <chapter number="53" style="c" sid="PSA 53"/>
  <para style="s1">ዓይኑሞ ሱኡጋሢ ዓይሣ ጎይፆና ዔራቶና ካላሊንቴ ዳውቴ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="d">ዓሲኮ ፑርቱሞ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 53:1"/>ዔኤያ ዓሲ ፔ ዒናና «ፆኦሲ ባኣሴ» ጋዓኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:1">ዬያታ ፑርታ ዓሲኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:1">ማዻ ዔያቶኮ ሻኣካያኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:1">ዔያቶ ባኣካ ፔቴታዖ ኮሺ ማዻይ ባኣሴ።<verse eid="PSA 53:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 53:2"/>ማሊ ጶቂሣ ዓሲና ፆኦሲ ኮዓ ዓሲያ ዓኣቴ ዛጋኒ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:2">ዒዚ ጫሪንጫፓ ዓሶ ዛጌኔ።<verse eid="PSA 53:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 53:3"/>ጋዓንቴ ቢያሢ ዣኣሌኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:3">ዔያታ ፔቴ ማዒያ ፑርቴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:3">ዔያቶይዳ ፔቴታዖ ኮሺ ባኣዚ ማዻይ ባኣሴ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">53፡3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 3:10-12">ሮሜ 3፡10-12</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 53:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 53:4"/>ዓሲ ካሣ ሙዓሢጉዲ ዴሮ ታኣኮ ሙዓ ዓሳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:4">ታና ዔኤሊ ዔሩዋ ዓሳ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:4">ዬያታ ፑርቶ ማዻ ዓሳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:4">ፔቴታዖ ዔኤቢ ዛጊ ዔሩዋዓዳ?<verse eid="PSA 53:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 53:5"/>ፆኦሲ ፔ ዴሮ ሞርኮ ሜንሤሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:5">ዎኖ ዎዳፓኣ ባሼ ዒጊቹሞ ዔያታ ዓርቄኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:5">ዒዚ ዔያቶ ዒፄሢሮ ጋፒ ዔያታ ቦርሲንታንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 53:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 53:6"/>ፂዮኔይዳፓ ዒስራዔኤሌም ዻቂንታ ዬዓያታቴ ዓይጎ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:6">ፆኦሲ ፔ ዴሮኮ ዲዒንቴ ባኮ ማሃ ዎዶና</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:6">ያይቆኦቤ ናኣታ ዎዛዻንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:6">ዒስራዔኤሌ ዴራኣ ኮሺ ዎዛዻንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 53:6"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 53"/>
  <chapter number="54" style="c" sid="PSA 54"/>
  <para style="s1">ዓይኑሞ ሱኡጋሢ ዓይሣ ጎይፆና ጎኦላና ዓይናዺንታ ዳውቴ ዓይኑሞ፤ ዜፓ ዓሳ ሳኣዖኦሌ ኮራ ሙኪ፥ «ዳውቴ ፑኒ ኑ ኮራ ዓኣኔ» ጌዒ ኬኤዜያና ዓይናዺንቴያኬ።</para>
  <para style="d">ሞርኮ ኩጫፓ ዓታኒ ሺኢቂንቴ ሺኢጲሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 54:1"/>ፆኦሲዮ! ኔ ሱንፆና ታና ዓውሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 54:1">ኔ ዎልቆና ታኣም ዎጌ።<verse eid="PSA 54:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 54:2"/>ፆኦሲዮ! ሺኢጲፆ ታኣኮ ዋይዜ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 54:2">ታኣኒ ጋዓ ባኮዋ ዒና ዔኬ።<verse eid="PSA 54:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 54:3"/>ፃንጎ ዓሳ ታኣም ዔቄኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 54:3">ጌኔ ማዻ ዓሳ ሼምፓሢ ታኣኮ ዼሂ ሃንታኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 54:3">ፆኦሲ ዔያታ ዔኤቢኬ ጎዑዋሴ።<verse eid="PSA 54:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 54:4"/>ጋዓንቴ ፆኦሲ ታና ማኣዳሢኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 54:4">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳኣ ታና ኬኤሊንቂ ዓርቄኔ።<verse eid="PSA 54:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 54:5"/>ዔያቶኮ ጌኖ ማዾ ታና ዋኣዪሳ ታ ሞርኮም ማሄ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 54:5">ዔያቶ ባይዚ፥ ኔኤኒ ጉሙርቂንታያ ማዒፆ ዻዌ።<verse eid="PSA 54:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 54:6"/>ኔኤም ዒንጎ ባኣዚ ታ ሼኔና ታ ዒንጋንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 54:6">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 54:6">ዬይ ኮይሳያ ማዔሢሮ ታ ኔና ጋላታኔ።<verse eid="PSA 54:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 54:7"/>ታ ሜታፓ ቢያ ኔ ታና ዓውሴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 54:7">ታ ሞርኮኮዋ ሎኦሚፆ ታ ዛጌኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">54፡7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 23:19">1ሳሙ. 23፡19</ref>፤ <ref loc="1SA 26:1">26፡1</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 54:7"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 54"/>
  <chapter number="55" style="c" sid="PSA 55"/>
  <para style="s1">ዓይኑሞ ሱኡጋሢ ዓይሣ ጎይፆና ጎኦላና ዓይናዺንታ ዳውቴ ኬኤዚ ዔርዜ ባኮ</para>
  <para style="d">ላጌ ዒፄ ዓሲ ሺኢቄ ሺኢጲሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 55:1"/>ፆኦሲዮ! ሺኢጲፆ ታኣሲ ዋይዜ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:1">ታ ኔና ሺኢቃ ሺኢጲፆ ቶኦዛዺፖ!<verse eid="PSA 55:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 55:2"/>ታ ባንሢ ዛጌ፥ ዋይዚያ ታኣም ማሄ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:2">ጋርሲና ታኣኒ ዲቃቴኔ፥ ዓጊፂያ ዓጊፄኔ።<verse eid="PSA 55:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 55:3"/>ታ ሞርካ ታኣም ዚርቃሢሮ ታ ዒጊጬኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:3">ፑርቶ ሄርቂ ዎይሢፃ ታና ሺኢቼኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:3">ዔያታ ፑርታ ሜቶ ታ ጊዳ ዔኪ ሙካኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:3">ዒፂ ዻጋና ታና ዔያታ ዛጋኔ።<verse eid="PSA 55:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 55:4"/>ዒና ታኣኮ ታና ማሊሢና ዋኣዪሳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:4">ታኣኒ ሃይቄኔ ጌይሲ ታና ዒጊቺ ዓርቄኔ።<verse eid="PSA 55:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 55:5"/>ዒጊቹሞና ዲቃቲሢና ታ ዓርቄኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:5">ዑፃ ታኣኮ ማዔ ካራና ዲቃታኔ።<verse eid="PSA 55:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 55:6"/>ዶኦሌጉዲ ጋኣሲ ታኣኮ ዓኣቴ ዓይጎ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:6">ባራኒ ዴንዲ ታ ሃውሼያ ናንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 55:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 55:7"/>ሄኤዶ ቤቲ ታኣኒ ሃኬ ዓኣዼቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:7">ዓሳ ናንጉዋ ዳውሎይዳ ታ ናንጋንዳቴኬ።<verse eid="PSA 55:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 55:8"/>ዓልጋሢ ዢባሮና ዢኢፖናፓ ታ ጳሽኪ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:8">ሩኡሪና ታ ማኣሮ ባንሢ ታ ሄሌያ ናንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 55:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 55:9"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:9">ካታሜሎይዳ ጌኔ ማዾና ዣሎና ታ ዛጋሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:9">ዲቃሢ ካራ ዔያቶኮ ባይዜ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:9">ጌስታ ሙኡጮዋ ዔያቶሲ ሲኢሬ።<verse eid="PSA 55:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 55:10"/>ዒዛ ሜቶና ባይሲንታና ኩሜ ካታማኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:10">ፑርቶ ዓሳ ዋንቶንታ ሮኦሮንታ ዒዞኮ ኬኤሎ ዲፆ ዑፃ ሃንታኔ።<verse eid="PSA 55:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 55:11"/>ባይሲንታ ዒዞይዳ ዓኣኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:11">ጌኔ ማዾና ጌሺሢና ዓሳ ቡካ ጶኦካፓ ዒዞኮ ባይቁዋሴ።<verse eid="PSA 55:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 55:12"/>ታና ጫሽካሢ ታ ሞርካሢቱዋሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:12">ዎንዴ ዬያታቴ ጊቢ ታ ዳንዳዔያ ናንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:12">ታ ዑፃ ዖቶርቃሢያ ዒዛቱዋሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:12">ዒዛታቴ ቤርታፓ ታ ዒዛኮ ዓኣሺንቴያ ናንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 55:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 55:13"/>ጋዓንቴ ዬያ ማዻሢ ታ ኔና ጉሙርቃ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:13">ታኣኮ ላጋሢና፥ ዒጊናሢ ማዔ ኔናኬ።<verse eid="PSA 55:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 55:14"/>ኑኡኒ ፆኦሲ ማኣራ ዴሮ ባኣካ ዎላ ሃንቴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:14">ዎዛሳ ናሹሞዋ ኑኡኮ ዓኣኔ።<verse eid="PSA 55:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 55:15"/>ዒና ዔያቶኮ ፑርቱሞ ቡኬ ቤሲታሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:15">ታ ሞርኮይዳ ዔያታ ዔሩዋንቴ ሃይቢ ዬዖንጎ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:15">ሳዛና ዓኣዖዋ ዱኡኪንቶንጎ!<verse eid="PSA 55:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 55:16"/>ታኣኒ ጋዓንቴ ፆኦሲ ባንሢ ዒላታኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:16">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢ ታና ዓውሳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 55:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 55:17"/>ዋንቶንታ ጉቶንታ ሮኦሮንታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:17">ታኣኒ ዔኤሊንታኔ፥ ዚኢሊንቲያ ታ ዚኢሊንታኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:17">ዑኡዞዋ ዒ ታኣኮ ዋይዛኔ።<verse eid="PSA 55:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 55:18"/>ታና ማኪ ዔቄ ዓሳ ሚርጌኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:18">ታኣም ማሎና ዖላፓ ሼምፓሢ ታኣኮ ዒዚ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:18">ማሂ ሻንቂ ዔኪ ዓውሳንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 55:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 55:19"/>ዔያታ ፔኤኮ ሃንቲፆ ላኣሚባኣሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:19">ፆኦሲያ ዔያታ ዒጊጩዋሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:19">ሚናፓ ዓርቃዖ ፔኤኮ ካኣቱሞይዳ ዓኣ ፆኦዛሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:19">ዋይዚ ዔያቶ ዒ ዻውሲሳንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 55:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 55:20"/>ታኣኒ ዒዛ ታ ላጌኬ ጋዓ ዓሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:20">ፔ ላጎ ጳርቃኒ ፔ ኩጮ ዔቂሴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:20">ዎላ ጫኣቄ ጫኣቁሞዋ ሃሼኔ።<verse eid="PSA 55:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 55:21"/>ዻንጋ ዒዛኮ ዖይሲዳፓ ባሼ ሺኢታኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:21">ዒና ጋዓንቴ ዒዛኮ ዖልዚ ማላኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:21">ዑኡዛ ዒዛኮ ዛይቴይዳፓ ባሼ ኮሽካኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:21">ጋዓንቴ ቱጊንቴ ጬንቻ ዓፓሮጉዲኬ።<verse eid="PSA 55:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 55:22"/>ኔና ዴኤፃ ባኮ ቢያ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳም ሃሼ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:22">ዒዚ ኔ ቶኦኮ ዛጊ ዓርቃንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:22">ዒዚ ኮዦ ዓሶ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:22">ፔቴታዖ ሜታዻንዳጉዲ ሜቶም ዓኣሢ ዒንጉዋሴ።<verse eid="PSA 55:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 55:23"/>ፆኦሲዮ! ኔኤኒ ጋዓንቴ ፑርቶ ዓሶ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:23">ባይሲንታ ዔቴይዳ ኬኤራንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:23">ዬያታ ዓሶ ዎዻ ዓሶና ጌሻ ዓሳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:23">ዔያታ ናንጋኒ ኮይሳ ሌዖኮ ሄካሢታዖ ናንጋዓኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:23">ታኣኒ ጋዓንቴ ኔና ጉሙርቃኔ።<verse eid="PSA 55:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 55"/>
  <chapter number="56" style="c" sid="PSA 56"/>
  <para style="s1">«ዶኦሌላ ሃኬ ዓኣ ሻኣቦይዳ» ጌይንቴ ዓይኑሞና ዓይኑሞ ሱኡጋሢ ዓይሣ ጎይፆ ካላሊንቴ ዳውቴ ካላሎ (ፒሊስፄኤሜ ዓሳ ጌኤቴይዳ ዳውቴ ዓርቄያና ዒ ካላሌያኬ።)</para>
  <para style="d">ፆኦሲ ጉሙርቂ ሺኢቂንታ ሺኢጲሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 56:1"/>ፆኦሲዮ! ዓሳ ታና ዋኣዪሳሢና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:1">ሞርካኣ ታኣኮ ታና ቢያ ዎዴ ዳውሳሢናሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:1">ታኣም ሚጪንቴ።<verse eid="PSA 56:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 56:2"/>ዖቶርሙሞና ታና ዖላ ዓሳ ሚርጌኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:2">ሞርካ ታኣኮ ሮኦሮ ጉቤ ታ ዑፃ ዔቄኔ።<verse eid="PSA 56:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 56:3"/>ታና ዒጊቻ ዎዶና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:3">ታኣኮ ጉሙርቂፆ ታ ኔጊዳ ማሃኔ።<verse eid="PSA 56:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 56:4"/>ታኣኒ ፆኦሲ ጉሙርቃሢሮ ዒጊጫዓ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:4">ታኣም ዒንጊንቴ ሃጊ ማዓ ዎዞሮ ዒዛ ታ ጋላታኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:4">ታኣኒ ዒዛ ጉሙርቃሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:4">ዔዞ ዓሲ ታና ዎዳንዳይ?<verse eid="PSA 56:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 56:5"/>ሞርካ ታኣኮ ሮኦሮ ጉቤ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:5">ታ ዻቢንቴቴ ዓርቃኒ ኮዒ ሃንታኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:5">ቢያ ዎዴ ታና ባይዛኒ ዎላ ዞርታኔ።<verse eid="PSA 56:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 56:6"/>ቡኪንቲ ታና ዔያታ ካታኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:6">ሄፆ ቢያ ዔያታ ታኣኮ ኮጲሳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:6">ሼምፓሢ ታኣኮ ባይዛኒ ኮዓኔ።<verse eid="PSA 56:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 56:7"/>ፆኦሲዮ! ዎይቴቴያ ዔያታ ቶሊ ዓቱዋጉዲ ማዼ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:7">ያቶ ዴሮ ኔኤኮ ጎሪንቶና ዻውሲሴ።<verse eid="PSA 56:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 56:8"/>ቃያሢ ታኣኮ ፃኣፒ ዓርቄ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:8">ዓቢፆዋ ኔ ዶሎዞይዳ ቃዼ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:8">ቢያሢ ፃኣፒ ዓርቆ ቤዛ ዓርቂንቴያቱዋዓዳ?<verse eid="PSA 56:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 56:9"/>ኔ ባንሢ ታኣኒ ዔኤሊንታ ኬሎና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:9">ሞርካ ታኣኮ ጊንሢም ማዓኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:9">ዬያና ፆኦሲ ታኣኮ ኮራ ማዔሢ ታ ዔራኔ።<verse eid="PSA 56:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 56:10"/>ዬይ ታኣና ዎላ ማዔ ፆኦዛሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:10">ቃኣሎ ታ ዒዛኮ ጋላታሢና ቦንቻ ፆኦዛሢኬ።<verse eid="PSA 56:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 56:11"/>ታኣኒ ዒዛ ጉሙርቃሢሮ ዒጊጫዓ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:11">ዓሲ ታና ዓይጎ ዎዳንዳይ?<verse eid="PSA 56:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 56:12"/>ፆኦሲዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:12">ኔኤም ታኣኒ ናኣቤ ናኣቢ ዓኣኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:12">ዬይያ ጋላታ ታ ኔኤም ሺኢሻያኬ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">56፡12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 21:13-15">1ሳሙ. 21፡13-15</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 56:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 56:13"/>ሃይቢዳፓ ኔኤኒ ታና ዓውሴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:13">ዹቂንቲ ታኣኒ ሎኦሙዋጉዲ ኔ ታና ማኣዴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:13">ዬያሮ ሼምፖና ዓኣ ዓሶ ዑፃ ፖዓ ፖዖይዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:13">ፆኦሲ ቤርታ ታኣኒ ሃንታኔ።<verse eid="PSA 56:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 56"/>
  <chapter number="57" style="c" sid="PSA 57"/>
  <para style="s1">«ባይዚፖ» ጌይንታ ዓይኑሞና ዓይኑሞ ሱኡጋሢ ዓይሣ ጎይፆ ካላሊንቴ ዳውቴ ካላሊ (ዳውቴ ሳኣዖኦሌ ቤርታፓ ፑኒ ዴኖ ዔቶ ጌሌያና ዓይናዼያኬ።)</para>
  <para style="d">ፆኦሲ ማኣዳንዳጉዲ ሺኢቂንቴ ሺኢጲሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 57:1"/>ፆኦሲዮ! ታኣም ሚጪንቴ፥ ታና ማኣሬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:1">ታ ሼምፓሢኮ ፑኖ ካያሢ ኔናኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:1">ሜቶ ዲጳ ዓኣዻንዳያ ሄላንዳኣና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:1">ኔኤኮ ጋኣዞ ዴሞ ታኣኒ ጌላንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 57:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 57:2"/>ታኣም ማሌ ባኮ ማዺ ኩንሣ ፆኦዛሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:2">ዒዛ ዼኤፓሢ ባንሢ ታኣኒ ዒላታኔ።<verse eid="PSA 57:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 57:3"/>ፆኦሲ ፔ ሚጪንቲፆና ጉሙርቂንቲፆዋ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:3">ጫሪንጫፓ ዳኪ ታና ዓውሳንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:3">ታና ሜታሳ ዓሶ ዒዚ ዻውሲሳንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 57:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 57:4"/>ሼምፔላ ታኣኮ ዞቢና ማንጊንቴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:4">ሾኦሊ ታና ሙዓ ቦዖ ባኣካ ታ ኬዴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:4">ዓጫ ዔያቶኮ ዎርሢና ሂኢሺናጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:4">ዒንዲርዛኣ ዔያቶሲ ዋርቂንቴ ጬንቻ ዓፓሮኬ።<verse eid="PSA 57:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 57:5"/>ፆኦሲዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:5">ሌካ ጫሪንጮኮ ዑፃ ዼግ ዼጊ ጌዔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:5">ቦንቻ ኔኤሲ ሳዖ ቢያይዳ ኩሞንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 57:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 57:6"/>ሞርካ ታኣኮ ታና ዓይሣኒ ፒሮ ታኣም ፒሬኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:6">ታና ጉቤና ዎቢሳ ዎዛ ቲቂሢ ታና ሄሌኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:6">ዔያታ ታኣኮ ጎይፆይዳ ዔቴ ቦኦኬኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:6">ጋዓንቴ ዬያ ዔቶይዳ ፔኤሮ ዔያታ ሎኦሜኔ።<verse eid="PSA 57:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 57:7"/>ፆኦዛሢዮ! ዒና ታኣኮ ዶዲኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:7">ካላሊያ ካላሊ ታኣኒ ዓይናዻኔ።<verse eid="PSA 57:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 57:8"/>ታኣኮ ሼምፔሌ ጴጬ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:8">ጎኦሎንታ ሃንጎ ዓይኑሞ ዓንጋሞንታ ዔቁዋቴ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:8">ታኣኒያ ሚኢሪ ዔቃንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 57:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 57:9"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ዴሮ ባኣካ ታ ኔና ጋላታንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:9">ታ ዴሮ ባኣካኣ ታ ኔኤም ጋላታ ዓይኑሞ ዓይናዻንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 57:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 57:10"/>ኔኤኮ ናንጊና ናንጋ ናሹማ ጫሪንጮ ሄላያኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:10">ጉሙርቂንቲፃኣ ሻኣሮ ሄላኔ።<verse eid="PSA 57:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 57:11"/>ፆኦሲዮ! ጫሪንጮኮ ዑፃ ዼግ ዼጊ ጌዔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:11">ቦንቻ ኔኤኮ ሳዖ ቢያይዳ ማዖንጎ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">57፡11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 22:1">1ሳሙ. 22፡1</ref>፤ <ref loc="1SA 24:3">24፡3</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 57:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 57"/>
  <chapter number="58" style="c" sid="PSA 58"/>
  <para style="s1">«ባይዚፖ» ጌይንታ ዓይኑሞና ዓይኑሞ ሱኡጋሢ ዓይሣ ጎይፆ ካላሊንቴ ዳውቴ ካላሎ</para>
  <para style="d">ፆኦሲ ፑርቶ ዓሶ ዎጋንዳጉዲ ሺኢቂንቴ ሺኢጲሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 58:1"/>ዒንሢ ዎይሣ ዓሳ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:1">ፒዜ ዒንሢ ጌስታ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:1">ዓሶም ጎኑሞና ሄኮ ዒንሢ ዎጋ?<verse eid="PSA 58:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 58:2"/>ዬያ ዒንሢ ሃሺ ዒኖና ዒንሢ ፑርታ ባኣዚ ማሊ ቱካኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:2">ሳዖይዳ ዒንሢ ማዻ ባካ ቢያ ፑርታ ሌሊኬ።<verse eid="PSA 58:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 58:3"/>ፑርቶ ዓሳ ዒንዶ ጎጳ ዓኣዖ ዣኣሌያኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:3">ሾይንቴማፓ ዓርቃዖ ዻባኔ፥ ሉኡዙሞዋ ዔያታ ጌስታኔ።<verse eid="PSA 58:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 58:4"/>ዔያታ ሾኦሺጉዲ ዳኣኒናኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:4">ዋይዚ ባይቄ ጎፖ ሾኦሺ ጉዴያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 58:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 58:5"/>ጎፖ ሾኦዣ ዋዮ ፔኤሲ ቱጫሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:5">ሾኦዦ ማርሻ ዓሶንታ ሳጎ ዓሶንታኮ ዑኡዞ ዋይዞ ዒፂኬ።<verse eid="PSA 58:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 58:6"/>ፆኦሲዮ! ዬያቶ ዞቦጉዴ ፑርቶ ዓሶንሢኮ ዓጮ ሜንሤ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:6">ባንጋሎዋ ዔያቶሲ ሾኦሌ።<verse eid="PSA 58:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 58:7"/>ላኣሊንታዖ ጋፓ ዋኣሢጉዲ ዔያታ ባይቆንጎ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:7">ሂኢዦ ዔያታ ዱካዛ ዻዻቦንጎ!<verse eid="PSA 58:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 58:8"/>ሃንታዖ ማኣሽኪ ጋፓ ዻኣዼጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:8">ጊንሣ ሃሣ ፖዒ ዛጉዋ፥ ቡሊሢጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:8">ዔያታ ማዖንጎ!<verse eid="PSA 58:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 58:9"/>ዔያታ ዔርቲባኣንቴ ዓንጊሢጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:9">ቱጊንቲ ኬኤሪንታንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:9">ፆኦሲ ፔኤኮ ዼኤፖ ዻጎና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:9">ሼምፔና ዓኣንቴ ዜርቂ ዔያቶ ባይዛንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 58:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 58:10"/>ጎሞ ዓሶኮ ኮማ ኮፂንታኣና ዛጋዖ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:10">ፂሎ ዓሳ ዎዛዻኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:10">ዔያታ ቶኮ ፔኤሲ ፑርቶ ዓሶ ሱጉፆና ማስታኔ።<verse eid="PSA 58:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 58:11"/>ዬኖ ዎዶና ዓሳ፦ «ፂሎ ዓሳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:11">ፔኤኮ ኮዦ ማዾ ዛሎ ዒንጎ ባኮ ዔኬኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:11">ሳዖይዳ ዎጋ ፆኦሲ ጎኔና ዓኣኔ» ጋዓንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 58:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 58"/>
  <chapter number="59" style="c" sid="PSA 59"/>
  <para style="s1">«ባይዚፖ» ጌይንታ ዓይኑሞና ዓይኑሞ ሱኡጋሢ ዓይሣ ጎይፆ ካላሊንቴ ዳውቴ ካላሊ (ዳውቴ ዎዻኒ ማኣሮ ዒዛኮ ማንጋንዳጉዲ ሳኣዖኦሌ ዓሶ ዳኬያና ዒ ዓይናዼያኬ።)</para>
  <para style="d">ፆኦሲ ካፓንዳጉዲ ሺኢቂንቴ ሺኢጲሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 59:1"/>ፆኦሲዮ! ታኣኮ ሞርኮይዳፓ ታና ዓውሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:1">ታና ማኣሳንሣኒ ዔቄ ዓሶይዳፓ ካፔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">59፡1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 19:11">1ሳሙ. 19፡11</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 59:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 59:2"/>ፑርቶ ማዻ ዓሶይዳፓ ሄሊ ታና ዓይሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:2">ዓሶ ዎዻ ዓሶይዳፓኣ ታና ዓውሴ።<verse eid="PSA 59:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 59:3"/>ዔያታ ታና ካቲ ዓኣ ጎይፆ ዛጌ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:3">ፆኦሲዮ! ሚጪንቱዋ ዓሳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:3">ታ ዻቤ ባኣዚንታ ጎሜያ ታኣኮ ባኣንቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:3">ታ ዑፃ ቡኪ ዔያታ ዞርቴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 59:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 59:4"/>ዔያታ ታ ዻቤ ባኣዚ ባኣንቴ ታና ማኣሳንሣኒ ጊኢጊንቴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:4">ኔኤኒ ዬያ ዛጊጋፓ ዔቂ ታና ማኣዴ።<verse eid="PSA 59:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 59:5"/>ኔኤኒ ቢያ ባኮ ዎይሣ ጎዳ ማዔ ዒስራዔኤሌ ፆኦዛሢኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:5">ሜሌ ዴሮይዳ ሜቶ ዓጋኒ ኬስኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:5">ዔያታ ፔኤኮ ጌኖ ማዾና ማዻ ባኮሮዋ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:5">ሚጪንቱዋዖ ሜቶ ዔያቶይዳ ኬኤሬ።<verse eid="PSA 59:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 59:6"/>ካታሞይዳ ዔያታ ዓዳ ካኒጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:6">ቦጪ ሃንቲ ሺራኣ ሺራ ፔኤቂ ዒባኒ ማዓንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 59:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 59:7"/>ዻንጋፓ ዔያቶኮ ኬስካ ባኮ ኔኤኒ ዋይዜ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:7">ዻንጋ ዔያቶኮ ጬንቻ ዓፓሮ ዓኣኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:7">ዔያታ፦ «ዖኦኒያ ኑኡሲ ዋይዙዋሴ» ጋዓኔ።<verse eid="PSA 59:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 59:8"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:8">ኔኤኒ ጋዓንቴ ዔያቶ ሚሚኢጫኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:8">ሜሌ ዴሮ ቢያ ቶኦቺ ኔ ዛጋኔ።<verse eid="PSA 59:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 59:9"/>ታኣኮ ዶዱማሢዮ! ታና ኔ ካፔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:9">ፆኦዛሢዮ! ኔኤኒ ታኣኮ ፑኖ ካያሢኬ።<verse eid="PSA 59:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 59:10"/>ፆኦሲ ፔ ማኣሪፆና ታኣና ካኣማንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:10">ታ ጎዳሢ ታ ሞርኮኮ ሎኦሚፆ ታና ዻዋንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 59:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 59:11"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ማዔ ኑ ጊቲማሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:11">ታኣኮ ዒጊና ኔኤኒ ኮሜ ኮፃያ ማዔሢ ዋሉዋጉዲ ዔያቶ ዎዺፖ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:11">ጋዓንቴ ኔኤኮ ዎልቆና ዔያቶ ዜርቄ፥ ሃሣ ዻውሲሴ።<verse eid="PSA 59:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 59:12"/>ፔኤኮ ዔያታ ዻንጋፓ ኬሳ ጎሞሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:12">ፔ ሙሱሮና ዔያታ ጌስታ ዑኡዞሮ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:12">ዔያታ ጋዳንቂ ሉኡቃሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:12">ፔ ዖቶርሙሞና ዓዺንቶንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 59:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 59:13"/>ኔኤኮ ዻጎና ዔያቶ ባይዜ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:13">ዔያቶ ጋጋፒሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:13">ያዺ ማዓዛ ፆኦሲ ዒስራዔኤሌ ዓሶ ዎይሣያ ማዔሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:13">ዓጮኮ ጋፖ ሄላንዳኣና ዔርቴያ ማዓንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 59:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 59:14"/>ታኣኮ ሞርካ ጉሪ ካታሞይዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:14">ካኒጉዲ ቦጪ ሃንቲ ሺራኣ ሺራ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:14">ዒባኒ ማዒ ሙካኔ።<verse eid="PSA 59:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 59:15"/>ሙዖ ባይዚ ዔያታ ጳሽኪ ሺራኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:15">ዔያታ ሚሽኪባኣያታቴ ጉሪ ቦጪ ሺራኔ።<verse eid="PSA 59:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 59:16"/>ታኣኒ ጋዓንቴ ኔኤኮ ዎልቆ ዛሎ ዓይናዻንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:16">ኔኤኒ ታኣኮ ፑኖ ካያሢኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:16">ታና ሜቴ ኬሎ ኔ ታኣኮ ዹካሢኬ።<verse eid="PSA 59:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 59:17"/>ፆኦዛሢዮ! ኔ ታኣኮ ዱማዼሢኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:17">ኔኤኒ ታኣኮ ፑኖ ካያሢኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:17">ኔኤኮ ናንጊና ናንጋ ናሹሞ ኔ ታና ቤኤዛኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:17">ዬያሮ ጋላታ ዓይኑሞ ታ ኔኤም ሺኢሻኔ።<verse eid="PSA 59:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 59"/>
  <chapter number="60" style="c" sid="PSA 60"/>
  <para style="s1">ዓይኑሞ ሱኡጋሢ ዓይሣ ጎይፆና «ሳሌ ቡኒ» ጌይንታ ዓይኑሞና ዓይናዺንታ ዳውቴ ካላሊ (ኬዶ ዛሎኮ ዓባ ጌላ ባንፃ ዓኣ ሜሴፖታሚያና ሶኦሪያ ዓጮኮ ሳዞይዳ ናንጋ ዓራማ ዓሳ ዒስራዔኤሌ ዓሶ ዖሌያና፥ ጊንሣ ሃሣ ዒዮዓኣቤያ ሶኦጎ ዶኦጮይዳ ታጶ ላምዖ ሺያ ማዓ ዔዶኦሜ ዓሶ ዎዼያና ዓሶ ዔርዛኒ ዳውቴ ካላሌ ካላሊኬ።)</para>
  <para style="d">ፆኦሲ ዓውሳያ ማዒፆ ዔርዛ ሺኢጲሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 60:1"/>ፆኦሲዮ! ኔ ኑና ኬኤሬኔ፥ ሜንሢያ ጋኣጬኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:1">ኔ ኑና ጎሬኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:1">ሃሢ ጋዓንቴ ማሂ ኑና ኮሼ።<verse eid="PSA 60:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 60:2"/>ሳዔሎ ኔ ዓጊሢ ፃሂሲ ዳርዜኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:2">ሴካ ሃንጋ ዒዛ ጋዓሢሮ ዒዞ ኮኦሌ።<verse eid="PSA 60:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 60:3"/>ኔኤኮ ዴሮ ሜቶ ኔ ዻዌኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:3">ማሣ ዎይኔ ዑሺ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:3">ኑ ዑሽካንዳጉዲ ኔ ዒንጌኔ።<verse eid="PSA 60:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 60:4"/>ፔኤኮ ሞርኮ ዓንጋፓ ቶሊ ዓታንዳጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:4">ኔና ዒጊጫዞንሢ ዴንቂ ፔና ካፓንዳንጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:4">ማላታ ማሂ ኔ ዔያቶም ዒንጌኔ።<verse eid="PSA 60:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 60:5"/>ኔ ናሽካ ዴራ ዻቃንዳጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:5">ሚዛቆ ኩጮና ኑና ማኣዴ፥ ማሂያ ኑም ኬኤዜ።<verse eid="PSA 60:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 60:6"/>ፆኦሲ ፔ ናንጋ ዱማዼ ማኣራፓ ኬኤዛዖ፦</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:6">«ታኣኒ ዎዛና ሴኬሜ ሳዖ ጊሽካንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:6">ሱኮቴ ዶኦጮዋ ፓቃንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 60:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 60:7"/>ጌሌዓዴንታ ሚናኣሴ ዓጮንታ ታኣሮኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:7">ዔፕሬኤሜ ዖሎሮ ታኣኮ ቶኦካ ዓጎ ዓንጎኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:7">ዪሁዳ ታኣኮ ካኣቱሞ ዎልቆኮ ማላታኬ።<verse eid="PSA 60:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 60:8"/>ሞዓኣቤ ታኣኮ ዑፆ ማስቶ ጎንጎኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:8">ዔዶኦሜ ታኣሮ ማዒፆ ዔርዛኒ ዱርዞ ታኣሲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:8">ዒኢካ ታ ጌሣንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:8">ፒሊስፄኤሜ ዓሳኣ ታ ዴማ ዎርቃንዳኔ» ጌዔኔ።<verse eid="PSA 60:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 60:9"/>ኬልቂ ዲርቂንቴ ካታሜሎ ዖ ታና ዔኪ ዓኣዻንዳይ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:9">ዴንዲ ዔዶሚያሴ ሄላኒ ዖ ታና ካኣሌሣንዳይ?<verse eid="PSA 60:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 60:10"/>ፆኦሲዮ! ኑና ኬኤሬሢ ኔናኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:10">ኑኡኮ ዖሎ ዓሶና ዎላ ኬስኪፆ ኔ ሃሼኔ።<verse eid="PSA 60:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 60:11"/>ዓሲ ዓሲ ማኣዳሢ ዔኤቢ ፓሡዋያኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:11">ዬያሮ ሞርኮ ኑኡኮ ኑ ባሻንዳጉዲ ኔ ኑና ማኣዴ።<verse eid="PSA 60:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 60:12"/>ፆኦሲ ኑኡና ዎላ ማዔያታቴ ኑ ባሻንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:12">ዒዚ ሞርኮ ኑኡኮ ዻውሲሳንዳኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">60፡12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 8:13">2ሳሙ. 8፡13</ref>፤ <ref loc="1CH 18:12">1ፆኦሲ. ዓሃኬ 18፡12</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 60:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 60"/>
  <chapter number="61" style="c" sid="PSA 61"/>
  <para style="s1">ዓይኑሞ ሱኡጋሢ ዓይሣ ጎይፆ ጎኦላና ዓይናዺንታ ዳውቴ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="d">ሜቶፓ ቶሊ ኬስካኒ ሺኢቂንቴ ሺኢጲሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 61:1"/>ፆኦሲዮ! ዒላቶ ታኣኮ ዒናፓ ዋይዜ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 61:1">ሺኢጲፆዋ ታኣኮ ዔኬ።<verse eid="PSA 61:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 61:2"/>ዒና ታኣኮ ዶጬ ዎዶና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 61:2">ሳዖኮ ጋፓ ዓኣዖ ታኣኒ ኔና ዔኤላኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 61:2">ታ ጊዳፓ ባሼ ዼግ ጌዔ ላላሢ ባንሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 61:2">ዔኪ ታና ዓኣዼ።<verse eid="PSA 61:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 61:3"/>ኔኤኒ ታኣኮ ፑኖ ካያሢኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 61:3">ታ ሞርካፓ ታ ዓኣሺንታ ዶዲ ኬኤሌ ኔ ታኣኮ ማዔኔ።<verse eid="PSA 61:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 61:4"/>ኔ ማኣሮይዳ ናንጊና ታ ናንጎም፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 61:4">ኔ ጋኣዞ ሺቦ ዴማ ታኣኒ ዔቆም።<verse eid="PSA 61:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 61:5"/>ፆኦሲዮ ናኣቦ ኔ ታኣሲ ዋይዜኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 61:5">ኔኤኮ ሱንፆ ዒጊጫ ዓሶም ኔ ጊኢጊሼ ዓንጆ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:5">ታኣማኣ ኔ ዒንጌኔ።<verse eid="PSA 61:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 61:6"/>ካኣቲ ናንጎይዳ ሚርጌ ሌዔ ቃሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 61:6">ሚርጌ ዎዴ ዒዛ ናንጊሼ!<verse eid="PSA 61:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 61:7"/>ኔ ቤርታ ናንጊና ዒ ካኣታዾንጎ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 61:7">ዒዛ ካፓንዳጉዲ ኔኤኮ ማኣሪፆንታ ጉሙርቂንቲፆዋ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 61:7">ዒዛም ጊኢጊሼ።<verse eid="PSA 61:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 61:8"/>ኬላ ኬላ ኔኤም ታ ናኣቤ ናኣቦ ሺኢሺሢና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 61:8">ቢያ ዎዴ ጋላታ ዓይኑሞ ታ ኔኤም ዓይናዻንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 61:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 61"/>
  <chapter number="62" style="c" sid="PSA 62"/>
  <para style="s1">ዓይኑሞ ሱኡጋሢ ዓይሣ ጎይፆና ዔዶታኣሜ ዛሎ ዓይናዺንቴ ዳውቴ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="d">ፆኦሲ ሌሊ ጉሙርቂሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 62:1"/>ሼምፓሢ ታኣኮ ሃውሾ ዴንቃሢ ፆኦሲና ሌሊኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:1">ዻቂንታ ታኣም ሙካሢ ዒዛይዳፓኬ።<verse eid="PSA 62:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 62:2"/>ታኣኮ ላሎ ሹጫሢና ዼኤሻሢ ዒዛ ሌሊኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:2">ታኣኮ ፑኖ ካያሢያ ዒዛኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:2">ፔቴታዖ ታ ዓጊፃዓኬ።<verse eid="PSA 62:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 62:3"/>ዓሲ ዒንሢ ማኣሳንሣሢ ዓይዲ ሄላንዳኣናዳይ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:3">ሃያ ዢኢፔ ኮጮና ዓጊፃ ዲሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:3">ዒንሢ ቢያሢ ሂዒ ዶይሳኒ ኮዓ?<verse eid="PSA 62:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 62:4"/>ዔያታ ኮዓሢ ዒዛ ቦንቻፓ ሺኢሻኒ ማዔሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:4">ዒዛይዳ ሉኡዙሞ ጌስታኒ ዔያታ ናሽካኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:4">ዔያታ ዻንጎና ዒዛ ዓንጃኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:4">ዒኖና ጋዓንቴ ዒዛ ጋጋዳንቃኔ።<verse eid="PSA 62:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 62:5"/>ታኣኮ ሼምፔሌ ሃውሺጋፓ ፆኦሲ ሌሊ ካፔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:5">ታኣኮ ሃጊ ማዓ ዎዛ ሙካሢ ዒዛይዳፓኬ።<verse eid="PSA 62:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 62:6"/>ታኣኮ ላሎ ሹጫሢና ዼኤሻሢ ዒዛ ሌሊኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:6">ፑኖ ካያሢያ ታኣኮ ዒዛኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:6">ታኣኒ ዓጊፃዓኬ።<verse eid="PSA 62:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 62:7"/>ታኣኮ ዻቂንቶና ቦንቾና ፆኦሲናኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:7">ዶዶ ላላሢንታ ዓኣሺንቶ ቤዛሢያ ዒዛኬ።<verse eid="PSA 62:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 62:8"/>ዓሲዮቴ! ቢያ ዎዴና ዒዛ ጉሙርቁዋቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:8">ዒኖ ዒንሢሲ ዒዛ ቤርቶ ሺኢሹዋቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:8">ዒዚ ኑኡኮ ፑኖ ካያሢኬ።<verse eid="PSA 62:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 62:9"/>ቶኦቺንቴ ዜርሢዳፓ ሾይንቲሢ ጉሪኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:9">ቦንቺንቴ ዜርሢዳፓኣ ሾይንቲሢያ ሉኡዙሞኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:9">ዴኤሡሞ ዔሮ ባኮይዳ ዴኤፂ ጴዼያታቴያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:9">ዬይ ቢያ ዎሊ ዑፃ ዢባሬይዳፓ ሼሌዓያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 62:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 62:10"/>ቡሪ ዔኮና ባኣዚና ሄርሺንቲፖቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:10">ዒንሢ ሳሪ ዔኬ ባኮናኣ ቦንቺንታኒ ዎዛዺፖቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:10">ቆላ ዒንሢኮ ሚርጌታቴያ ዬያና ጉሙርቂንቲፖቴ።<verse eid="PSA 62:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 62:11"/>ዎልቄ ፆኦሲሮኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:11">ዒዚ ፔቴ ባኣዚ ኬኤዛንቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:11">ላምዒ ማይንቲ ታ ዋይዜኔ።<verse eid="PSA 62:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 62:12"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ሚጪንቲሢ ኔኤሮኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:12">ኔኤኒ ፔቴ ፔቴሢም ማዾጉዴያ ጪጋንዳኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">62፡12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 34:11">ዒዮ. 34፡11</ref>፤ <ref loc="JER 17:10">ዔር. 17፡10</ref>፤ <ref loc="MAT 16:27">ማቲ. 16፡27</ref>፤ <ref loc="ROM 2:6">ሮሜ 2፡6</ref>፤ <ref loc="REV 2:23">ዮሃ. ፆፔዻ 2፡23</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 62:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter eid="PSA 62"/>
  <chapter number="63" style="c" sid="PSA 63"/>
  <para style="s1">ዳውቴ ዓሲ ናንጉዋ ዪሁዳ ቦኦሎይዳ ዓኣና ዓይናዼ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="d">ፆኦሲ ኮዒሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 63:1"/>ፆኦሲዮ! ኔኤኒ ታ ፆኦዛሢኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:1">ዒናፓ ታ ኔና ዴንቃኒ ኮዓኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:1">ዑፃ ታኣኮ ኔና ሱኡካዻኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:1">ዋኣሢ ባይዚ ሜሊ ፃሄ ሳዓጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:1">ሼምፓሢ ታኣኮ ኔና ዼኤቤኔ።<verse eid="PSA 63:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 63:2"/>ታኣኒ ኔና ኔ ማኣሮይዳ ዛጌኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:2">ኔኤኮ ዎልቆንታ ቦንቾዋ ታ ዴንቄኔ።<verse eid="PSA 63:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 63:3"/>ሚጪንቲፃ ኔኤኮ ናንጊዳፓ ባሼታሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:3">ዻንጋ ታኣኮ ኔና ጋላታኔ።<verse eid="PSA 63:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 63:4"/>ዓካሪ ናንጎ ዎዶይዳ ቢያ ኔና ታ ጋላታኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:4">ኔ ሱንፆና ታ ኩጮ ታኣኒ ሌካ ዔቂሳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 63:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 63:5"/>ሼምፓሢ ታኣኮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:5">ዔኤሲና ማሊና ሙዒ ዎዛዻ ዓሲጉዲ ዎዛዻኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:5">ዻንጋ ታኣኮ ዎዛና ጋላታ ዓይኑሞ ኔኤም ዓይናዻኔ።<verse eid="PSA 63:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 63:6"/>ታ ላሄ ቤዛ ዓኣዖ ኔና ማላኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:6">ዋንቶ ቢያ ኔ ባኣዚ ታ ሱካኔ።<verse eid="PSA 63:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 63:7"/>ኔኤኒ ታና ማኣዳሢታሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:7">ኔኤኮ ጋኣዞ ሺቦ ዴማ ዔቂ ዎዛና ታ ዓይናዻኔ።<verse eid="PSA 63:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 63:8"/>ሼምፔላ ታኣኮ ኔና ጩጫምቢ ዓርቄኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:8">ኔኤኮ ሚዛቆ ኩጫኣ ታና ኬልቄኔ።<verse eid="PSA 63:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 63:9"/>ታና ዎዻኒ ኮዓሢ ቢያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:9">ሃይቂ ዱኡኪንታንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 63:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 63:10"/>ጬንቾ ዓፓሮና ዔያታ ዎዺንታንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:10">ሌዞ ዔያቶኮ ቦዖ ሙዓንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 63:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 63:11"/>ፆኦሲ ዒዛም ባሺሢ ዒንጋሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:11">ካኣቲ ዎዛዻኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:11">ፆኦሲ ሱንፆና ጌፓ ዓሳ ቢያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:11">ዒዛ ጋላታንዳኔ፥ ሉኡቃ ዓሶ ዻንጋ ጋዓንቴ ዓርቂንታንዳኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">63፡11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 23:14">1ሳሙ. 23፡14</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 63:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 63"/>
  <chapter number="64" style="c" sid="PSA 64"/>
  <para style="s1">ዓይኑሞ ሱኡጋሢ ዓይሣ ጎይፆና ዓይናዺንታ ዳውቴ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="d">ሜታፓ ቶሊ ኬስካኒ ሺኢቂንቴ ሺኢጲሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 64:1"/>ፆኦሲዮ! ታኣኮ ሜቶሮ ኔና ታ ሺኢቃሢ ዋይዜ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:1">ታ ሞርካ ታና ዒጊቻሢዳፓ ታና ካፔ።<verse eid="PSA 64:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 64:2"/>ፑርቶ ዓሳ ታ ጊዳ ጌኔ ማሊሢና ዔቄሢፓ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:2">ዔያቶኮ ዎጎ ዎጋኒ ቡኮሢዳፓኣ ታና ዓይሴ።<verse eid="PSA 64:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 64:3"/>ዔያታ ዒንዲርዞ ፔኤኮ ዓዳ ጬንቻ ዓፓሮጉዲ ዋርቃኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:3">ዔያቶኮ ጫንጮ ዑኡዛ ሂኢሺጉዲ ዱካኔ።<verse eid="PSA 64:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 64:4"/>ካቲ ዴዒ ፂሎ ዓሶ ዔያታ ዱካኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:4">ዓሳ ማሊባኣንቴ ዒጊጩዋዖ ዱካኔ።<verse eid="PSA 64:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 64:5"/>ፑርታ ባኣዚ ማዻኒ ዎላ ዞርታኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:5">ፒራሢያ ዓኣቺ ፒራኒ ዔያታ ጌስታኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:5">ዔያታ ዬያ ቢያ ሂዳዖ፦</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:5">«ዖኦኒያ ዴንቃኒ ኑና ዳንዳዑዋሴ» ጋዓኔ።<verse eid="PSA 64:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 64:6"/>ዔያታ ጌኔ ማሊሢ ማሊ ቱኬስካፓ፦</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:6">«ዓካሪ ፑርታ ማሊሢ ዶዲ ኑኡኒ ቱኬኔ» ጋዓኔ።</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:6">ዬይያ፦</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:6">ዓሲኮ ዒናንታ ማሊሢያ ጌኔ ባኣዚና ኩሜያ ማዒፆ ዔርዛኔ።<verse eid="PSA 64:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 64:7"/>ፆኦሲ ጋዓንቴ ዔያቶ ፔ ሂኢዦና ዱካንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:7">ዔያታ ማሊባኣዖ ማኣሳናንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 64:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 64:8"/>ፔ ዻንጎና ዔያታ ዹቂንታንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:8">ባይሲንታ ዔያቶ ሄላንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:8">ዬያሮ ዔያቶ ዛጋ ዓሳ ቢያ ዔያቶ ዾንኪ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:8">ቶኦኮ ፔኤሲ ዓጊሣንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 64:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 64:9"/>ዓሲ ቢያ ዒጊጫንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:9">ፆኦሲ ማዼ ባኮ ፔጌና ዔያታ ኬኤዛንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:9">ዒናፓኣ ዔያታ ማላንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 64:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 64:10"/>ፂሎ ዓሳ ፆኦሲና ዎዛዾንጎ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:10">ዒዛ ፔኤኮ ፑኖ ካያሢ ማሄ ዓሳ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:10">ዒኖ ፒዜዚንሢያ ቢያ ዎዛዾንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 64:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 64"/>
  <chapter number="65" style="c" sid="PSA 65"/>
  <para style="s1">ዓይኑሞ ሱኡጋሢ ዓይሣ ጎይፆና ዓይናዺንታ ዳውቴኮ ጋላታ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="d">ፆኦሲ ጋላቲሢና ቦንቺሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 65:1"/>ፆኦሲዮ! ፂዮኔይዳ ጋላታ ኔኤም ኮይሳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:1">ኔኤም ኑኡኒ ናኣቤ ናኣቦዋ ዒንጊ ኩንሣንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 65:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 65:2"/>ኔኤኒ ሺኢጲሢ ዋይዛያ ማዔሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:2">ዓሲ ቢያ ኔ ባንሢ ሙካንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 65:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 65:3"/>ጎማ ኑና ኩሚ ባይዜ ዎዶና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:3">ኔኤኒ ኑ ዻቢንቶ ዓቶም ጌዔኔ።<verse eid="PSA 65:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 65:4"/>ኔኤኒ ዶኦሬ፥ ኔ ባንሢያ ኔ ዑኪሴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:4">ዓሳ ቡካ ጶኦካ ኔ ጌሤዞንሢ ዎዛዾንጎ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:4">ኔኤኮ ዱማዼ ጌኤዦ ማኣራፓ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:4">ኔ ኬኤፃፓ ዓንጆ ኑ ሚሽካንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 65:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 65:5"/>ኑና ዓውሳ ፆኦዛሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:5">ኔኤኮ ዲቃሣ ፂሉሞና ኑኡም ማሄ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:5">ኔኤኒ ሳዖኮ ጋፖም ቢያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:5">ሃኬ ዓኣ ባዞማኣ ጉሙርሳ ዎዛሢኬ።<verse eid="PSA 65:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 65:6"/>ዹኮ ኔኤኒ ኔ ዶዱሞና ማዤኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:6">ዎልቆዋ ኔኤኮ ኔኤኒ ቱኡቴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 65:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 65:7"/>ኔኤኒ ባዞኮ ዖኦዢፆ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:7">ባዞ ጉዳሢኮዋ ጉኡሚፆ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:7">ዴሮኮዋ ዣላሢ ኔ ዚቲዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 65:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 65:8"/>ሳዖኮ ጋፓ ሃኬ ዓኣሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:8">ኔኤኮ ዲቃሣ ዓኮ ማዾሮ ዲቃታኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:8">ካሪፆንታ ዓሚፆንታ ሙካኣና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:8">ዎዛዺ ዒላሻንዳጉዲ ኔ ማሃኔ።<verse eid="PSA 65:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 65:9"/>ሳዖም ዒርዚ ኔ ዋርቂሻኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:9">ዔባ ዓኣፓንዳጉዲ ማሂሢና ዖርጎቻኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:9">ዎሮ ዋኣሢና ኔ ኩንሣኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:9">ሳዖይዳ ሃኣኮ ኔ ባቃልሳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:9">ዬያ ኔ ማዻሢያ ሂዲኬ፦<verse eid="PSA 65:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 65:10"/>ጎሽኪንቴ ጎዦይዳ ዒርዚ ኔ ዋርቂሳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:10">ሂርኪ ዼግ ጋዓ ቤዞ ኔ ጊኢጊሻኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:10">ሳዖ ዓጮ ዒሮኮ ዑኡፖና ኔ ዎዒሳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:10">ባቃሎ ባቃልሲ ኔ ዑጊሳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 65:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 65:11"/>ኔ ኮሹሞና ካፃ ሃኣካ ዎዚ ሚርጋይ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:11">ኔ ዓኣ ቤዛ ቢያ ሚርጌ ሃኣኮ ዓኣኔ።<verse eid="PSA 65:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 65:12"/>ዓሳ ናንጉዋ ዳውላ ሚርጌ ማኣቲ ዋርቄኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:12">ጌሜራኣ ዎዛና ኩሜኔ።<verse eid="PSA 65:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 65:13"/>ቦኦላዻ ጊንፃ ቆልሞ ሌሊ ማዔኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:13">ዶኦጮ ጊንፃኣ ሃኣኮና ኩሜኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:13">ዬያሮ ቢያሢ ዎዛዺ ዒላሺሢና ኔኤም ዓይናዻኔ።<verse eid="PSA 65:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 65"/>
  <chapter number="66" style="c" sid="PSA 66"/>
  <para style="s1">ዓይኑሞ ሱኡጋሢ ዓይሣ ጎይፆና ዓይናዺንታ ፆኦሲ ሄርሺሢ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="d">ዎላ ቡኪ ጋላቶ ጋላታ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 66:1"/>ዒንሢ ሳዖይዳ ዓኣ ዓሳ ቢያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:1">ፆኦሲም ዒላሺ ጋላቱዋቴ።<verse eid="PSA 66:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 66:2"/>ሱንፆ ዒዛኮ ቦንቺ ዓይናዹዋቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:2">ጋላታና ዒዛ ቦንቹዋቴ።<verse eid="PSA 66:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 66:3"/>ፆኦሲም ሂዚ ጎዑዋቴ፦</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:3">«ማዻ ኔኤኮ ዎዚ ዲቃሢ ሄርሺሳያዳይ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:3">ዎልቃ ኔኤኮ ዼኤፒታሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:3">ኔ ሞርካ ኔ ቤርቶይዳ ዒጊቹሞና ጎጋይቃኔ።<verse eid="PSA 66:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 66:4"/>ሳዖይዳ ዓኣ ዓሳ ቢያ ኔኤም ዚጋኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:4">ኔኤም ዔያታ ጋላታ ዓይኑሞዋ ሺኢሻኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:4">ሱንፆዋ ኔኤኮ ቦንቺሢና ዓይናዻኔ።»<verse eid="PSA 66:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 66:5"/>ሃኒ ሙኪ ፆኦሲ ማዼ ባኮ ዛጉዋቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:5">ዓሶ ባኣካ ዒዛኮ ማዻ ዒጊቻያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 66:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 66:6"/>ባዞ ዒዚ ሳዓ ማሄኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:6">ኑኡኮ ቤርታኣ ዓዶንሢ ዎሮ ቶኪና ፒንቄኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:6">ዒዚ ማዼ ባኮና ኑኡኒያ ዎዛዼኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">66፡6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 14:21">ኬሲ. ማፃ 14፡21</ref>፤ <ref loc="JOS 3:14-17">ዒያ. 3፡14-17</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 66:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 66:7"/>ፔኤኮ ዎልቆና ዒዚ ናንጊና ዎይሣኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:7">ዓኣፖና ዴሮ ጊዥ ጌዒ ዛጋኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:7">ዬያሮ ዋይዞ ዒፃ ዓሳ ዒዛ ዑፃ ዔቂባኣቴ ቃራኬ።<verse eid="PSA 66:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 66:8"/>ዒንሢ ዴራ ቢያ ኑ ፆኦዛሢ ቦንቹዋቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:8">ዑኡዞ ዒንሢሲ ዼጊዲ ዒዛም ጋላታ ሺኢሹዋቴ።<verse eid="PSA 66:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 66:9"/>ኑና ሼምፔና ጌሣሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:9">ቶኮዋ ኑኡኮ ሃሊፁዋጉዲ ካፓሢ ዒዛኬ።<verse eid="PSA 66:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 66:10"/>ፆኦሲዮ! ኑ ዎይታቴያ ኔ ኑና ዛጌኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:10">ዓዳ ቢራ ዓንጊጉዲ ኔ ኑና ሼኤሼኔ።<verse eid="PSA 66:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 66:11"/>ፒሮይዳ ኔ ኑና ዓይሤኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:11">ዴኤሢ ባሲ ኑና ኔ ባሲሴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 66:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 66:12"/>ኑኡኮ ሞርካ ኑና ጎይሢ ባይዚ ሄርቃንዳጉዲ ኔ ኑና ማሄኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:12">ታሚና ዲጲናኮ ባኣኪና ኑ ዓኣዼኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:12">ሃሢ ጋዓንቴ ዖርጎቹሞ ኩሜ ዳልጎ ቤዞ ዔኪ ኔ ኑና ሙኬኔ።<verse eid="PSA 66:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 66:13"/>ኔ ማኣሪ ሚቺ ዒንጎ ዒንጊፆ ዔኪ ታ ጌላንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:13">ታኣኮ ናኣቦዋ ታ ኔኤም ሺኢሻንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 66:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 66:14"/>ፑርታ ሜታ ታና ሄሌ ዎዶና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:14">«ኔኤም ታ ዒንጋንዳኔ» ጌዔ ናኣቦ ታ ሺኢሻንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 66:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 66:15"/>ሶቦሮ ጌማቶ ሚቺ ዒንጎ ዒንጊሢ ማሂ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:15">ዓዶ ማራቶዋ ሳውቃ ዒንጊሢ ማሂ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:15">ታ ኔኤም ሺኢሻንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:15">ዚዮ ጌማቶንታ ኮላቶንታ ታ ኔኤም ሹካንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 66:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 66:16"/>ዒንሢ ፆኦሲ ዒጊጫ ዓሳ ሃኒ ሙኪ ዋይዙዋቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:16">ታ ሼምፔሎም ዒዚ ማዼ ባኮ ታ ዒንሢም ኬኤዞም።<verse eid="PSA 66:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 66:17"/>ታኣኒ ዒዛ ባንሢ ዒላቴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:17">ታ ዻንጎናኣ ታ ዒዛ ጋላቴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 66:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 66:18"/>ጎሞ ታኣኮ ታ ቡኡፁዋዖ ዎንዴ ዒና ዓኣቼያታቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:18">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ሺኢጲፆ ታኣኮ ዋይዚንዱዋንቴኬ።<verse eid="PSA 66:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 66:19"/>ሃሢ ጋዓንቴ ፆኦሲ ጎኔና ዋይዜኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:19">ታኣኒ ሺኢቃ ዑኡዞ ዒናፓ ዒ ዋይዜኔ።<verse eid="PSA 66:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 66:20"/>ሺኢጲፆ ታኣኮ ቦሂባኣሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:20">ሚጪንቲፆዋ ታና ሃሺባኣሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:20">ዬይ ፆኦዛሢ ጋላቲንቶንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 66:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 66"/>
  <chapter number="67" style="c" sid="PSA 67"/>
  <para style="s1">ዓይኑሞ ሱኡጋሢ ዓይሣ ጎይፆ ጎኦላና ፆኦሲ ሄርሺ ዓይናዾ ዳውቴ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="d">ጋላታ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 67:1"/>ፆኦሲ ኑና ሚጪንቶንጎ፥ ዓንጆንጎ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 67:1">ዒዛኮ ዓኣፖ ካራ ኑም ፖዖንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 67:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 67:2"/>ጎይፃ ኔኤሲ ሳዖ ዑፃ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 67:2">ዓውሲፃኣ ኔኤሲ ዴሮ ባኣካ ዔርቶንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 67:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 67:3"/>ፆኦሲዮ! ዴራ ኔና ጋላታኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 67:3">ዓሲ ቢያኣ ኔኤም ጋላታ ሺኢሻኔ።<verse eid="PSA 67:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 67:4"/>ዴሮም ፒዙሞና ኔ ዎጋሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 67:4">ዓሶዋ ሳዖይዳ ኔ ዔኪ ዓኣዻሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 67:4">ዴራ ዎዛዾንጎ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 67:4">ዒላሺያ ኔኤም ዓይናዾንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 67:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 67:5"/>ፆኦሲዮ! ዴሬ ኔና ጋላቶንጎ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 67:5">ዓሳ ቢያኣ ኔኤም ጋላታ ሺኢሾንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 67:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 67:6"/>ዬካፓ ሳዓ ሃኣኮ ካፂሳንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 67:6">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ማዔ ኑ ፆኦሲ ኑና ዓንጃንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 67:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 67:7"/>ፆኦሲ ኑና ዓንጆንጎ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 67:7">ዓጫ ማዔ ካራና ቢያ ዒዛ ዒጊጫንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 67:7"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 67"/>
  <chapter number="68" style="c" sid="PSA 68"/>
  <para style="s1">ዓይኑሞ ሱኡጋሢ ዓይሣ ጎይፆ ፆኦሲ ሄርሺ ዓይናዾ ዳውቴ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="d">ባሻዖ ዓይናዾ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 68:1"/>ፆኦሲ ዔቆንጎ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:1">ሞርካ ዒዛኮ ላኣሊንቶንጎ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:1">ዒዛ ዒፃዞንሢ ዒዛ ቤርታፓ ጳሽኮንጎ!<verse eid="PSA 68:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 68:2"/>ጩቢ ላኣሊንቲ ባይቃሢጉዲ ዔያቶ ፒፒንፂዴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:2">ታሚ ሾፒ ዓልቂሳሢጉዲ ፑርቶ ዓሳ ፆኦሲ ቤርታፓ ባይቆንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 68:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 68:3"/>ፂሎ ዓሳ ጋዓንቴ ዎዛዾንጎ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:3">ዒዛ ቤርታ ዔያታ ኮኦሞንጎ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:3">ዎዛና ዔያታ ኮርጎንጎ!<verse eid="PSA 68:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 68:4"/>ፆኦሲም ዓይናዹዋቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:4">ዒዛ ሱንፆም ጋላታ ዓይኑሞ ሺኢሹዋቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:4">ሻኣሮይዳ ሃንታሢም ጎይሢ ጊኢጊሹዋቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:4">ሱንፃ ዒዛኮ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:4">ዒዛ ቤርታ ዎዛዹዋቴ!<verse eid="PSA 68:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 68:5"/>ዒዛም ዱማዼ ጌኤዦ ማኣራ ዓኣ ፆኦዛሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:5">ዓዴባኣ ናኣቶም ዓዶኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:5">ዜኤሮንዳሢ ዛሎ ዒ ሞኦቲንታሢኬ።<verse eid="PSA 68:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 68:6"/>ፆኦሲ ሴሎ ዓሶ ማኣሪ ዓሲ ባኣካ ጌሣኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:6">ቱኡዞ ዓሶ ቱኡዛፓ ቡሊ ዎዛሲ ኮኦሚሳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:6">ዋይዞ ዒፃ ዓሳ ጋዓንቴ ዓሲ ናንጎዋ ዳውሎይዳ ናንጋንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 68:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 68:7"/>ፆኦሲዮ! ዴሮ ኔኤኮ ኔ ዔኪ ዓኣዼ ዎዶና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:7">ዓሳ ናንጉዋ ዳውሎይዴና ሃንቲሴ ዎዶና<verse eid="PSA 68:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 68:8"/>ሲና ዹኮ ፆኦዛሢ ቤርታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:8">ዒስራዔኤሌ ፆኦዛሢኮዋ ቤርታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:8">ሳዓ ዓጊፄኔ፥ ጫሪንጫኣ ዒሪዶኦቦ ዋርቂሴኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">68፡8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:18">ኬሲ. ማፃ 19፡18</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 68:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 68:9"/>ፆኦሲዮ! ጊዳ ዒርዚ ኔ ዋርቂሴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:9">ፃኣዺ ሜሌ ኔ ዓጮ ኔ ዑሼኔ።<verse eid="PSA 68:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 68:10"/>ኔ ዴራ ዒኢካ ማኣሪ ማዢ ዴዔኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:10">ኔኤኒ ፆኦሲ ኔ ዓንጃፓ ማንቆ ዓሶም ዒንጌኔ።<verse eid="PSA 68:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 68:11"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ሂዚ ጋዓ ዓይሥሢ ኬሴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:11">ዒዛኮ ዓይሢፆ ኬኤዛዞንሢ ኮሺ ሚርጌኬ።<verse eid="PSA 68:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 68:12"/>ዔያታ ሂዚ ጌዔኔ፦</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:12">«ካኣቶንታ ዔያቶኮ ዖሎ ዓሳኣ ዑኬና ፑኒ ጳሽኬኔ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:12">ዖሎ ኬስኩዋዖ ማኣራ ዓቴ ላኣላ ዲዖና ባኮ ጊሽቲ ዔኬኔ።<verse eid="PSA 68:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 68:13"/>ዲዒ ዔኮና ባኮ ባኣካ፦ ዑፃ ቢራ ዓንጊና ማዢንቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:13">ዓኣፓ ዱካ ዎርቄና ጋኣዛ ኮሺንቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:13">ዶኦሌ ማሊሲ ኮሾና ባኣዚያ ዓኣኔ።</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:13">ዓሳ ዖሎ ዖላኣና ዒንሢዳፓ ዛሎ ዓሳ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:13">ዓይጎሮ ማራቶ ሞኦፃ ዴዔይ?<verse eid="PSA 68:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 68:14"/>ቢያ ባኮ ዳንዳዓ ፆኦዛሢ ካኣቶ ላኣሌ ዎዶና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:14">ሻቺ ፃልሞኔ ዹኮ ቶኦካ ኬዳንዳጉዲ ማሄኔ።»<verse eid="PSA 68:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 68:15"/>«ባኣሳኣኔ ዹካ ሚርጌ ዛሬና ጌሜሪያ ኩሜ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:15">ዒጊቻያ ማዔ ዹካኬ።<verse eid="PSA 68:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 68:16"/>ዒንሢ ያዺ ማዔ ዹካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:16">ፆኦሲ ናንጋኒ ዶኦሬ ዹኮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:16">ቂኢሪ ዒንሢ ዛጋሢ ዓይጎሮዳይ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:16">ዬካ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ናኣናና ናንጋንዳኔ።»<verse eid="PSA 68:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 68:17"/>«ፆኦሲ ሚርጌ ሺያና ፓይዲንታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:17">ዼኤፖ ሳርጌሎ ዖይቶና ሲና ዹካፓ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:17">ፔኤኮ ዱማዼ ጌኤዦ ማኣሪ ሙካንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 68:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 68:18"/>ሌካ ጫሪንጮ ኔ ዓኣዼኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:18">ዲዒሢ ኔ ቡኩሴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:18">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ኔኤኒ ዒኢካ ናንጋኒ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:18">ዋይዞ ዒፃ ዓሶይዳፓኣ ዓይሱዋዖ ዒንጎ ባኣዚ ኔ ዔኬኔ።» <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">68፡18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:8">ዔፕ. 4፡8</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 68:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 68:19"/>«ባሶ ኑኡኮ ኬላ ኬላ ኬዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:19">ኑና ዓውሳ ፆኦዛሢ ዓንጂንቶንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 68:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 68:20"/>ኑ ፆኦዛሢ ኑና ዓውሳ ፆኦሲኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:20">ሃይቢፓ ቶሊ ዓታኒ ዳንዳዒንታሢያ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:20">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳናኬ።<verse eid="PSA 68:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 68:21"/>ጎኔና ፆኦሲ ፔ ሞርኮኮ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:21">ጎሞና ዶዲ ናንጋ ዓሶኮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:21">ቶኦኮ ዒ ዳኣፃንዳኔ።»<verse eid="PSA 68:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 68:22"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ፦</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:22">«ታ ዔያቶ ባኣሳኣኔፓ ማሂ ዔኪ ሙካንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:22">ባዞ ዔቶይዳፓ ኬሲ ዔኪ ዬዓንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 68:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 68:23"/>ቶካ ኔኤሲ ሞርኮኮ ሱጉፆይዳ ሄርቃንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:23">ኔ ካናታኣ ዬያ ሱጉፆ ላዓንዳኔ» ጋዓኔ።<verse eid="PSA 68:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 68:24"/>ፆኦሲዮ! ኔኤኮ ቦንቺንታ ሃንቲፃ ጴዼኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:24">ዬይያ ታኣኮ ፆኦዛሢና ካኣታሢ ጌኤዦ ማኣሪ ዓኣዻኣና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:24">ሃንታ ሃንቲፆኬ።<verse eid="PSA 68:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 68:25"/>ዓይኑሞ ዓይናዻ ዓሳ ቤርቲና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:25">ዓይኑሞ ዓንጋሞ ዋርቃ ዓሳ ጊንሢና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:25">ካራባሢ ባዓ ዉዱራሢያ ዔያቶኮ ባኣካ ዓኣኔ።<verse eid="PSA 68:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 68:26"/>ዔያታ፦ «ዒዛ ዓሳ ቡኬ ቤዛ ፆኦሲ ጋላቱዋቴ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:26">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዴሬ ማዔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:26">ዒስራዔኤሌ ዓሳ ቡኬ ቤዛ ዒዛ ጋላቱዋቴ!» ጋዓኔ።<verse eid="PSA 68:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 68:27"/>ዔኪ ዔያቶ ዓኣዻሢ ዻኮ ፃጳሢ ቢኢኒያሜኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:27">ዒኢካ ሚርጌና ፓይዲንታ ዪሁዳ ዓሶ ሱኡጋ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:27">ዬያጉዲ ሃሣ ዛብሎኦኔንታ ኒፕታሌሜንታ ሱኡጋኣ ዓኣኔ።<verse eid="PSA 68:27"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 68:28"/>ፆኦሲዮ! ዎልቆ ኔኤሲ ቤኤዜ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:28">ሚና ኔ ኑኡም ማዼ ጎይፆ ሃሢያ ዶዱሞ ኔኤሲ ዻዌ።<verse eid="PSA 68:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 68:29"/>ዬሩሳላሜይዳ ዓኣ ኔኤኮ ጌኤዦ ማኣሮም</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:29">ዒንጎ ባኣዚ ካኣታ ኔኤም ዔኪ ዬዓንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 68:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 68:30"/>ፒሎ ባኣካ ዓኣ ካዮ ቦዖ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:30">ዚዮ ጌማቶና ናኣሮ ማላ ካኣቶ ጎሬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:30">ቢያሢ ጉምዓቲ ቢሮ ኔኤም ጊኢራንዳጉዲ ማዼ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:30">ዖሎ ዖላኒ ናሽካ ዴሮዋ ኔ ላኣሌ።<verse eid="PSA 68:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 68:31"/>ጊብፄ ዓጫፓ ፖኦሊሶ ሱኡጋ ዬዓንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:31">ዒቶጲያ ዓሳኣ ኩጮ ሌካ ፆኦሲ ባንሢ ዔቂሳንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 68:31"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 68:32"/>ዒንሢ ዓጮ ካኣታ ቢያ ፆኦሲም ዓይናዹዋቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:32">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳም ዓይኑሞ ሺኢሹዋቴ።<verse eid="PSA 68:32"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 68:33"/>ሚናፓ ዓርቃዖ ዓኣ ጫሪንጮኮ ዑፆ ኬስኬሢም</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:33">ፔኤኮ ዼኤፖ ዑኡዞና ጉኡማሢም ዓይናዹዋቴ።<verse eid="PSA 68:33"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 68:34"/>ዲቃሢ ሄርሺሲፃ ዒዛኮ ዒስራዔኤሌይዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:34">ዎልቃኣ ዒዛሲ ሻኣሮኮ ዑሣ ማዔሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:34">ፆኦሲኮ ዶዱሞ ኬኤዙዋቴ።<verse eid="PSA 68:34"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 68:35"/>ፆኦሲዮ! ኔኤኒ ኔኤኮ ጌኤዦ ማኣራ ዲቃሢ ሄርሺሳያኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:35">ዒስራዔኤሌ ዓሶኮ ፆኦዛሢ ፔ ዴሮም</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:35">ዎልቄና ዶዱሞና ዒንጋኔ፤</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 68:35"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:35">ፆኦሲም ጋላታ!<verse eid="PSA 68:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 68"/>
  <chapter number="69" style="c" sid="PSA 69"/>
  <para style="s1">ዓይኑሞ ሱኡጋሢ ዓይሣ ጎይፆ ዛዬና ዓይናዺንታ ዳውቴ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="d">ማኣዶ ዴንቃኒ ሺኢቂንቴ ሺኢጲሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 69:1"/>ፆኦሲዮ! ታና ዓውሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:1">ዋኣፃ ታኣኮ ቆርጮ ሄሌኔ።<verse eid="PSA 69:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 69:2"/>ቶኪ ዔቃ ቤሲባኣ ዔቴ ቶኦጶይዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:2">ታኣኒ ጌሊ ዔኤዺንቴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:2">ዔታዻ ቁልቤ ዋኣሢዳ ታ ጌሌኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:2">ዋኣፆ ጉዳሢያ ታና ዔኤዼኔ።<verse eid="PSA 69:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 69:3"/>ዒላቲና ታ ላቤኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:3">ቆርጫኣ ታኣኮ ፃኣዼኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:3">ታ ፆኦዛሢኮ ጎይፆ ታ ዛጋንቴ ዓኣፓ ታኣኮ ታይሬኔ።<verse eid="PSA 69:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 69:4"/>ታኣኒ ማዼ ባኣዚባኣንቴ ታና ዒፃ ዓሳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:4">ታ ቶኦኮ ጋፓናፓ ባሼ ሚርጌኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:4">ሼምፓሢ ታኣኮ ባይዛኒ ኮዓ ዓሳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:4">ጉሪ ታና ዒፃ ዓሳ ሚርጌ ማዔኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:4">ዉኡቂ ታኣኒ ዔኪባኣ ባኣዚ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:4">«ማሂ ዔኪ ዬዔ» ጌይንቴኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">69፡4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 35:19">ዓይኑ. 35፡19</ref>፤ <ref loc="JHN 15:25">ዮሃ. 15፡25</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 69:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 69:5"/>ፆኦሲዮ! ኔኤኒ ታኣኮ ዔኤያቶ ዔራኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:5">ታ ዻቢንታ ኔኤም ዓኣሺንቴያቱዋሴ።<verse eid="PSA 69:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 69:6"/>ቢያ ባኮ ዎይሣ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:6">ኔና ዎዛ ማሂ ካፓ ዓሳ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:6">ታ ጊዳ ማዺንታ ባኮ ዛጊ ቦርሲንቶፓ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:6">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ማዔ ዒስራዔኤሌ ፆኦዛሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:6">ኮሺ ኔና ኮዓ ዓሳ ታ ጊዳ ማዺንታ ባኮ ዛጊ ዻውሲንቶፓ።<verse eid="PSA 69:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 69:7"/>ኔ ጋይቴ ጌዒ ጫሺ ታ ጊቤኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:7">ቦርሲንቲና ዓኣፖ ካራ ታኣኮ ቦኦሬኔ።<verse eid="PSA 69:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 69:8"/>ታ ጌርሲንሢም ዓዳ ፃንጎ ዓሲጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:8">ታኣኮ ዒንዶ ናኣቶማኣ ሾኦቺ ታ ማዔኔ።<verse eid="PSA 69:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 69:9"/>ኔ ማኣሮ ዛሎ ባካ ታና ሻላኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:9">ኔና ጫሽኮ ጫዣ ታ ዑፃ ማዔኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">69፡9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 2:17">ዮሃ. 2፡17</ref>፤ <ref loc="ROM 15:3">ሮሜ 15፡3</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 69:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 69:10"/>ሼምፓሢ ታኣኮ ታ ሙዖ ሃሾ ዳምቦና ሜታሴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:10">ዬያሮዋ ዔያታ ታና ፓሴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 69:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 69:11"/>ሲዮ ፓቲሎ ታ ማይንቴ ዎዶና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:11">ዔያታ ታና ዓማሊ ማሂ ሚኢጬኔ።<verse eid="PSA 69:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 69:12"/>ዲሮ ካራ ዴዓ ዓሶም ጌኤሲ ጌስቶያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:12">ማሢንቴ ዓሶማኣ ኮሢ ኮርጎያ ታ ማዔኔ።<verse eid="PSA 69:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 69:13"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:13">ኔ ናሽካ ዎዶና ታ ኔና ሺኢቃንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:13">ፆኦሲዮ! ኔኤኮ ዼኤፖ ማኣሪፆና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:13">ኔኤኮ ዓውሲፆ ጎኑሞና ታኣም ዋይዜ።<verse eid="PSA 69:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 69:14"/>ቶኦጳሢዳፓ ታና ኬሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:14">ዔኤዺንታንዳጉዲ ታና ሃሺፖ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:14">ዋኣፆ ዔታፓ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:14">ዬያቶንታ ታና ዒፃዞንሢናፓ ሄሊ ዓውሴ።<verse eid="PSA 69:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 69:15"/>ዲጳ ኩሚ ዔኪ ታና ዓኣዾፓ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:15">ዋኣፆ ዔታኣ ታና ዔኤዾፓ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:15">ዔታ ዶዒ ካሮ ታኣኮ ባይዞፓ።<verse eid="PSA 69:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 69:16"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ማኣሪፃ ኔኤኮ ሚርጌ ማዔሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:16">ታኣም ዋይዜ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:16">ኔኤኮ ሚጪንቶ ሚርጉሞና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:16">ታ ባንሢ ሺሬ።<verse eid="PSA 69:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 69:17"/>ታና ኔ ዓይላሢዳፓ ዓኣፖ ኔኤሲ ሺርሺፖ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:17">ታኣኒ ሜቶይዳታሢሮ ዑኬና ታኣም ዋይዜ።<verse eid="PSA 69:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 69:18"/>ታ ባንሢ ሙኪጋፓ ታና ዓውሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:18">ታ ሞርኮ ኩጫፓኣ ታና ጊንሣ ማሂ ሻንቂ ዓይሴ።<verse eid="PSA 69:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 69:19"/>ታና ሄሌ ጫዦንታ ቦርሲንቶንታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:19">ዻውሲንቶዋ ኔ ዔራኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:19">ታኣኮ ሞርኮዋ ፔቴ ፔቴ ኔ ዔራኔ።<verse eid="PSA 69:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 69:20"/>ጫዣ ዒኖ ታኣኮ ሜንሤኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:20">ዎዛ ባይቂ ታኣኮ ጋፔኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:20">ታኣም ሚጪንታ ዓሲ ታ ኮዔኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:20">ጋዓንቴ ታ ዴንቂባኣሴ።</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:20">ታና ዶዲሻ ዓሲያ ታ ኮዔንቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:20">ፔቴታዖ ባኣሴ።<verse eid="PSA 69:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 69:21"/>ዔያታ ሙዖ ታኣኮ ጪሼና ሲኢሬኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:21">ታ ዼኤቢንታዛ ሶልኪ ዑሺ ታኣም ዒንጌኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">69፡21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:48">ማቲ. 27፡48</ref>፤ <ref loc="MRK 15:36">ማር. 15፡36</ref>፤ <ref loc="LUK 23:36">ሉቃ. 23፡36</ref>፤ <ref loc="JHN 19:28-29">ዮሃ. 19፡28-29</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 69:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 69:22"/>ዔያቶም ሺኢሾና ካፃ ፒሮ ዔያቶም ማዖንጎ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:22">ዔያቶኮ ሙዖሮ ቡኪንቲፃኣ ባይሲንታ ካራ ማዖንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 69:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 69:23"/>ዓኣፓ ዔያቶሲ ዛጉዋጉዲ ዹሞንጎ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:23">ጊኢራ ቢያ ዎዴ ዎቦንጎ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">69፡23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 11:9-10">ሮሜ 11፡9-10</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 69:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 69:24"/>ዱማ ዱማ ኔኤኮ ዎዻ ባኮ ዔያቶ ዑፃ ኬይሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:24">ዔያታ ዔሪባኣንቴ ኔ ዻጎ ዔያቶ ዑፃ ጮኦሽኬ።<verse eid="PSA 69:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 69:25"/>ጉርዳ ዔያቶሲ ዳውሌ ማዖንጎ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:25">ዓፒሎና ማዦና ማኣራ ዔያቶኮ ዓሲ ናንጎፓ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">69፡25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:20">ዳኪ. ማዾ 1፡20</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 69:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 69:26"/>ኔ ጳርቄ ዓሶ ዔያታ ዳውሴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:26">ኔ ኪፃሴ ዓሶኮ ሜታሢ ዔያታ ዳልጊሼኔ።<verse eid="PSA 69:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 69:27"/>ዻቢንቶይዳ ዔያቶኮ ዻቢንቲ ቃሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:27">ኔ ፂሉሞ ባንሢያ ዑኮፓ።<verse eid="PSA 69:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 69:28"/>ናንጎ ማፃኣፓፓ ዔያታ ቃኣጪንቶንጎ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:28">ፂሎ ዓሶና ዎላ ፃኣፒንቶፓ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">69፡28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:32">ኬሲ. ማፃ 32፡32</ref>፤ <ref loc="REV 3:5">ዮሃ. ፆፔዻ 3፡5</ref>፤ <ref loc="REV 13:8">13፡8</ref>፤ <ref loc="REV 17:8">17፡8</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 69:28"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 69:29"/>ጋዓንቴ ታኣኒ ሜቶ ዋኣዪሢዳ ዓኣኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:29">ፆኦሲዮ! ኔኤኮ ዓውሲፃ ኬልቂ ታና ዓርቆንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 69:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 69:30"/>ፆኦሲኮ ሱንፆ ጋላቲሢና ታ ዓይናዻንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:30">ጋላቲሢና ታኣኒ ዼግ ዼጊዳንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 69:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 69:31"/>ዬይያ ጌማይዳፓ ባሼ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:31">ጉራኒንታ ሹቁሊንታ ኬሴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:31">ዚያ ጌማይ ዒዛም ዒንጊሢዳፓ ባሼ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:31">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዎዛሳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 69:31"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 69:32"/>ማንቆ ዓሳ ዬያ ዛጋዖ ዎዛዻንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:32">ዒንሢ ፆኦሲ ኮዓ ዓሳ ዒና ዒንሢኮ ዶዶንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 69:32"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 69:33"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ሜታዼ ዓሶኮ ዒላቶ ዋይዛኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:33">ቱኡቲ ዓኣ ዓሶዋ ዒዚ ቶኦዛዺ ዛጉዋሴ።<verse eid="PSA 69:33"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 69:34"/>ጫሪንጮንታ ሳዖንታ ባዞንታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:34">ዬያኮ ጋሮይዳ ዓጊፃ ባካ ቢያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:34">ፆኦሲ ጋላቶንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 69:34"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 69:35"/>ፆኦሲ ፂዮኔ ዓውሳንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:35">ዪሁዳ ካታሞዋ ማሂ ጊንሣ ማዣንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:35">ዬካፓ ዴራ ዒዛኮ ዒኢካ ናንጋንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:35">ሳዔሎዋ ዔያታ ፔኤሮ ማሃንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 69:35"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 69:36"/>ዒዛ ዓይሎ ዜርፃ ዬኖ ዻካላንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:36">ዒዛ ናሽካዞንሢያ ቢያ ዒኢካ ናንጋንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 69:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 69"/>
  <chapter number="70" style="c" sid="PSA 70"/>
  <para style="ms">ማኣዶ ዴንቃኒ ሺኢቂንቴ ሺኢጲሢ</para>
  <para style="mr">(ዓይኑ. 40፡13-17ይዳ ዓኣሢና ዎሊ ማላያኬ)</para>
  <para style="s1">ዓይኑሞ ሱኡጋሢ ዓይሣ ጎይፆና ማሊ ጶቂሥሢሮ ዓይናዺንታ ዳውቴ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 70:1"/>ፆኦሲዮ! ታና ዓውሳኒ ታ ባንሢ ሺሬ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 70:1">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ታና ማኣዳኒ ሩኡሬቴራ!<verse eid="PSA 70:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 70:2"/>ታኣኮ ሼምፓሢ ባይዛኒ ኮዓዞንሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 70:2">ቦርሲንቶንጎ፥ ዲቃቲ ካራ ባይዞንጎ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:2">ታኣኮ ባይሲንቶ ካፓዞንሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 70:2">ዻውሲንቲ ጊንሢም ማዖንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 70:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 70:3"/>ታ ዑፆይዳ፦ «ማዳ ዒዛም!» ጋዓዞንሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 70:3">ቦርሲንቲ ጊንሢም ማዖንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 70:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 70:4"/>ጋዓንቴ ኔና ኮዓዞንሢ ቢያ ኔኤና ሚርጌና ዎዛዾንጎ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 70:4">ኔኤኮ ዓውሲፆ ናሽካዞንሢ ቢያ ዎዴ፦</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 70:4">«ፆኦሲ ዼኤፒኬ!» ጎዖንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 70:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 70:5"/>ፆኦሲዮ! ታኣኒ ጋዓንቴ ማንቆ፥ ሃሣ ሜታዼ ዓሲኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 70:5">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ሩኡሪና ታና ሄሌ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:5">ታና ማኣዳሢና ዓውሳሢያ ኔናታሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 70:5">ፆኦሲዮ! ኔኤኒ ኔጊፖ!<verse eid="PSA 70:5"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 70"/>
  <chapter number="71" style="c" sid="PSA 71"/>
  <para style="s1">ፆኦሲ ካፓንዳጉዲ ሺኢቂንቴ ሺኢጲሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 71:1"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ታ ኔና ታኣኮ ጊቲማሢ ማሄሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:1">ፔቴታዖ ታኣኒ ቦርሲንታዓኬ።<verse eid="PSA 71:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 71:2"/>ኔ ፂሉሞና ቶሊሲ ታና ዓውሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:2">ዋዮ ኔኤኮ ታ ባንሢ ማሂ ታና ዓይሴ።<verse eid="PSA 71:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 71:3"/>ዓይጎ ዎዴናኣ ታ ዓኣሺንቲ ጌኤቂንታ ላላሢ ታኣኮ ማዔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:3">ኔ ታኣኮ ዋርዲዮ ላሎ ሹጫሢኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:3">ዬያሮ ታና ዓውሳንዳ ዓይሥሢ ኬስኮንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 71:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 71:4"/>ፆኦሲዮ! ፑርቶ ዓሶ ኩጫፓ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:4">ሚጪንቱዋ ጌኔ ማዻ ዓሶፓ ታና ዓውሴ።<verse eid="PSA 71:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 71:5"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:5">ኔኤኒ ታኣኮ ሃጊ ማዓ ዎዛሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:5">ናኣቱማፓ ዓርቃዖ ኔ ታኣኮ ጌኤቂንቶሢኬ።<verse eid="PSA 71:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 71:6"/>ታኣኒ ሾይንታፓ ዓርቃዖ ኔ ዑፃ ጌኤቂንቴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:6">ታ ዒንዶ ጎጳፓ ታና ኔ ኬሴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:6">ቢያ ዎዴ ታኣኮ ጋላቶሢ ኔናኬ።<verse eid="PSA 71:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 71:7"/>ኔኤኒ ታ ዛሎ ዶዲ ዖልታሢ ማዔሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:7">ናንጋ ታኣኮ ሚርጌ ዓሶም ማላታ ማዔኔ።<verse eid="PSA 71:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 71:8"/>ሮኦሮ ጉቤ ኔኤኮ ቦንቾ ኬኤዛኒ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:8">ዻንጋ ታኣኮ ጋላታ ሌሊ ማዔኔ፤<verse eid="PSA 71:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 71:9"/>ሃሢ ታ ጋርቼቴያ ታና ኬኤሪፖ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:9">ዎልቃ ታኣኮ ጋፓዛኣ ታና ሃሺፖ።<verse eid="PSA 71:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 71:10"/>ሞርካ ታኣኮ ዎላ ጌስቴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:10">ሼምፓሢ ታኣኮ ባይዛኒ ኮዓ ዓሳ ዎሊና ዞርቴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 71:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 71:11"/>ዔያታ ዒማና፦ «ፆኦሲ ዒዛ ሃሼኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:11">ዒዛ ዓውሳንዳይ ባኣሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:11">ዳውሲ ዒዛ ዓርቁዋቴራ» ጌዔኔ።<verse eid="PSA 71:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 71:12"/>ፆኦሲዮ! ኔ ታ ኮራፓ ሃኪፖ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:12">ታ ፆኦዛሢዮ! ታና ማኣዳኒ ሩኡሬ።<verse eid="PSA 71:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 71:13"/>ማኪ ታና ዒፃዞንሢ ዒጊጪ ባይቆንጎ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:13">ማኣሳንሣኒ ኮዓዞንሢያ ቶኦቺንቲ ዻውሲንቶንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 71:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 71:14"/>ታኣኒ ጋዓንቴ ቢያ ዎዴ ኔና ጉሙርቃኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:14">ቃሲ ቃሲ ጋላታ ታ ኔኤም ሺኢሻኔ።<verse eid="PSA 71:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 71:15"/>ዻንጋ ታኣኮ ኔ ፂሉሞ ሮኦሮ ጉቤ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:15">ኔ ዻቂሺፆ ኬኤዛኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:15">ጌኤዞ ዎማካ ዔቂሶንዶቴያ ታኣም ዔርቲባኣሴ።<verse eid="PSA 71:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 71:16"/>ታኣኒ ሙኪ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳኮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:16">ዶዶ ማዾ ኬኤዛንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:16">ኔ ፂሉሞ ሌሊ ታኣኒ ኬኤዛንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 71:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 71:17"/>ፆኦሲዮ! ኔኤኒ ታና ናኣቱሞፓ ዓርቃዖ ዔርዜኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:17">ታኣኒያ ሃኖ ሄላንዳኣና ኔኤኮ ሄርሺሲ ዲቃሣ ዓኮ ማዾ ኬኤዛኔ።<verse eid="PSA 71:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 71:18"/>ፆኦሲዮ! ታኣኒ ጋርቺ ቡኡቄቴያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:18">ኩጮ ኔኤኮ ሙካ ሾይንቶም</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:18">ዎልቆዋ ጊንፃ ኬስካ ዴሮም</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:18">ቢያ ታ ኬኤዛንዳያ ሄላንዳኣና ኔ ታና ሃሺፖ።<verse eid="PSA 71:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 71:19"/>ፆኦሲዮ! ፂሉማ ኔኤሲ ጫሪንጮ ሄላያኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:19">ኔኤኒ ዼኤፒ ዼኤፒ ባኣዚ ማዼኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:19">ፆኦዛሢዮ! ኔጉዴያ ዖናዳይ?<verse eid="PSA 71:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 71:20"/>ኔኤኒ ታና ሚርጌ ሜቶና ዋኣዪሢና ሄሊሴታቴያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:20">ናንጎ ታኣሲ ኔ ጊንሣ ዓካሳንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:20">ሳዖ ዴሞ ዔቶይዳፓ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:20">ላሚ ታና ኔ ኬሳንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 71:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 71:21"/>ታኣኮ ቦንቾ ታኣም ኔ ቃሳንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:21">ማሂ ኔ ታና ጊንሣ ዶዶሻንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 71:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 71:22"/>ፆኦሲዮ! ኔኤኮ ጉሙርቂንቲፆ ዛሎ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:22">ጎኦላ ዋርቂ ታ ኔና ጋላታንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:22">ዒስራዔኤሌ ዓሶኮ ፆኦዛሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:22">ዓይኑሞ ዓንጋሞና ጋላታ ዓይኑሞ ታ ኔኤም ሺኢሻኔ።<verse eid="PSA 71:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 71:23"/>ታኣኒ ኔኤም ዓይኑሞ ዓይናዻ ዎዶና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:23">ሙሱራ ታኣኮ ዎዛና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:23">ኔኤኒ ማሂ ሻንቂ ዓውሴ ሼምፔላኣ ዒላሻኔ።<verse eid="PSA 71:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 71:24"/>ዻንጋ ታኣኮ ኔ ፂሉሞ ዛሎ ሮኦሮ ጉቤ ኬኤዛኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:24">ታና ሜታ ሄላንዳጉዲ ኮዓዞንሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:24">ቦርሲንቴኔ፥ ጋፒ ዻውሲንቴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 71:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 71"/>
  <chapter number="72" style="c" sid="PSA 72"/>
  <para style="s1">ሃጊ ሙካ ካኣታሢ ፆኦሲ ማኣዳንዳጉዲ ሺኢቂንቴ ሺኢጲሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 72:1"/>ፆኦሲዮ! ኔኤኮ ዎጎ ካኣቲም</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:1">ፂሉሞዋ ኔኤኮ ካኣቲ ናኣዚም ዒንጌ።<verse eid="PSA 72:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 72:2"/>ዒዚ ኔ ዴሮኮ ጌኤዞ ፂሉሞና ዛጋንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:2">ሜታዼዞንሢማኣ ፒዙሞና ዎጋንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 72:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 72:3"/>ዹካ ዖርጎቹሞ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:3">ጌሜራኣ ዴሮም ፂሉሞ ዓኣፒ ዔኪ ዬዓንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 72:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 72:4"/>ዒዚ ሜታዼ ዴሮም ሞኦቲንታንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:4">ማንቆ ዓሶዋ ዓውሳንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:4">ዓሶ ሄርቂ ዎይሣ ዓሶዋ ዒ ጋኣጫንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 72:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 72:5"/>ዓባ ዓኣ ዎዶይዳ ቢያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:5">ዓጊናኣ ፖዓ ዎዶይዳ ቢያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:5">ሾይንቲፓ ሾይንቲ ሄላንዳኣና ዒዚ ናንጋንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 72:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 72:6"/>ሃኣኮ ቡሪንቴም ማኣሊዳ ዋርቃ ዒርዚጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:6">ዒ ዋርቃንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:6">ዓዳ ፁቢ ዒርዚጉዲ ሳዓ ጌላንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 72:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 72:7"/>ዒዛ ካኣቱሞና ፂሉሞ ሚርጋንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:7">ዓጊና ፖዖ ሃሻንዳያ ሄላንዳኣና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:7">ዖርጎቹማ ዒዛኮ ሚርጊ ዴዓንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 72:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 72:8"/>ዒዛ ዓጮኮ ዛጳ ባዛፓ ባዞ ሄላንዳኣና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:8">ዔፕራፂሴ ዎራፓ ዴንዲ ዓጮ ጋፖ ሄላንዳኣናኬ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">72፡8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 9:10">ዛካ. 9፡10</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 72:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 72:9"/>ዳውሎ ዓጮ ዓሳ ዒዛም ዚጋንዳኔ፤ <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">72፡9 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ዳውሎ ዓጮ ዓሳ ዒዛም ዚጋንዳኔ </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ጋዓዞ፦ ላንካይታሞ ዓሳ ቡሌ ማፃኣፖይዳ «ዒቶጲያ ዒዛም ዚጋንዳኔ» ጋዓኔ።</char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:9">ሞርካ ዒዛኮ ዒዛ ቤርታ ሎኦሚ ዓጪ ኩኡላንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 72:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 72:10"/>ቴርሴሴንታ ዋኣፆ ሳዛ ዓኣ ዓጮ ካኣታኣ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:10">ጊኢራ ሚኢሼ ዒዛም ዔኪ ዬዓንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:10">ዓሬቤንታ ሳኣባ ዓጮ ካኣታኣ ዔኤቢ ዒንጋኒ ዒዛም ሺኢሻንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 72:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 72:11"/>ካኣታ ቢያ ዒዛም ዚጋንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:11">ዴራኣ ቢያ ዒዛም ዎርቃንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 72:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 72:12"/>ሜታዼሢ ዒላታ ዎዶና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:12">ማንቆ ዓሶንታ ማኣዳይ ባኣ ዓሶዋ ዒዚ ሄሊ ዓውሳንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 72:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 72:13"/>ማንቆንታ ሜታዼ ዓሶንታም ዒ ሚጪንታንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:13">ዬያቶ ሃይቢዳፓኣ ዒ ዓውሳንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 72:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 72:14"/>ሄርቂንቲ ዎርቆ ዎይፆይዳፓ ዒዚ ዔያቶ ኬሳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:14">ሱጉፃ ዔያቶሲ ዒዛ ቤርታ ቦንቺንቴያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 72:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 72:15"/>ካኣታሢ ሚርጌ ሌዔ ናንጎም!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:15">ሳኣባ ዓጮይዳፓ ዎርቄ ዒዛም ሺኢኮም፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:15">ሺኢጲሢያ ቢያ ዎዴ ዒዛም ሺኢቂንቶም፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:15">ቢያ ዎዴ ፆኦሲኮ ዓንጃ ዒዛም ማዖም።<verse eid="PSA 72:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 72:16"/>ዓጫ ዒዛሲ ሚርጌ ሃኣኮ ካሦም፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:16">ዹካ ዒዛኮ ሃኣኮ ባቃልሶም፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:16">ሊባኖኦሴ ዹኮጉዲ ማሊ ማዖም፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:16">ሃኣኮኮ ናታ ዒዛኮ ማኣቲጉዲ ሚርጎም።<verse eid="PSA 72:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 72:17"/>ሱንፃ ዒዛሲ ናንጊና ዶዲ ናንጎም!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:17">ዔርቲፃ ዒዛኮ ዓቢ ናንጋሢጉዲ ማዖም፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:17">ዴሬ ቢያ ዒዛና ዓንጂንቶም፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:17">ዴራ ቢያ፦ «ኔኤኒ ዓንጂንቴያኬ!» ዒዛ ጎዖም።<verse eid="PSA 72:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 72:18"/>ፔኤሮ ሌሊ ሄርሺሲ ዲቃሣ ዓኪ ባኣዚ ማዻ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:18">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ማዔ ዒስራዔኤሌ ፆኦዛሢ ዓንጂንቶም!<verse eid="PSA 72:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 72:19"/>ዒዛኮ ቦንቾ ሱንፃ ናንጊና ዓንጂንቶም፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:19">ዓጫ ቢያ ዒዛኮ ቦንቾና ኩሞም!</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 72:19"/>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:19">ዓኣሜን! ዓኣሜን!<verse eid="PSA 72:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 72:20"/>ዒሴዬ ናኣዚ ዳውቴ ሺኢጲፃ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:20">ሃይማ ሄሊ ጋፔኔ።<verse eid="PSA 72:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 72"/>
  <chapter number="73" style="c" sid="PSA 73"/>
  <para style="ms">ሃይሣሳ ፖቂፆ</para>
  <para style="mr">(ዓይኑ. ማፃ ዓይ. 73—89)</para>
  <para style="d">ዓሳኣፔ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="s1">ፆኦሲኮ ፒዜ ዎጊፆ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 73:1"/>ዒና ጌኤሺ ማዔ ዒስራዔኤሌ ዓሶም</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:1">ፆኦሲ ዎዚ ኮሺዳይ!<verse eid="PSA 73:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 73:2"/>ታኣኒ ጋዓንቴ ቶካ ታኣኮ ዹቂንታኒ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:2">ሃሊፄም ሎኦማኒ ዻካሮ ዓቴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 73:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 73:3"/>ታኣኒ ፑርቶ ዓሶም ዔባ ኮሽካዛ ዛጊ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:3">ዋይዞ ዒፃ ዓሶማኣ «ዬይ ዎዲ ማዔዖ»</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:3">ጌይ ማሌኔ።<verse eid="PSA 73:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 73:4"/>ፔቴታዖ ሜታ ዔያቶኮ ባኣሴ።</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:4">ዑፃ ዔያቶሲ ኩሙሢ ኮሺኬ።<verse eid="PSA 73:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 73:5"/>ዓሲ ሄላ ፑርታ ሜታ ዔያቶ ሄሉዋሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:5">ዓይጎ ዓሲዳኣ ማዓ ሜታ ዔያቶ ዑፃ ማዑዋሴ።<verse eid="PSA 73:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 73:6"/>ዬያሮ ዖቶርሙሞ ዔያቶኮ ቆርጫ ማይንቶ ፓልሞኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:6">ዋይዚ ዒፂሢያ ዓዳ ዔያታ ማኣዖጉዲ ማይንቴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 73:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 73:7"/>ዔያቶኮ ማሌ ዓኣፓ ቴልዮ ጌይ ዛጋኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:7">ዒናኣ ዔያቶሲ ፑርታ ማሊሢ ኬሳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 73:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 73:8"/>ቶኦቺሢና ፑርቱሞ ዔያታ ጌስታኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:8">ሌካ ጪኢዺንቲ ጪኢዺንቲ ዋይዞ ዒፂፆና ዚርቃኔ።<verse eid="PSA 73:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 73:9"/>ጫሪንጫ ዓኣ ፆኦዛሢ ማኪ ዔያታ ጌስታኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:9">ጌኤዛ ዔያቶኮ ሳዓ ማዔ ካሮ ሄላኔ።<verse eid="PSA 73:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 73:10"/>ዬያሮ ፆኦሲ ዴራኣ ዓቱዋዖ ዔያቶ ባንሢ ጎዓኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:10">ዋኣፆዋ ዔያቶኮ ካራባኣ ጎይሢና ዑሽካኔ።<verse eid="PSA 73:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 73:11"/>«ዓካሪ ፆኦሲ ዎይቲ ዔራይ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:11">ዼኤፖ ፆኦዛሢ ኮራ ዔራቶ ዓኣ?» ዔያታ ጋዓኔ።<verse eid="PSA 73:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 73:12"/>ፑርቶ ዓሳ ያዺ ማላኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:12">ዔያቶኮ ዓኣ ቆላ ጊዳያኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:12">ዬያይዴንቴያ ቃሲ ቆሎ ዔያታ ዴንቃኔ።<verse eid="PSA 73:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 73:13"/>ሃይሾ ዒኖ ታኣኮ ታ ጌኤሺ ማሄሢ ጉሪኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:13">ዔኤቢ ታ ካኣሚባኣዋይ ጌዒ ኩጮ ማስታሢያ ጉሪኬ።<verse eid="PSA 73:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 73:14"/>ሮኦሮ ጉቤ ታ ሜታዼኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:14">ጉቶ ጉቶዋ ሜቶ ታ ዔኬኔ።<verse eid="PSA 73:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 73:15"/>ታኣኒ ሃያይዲ ጌስታንዳኔ ጌዔያ ማዔያታቶ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:15">ኔኤኮ ናኣቶ ሾይንቶይዳ ሄኤዶ ፑርታ ባኣዚ ማዼያናንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 73:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 73:16"/>ዬያ ባኮ ታ ዔራኒ ማሌ ዎዶና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:16">ላቢሢ ማዾ ማሊ ታኣም ጴዼኔ።<verse eid="PSA 73:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 73:17"/>ዬይያ ፆኦሲኮ ዱማዼ ማኣሮ ታ ጌላንዳያ ሄላንዳኣና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:17">ጋፒንፆዋ ዔያቶኮ ታ ዛጋንዳያ ሄላንዳኣናኬ።<verse eid="PSA 73:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 73:18"/>ጎኔና ሃሊፃ ቤስካ ኔ ዔያቶ ጌሤኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:18">ባይሲንታ ባንሢያ ኔ ዔያቶ ኬይሴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 73:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 73:19"/>ዔያታ ቤዞና ሩኡሪ ዎይቲ ባይቄይ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:19">ዲቃቲ ጋፒ ዔያታ ኩዴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 73:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 73:20"/>ዓሲ ዓውቲዳፓ ዲቃታዖ ዎኦታሢጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:20">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:20">ኔኤኒ ዔቃ ዎዶና ባልባቲሢጉዲ ጉሪ ኔ ዔያቶ ማሃንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 73:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 73:21"/>ማሊፃ ታኣኮ ሚርጌና ጫንቄኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:21">ዒናኣ ታኣኮ ሜቄኔ።<verse eid="PSA 73:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 73:22"/>ማሊሢባኣያና ዔሩዋ ዓሲያ ታ ማዔኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:22">ኔ ቤርታ ቆልሞጉዲ ታ ማዔኔ።<verse eid="PSA 73:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 73:23"/>ያዺ ማዔያታቴያ ቢያ ዎዴ ታ ኔኤና ዎላኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:23">ኔኤኒያ ታኣኮ ሚዛቆ ኩጮ ዓርቄኔ።<verse eid="PSA 73:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 73:24"/>ኔ ዞሪፆና ዔኪ ታና ኔ ዓኣዼኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:24">ጊንፃፓ ኔ ታና ቦንቺሳንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 73:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 73:25"/>ጫሪንጮይዳ ኔኤፓ ዓታዛ ታኣኮ ዖኦኒ ዓኣይ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:25">ሳዖይዳ ኔ ጊዳፓ ሜሌ ታ ኮዓይ ባኣሴ።<verse eid="PSA 73:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 73:26"/>ታኣኮ ዑፆንታ ዒኖንታ ላባኒ ዳንዳዓኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:26">ፆኦሲ ጋዓንቴ ዒኖኮ ታኣኮ ዶዱማሢና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:26">ናንጊና ታኣሮ ማሂ ታ ዔኬሢኬ።<verse eid="PSA 73:26"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 73:27"/>ዓካሪ ኔኤፓ ሃካዞንሢ ባይቃንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:27">ኔኤኒ ኔኤም ጉሙርቂንቱዋዞንሢ ቢያ ባይዛንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 73:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 73:28"/>ታኣም ጋዓንቴ ፆኦሲ ባንሢ ዑኪሢ ኮይሳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:28">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ጊቲማሢ ታኣኮ ታ ማሄኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:28">ኔኤኮ ማዾ ዛሎዋ ታኣም ኬኤዛኒ ኮሺኬ።<verse eid="PSA 73:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 73"/>
  <chapter number="74" style="c" sid="PSA 74"/>
  <para style="s1">ዓሳኣፔ ዔራቶና ካላሌ ካላሊ</para>
  <para style="d">ዴራ ኮሺ ናንጋንዳጉዲ ሺኢቂንቴ ሺኢጲሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 74:1"/>ፆኦሲዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:1">ናንጊና ኔ ኑና ዓይጋ ኬኤሬይ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:1">ሄንቆ ቦኦሎይዳ ዓኣ ኔ ማራቶይዳ ዻጋ ኔኤኮ ዓይጋ ዔኤቴይ?<verse eid="PSA 74:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 74:2"/>ሚናፓ ዓርቃዖ ኔ ዶኦሬ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:2">ኔ ዒጊኒ ማዓንዳጉዲ ዓይላታፓ ሻንቂ ኔ ኬሴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:2">ዴሮ ኔኤኮ ማሌ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:2">ሃያኮ ቤርታ ኔኤኮ ናንጎ ቤሲ ኔ ማሄ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:2">ፂዮኔ ዹኮም ማሌ።<verse eid="PSA 74:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 74:3"/>ሄፆ ኔኤኮ ናንጊና ቆይዳ ማዔ ቤዞ ባንሢ ማሄ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:3">ሞርካ ኔኤኮ ጌኤዦ ማኣራ ዓኣ ባኮ ቢያ ፑርቲሴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 74:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 74:4"/>ሞርካ፦ «ኑ ባሼኔ» ጌዒ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:4">ኔኤኮ ጌኤዦ ማኣሮይዳ ሄርሺንታኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:4">ባሺፆ ዔርዛ ዔያቶኮ ባንዲሮዋ ሱፄኔ።<verse eid="PSA 74:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 74:5"/>ካዮ ባኣካ ሚሢ ቆፃኒ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:5">ሄርጋ ዓርቄ ዓሲ ዔያታ ማላኔ።<verse eid="PSA 74:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 74:6"/>ሚፆ ቃርፂ ኮጫ ሱፆና ባኮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:6">ሄርጋና ቆፂ፥ ሞቶሾናኣ ጳርቂ ሜንሤኔ።<verse eid="PSA 74:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 74:7"/>ኔኤኮ ጌኤዦ ማኣሮ ሚቺ ዔያታ ባይዜኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:7">ኔ ሱንፆኮ ዎይፆ ቤዞዋ ዒኢሴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 74:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 74:8"/>ዔያታ ፔኤኮ ዒኖና፦</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:8">«ጋፒንሢ ሄርቂ ኑ ዔያቶ ዎይሣንዳኔ» ጌዔኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:8">ሳዔሎይዳ ፆኦሲ ካኣሽኪንታ ቤዞ ቢያ ዔያታ ሚቼኔ።<verse eid="PSA 74:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 74:9"/>ማይ ኑ ዛጋንዳ ማላታ ማዓ ባኣዚ ባኣሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:9">ፔቴታዖ ፆኦሲ ማሊሢ ኬኤዛኒ ኬስካ ዓሲያ ባኣሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:9">ሃይ ዎማ ሄላንዳኣና ሃማይዲ ዴዓቴያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:9">ዔራይ ኑ ባኣካ ባኣሴ።<verse eid="PSA 74:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 74:10"/>ፆኦሲዮ! ሞርካ ሚኢጫሢ ዎማ ሄላንዳኣናዳይ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:10">ኔ ሱንፆ ጫርቂ ዔያታ ቶኦቻሢ ዎማካ ጋፓይ?<verse eid="PSA 74:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 74:11"/>ኩጮ ኔኤኮ ኔ ዓይጋ ማሂ ዔካይ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:11">ሚዛቆ ኩጮ ኔኤኮ ሾኦጶ ዴማ ዓይጋ ዳካይ?<verse eid="PSA 74:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 74:12"/>ፆኦሲዮ! ሚናፓ ዓርቃዖ ኔ ታኣኮ ካኣቲኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:12">ሳዖይዳ ኔኤኮ ዓውሲፆ ማዾ ኔ ማዼኔ።<verse eid="PSA 74:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 74:13"/>ኔኤኮ ዎልቆና ባዞ ፓቄሢ ኔናኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:13">ባዞይዳ ናንጋ ቦዖኮዋ ቶኦኮ ዋኣፆይዳ ኔ ዳኣፄኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">74፡13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 14:21">ኬሲ. ማፃ 14፡21</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 74:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 74:14"/>ሌዋታኔ ጌይንታ ቦዖኮ ቶኦኮ ኔ ጋኣጬኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:14">ዓሲ ናንጉዋ ዳውሎ ማዢንቶማዋኣ <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">74፡14 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ዓሲ ናንጉዋ ዳውሎ ማዢንቶማኣ </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ጋዓዞ፦ ላንካይታሞ ዓሳ ቡሌ ማፃኣፖይዳ «ዒቶጲያ ዓሶማኣ ሙኡዚ ኔ ዒንጌኔ» ጋዓኔ።</char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:14">ሙኡዚ ማሂ ኔ ዒንጌኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">74፡14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 41:1">ዒዮ. 41፡1</ref>፤ <ref loc="PSA 104:26">ዓይኑ. 104፡26</ref>፤ <ref loc="ISA 27:1">ዒሲ. 27፡1</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 74:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 74:15"/>ዓልቃ ዋኣፆንታ ዎታ ዎሮንታ ዑሬሢ ኔናኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:15">ቢያ ዎዴ ዎታ ዎሮ ኔ ሚጪሴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 74:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 74:16"/>ሮኦሮንታ ዋንቶንታ ኔኤሮኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:16">ዓጊኖና ዓቦና ኔኤኒ ዶዲሺ ዴይሤኔ።<verse eid="PSA 74:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 74:17"/>ሳዖኮ ማዓ ካሮ ጌሤሢ ኔናኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:17">ዖጎፆንታ ባርጎንታ ኔኤኒ ኬሴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 74:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 74:18"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:18">ኔ ሞርካ ኔና ቦሂ ዓማላሢ ዛጌ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:18">ዔያታ ዔኤያ ማዔሢሮ ኔ ሱንፆይዳ ጫርቃኔ።<verse eid="PSA 74:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 74:19"/>ኔኤም ዎርቃ ሼምፓሢ ቦዖም ዓኣሢ ዒንጊፖ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:19">ኔኤም ማዻዞንሢኮ ሜቶ ናንጊና ዋሊፖ!<verse eid="PSA 74:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 74:20"/>ጫኣቁሞ ኔኤሲ ማሌ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:20">ዋይዚ ዒፂሢ ቡኬ ቤሲ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:20">ሳዔሎኮ ዹሜ ጊንፃ ኩሜኔ።<verse eid="PSA 74:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 74:21"/>ሄርቂንቲ ዎርቃዞንሢ ቦርሲንቲ ማዖፓ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:21">ማንቆንታ ሜታዼ ዓሶንታ ሱንፆ ኔኤሲ ጋላቶንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 74:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 74:22"/>ፆኦሲዮ! ዔቄ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:22">ኔ ጌኤዞ ዛሎ ሞኦቲንቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:22">ፓሡዋ ዓሳ ሮኦሮ ጉቤ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:22">ኔና ቶኦቻሢ ዛጌ።<verse eid="PSA 74:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 74:23"/>ኔ ሞርኮኮ ሄርሺንቶ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:23">ቢያ ዎዴ ዺቢ ዺቢ ዓኣዻ ሆኦሊንቶ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:23">ዔያቶኮ ኔኤኒ ዋሊፖ።<verse eid="PSA 74:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 74"/>
  <chapter number="75" style="c" sid="PSA 75"/>
  <para style="s1">«ባይዚፖ» ጌይንታ ዓይኑሞና ዓይኑሞ ሱኡጋሢ ዓይሣ ጎይፆ ዓይናዺንቴ ዓሳኣፔኮ ፆኦሲ ሄርሺፆ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="d">ፆኦሲ ዎጋያ ማዒፆ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 75:1"/>ፆኦሲዮ! ኑኡኒ ኔና ጋላታኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:1">ኔኤኒ ሃንጋ ኑ ባንሢ ዑኬሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:1">ኔ ሱንፆም ኑ ጋላታ ሺኢሻኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:1">ኔ ማዼ ዲቃሢ ሄርሺሳ ማዾ ኑ ኬኤዛኔ።<verse eid="PSA 75:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 75:2"/>ኔኤኒ፦ «ታኣኒ ዎጌ ዎጋንዳ ኬሊ ሜንሤኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:2">ዬኖ ዎዶና ፒዜ ታ ዎጋንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 75:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 75:3"/>ሳዓ ዓጊፄታቴያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:3">ዒኢካ ዓኣ ማዢንታ ጎጋይቄቴያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:3">ታኣኒ ሳዖኮ ዓይፆ ዶዲሻኔ።<verse eid="PSA 75:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 75:4"/>ዖቶርቃዞንሢያ ‹ዒንሢ ሄርሺንቲፖቴ›</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:4">ፑርቶ ዓሶዋ ‹ጪኢዺንቲፖቴ› ታኣኒ ጋዓንዳኔ፤<verse eid="PSA 75:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 75:5"/>ፆኦሲ ዑፆይዳ ኔና ዼግ ዼጊዲፖ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:5">ሃንጎ ሃሣ ዖቶርቂ ጌስቲፖ» ጌዔኔ።<verse eid="PSA 75:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 75:6"/>ዎጌ ዓባ ኬስካ ባንፃፓ ማዖም ጌላ ባንፃፓ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:6">ጊንሣ ሃሣ ዓሲ ናንጉዋ ዳውላፓ ሙኩዋሴ።<verse eid="PSA 75:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 75:7"/>ፔቴሢ «ዻቤኔ» ጌዒ ዎጋሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:7">ባጋሢ «ዔኤቢ ኔኤኮ ባኣሴ» ጌዒ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:7">ፒዜ ዎጋሢ ፆኦሲኬ።<verse eid="PSA 75:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 75:8"/>ዑዦ ዑሽኮ ዓንጋ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳኮ ኩጫ ዓኣኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:8">ኮይሳሢጉዲ ጊኢጊሾና ዱባዻ ዎይኖ ዑዣ ኩሚ ዓኣኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:8">ዬያ ዒ ዓንጋፓ ላኣላዛ ሳዖይዳ ዋይዞ ዒፃ ዓሳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:8">ሞጮዋ ዓይሱዋዖ ጋፒሲ ዑሽካንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 75:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 75:9"/>ታኣኒ ጋዓንቴ ዬያ ናንጊና ኬኤዛንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:9">ያይቆኦቤ ፆኦዛሢም ዓይኑሞ ሺኢሻንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 75:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 75:10"/>ፑርቶ ዓሶኮ ካኣሮ ቢያ ታ ሜንሣንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:10">ፂሎ ዓሶሲ ጋዓንቴ ዼግ ጋዓንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 75:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 75"/>
  <chapter number="76" style="c" sid="PSA 76"/>
  <para style="s1">ዓይኑሞ ሱኡጋሢ ዓይሣ ጎይፆ ጎኦላና ዓይናዺንቴ ዓሳኣፔኮ ፆኦሲ ሄርሺፆ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="d">ፆኦሲ ባሻያ ማዔሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 76:1"/>ፆኦሲ ዪሁዳ ዓጫ ዔርቴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:1">ሱንፃ ዒዛኮ ዒስራዔኤሌይዳ ዼኤፒኬ።<verse eid="PSA 76:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 76:2"/>ጌኤዦ ማኣራ ዒዛኮ ዬሩሳላሜይዳ (ሳሌሜይዳ)</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:2">ዒዚ ዎርቃ ቤዛኣ ፂዮኔይዳ።<verse eid="PSA 76:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 76:3"/>ዒኢካ ዱኪንታ ሂኢዦንታ ጊቲሞንታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:3">ዎርፆዋ ዒ ሜንሤኔ።<verse eid="PSA 76:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 76:4"/>ፆኦሲዮ! ኔኤኒ ዒጊቻያኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:4">ኔኤኮ ዲቃሢ ሄርሺሲፃ ዼኤፖ ዹካፓ ባሼኬ።<verse eid="PSA 76:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 76:5"/>ዖሎና ዔርቴ ፖኦሊሳ ዲዒ ዔኬ ባካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:5">ጊንሣ ቡሪንቲ ዔውቴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:5">ኩጮ ዔያታ ዔቂሶ ባሺንቲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:5">ጋፒ ጊንዖ ጊንዔኔ።<verse eid="PSA 76:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 76:6"/>ያይቆኦቤ ፆኦዛሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:6">ኔኤኒ ዔያቶ ጎሬ ዎዶና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:6">ፓራሢ ቶጌ ዓሳ ፓራሢና ዎላ ሃይቄኔ።<verse eid="PSA 76:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 76:7"/>ዒጊጮንዶያ ኮይሳሢ ኔና ሌሊኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:7">ኔኤኒ ዻጋዼ ዎዶና ኔ ቤርታ ዖኦኒ ዔቃኒ ዳንዳዓንዳይ?<verse eid="PSA 76:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 76:8"/>ኔኤኒ ጫሪንጫፓ ዎጎ ኬኤዜም</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:8">ሳዔላ ዋይዚ ዒጊቹሞና ዚቲዮ ጌዔኔ።<verse eid="PSA 76:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 76:9"/>ፆኦሲዮ! ዬይ ያዺ ማዔሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:9">ኔኤኒ ሳዖይዳ ሜታዼ ዓሶ ዓውሳኒ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:9">ዎጎሮ ዔቄ ዎዶናኬ።<verse eid="PSA 76:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 76:10"/>ዓሲ ሜቶ ዓጊ ኔኤኒ ጎሬቴያ ኔ ቦንቾም ማዓኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:10">ዬያ ጎሪንቶፓ ቶሌዞንሢያ ሪኢራኔ።<verse eid="PSA 76:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 76:11"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ማዔ ዒንሢ ፆኦዛሢም ናኣቡዋቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:11">ዒንሢ ናኣቤ ናኣቦዋ ኩንሡዋቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:11">ዒዛኮ ዑኬ ዓኣ ዓሳ ቢያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:11">ዒጊቻያ ማዔሢም ዒንጎ ባኣዚ ሺኢሾንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 76:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 76:12"/>ዒዚ ዖቶርቃ ሱኡጎ ዻውሲሳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:12">ዼኤፖ ዼኤፖ ካኣቶዋ ጎቃይሳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 76:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 76"/>
  <chapter number="77" style="c" sid="PSA 77"/>
  <para style="s1">ዓይኑሞ ሱኡጋሢ ዓይሣ ጎይፆ ዔዶታሜ ዛሎ ዓይናዺንቴ ዓሳኣፔ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="d">ሜቶፓ ቶላኒ ሺኢቂንቴ ሺኢጲሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 77:1"/>ዑኡዞ ታኣኮ ዼጊዲ ፆኦሲ ባንሢ ዒላቴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:1">ዒዚ ታኣም ዋይዛንዳጉዲ ዒዛ ባንሢ ዔኤሊንቴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 77:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 77:2"/>ታኣኮ ሜታሢ ኬሎና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:2">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ታ ኮዔኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:2">ዋንቶ ላቢሢ ባኣንቴ ኩጮ ታ ዒዛ ባንሢ ዔቂሴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:2">ሼምፔላ ጋዓንቴ ታኣኮ ዶዲፆ ዒፄኔ።<verse eid="PSA 77:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 77:3"/>ፆኦሲ ዛሎ ታ ማላ ዎዶና ታ ዖዬኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:3">ዒናፓ ታ ማላዛ ዒና ታኣኮ ዶጬኔ።<verse eid="PSA 77:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 77:4"/>ዋንቶ ጉቤ ኔ ታና ጴቼኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:4">ዖዪፃ ታኣኮ ሚርጌሢሮ ጌስታኒ ታ ዳንዳዒባኣሴ።<verse eid="PSA 77:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 77:5"/>ጊንሢም ዓኣዼ ኬሎ ታ ማሌኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:5">ሚና ዓኣ ሌዖዋ ማሊ ታ ጶቂሤኔ።<verse eid="PSA 77:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 77:6"/>ዋንቶ ታ ዓይናዼ ዓይኑሞ ማሌኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:6">ታኣኮ ዒኖና ታ ጌስቴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:6">ታ ዓያኖና ታ ማላዖ፦<verse eid="PSA 77:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 77:7"/>«ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ኑና ጋፒ ኬኬኤሪያ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:7">ሃካፓ ሴካ ፔ ኮሹሞ ዒ ፔቴታዖ ዻዋዓዳ?<verse eid="PSA 77:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 77:8"/>ዒዛኮ ማኣሪፃኣ ኑኡም ናንጊና ባይቂያ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:8">ጫኣቁማኣ ሃካፓ ሴካ ዶዲ ዴዑዋዓዳ?<verse eid="PSA 77:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 77:9"/>ፆኦሲ ፔኤኮ ኮሹሞ ዋሊያ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:9">ዻጎይዳፓ ዔቄያና ሚጪንቶ ዒ ሃሺያ?» ጌዔኔ።<verse eid="PSA 77:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 77:10"/>ታኣኒ፦ «ዼኤፖ ፆኦዛሢኮ ሚዛቆ ኩጫ ላኣሚንቴያ ማሂ ማሊፃ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:10">ታኣኮ ላቢሢኬ» ጌዔኔ።<verse eid="PSA 77:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 77:11"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳኮ ማዾ ታ ጶቂሣኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:11">ሚና ዒ ፔ ዎልቆና ማዻ ዲቃሣ ማዻ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:11">ጎኔና ታኣም ጶቃኔ።<verse eid="PSA 77:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 77:12"/>ማዾ ቢያ ታ ኔኤኮ ማላኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:12">ዲቃሣ ዓኮ ማዾ ቢያ ማሊ ታ ሱካኔ።<verse eid="PSA 77:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 77:13"/>ፆኦሲዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:13">ኔኤኒ ማዻ ባካ ቢያ ዱማዼያኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:13">ኔጉዴያ ዼኤፒ ፆኦሲ ዖናዳይ?<verse eid="PSA 77:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 77:14"/>ኔ ዎልቄና ማዺንታ ዓኪ ባኣዚ ማዻይ ኔናኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:14">ሜሌ ዴሮ ባኣካ ኔ ዎልቆ ኔ ፔጋሲ ዻዋኔ።<verse eid="PSA 77:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 77:15"/>ያይቆኦቤንታ ዮሴፔንታ ናኣቶ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:15">ኔ ዎልቆና ዴሮ ኔኤኮ ማሂ ሻንቂ ኔኤኒ ዓውሴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 77:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 77:16"/>ፆኦሲዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:16">ዋኣፃ ኔና ዛጋዖ ዒጊጬኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:16">ዔቶ ባዞ ዋኣፃኣ ጎጋይቄኔ።<verse eid="PSA 77:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 77:17"/>ሻኣራ ዒሮ ዋርቄኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:17">ጫሪንጫ ጉጉንፃ ጉጉንሤኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:17">ዜኤሊንፃኣ ጫሪንጫፓ ቢያ ባንፆና ፖዔኔ።<verse eid="PSA 77:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 77:18"/>ኔኤኮ ጉጉንሣ ዑኡዛ ዓልጋሢ ዢባሮይዳ ዋይዚንቴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:18">ዜኤሊንፃ ኔኤኮ ዓጮ ፖዒሴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:18">ሳዓ ጎጋይቂ ዓጊፄኔ።<verse eid="PSA 77:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 77:19"/>ኔኤኮ ጎይፃ ባዞ ዋኣፆይዴና ዓኣዻኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:19">ኔ ሃንቲፃ ዼኤፖ ዋኣፆይዳኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:19">ኮጲሲ ጋዓንቴ ኔኤኮ ጴዺባኣሴ።<verse eid="PSA 77:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 77:20"/>ሙሴና ዓኣሮኔና ዎላ ኔ ማዒ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:20">ዴሮ ኔኤኮ ዓዳ ማራይጉዲ ዔኪ ኔ ዓኣዼኔ።<verse eid="PSA 77:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 77"/>
  <chapter number="78" style="c" sid="PSA 78"/>
  <para style="s1">ዓሳኣፔ ዔራቶና ካላሌ ካላሊ</para>
  <para style="d">ፆኦሲና ዒዛኮ ዴሮና</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 78:1"/>ታ ዴሬዮቴ! ታ ዔርዛ ባኮ ዋይዙዋቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:1">ታ ቃኣሎዋ ዒና ዔኩዋቴ።<verse eid="PSA 78:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 78:2"/>ሃይሶ ታኣኮ ታኣኒ ኮኦኪንሢና ዓርቃንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:2">ሚናፓ ዓኣቺ ዓማሎ ዓማሊና ታ ኬኤዛንዳኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">78፡2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:35">ማቲ. 13፡35</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 78:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 78:3"/>ዬይ ኑኡኒ ዔሬሢና ዋይዜሢኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:3">ኑ ዓዶንሢያ ኑኡም ኬኤዜሢኬ።<verse eid="PSA 78:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 78:4"/>ዬንሢ ባኮ ኑ ናኣቶም ኑ ዓኣቻዓኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:4">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳኮ ዎልቆ ዛሎ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:4">ዒዚ ማዼ ዼኤፖ ማዾና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:4">ዒ ፔ ዎልቆና ማዼ ዲቃሢ ሄርሺሳ ባኮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:4">ሙካ ሾይንቶም ኑ ኬኤዛንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 78:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 78:5"/>ዒዚ ያይቆኦቤም ዳምቤ ኬሴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:5">ዒስራዔኤሌይዳኣ ዎጌ ዒ ጌሤኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:5">ናኣቶ ፔኤኮ ዔያታ ዔርዛንዳንጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:5">ኑ ዓዶንሢም ዓይሤኔ።<verse eid="PSA 78:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 78:6"/>ዬያ ሙካ ሾይንታ ዔራንዳጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:6">ዔያታ ፔ ዎዶና ዔያቶኮ ናኣቶም</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:6">ሃጊ ሾይንታዞንሢማኣ ኬኤዛንዳጉዲኬ።<verse eid="PSA 78:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 78:7"/>ዬያይዶናሢሮ ዔያታ ፆኦሲ ጉሙርቃንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:7">ዒዛኮ ማዾዋ ዔያታ ዋላዓኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:7">ዓይሢፆዋ ዔያታ ካፓንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 78:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 78:8"/>ጋዓንቴ ዔያታ ፔ ዓዶንሢጉዲ ዋይዚፆና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:8">ዓይሢንቲፆዋ ዒፃ፥ ዒኖዋ ፔኤኮ ፒዚሲባኣ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:8">ዓያናኣ ፆኦሲ ጉሙርቁዋ ሾይንቲ ማዓዓኬ።<verse eid="PSA 78:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 78:9"/>ሂኢዦና ዖላ ዔፕሬኤሜ ናኣታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:9">ሂኢዦ ዓርቄያ ማዔያታቴያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:9">ዖሎ ኬሎና ጊንሢም ዔያታ ማዔኔ።<verse eid="PSA 78:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 78:10"/>ፆኦሲ ጫኣቄ ጫኣቁሞ ዔያታ ካፒባኣሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:10">ዒዛኮ ዎጎ ጎይፆ ዓኣዺፆዋ ዒፄኔ።<verse eid="PSA 78:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 78:11"/>ዒዚ ማዼ ማዾ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:11">ዔያቶ ዒ ዻዌ ዲቃሣ ዓኮ ባኮዋ ዔያታ ዋሌኔ።<verse eid="PSA 78:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 78:12"/>ዓዶንሢ ዔያቶኮ ፔ ዓኣፖና ዛጋንቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:12">ጊብፄ ዓጫ ፆዓኔ ጌይንታ ቤዛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:12">ዒ ፔ ዎልቆና ማዺንታ ዓኪ ባኣዚ ማዼኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">78፡12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 7:8-12:32">ኬሲ. ማፃ 7፡8—12፡32</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 78:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 78:13"/>ባዞ ፓቂ ዔያቶ ዒ ፒንሤኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:13">ዋኣፆዋ ናቲጉዲ ዔቂሴኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">78፡13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 14:21-22">ኬሲ. ማፃ 14፡21-22</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 78:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 78:14"/>ሮኦሮ ሻኣሬና ዔኪ ዔያቶ ዓኣዼኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:14">ዋንቶዋ ቢያ ታሚ ፆምፔ ዔያቶም ፖዔኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">78፡14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:21-22">ኬሲ. ማፃ 13፡21-22</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 78:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 78:15"/>ዓሳ ናንጉዋ ዳውሎይዳ ላሎ ዹኡሴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:15">ዬካፓ ባዚ ዋኣሢጉዴ ሚርጌ ዋኣሢ ዒ ዔያቶ ዑሼኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">78፡15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 17:1-7">ኬሲ. ማፃ 17፡1-7</ref>፤ <ref loc="NUM 20:2-13">ፓይ. ማፃ 20፡2-13</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 78:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 78:16"/>ሹጮ ዼኤፓፓ ዓልቃ ዋኣሢ ዑሬኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:16">ዋኣፆ ዎርዚጉዲ ዎይሴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 78:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 78:17"/>ዔያታ ጋዓንቴ ዓሲ ናንጉዋ ዳውሎይዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:17">ዼኤፖ ፆኦዛሢም ዋይዞ ዒፂፆና ጎሜ ማዺሢዳፓ ማዒባኣሴ።<verse eid="PSA 78:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 78:18"/>ኮሺ ዔያቶ ዓፃሴ ሙኡዚ ዖኦጪሢና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:18">ዔያታ ዒኖና ዔሬያታዖ «ፆኦሲ ዎይታቴያ» ጌዒ ዛጌኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">78፡18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 16:2-15">ኬሲ. ማፃ 16፡2-15</ref>፤ <ref loc="NUM 11:4-23">ፓይ. ማፃ 11፡4-23</ref>፤<ref loc="NUM 11:31-35">31-35</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 78:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 78:19"/>ፆኦሲ ዑፃ ጉንዱሚ ጌስቴሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:19">«ፆኦሲ ዓሲ ናንጉዋ ዳውሎይዳ ሙኡዚ ጊኢጊሺ ዒንጋኒ ዳንዳዓ?<verse eid="PSA 78:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 78:20"/>ዒዚ ላሎ ዹኡሲሢና ዋኣፆ ዲጲጉዲ ዎይሴሢ ጎኔኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:20">ሂዴቴያ ሙኡዚ ኑም ዒንጋኒና ዓሽኪ ጊኢጊሻኒ ዳንዳዓኔ ጌይሢዳ?» ጌዔኔ።<verse eid="PSA 78:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 78:21"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዬያ ዋይዛዖ ሚርጌና ዻጋዼኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:21">ያይቆኦቤ ዑፆይዳ ታሚ ዔኤቴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:21">ዻጋ ዒዛኮ ዒስራዔኤሌይዳ ዔቄኔ።<verse eid="PSA 78:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 78:22"/>ዔያታ ዒዛ ጉሙርቂባኣሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:22">ዒዛኮ ዓውሲፆናኣ ጌኤቂንቲባኣሴ።<verse eid="PSA 78:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 78:23"/>ዒዚ ጋዓንቴ ሎፓ ሻኣሮ ዓይሤኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:23">ጫሪንጮኮዋ ካሮ ቡሌኔ።<verse eid="PSA 78:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 78:24"/>ዔያታ ሙዓንዳጉዲ ማና ዒ ዲኢኒሼኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:24">ጫሪንቺዳ ዓኣ ሙኡዚ ዔያቶም ዒንጌኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">78፡24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:31">ዮሃ. 6፡31</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 78:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 78:25"/>ዓሲ ኪኢታንቾ ካሦ ሙዔኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:25">ሚሽኪ ዶምባ ዓይሳንዳያ ሄላንዳኣና</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:25">ሙዖ ዔያቶም ዒንጌኔ።<verse eid="PSA 78:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 78:26"/>ጫሪንጫፓ ዓባ ኬስካ ባንፆ ዢባሮ ዒ ዔቂሴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:26">ዾኦሎ ባንፆ ዢባሮዋ ዔኪ ሙኬኔ።<verse eid="PSA 78:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 78:27"/>ዓሽኪ ዔያቶም ዓጪጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:27">ባራና ካፖዋ ባዞ ዓጮ ማኣሻሎጉዲ ዒ ኬይሴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 78:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 78:28"/>ዔያቶኮ ጉርዶ ባኣኮይዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:28">ዓፒሎና ማዢንቴ ማኣሮ ኮራኣ ኬይሴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 78:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 78:29"/>ዔያታ ሚሽካንዳያ ሄላንዳኣና ሙዔኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:29">ዔያታ ሚርጌና ዓፃዼ ባኮ ዔያቶም ዒ ዒንጌኔ።<verse eid="PSA 78:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 78:30"/>ጋዓንቴ ሃጊ ሱኡካ ዔያቶኮ ማዑዋንቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:30">ሙዓ ዔያቶኮ ዻንጋ ዓኣ ጎይሣ ዓኣንቴ<verse eid="PSA 78:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 78:31"/>ፆኦሲኮ ጎሪንታ ዔያቶ ዑፃ ሙኬኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:31">ዔያቶ ባኣካፓ «ኑ ዶዲኬ» ጋዓ ዓሶ ዎዼኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:31">ሃጋ ቡኖ ማዔ ዼጌሢያ ማንፄኔ።<verse eid="PSA 78:31"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 78:32"/>ዬይ ቢያ ማዔንቴያ ዔያታ ፔኤኮ ዻቢንቶና ዶዴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:32">ዒዚ ማዻ ዲቃሣ ባኮዋ ዔያታ ጉሙርቂባኣሴ።<verse eid="PSA 78:32"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 78:33"/>ዬያሮ ዎዶ ዔያታ ፔኤሲ ጉሪ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:33">ናንጎዋ ዲቃቲሢና ጋፒሴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 78:33"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 78:34"/>ዒዚ ዔያቶ ዎዼ ዎዶና ዔያታ ዒዛ ኮዔኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:34">ዒናፓ ኮዒሢና ዒዛ ባንሢ ማዔኔ።<verse eid="PSA 78:34"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 78:35"/>ፆኦሲ ዔያቶኮ ላላሢ ማዔሢ ዔያታ ጶቂሤኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:35">ዼኤፖ ፆኦዛሢ ዔያቶ ዓውሳሢ ማዔሢያ ማሌኔ።<verse eid="PSA 78:35"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 78:36"/>ጋዓንቴ ዔያታ ፔ ዻንጎና ዒዛ ጌሼኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:36">ዬያ ዻንጎና ዒዛም ዔያታ ሉኡቄኔ።<verse eid="PSA 78:36"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 78:37"/>ዒና ዔያቶኮ ዒዛና ዶዲባኣያኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:37">ዒዛኮ ጫኣቁሞማኣ ጉሙርቂንቲባኣሴ።<verse eid="PSA 78:37"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 78:38"/>ዒዚ ጋዓንቴ ማኣራያ ማዔ ጎይፆና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:38">ዻቢንቶ ዔያቶሲ ዓቶም ጌዔኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:38">ዔያቶ ዒዚ ባይዚባኣሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:38">ዻጎዋ ሚርጌ ዎዴ ቲኢሬኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:38">ዱማ ዱማ ዎዻ ባኮዋ ዔያቶይዳ ዒ ኬይሲባኣሴ።<verse eid="PSA 78:38"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 78:39"/>ኬስካዖ ማዑዋ ዢባሬጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:39">ዔያታ ዓሲ ማዔሢያ ዒ ማሌኔ።<verse eid="PSA 78:39"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 78:40"/>ዓሲ ናንጉዋ ዳውሎይዳ ዎማይዲ ዔያታ ዋይዞ ዒፄይ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:40">ዬያ ዳውሎይዳ ዎማዼ ዒዛ ዖዪሴይ!<verse eid="PSA 78:40"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 78:41"/>ፆኦሲ ዎይታቴያ ጌዒ ላሚ ላሚ ዔያታ ዛጌኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:41">ዒስራዔኤሌኮ ዱማዼሢያ ዔያታ ዻጋሴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 78:41"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 78:42"/>ዔያቶ ዬኖ ዎዶና ሞርካፓ ዒ ዓውሴሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:42">ዬያ ዎልቆ ዒዛኮ ዔያታ ማሊ ጶቂሢባኣሴ።<verse eid="PSA 78:42"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 78:43"/>ጊብፄ ዓጫ ዒ ፔ ዎልቆና ማዻ ዓኮ ባኮ ማላቶ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:43">ፆዓኔ ጌይንታ ዓሳ ናንጉዋ ዳውላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:43">ዒዚ ዻዌ ዲቃሢ ሄርሺሳ ማዾ ዔያታ ማሊባኣሴ።<verse eid="PSA 78:43"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 78:44"/>ዎሮ ዋኣፆ ዔያቶኮ ዒ ሱጉሢ ማሄኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:44">ዛሮ ዋኣፆ ዑሽካኒ ዔያታ ዳንዳዒባኣሴ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">78፡44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 7:17-21">ኬሲ. ማፃ 7፡17-21</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 78:44"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 78:45"/>ሻኣሬጉዴ ሶኦፆምቦ ዉፃሌ ዔያቶም ዒ ዳኬኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:45">ዬይ ሶኦፆምባሢያ ዔያቶ ዻዔኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:45">ፓንቆዋ ዔያቶም ዳኬኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:45">ዬይያ ዓሶኮ ካራ ባይዜኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">78፡45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 8:1-6">ኬሲ. ማፃ 8፡1-6</ref>፤ <ref loc="EXO 20:24">20፡24</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 78:45"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 78:46"/>ባቃሎ ዔያቶኮ ማኮም</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:46">ሃኣኮዋ ዔያቶኮ ዒ ዓቢሢም ዒንጌኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">78፡46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 10:12-15">ኬሲ. ማፃ 10፡12-15</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 78:46"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 78:47"/>ቱኮና ዎይኖ ዔያቶኮ ሻቺና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:47">ቤሌሶ ሚፆዋ ቃኣዮና ዒ ዎዺሺ ባይዜኔ።<verse eid="PSA 78:47"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 78:48"/>ባኣቶ ዔያቶኮ ሻቺና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:48">ሃንጎ ቆልሞዋ ጉጉንሢና ዎዼኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">78፡48 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 9:22-25">ኬሲ. ማፃ 9፡22-25</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 78:48"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="PSA 78:49"/>ፔኤኮ ዒ ዶዶ ዻጎ ዔያቶ ዑፃ ዳኬኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:49">ዱማ ዱማ ዎዻ ባኮንታ ዒ ሌሊ ካኣሽኪንታኒ ኮዓ ዻጎዋ ኬይሴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:49">ዖሊ ባይዛ ኪኢታንቾዋ ዔያቶይዳ ዳኬኔ።<verse eid="PSA 78:49"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="PSA 78:50"/>ጎሪንቲም ጎይሢ ዒዚ ጲሼኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:50">ዔያቶኮ ሼምፓሢ ሃይቢዳፓ ዓውሲባኣሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:50">ሼምፓሢ ዔያቶኮ ዱማ ዱማ ዎዻ ባኮም ዓኣሢ ዒንጌኔ።<verse eid="PSA 78:50"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="PSA 78:51"/>ዔያቶ ዼጋቶ ዎልቆኮ ቤርቶ ማዔዞንሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:51">ካኣሜኮ ዓፒሎና ኮሾና ማኣራ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:51">ቶይዶ ናኣቶዋ ዔያቶኮ ቢያ ጊብፄ ዓጫ ዒ ጋፒሲ ዎዼኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">78፡51 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:29">ኬሲ. ማፃ 12፡29</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 78:51"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="PSA 78:52"/>ዴሮ ፔኤኮ ዓዳ ማራይጉዲ ሄንቃኒ ኬሴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:52">ዓሲ ናንጉዋ ዳውሎይዳ ማራይ ጎይሢ ሄንቄኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">78፡52 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:17-22">ኬሲ. ማፃ 13፡17-22</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 78:52"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="PSA 78:53"/>ኮሺና ዔያቶ ዒ ዔኪ ዓኣዼሢሮ ዔያታ ዒጊጪባኣሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:53">ሞርኮ ዔያቶኮ ጋዓንቴ ባዛ ሙዔኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">78፡53 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 14:26-28">ኬሲ. ማፃ 14፡26-28</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 78:53"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="PSA 78:54"/>ዒዛኮ ሚዛቆ ኩጮና ዒ ዓርቄ ዹኮ ባንሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:54">ዒዛም ዱማዼ ዓጬሎዋ ዔያቶ ዒ ጌልዜኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">78፡54 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 15:17">ኬሲ. ማፃ 15፡17</ref>፤ <ref loc="JOS 3:14-17">ዒያ. 3፡14-17</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 78:54"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="PSA 78:55"/>ሜሌ ዴሮ ዔያቶ ቤርታፓ ዳውሴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:55">ዬያ ዓሶኮ ዓጮ ዔያቶ ዴኔ ማሂ ዒዚ ጊሽኬኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:55">ዒስራዔኤሌ ዓሶ ፃጶ ዔያቶ ሞርኮ ማኣራ ናንጊሼኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">78፡55 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 11:16-23">ዒያ. 11፡16-23</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 78:55"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="PSA 78:56"/>ዔያታ ጋዓንቴ ዼኤፖ ፆኦዛሢ ዎይታቴያ ጌይ ዛጌኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:56">ዋይዚያ ዒዛም ዔያታ ዒፄኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:56">ዳምቦዋ ዒዛሲ ካፒባኣሴ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">78፡56 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 2:11-15">ሱኡጎ. ማፃ 2፡11-15</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 78:56"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="PSA 78:57"/>ዔያቶኮ ዓዶንሢጉዲ ዒዛም ዋይዙዋያ ማዔኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:57">ጉሙርሱዋ ዎቦ ሂኢሺጉዲ ዔያታ ማዔኔ።<verse eid="PSA 78:57"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="PSA 78:58"/>ጌሜሮይዳ ሜሌ ፆኦዞ ካኣሽኮ ቤዞ ኮሺሢና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:58">ዔያታ ዒዛ ዻጋሴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:58">ዓርሲ ኮሾና ሜሌ ፆኦዞ ካኣሽኪፆና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:58">ዻጎ ዒዛኮ ዔያታ ዔቂሴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 78:58"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="PSA 78:59"/>ፆኦሲ ዬያ ዋይዜ ዎዶና ሚርጌና ዻጋዼኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:59">ዒስራዔኤሌ ዓሶዋ ጋፒ ዒዚ ሃሼኔ።<verse eid="PSA 78:59"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="PSA 78:60"/>ዓሶ ባኣካ ዒዚ ዾቄ ዓፒላፓ ኮሾና ማኣሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:60">ሴኤሎይዳ ፔኤኮ ዎርቆ ቤዞ ዒ ሃሼኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">78፡60 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 18:1">ዒያ. 18፡1</ref>፤ <ref loc="JER 7:12-14">ዔር. 7፡12-14</ref>፤ <ref loc="JER 26:6">26፡6</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 78:60"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="PSA 78:61"/>ዒዛኮ ዎልቆ ማላታ ማዔ ጫኣቁሞ ታኣቦቶ ዲዒሴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:61">ዒዛኮ ቦንቾዋ ሞርኮም ዓኣሢ ዒንጌኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">78፡61 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 4:4-22">1ሳሙ. 4፡4-22</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 78:61"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="PSA 78:62"/>ዴሮ ፔኤሲ ዒዚ ጬንቾ ዓፓሮም ማሄኔ።</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:62">ፔ ዴሮይዳ ሚርጌና ዒ ዻጋዼኔ።<verse eid="PSA 78:62"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="PSA 78:63"/>ዼጌሢ ዔያቶኮ ታሚ ሙዔኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:63">ዉዱሮ ናኣቶማኣ ዔፒ ጋኣዴ ጋኣዲንቲባኣሴ።<verse eid="PSA 78:63"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="PSA 78:64"/>ቄኤሳ ዔያቶኮ ጬንቻ ዓፓሮና ዎዺንቴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:64">ዔያቶ ላኣላ ዬኤካኒ ዔያቶ ዳንዳዒባኣሴ።<verse eid="PSA 78:64"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="PSA 78:65"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ጊንዓፓ ጴጫ ዓሲጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:65">ዳጋሢ ማሤ ዓሲ ማሢንታዖ ጫርቃሢጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:65">ጫርሺ ዓሲ ማዒ ዔቄኔ።<verse eid="PSA 78:65"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="PSA 78:66"/>ሞርካ ዒዛኮ ባሺንቲ ጊንሢም ጳሽካንዳጉዲና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:66">ናንጊና ጋፑዋ ቦርሲንቲ ቦርሲንታንዳጉዲ ማሄኔ።<verse eid="PSA 78:66"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="PSA 78:67"/>ዮሴፔኮ ዓፒሎና ማዢንቴ ማኣሮ ዒዚ ሃሼኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:67">ዔፕሬኤሜ ፃጶዋ ዒዚ ዶኦሪባኣሴ።<verse eid="PSA 78:67"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="PSA 78:68"/>ጋዓንቴ ዪሁዳ ፃጶ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:68">ዒዚ ሚርጌና ናሽኬ ፂዮኔ ዹኮ ዶኦሬኔ።<verse eid="PSA 78:68"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="PSA 78:69"/>ፔኤኮ ጌኤዦ ማኣሮ ኮሺ ዼጋያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:69">ናንጊና ናንጋያ ማሂ ሳዖ ዒ ዶዲሺ ማዤ ጎይፆ ማዤኔ።<verse eid="PSA 78:69"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="PSA 78:70"/>ፔኤኮ ዓይላሢ ዳውቴ ዒ ዶኦሬኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:70">ማራቶ ሄንቆ ቤዛፓ ዒ ዔኬኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">78፡70 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 16:11-12">1ሳሙ. 16፡11-12</ref>፤ <ref loc="2SA 7:8">2ሳሙ. 7፡8</ref>፤ <ref loc="1CH 17:7">1ፆኦሲ. ዓሃኬ 17፡7</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 78:70"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="PSA 78:71"/>ፔ ዴሮ ያይቆኦቤ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:71">ዒዛ ዴኖ ማዔ ዒስራዔኤሌ ሄንቃንዳንጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:71">ማራቶ ሄንቂፃፓ ዔኪ ሙኬኔ።<verse eid="PSA 78:71"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="PSA 78:72"/>ዬካፓ ዒዚ ፒዜ ዒናና ዔያቶ ሄንቄኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:72">ዔራቶናኣ ዔኪ ዔያቶ ዓኣዼኔ።<verse eid="PSA 78:72"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 78"/>
  <chapter number="79" style="c" sid="PSA 79"/>
  <para style="s1">ዓሳኣፔ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="d">ዴሮኮ ኮሹሞ ዛላ ሺኢቂንቴ ሺኢጲሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 79:1"/>ፆኦሲዮ! ሜሌ ዴራ ዴኖ ኔኤኮ ዓርቄኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:1">ኔኤኮ ዱማዼ ጌኤዦ ማኣሮዋ ዔያታ ዒኢሴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:1">ዬሩሳላሜ ሻሂ ዔያታ ባይዜኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">79፡1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:8-10">2ካኣቶ. ማ 25፡8-10</ref>፤ <ref loc="2CH 36:17-19">2ፆኦሲ. ዓሃኬ 36፡17-19</ref>፤ <ref loc="JER 52:12-14">ዔር. 52፡12-14</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 79:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 79:2"/>ኔ ዓይሎኮ ሌዞ ጫሪንጮ ካፖም</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:2">ኔኤኮ ዱማዼዞንሢኮዋ ዓሽኮ ካዮ ቦዖም</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:2">ሙኡዚ ማሂ ዔያታ ዒንጌኔ።<verse eid="PSA 79:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 79:3"/>ሱጉፆ ዔያቶኮ ዬሩሳላሜይዳ ዓዳ ዋኣሢጉዲ ዔያታ ላኣሌኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:3">ዬያ ዓሶ ዱኡካ ዓሲያ ጴዺባኣሴ።<verse eid="PSA 79:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 79:4"/>ኑኡኒ ኑ ዓሺኖም ሚኢቺ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:4">ኑ ኮይላ ዓኣ ዓሶማኣ ዓማሊ ባኣዚ ማዔኔ።<verse eid="PSA 79:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 79:5"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ሃይ ዓይዲ ሄላንዳኣናዳይ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:5">ኔኤኒ ዻጋዻሢ ናንጊና ጋፑዋያዳ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:5">ሜሌ ካኣሽኪንቱዋጉዲ ኮዓ ኔ ማሊፃ ታሚጉዲ ዔኤቴ ጎይሣ ናናንጋ?<verse eid="PSA 79:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 79:6"/>ኔና ዔሩዋ ሜሌ ዴሮ ዑፃ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:6">ሱንፆዋ ኔኤኮ ዔኤሉዋ ካኣቶ ዑፃ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:6">ዱማ ዱማ ኔኤኮ ዎዻ ባኮ ዳኬ።<verse eid="PSA 79:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 79:7"/>ዔያታ ያይቆኦቤ ሙዔኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:7">ዔያቶኮ ናንጎ ቤዞዋ ዓሲ ናንጉዋ ዳውሌ ማሄኔ።<verse eid="PSA 79:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 79:8"/>ኑ ዓዶንሢ ጎሞ ኑ ዑፃ ማሂፖ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:8">ማኣሪፃ ኔኤኮ ዑኬና ኑ ባንሢ ሙኮንጎ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:8">ኑኡኒ ዓኣሢያ ሜቶይዳኬ።<verse eid="PSA 79:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 79:9"/>ኑና ዓውሳያ ማዔ ፆኦዛሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:9">ኔ ሱንፆ ቦንቾሮ ጌዒ ኑና ማኣዴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:9">ኔ ሱንፆሮ ጌዒያ ሄሊ ኑና ዓውሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:9">ጎሞዋ ኑኡኮ ዓቶም ጌዔ።<verse eid="PSA 79:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 79:10"/>ዴራ፦ «ፆኦዛሢ ዔያቶኮ ዎካዳዖ?» ዓይጎሮ ጋዓይ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:10">ኔኤም ማዻ ዓሶ ሱጉፆ ዛሎ ኮሞ ኮፄ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:10">ኑ ዓኣፓ ዛጋንቴ ዬያ ማዼ።<verse eid="PSA 79:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 79:11"/>ቱኪንቲ ዓኣ ዓሶኮ ሜቶ ዒላታ ኔ ቤርቶ ሄሎንጎ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:11">ሃይቆንጎ ጌይ ዎጊንቴ ዓሶዋ ኔ ዎልቆና ዓውሴ።<verse eid="PSA 79:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 79:12"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ኑ ዓሺና ኔና ሚኢጬ ሚኢጮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:12">ላንካይ ጳንጬ ማሂ ዔያቶ ኮንቂሴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 79:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 79:13"/>ኑኡኒ ኔኤኮ ዴራ፥ ኔኤኒ ሄንቃ ማራታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:13">ናንጊና ጋላታ ኔኤም ሺኢሻኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:13">ሾይንታፓ ሾይንቲ ሄላንዳኣና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:13">ኔ ኑም ማዼ ባኮ ኑ ኬኤዛንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 79:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 79"/>
  <chapter number="80" style="c" sid="PSA 80"/>
  <para style="s1">«ጫኣቁሞ ቡኒ» ጌይንታ ዓይኑሞና ሱኡጋሢ ዓይሣ ጎይፆ ዓይናዺንታ ዓሳኣፔ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="d">ዒስራዔኤሌ ካኣታ ጊንሣ ዶዳንዳጉዲ ሺኢቂንቴ ሺኢጲሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 80:1"/>ዮሴፔ ማራይጉዲ ሄንቃ፥ ዒስራዔኤሌያ ሄንቃሦ ኑም ዋይዜ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:1">ኪሩቤኤሎይዳ ዓኣ ካኣቱሞ ዖይታ ዴዓሦ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:1">ኔኤኮ ፖዖና ፔጋዺ ጴዼ።<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">80፡1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:22">ኬሲ. ማፃ 25፡22</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 80:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 80:2"/>ዔፕሬኤሜንታ ቢኢኒያሜንታ ሚናሴንታም</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:2">ኔና ፔጋሲ ዻዌ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:2">ዎልቆ ኔኤሲ ዓጊሤ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:2">ሙኪያ ኑና ዓውሴ።<verse eid="PSA 80:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 80:3"/>ፆኦሲዮ! ኑና ማሄ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:3">ኑ ዻቃንዳጉዲ ኔ ዓኣፖ ካሮ ኑኡም ፖዒሤ።<verse eid="PSA 80:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 80:4"/>ቢያ ባኮ ዎይሣ ጎዳ ማዔ ዼኤፖ ፆኦዛሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:4">ኔ ዴሮኮ ሺኢጲፆ ዋይዞ ዒፂ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:4">ጎሪንቶ ኔኤኮ ኔ ቤኤዛሢ ዎማ ሄላንዳኣናዳይ?<verse eid="PSA 80:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 80:5"/>ዖዪሢ ዓዳ ሙኡዚጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:5">ዓቢሢያ ዑሺጉዲ ሚርጌና ኔ ዔያቶ ዑሼኔ።<verse eid="PSA 80:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 80:6"/>ኑ ዓሺኖም ኔ ኑና ዑራ ማዣ ዓሲ ማሄኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:6">ኑኡኮ ሞርካኣ ኑና ሚኢጬኔ።<verse eid="PSA 80:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 80:7"/>ቢያ ባኮ ዳንዳዓ ፆኦዛሢዮ! ኑና ማሄ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:7">ኑ ዻቃንዳጉዲ ኔ ዓኣፖ ካሮ ኑም ፖዒሴ።<verse eid="PSA 80:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 80:8"/>ጊብፄ ዓጫፓ ዎይኔ ዞንዜ ኔ ዔኪ ሙኬኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:8">ሜሌ ዴሮ ዳውሲ ዔያቶ ቤዛ ዬያ ኔ ቱኬኔ።<verse eid="PSA 80:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 80:9"/>ዬይ ዑጋንዳ ቤዞ ኔ ጲሺ ጊኢጊሼኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:9">ዬያሮ ፃጲ ዳኪ ዓጬሎ ባልጊ ኩሜኔ።<verse eid="PSA 80:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 80:10"/>ዹካ ዬያ ዒላዦና ሺቢንቴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:10">ዼኤፖ ዚቢቃኣ ዬያ ካኣፖ ዴማ ዔቄኔ።<verse eid="PSA 80:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 80:11"/>ዬይ ካኣፓ ዴንዲ ባዞ ሄላንዳኣና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:11">ቶሻኣ ዔፕራፂሴ ዎሮ ሄላንዳኣና ጋምፒንቴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 80:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 80:12"/>ዓካሪ ዒኢና ሊካ ሌካ ጋዓሢ ዓኣፖ ዬያ ማንፃንዳጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:12">ዲፆ ኔኤኒ ዓይጋ ሻሄይ?<verse eid="PSA 80:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 80:13"/>ጉዱንፃ ካያፓ ኬስኪ ዬያ ፑርቲሳንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:13">ቆልማ ሄንቃ ቤዛ ዲርጋ ቆልማ ቢያ ሙዓንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 80:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 80:14"/>ቢያ ባኮ ዎይሣ ጎዳሢዮ! ዓካሪ ኑ ባንሢ ማዔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:14">ጫሪንጫፓ ሊካ ኑ ባንሢ ዛጌ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:14">ሃኖ ኔኤኒ ቱኬ ዎይኔሎ ዛጊ ካፔ።<verse eid="PSA 80:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 80:15"/>ሃይ ኔኤኮ ሚዛቆ ኩጫ ቱኬ ባቃላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:15">ኔ ዛላ ማሂ ኔ ባቃልሴ ናዓሢኬ።<verse eid="PSA 80:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 80:16"/>ዬይ ዎይናሢ ቲቂንቲ ታሚዳ ሚጬኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:16">ኔ ዻጎ ጎሪንታ ኔ ዓሶ ባይዛንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 80:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 80:17"/>ኔኤሮ ማሂ ኔኤኒ ዶዲሺ ዔቂሴ ዓሢ ዑፃ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:17">ኔኤኮ ሚዛቆ ዛላ ዓኣ ኔ ናዓሢ ዑፃ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:17">ኔ ኩጫ ማዖንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 80:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 80:18"/>ሃይካፓ ሴካ ኔና ሃሺ ጊንሢም ኑ ማዓዓኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:18">ናንጊና ባይቁዋያ ኑና ማሄ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:18">ኑኡኒያ ኔና ካኣሽካንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 80:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 80:19"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ማዔ ዼኤፖ ፆኦዛሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:19">ኑና ጊንሣ ቤዞ ማሄ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:19">ኑኡኒ ዻቃንዳጉዲ ኔ ዓኣፖ ካሮ ኑም ፖዒሴ።<verse eid="PSA 80:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 80"/>
  <chapter number="81" style="c" sid="PSA 81"/>
  <para style="s1">ዓይኑሞ ሱኡጋሢ ዓይሣ ጎይፆ ሹሉንጎና ዓይናዺንታ ዓሳኣፔ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="d">ቦንቾ ኬሊና ዓይናዺንታ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 81:1"/>ኑኡኮ ዶዱማሢ ማዔ ፆኦዛሢም ዓይናዹዋቴ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:1">ያይቆኦቤ ፆኦዛሢም ዒላሹዋቴ!<verse eid="PSA 81:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 81:2"/>ዓይኑሞ ዓርቁዋቴ፥ ታምቡሮዋ ባዑዋቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:2">ፔቴ ሻሺና ዴንሢ ዋርቆ ጎኦሎንታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:2">ሜሌ ዓይኑሞ ዓንጋሞዋ ዴንሢ ኮሺ ዑኡሲና ዓይናዹዋቴ።<verse eid="PSA 81:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 81:3"/>ዓጊና ፄኤራኣና ጊንሣ ዋኣፃ ጌላኣና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:3">ዼኤፖ ቦንቾ ኬሎናይዳኣ ዛዬ ዋርቁዋቴ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">81፡3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 10:10">ፓይ. ማፃ 10፡10</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 81:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 81:4"/>ዬይ ዒስራዔኤሌ ዓሶም ዒንጊንቴ ዳምቤ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:4">ያይቆኦቤ ፆኦዛሢ ኬሴ ዎጌኬ።<verse eid="PSA 81:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 81:5"/>ዒዚ ጊብፄ ዓጮይዳ ሜቶ ዓጌ ኬሎና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:5">ዬይ ዮሴፔም ኬሶናያኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:5">ታ ዔሩዋ ሙኡቺና ሂዚ ጋዓንቴ ታ ዋይዜኔ፦<verse eid="PSA 81:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 81:6"/>«ጌኤቶ ታ ዒዛኮ ኬዲዳፓ ሃውሺሴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:6">ኩጫ ዒ ዔካ ዴኤፆ ባኮ ታ ዒዛ ሃሺሴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 81:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 81:7"/>ኔና ሜቴ ዎዶና ኔ ታና ዔኤሌኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:7">ታኣኒያ ኔና ዓውሴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:7">ታ ዓኣሺንቲ ዓኣ ዹሞ ሻኣሮ ጉጉንፆሲ ባኣካ ዓኣዖ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:7">ታ ኔኤም ዋይዜኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:7">ዣላሢ ዎሮኮ ዋኣፃ ዓልቃ ቤዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:7">ኔ ዎይታቴያ ጌዒ ታ ኔና ዛጌኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">81፡7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 17:7">ኬሲ. ማፃ 17፡7</ref>፤ <ref loc="NUM 20:13">ፓይ. ማፃ 20፡13</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 81:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 81:8"/>ታ ዴሬዮቴ! ታ ላታ ባኮ ዋይዙዋቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:8">ዒስራዔኤሌ! ኔ ታኣም ዋይዛቴ ዓይጎ!<verse eid="PSA 81:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 81:9"/>ኔ ካኣሽካ ፃንጎ ፆኦሲ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:9">ሃሣ ዔርቱዋ ፆኦሲ ኔኤኮ ባኣያ ማዖንጎ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:9">ዬያ ካኣሽኪፖ።<verse eid="PSA 81:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 81:10"/>ጊብፄ ዓጫፓ ኔና ኬሴ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ማዔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:10">ኔ ፆኦዛሢ ታናኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:10">ዻንጎ ኔኤሲ ኮሺ ሾኦኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:10">ታኣኒ ኩንሢ ኩልሳንዳኔ።» <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">81፡10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:2-3">ኬሲ. ማፃ 20፡2-3</ref>፤ <ref loc="DEU 5:6-7">ላሚ. ዎማ 5፡6-7</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 81:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 81:11"/>«ታኣኮ ዴራ ጋዓንቴ ታኣም ዋይዚባኣሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:11">ዒስራዔኤሌ ዓሳኣ ታኣም ዓይሢንቲባኣሴ።<verse eid="PSA 81:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 81:12"/>ዬያሮ ዔያታ ማሌ ማሊፆጉዴያ ዓኣዻንዳጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:12">ዔያቶኮ ባይቄ ዒኖም ዓኣሢ ታ ዔያቶ ዒንጌኔ።<verse eid="PSA 81:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 81:13"/>ታ ዴራ ዎንዴ ታኣም ዋይዜያ ማዔያታቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:13">ዒስራዔኤሌ ዓሳ ታ ጎይፆና ዓኣዼያታቴ<verse eid="PSA 81:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 81:14"/>ቤዞና ታ ዔያቶኮ ሞርኮ ባሼያ ናንዳንቴኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:14">ዔያቶ ሞርኮ ዑፃ ታ ኩጮ ታ ዔቂሴያ ናንዳንቴኬ።<verse eid="PSA 81:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 81:15"/>ፆኦሲም ዋይዞ ዒፃ ዓሳ ዒዛ ቤርታ ዻውሲንታንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:15">ዔያቶ ሄላ ሜታሢያ ናንጊና ጋፑዋያ ማዓንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 81:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 81:16"/>ዒንሢ ታ ጋዓንቴ ኮሺ ዛርጌ ሙኡዛንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:16">ዑታሢ ዔኤዞና ታ ዒንሢ ሚሻንዳኔ።»<verse eid="PSA 81:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 81"/>
  <chapter number="82" style="c" sid="PSA 82"/>
  <para style="s1">ዓሳኣፔ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="d">ፆኦሲ ቢያፓ ዑሣ ማዔሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 82:1"/>ፆኦሲ ጫሪንጮ ቡኪንቶይዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 82:1">ሜሌ ፆኦዛ ቡካ ቡኪንቶይዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 82:1">ሙኪ ጴዺ ዎጌ ዎጋኔ፦<verse eid="PSA 82:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 82:2"/>«ዎጎ ዒንሢ ፒዜ ዎጉዋኣሢ ዎማ ሄላንዳኣናዳይ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 82:2">ፑርቶ ዓሶ ማኣዲ ዒንሢ ጌስታሢ ዓይዲ ሄላንዳኣናዳይ?<verse eid="PSA 82:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 82:3"/>ዎልቃባኣ ዓሶና ዜኤሮ ናኣቶናም ፒዜ ዎጉዋቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 82:3">ሜታዼሢና ማንቃሢና ሄርቂንቱዋጉዲ ማዹዋቴ።<verse eid="PSA 82:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 82:4"/>ዒጊኒ ባኣሢና ሜታዼሢና ሄሊ ዓውሱዋቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 82:4">ሄርቂ ዎይሣ ዓሶይዳፓ ዔያቶ ዓይሱዋቴ።»<verse eid="PSA 82:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 82:5"/>«ዔራቶና ማሊ ጶቂሥሢና ዒንሢኮ ባኣሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 82:5">ዹሚዳ ሴካ ሃንጋ ዒንሢ ሃንታኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 82:5">ሳዖኮዋ ዴማ ቢያ ካራና ዓጊፄኔ።<verse eid="PSA 82:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 82:6"/>ታኣኒ፦ ‹ዒንሢ ፆኦዞኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 82:6">ቢያሢ ዒንሢ ዼኤፖ ፆኦዛሢ ናኣቶኬ› ጌዔኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">82፡6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 10:34">ዮሃ. 10፡34</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 82:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 82:7"/>ጋዓንቴ ዒንሢ ዓሲ ሃይቃ ጎይሢ ሃይቃንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 82:7">ዎይሣ ሱኡጎ ጎይፆ ጉሪ ዒንሢ ሎኦማንዳኔ።»<verse eid="PSA 82:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 82:8"/>ፆኦሲዮ! ዔቄ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 82:8">ሳዖ ዴሮ ዑፃ ቢያ ዎጌ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 82:8">ዴራኣ ቢያ ኔኤሮኬ።<verse eid="PSA 82:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 82"/>
  <chapter number="83" style="c" sid="PSA 83"/>
  <para style="s1">ዒስራዔኤሌኮ ሞርካ ባሺንታንዳጉዲ ሺኢቂንቴ ሺኢጲሢ</para>
  <para style="d">ዓሳኣፔኮ ፆኦሲ ሄርሺፆ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 83:1"/>ፆኦሲዮ! ኔኤኒ ዚቲዮ ጌዒፖ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:1">ፆኦሲዮ! ኔኤኒ ጬዊዮ ጌዒፖ።<verse eid="PSA 83:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 83:2"/>ሞርካ ኔኤኮ ዎማይዲ ዔቄያታቴ ዛጌ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:2">ኔና ዒፃ ዓሳ ቶኦኮ ፔኤሲ ዎማይዲ ዼጊሴቴያ ዛጌ።<verse eid="PSA 83:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 83:3"/>ኔኤኮ ዴሮ ዑፃ ጌኔ ማዻኒ ዓኣቺ ጌስታኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:3">ኔኤኒ ካፓ ዓሶ ኮምባኒ ዔያታ ዞርታኔ።<verse eid="PSA 83:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 83:4"/>«ሃካፓ ሴካ ዒስራዔኤሌ ዓሶ ሱንፃ ዔርቱዋጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:4">ሃኒ ሙኩዋቴ ዴሬ ማዑዋጉዲ ኑ ዔያቶ ጋፒሶም» ጋዓኔ።<verse eid="PSA 83:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 83:5"/>ፔቴ ማሊሢና ዎላ ጊኢጊ ዔያታ ዞርቴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:5">ኔ ዑፃ ዔቃኒ ዎላ ጫኣቄኔ።<verse eid="PSA 83:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 83:6"/>ዔያታ፦ ዔዶኦሜ፥ ዒስማዔኤሌ፥ ሞዓኣቤ፥ ዓጋሪያኔ፥<verse eid="PSA 83:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 83:7"/>ጌባሌ፥ ዓሞኔ፥ ዓማሌቄ፥ ፒሊስፄኤሜንታ ፂሮሴ ዴሮንታኬ።<verse eid="PSA 83:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 83:8"/>ዓሶኦሬ ዓሳኣ ዔያቶና ዎላ ፔቴ ማዔኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:8">ሎኦፄ ናኣቶዋ ዔያታ ማኣዳያ ማዔኔ።<verse eid="PSA 83:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 83:9"/>ሚዲያሜ ዓጮይዳ ኔ ማዼ ጎይፆ ዔያቶይዳ ማዼ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:9">ቂሶኔ ዎራ ሲሳራና ዒያቢሴናይዳ ኔ ሄሊሴ ባካ ዔያቶ ሄሎንጎ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">83፡9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 4:6-22">ሱኡጎ. ማፃ 4፡6-22</ref>፤ <ref loc="JDG 7:1-23">7፡1-23</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 83:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 83:10"/>ዔያታ ዓይኔዶሬ ጌይንታ ቤዛ ባይቄኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:10">ዓዳ ሳዓይዳ ኬኤሪንቴ ቡኡራ ማዔኔ።<verse eid="PSA 83:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 83:11"/>ዖሬቤና ዜቤ ዓሶና ዑፃ ኔ ማዼ ጎይፆ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:11">ሃያ ዓሶ ሱኡጎ ዑፃኣ ማዼ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:11">ዜባሄና ፃልሙናዔ ዓሶና ዑፃ ኔ ማዼ ጎይፆ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:11">ሃያ ዓሶ ዎይሣ ዓሶይዳኣ ማዼ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">83፡11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 7:25">ሱኡጎ. ማፃ 7፡25</ref>፤ <ref loc="JDG 8:12">8፡12</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 83:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 83:12"/>ዔያታ፦ «ፆኦሲ ዓሶ ቤዞ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:12">ኑኡኒ ኑኡሮ ማሃንዳኔ» ጌዔኔ።<verse eid="PSA 83:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 83:13"/>ዬያሮ ታ ፆኦዛሢዮ! ዔያቶ ሲላሊጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:13">ዢባሬ ዔኪ ዓኣዻ ዲልባጉዲ ላኣሌ።<verse eid="PSA 83:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 83:14"/>ታሚ ዴኤሊ ካይዚ ሙዓሢጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:14">ታሚኮ ሎስታ ዹካ ዓርቃሢጉዲ<verse eid="PSA 83:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 83:15"/>ኔኤኮ ጉዳሢ ዢባሮና ዔያቶ ዳውሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:15">ዓልጎ ዢባሮናኣ ዲቃሤ።<verse eid="PSA 83:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 83:16"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ዔያታ ሱንፆ ኔኤሲ ኮዓንዳጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:16">ቦርሲንቲ ዔያቶይዳ ዋሄ።<verse eid="PSA 83:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 83:17"/>ናንጊና ዔያታ ካራ ባይዚ ቦርሲንቶንጎ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:17">ዻውሲንቲ ዔያታ ባይቆንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 83:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 83:18"/>ሱንፃ ኔኤኮ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ማዔሢ ኔ ሌሊ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:18">ሳዖ ቢያይዳ ዼኤፓሢ ኔና ማዔሢያ ዔያታ ዔሮንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 83:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 83"/>
  <chapter number="84" style="c" sid="PSA 84"/>
  <para style="s1">ዓይኑሞ ሱኡጋሢ ዓይሣ ጎይፆና ቆሬ ናኣታ ሹሉንጎና ዓይናዼ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="d">ፆኦሲኮ ጌኤዦ ማኣሮ ጶቂሥሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 84:1"/>ቢያ ባኮ ዎይሣ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:1">ኔ ዎርቃ ማኣራ ዎዚጉዲ ናሽኪንታያዳይ!<verse eid="PSA 84:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 84:2"/>ሼምፓሢ ታኣሲ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ካራ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:2">ዓሳ ቡካ ጶኦኮ ጶቂሣኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:2">ታኣኮ ዒኖንታ ዑፆንታ ናንጊና ባይቁዋ ፆኦዛሢም ዒላሹዋቴ።<verse eid="PSA 84:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 84:3"/>ቢያ ባኮ ዎይሣ ጎዳ ማዔ ፆኦዛሢዮ፥ ታ ጎዳ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:3">ኔኤም ዒንጎ ባኮ ሺኢሾ ቤዞ ኮራ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:3">ሱኡታታዖ ናንጋ ማኣሪ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:3">ዶኦሌያ ፔ ናኣቶ ዴይሣ ማኣሪ ማዣኔ።<verse eid="PSA 84:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 84:4"/>ኔ ማኣራ ናንጋዞንሢ ዓንጂንቴያኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:4">ናንጊና ዔያታ ኔና ጋላታኔ።<verse eid="PSA 84:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 84:5"/>ኔና ፔኤኮ ዎልቃሢ ማሄዞንሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:5">ዒኖና ፔኤኮ ፂዮኔ ጎይፆ ማላዞንሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:5">ሚርጌና ዓንጂንቴያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 84:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 84:6"/>ባካ ጌይንታ ዋኣፃ ባኣ ዶኦጮና ዔያታ ፒንቃ ዎዶና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:6">ዓልቃ ዋኣሢ ፆኦሲ ዔያቶም ዑራኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:6">ሲሎ ዒራኣ ቦቆሎ ዔቶ ዋኣሢና ኩንሣንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 84:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 84:7"/>ዎልቄይዳ ዎልቄ ዔያታ ቃሳንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:7">ፔቴ ፔቴሢ ፂዮኔ ዹኮይዳ ዓኣ ፆኦሲ ቤርቶ ሺኢካንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 84:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 84:8"/>ቢያ ባኮ ዎይሣ ጎዳሢዮ! ሺኢጲፆ ታኣኮ ዋይዜ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:8">ያይቆኦቤ ፆኦዛሢዮ! ታኣም ዋይዜ።<verse eid="PSA 84:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 84:9"/>ፆኦሲዮ! ዶኦሪ ኔ ኑም ዶኦሜ ካኣቲ ዓንጄ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:9">ዒዚ ኑኡኮ ጊቲማ ማዔሢሮ ዒዛ ዛጌ።<verse eid="PSA 84:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 84:10"/>ሜሌ ቤስካ ሺያ ኬሊ ዴይሢዳፓ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:10">ኔ ጌኤዦ ማኣሮ ካራ ፔቴ ኬሊ ፔኤቂሢ ኮሺኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:10">ፑርቶ ዓሶ ማኣራ ናንጊፆይዳፓ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:10">ፆኦሲ ማኣሮ ካፓያ ማዒ ናንጋኒ ታ ኮዓኔ።<verse eid="PSA 84:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 84:11"/>ኑኡኮ ጎዳሢና ፆኦዛሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:11">ኔኤኒ ዓዳ ዓቢና ጊቲማና ጉዲኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:11">ኔ ኮሹሞና ኔ ቦንቾና ኔ ኑና ካፓኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:11">ኮሺ ማዻ ዓሲም ዓይጎዋ ኮሺ ማዔ ባኣዚ ኔ ላኣጉዋሴ።<verse eid="PSA 84:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 84:12"/>ቢያ ባኮ ዎይሣ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:12">ኔና ጉሙርቃዞንሢ ዎዚ ዓንጂንቴያዳይ!<verse eid="PSA 84:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 84"/>
  <chapter number="85" style="c" sid="PSA 85"/>
  <para style="s1">ዓይኑሞ ሱኡጋሢ ዓይሣ ጎይፆና ቆሬ ናኣታ ዓይናዼ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="d">ኮሹሞ ዛላ ሺኢቂንቴ ሺኢጲሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 85:1"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:1">ኔ ሳዖም ኔኤኒ ኮሺ ባኣዚ ማዼኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:1">ያይቆኦቤኮ ዲዒንቴ ዓሶ ማሂ ኔ ዓንጄኔ።<verse eid="PSA 85:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 85:2"/>ኔ ዴሮኮ ጎሞ ዓቶም ኔኤኒ ጌዔኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:2">ጎሞ ዔያቶሲ ቢያ ኔ ካንቄኔ።<verse eid="PSA 85:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 85:3"/>ኔኤኮ ዎዻ ባኮ ቢያ ኔ ሺኢሼኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:3">ዼኤፖ ዻጎይዳፓኣ ኔ ማዔኔ።<verse eid="PSA 85:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 85:4"/>ኑኡኮ ዼኤሻሢ ማዔ ፆኦዛሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:4">ኑና ኑ ቤዞ ማሄ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:4">ኑ ዑፃ ዔቃኒ ማላ ዻጎ ኔኤኮ ሺርሼ።<verse eid="PSA 85:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 85:5"/>ኔ ኑና ጎሬ ጎይሣ ናኣናና ናንጋ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:5">ዻጋ ኔኤሲ ሾይንቲፓ ሾይንቲ ሄሄላኒዳ?<verse eid="PSA 85:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 85:6"/>ዴራ ኔኤኮ ዎዛዻንዳጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:6">ኔ ኑም ጊንሣ ሼምፖ ዒንጋዓዳ?<verse eid="PSA 85:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 85:7"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:7">ኔኤኮ ማኣሪፆ ኑና ዻዌቴራ፥ ኑና ዓውሴ።<verse eid="PSA 85:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 85:8"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ማዔ ፆኦዛሢ ኬኤዛ ባኮ ታ ዋይዛንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:8">ኑኡኒ ኑኡኮ ዔኤዩሞ ጎይፆ ማዒ ዴንዲባኣቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:8">ዒዚ ኑና ፔ ዴሮ፥ ዱማዼዞንሢም ኮሹሞ ዒንጋኒ ጫኣቄኔ።<verse eid="PSA 85:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 85:9"/>ቦንቻ ዒዛኮ ኑ ሳዖይዳ ናንጋንዳጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:9">ዒዛ ዒጊጫዞንሢም ዓውሲፃ ዒዛኮ ዑኬኬ።<verse eid="PSA 85:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 85:10"/>ማኣሪሢና ጉሙርቂንቲሢና ዎላ ካኣማያኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:10">ፂሉሞና ኮሹሞና ዎሊ ዔካያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 85:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 85:11"/>ጉሙርቂንቲሢ ሳዓፓ ሌካ ባቃላኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:11">ፂሉሞ ጫሪንቺፓ ሊካ ዛጋኔ።<verse eid="PSA 85:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 85:12"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ኮሺ ባኣዚ ዒንጋኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:12">ዓጬላ ኑኡኮ ጎሽኮዛ ሚርጌ ባኣዚ ካሣኔ።<verse eid="PSA 85:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 85:13"/>ፂሉማ ዒዛኮ ቤርታ ቤርታ ዓኣዻኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:13">ሃንታንዳጉዲ ጎይፆ ዒዛም ጊኢጊሻኔ።<verse eid="PSA 85:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 85"/>
  <chapter number="86" style="c" sid="PSA 86"/>
  <para style="s1">ዳውቴኮ ሺኢጲፆ</para>
  <para style="d">ፆኦሲ ማኣዳንዳጉዲ ሺኢቂንቴ ሺኢጲሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 86:1"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:1">ዋዮ ኔኤሲ ታ ባንሢ ማሂ ዋይዜ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:1">ታኣኒ ማንቆ ሃሣ ሜታዼ ዓሲኬ።<verse eid="PSA 86:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 86:2"/>ኔኤም ታኣኒ ዱማዼ ዓሲታሢሮ ሼምፓሢ ታኣኮ ካፔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:2">ኔኤኒ ታኣኮ ፆኦዛሢኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:2">ኔና ጉሙርቃ ኔኤኮ ዓይላሢ፥ ታና ዓውሴ።<verse eid="PSA 86:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 86:3"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ታና ሚጪንቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:3">ሮኦሮ ጉቤ ታ ኔ ባንሢ ዒላታኔ፤<verse eid="PSA 86:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 86:4"/>ኔ ዓይላሢኮ ሼምፓሢ ዎዛሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:4">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ታ ሼምፓሢ ታ ኔኤም ዒንጋኔ።<verse eid="PSA 86:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 86:5"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ኔኤኒ ሚጪንታያና ዓቶም ጋዓያናኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:5">ኔና ዔኤላዞንሢም ቢያ ሚጪንቲፆኮ ዛጲ ኔኤኮ ባኣሴ።<verse eid="PSA 86:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 86:6"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ሺኢጲፆ ታኣኮ ዒናፓ ዋይዜ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:6">ታ ሜታዺ ሺኢቃ ሺኢጲፆ ዋይዜ።<verse eid="PSA 86:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 86:7"/>ኔኤኒ ታኣም ማሂ ኬኤዛያታሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:7">ታኣኮ ሜታሢ ኬሎ ታ ኔ ባንሢ ዒላታኔ።<verse eid="PSA 86:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 86:8"/>ጎዳሢዮ! ሜሌ ፆኦዞ ባኣካ ኔጉዴይ ባኣሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:8">ኔ ማዾና ቤቃ ማዾዋ ባኣሴ።<verse eid="PSA 86:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 86:9"/>ጎዳሢዮ! ኔኤኒ ማዤ ዴራ ቢያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:9">ኔ ቤርቶ ሙኪ ኔኤም ዚጋንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:9">ኔ ሱንፆም ቦንቾዋ ዒንጋንዳኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">86፡9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 15:4">ዮሃ. ፆፔዻ 15፡4</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 86:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 86:10"/>ኔኤኒ ዼኤፒ ማዔሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:10">ኔ ዎልቄና ማዺንታ ዓኪ ባኣዚ ኔ ማዻኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:10">ኔኤኒ ሌሊ ፆኦሲኬ።<verse eid="PSA 86:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 86:11"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:11">ኔኤኮ ጎይፆ ታና ዔርዜ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:11">ኔ ጎኑሞና ታ ዓኣዻንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:11">ሱንፆ ኔኤኮ ታ ዒጊጫንዳጉዲ ኩሙሢ ዒኔ ታኣም ዒንጌ።<verse eid="PSA 86:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 86:12"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ማዔ ታ ፆኦዛሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:12">ጎኔ ዒናፓ ታ ኔና ጋላታኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:12">ናንጊና ሱንፆ ታ ኔኤኮ ቦንቻኔ።<verse eid="PSA 86:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 86:13"/>ኔ ታና ሚጪንቴ ሚጪንቲፃ ኮሺ ዼኤፒኬ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:13">ሼምፓሢ ታኣኮ ኔ ሄሊንቱዋ ዔታፓ ዓውሴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 86:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 86:14"/>ፆኦሲዮ! ዖቶርቃ ዓሳ ታ ጊዳ ፑርቱሞና ዔቄኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:14">ዒጊቻ ፑርቶ ዓሳ ዎዻኒ ታና ኮዓኔ።</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:14">ኔና ዔያታ ዔኤቢኬ ጌይባኣሴ።<verse eid="PSA 86:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 86:15"/>ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:15">ኔኤኒ ጋዓንቴ ኮሺ ሃሣ ሚጪንታ ፆኦሲኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:15">ሩኡሪና ዻጋዹዋያ፥ ኮሹሞንታ ጉሙርቂንቲፃኣ ኔኤኮ ሚርጌኬ።<verse eid="PSA 86:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 86:16"/>ታ ባንሢ ዛጊ ታና ሚጪንቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:16">ታና ኔ ዓይላሢም ዎልቄ ዒንጌ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:16">ታና፥ ኔ ዓይሌሎ ናዓሢ ዓውሴ።<verse eid="PSA 86:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 86:17"/>ታና ዒፃ ዓሳ ዛጊ ቦርሲንታንዳጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:17">ኔኤኮ ሚጪንቲፆ ማላቶ ታና ዻዌ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:17">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:17">ኔ ታና ማኣዴኔ፥ ዶዲሼኔ።<verse eid="PSA 86:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 86"/>
  <chapter number="87" style="c" sid="PSA 87"/>
  <para style="s1">ቆሬ ናኣቶኮ ጋላታ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="d">ዬሩሳላሜ ሄርሾና ሄርሺሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 87:1"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ካታሞ ፔኤሲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 87:1">ዱማዼ ዹኮ ቶኦካ ዔቂሴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 87:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 87:2"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ያይቆኦቤኮ ዎርቆ ማኣራፓ ባሼ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 87:2">ፂዮኔኮ ጌሎ ካሮ ናሽካኔ።<verse eid="PSA 87:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 87:3"/>ፆኦሲ ካታሜሌ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 87:3">ቦንቾ ማዔ ባኣዚ ሂዚ ጌይ ኔ ዛሎ ኬኤዚንታንዳኔ፦<verse eid="PSA 87:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 87:4"/>«ታና ዔራዞንሢ ባኣካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 87:4">ጊብፄንታ ባብሎኔንታ ታኣኒ ፃኣፓንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 87:4">ፒሊስፄኤሜንታ ፂሮሴንታ ዒቶጲያ ዓሳኣ ዒኢካ ሾይንቴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 87:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 87:5"/>ጎኔና ፂዮኔ ዛሎ፦ ‹ሃያ ዴሮንታ ዬያ ዴሮንታ ዒዞይዳ ሾይንቴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 87:5">ዼኤፖ ፆኦዛሢ ፔኤሮ ዒዞ ዶዲሺ ዔቂሳንዳኔ› ጌይንታንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 87:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 87:6"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዴሮ ፔኤሲ ፃኣፓ ዎዶና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 87:6">‹ሃይ ዴራ ሾይንቴሢ ዒኢካኬ› ጌይ ፃኣፒንታንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 87:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 87:7"/>ዓይኑሞ ዓይናዻ ዓሶንታ ኮፆ ኮርጋ ዓሳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 87:7">‹ሃያ ዓንጆኮ ቢያ ካሬላ ፂዮኔኬ› ጌይ ጌይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 87:7">ዎዛና ዓይናዻንዳኔ።»<verse eid="PSA 87:7"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 87"/>
  <chapter number="88" style="c" sid="PSA 88"/>
  <para style="s1">ቆሬ ናኣቶኮ ጋላቶ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="d">ዓይኑሞ ሱኡጋሢ ዓይሣ ጎይፆና ዎሊም ዓጊ ዓጊ ዓይናዾያ፥ ዒዝራዔኤሌ ዓሢ ዔማኔ ካላሎ፥ ፆኦሲ ማኣዶ ዴንቃኒ ሺኢቂንቴ ሺኢጲሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 88:1"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ማዔ ታና ዓውሳ ፆኦዛሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:1">ሮኦሮና ዋንቶና ታ ኔ ቤርታ ዒላታኔ።<verse eid="PSA 88:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 88:2"/>ሺኢጲፃ ታኣሲ ኔ ቤርቶ ሄሎንጎ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:2">ዋዮ ኔኤኮ ታ ዒላቶ ባንሢ ማሄ!<verse eid="PSA 88:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 88:3"/>ሚርጌ ሜታ ታና ሄሌሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:3">ሃይቃኒ ታኣኒ ዑኬኔ።<verse eid="PSA 88:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 88:4"/>ሃይቂ ዱኡኪንታ ዓሶና ዎላ ታኣኒ ፓይዲንቴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:4">ፔቴታዖ ማኣዳ ዓሲባኣያ ታ ማዔኔ።<verse eid="PSA 88:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 88:5"/>ሃይቄ ዓሶ ባኣካ ኬኤሪንቴ ዓሶጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:5">ዎዺ ዱኡኮና ዓሲጉዲ ታ ላሄኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:5">ሃካፓ ሴካ ኔ ማሊ ጶቂሡዋ ዓሶጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:5">ኔ ኩጫፓ ኬስኪ ኬኤሪንቴ ዓሶጉዲ ታ ማዔኔ።<verse eid="PSA 88:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 88:6"/>ኔ ታና ዔቶ ቶርጳሢዳ ኬኤሬኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:6">ዹሚ ዔቴይዳ ኔ ታና ዓጌኔ።<verse eid="PSA 88:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 88:7"/>ኔ ጎሪንቶ ዴኤሡማ ታ ዑፃ ማዔኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:7">ኔኤኮ ዋኣፆ ጉዳሢና ኔ ታና ዱኡኬኔ።<verse eid="PSA 88:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 88:8"/>ታኣኮ ዑካ ላጎ ታ ኮራፓ ኔ ሃኪሴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:8">ዔያታ ታና ሻኣኪንታንዳጉዲ ኔ ማዼኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:8">ታ ማንጊንቴኔ፥ ቶላኒያ ታ ዳንዳዒባኣሴ።<verse eid="PSA 88:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 88:9"/>ዓኣፓ ታኣኮ ዖዪፆና ዴዒ ዓቴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:9">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ታ ኔ ባንሢ ዒላታኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:9">ኩጮዋ ታ ኔ ባንሢ ዔቂሳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 88:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 88:10"/>ኔኤኮ ዲቃሢ ሄርሺሳ ማዾ ሃይቄ ዓሶም ኔ ቤኤዛ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:10">ሃይቄ ዓሶኮ ዔኤዣ ዔቂ ኔና ጋላታ?<verse eid="PSA 88:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 88:11"/>ሚጪንቲፃ ኔኤኮ ዱኡፒ ቤስካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:11">ጉሙርቂንቲፃኣ ባይሲንታ ቤስካ ኬኤዚንታ?<verse eid="PSA 88:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 88:12"/>ዲቃሢ ሄርሺሳ ማዻ ኔኤኮ ዹሞ ቤዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:12">ፂሉማኣ ኔኤሲ ዋሊንቴ ሳዓይዳ ዔርታ?<verse eid="PSA 88:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 88:13"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:13">ኔ ታና ማኣዳንዳጉዲ ኔ ባንሢ ታ ዒላታኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:13">ጉቶዋ ሺኢጲፆ ታኣኮ ታ ኔ ቤርቶ ሺኢሻኔ።<verse eid="PSA 88:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 88:14"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ዓይጋ ኔ ታና ሃኪሳይ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:14">ኔኤኮ ዓኣፖ ካሮዋ ታ ጊዳፓ ዓይጋ ኔ ሺርሻይ?<verse eid="PSA 88:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 88:15"/>ታኣኒ ናኣቱሞፓ ዓርቃዖ ሜታዼያና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:15">ሃይቃኒያ ዑኬያኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:15">ኔ ታና ሚርጌና ዲቃሤኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:15">ዔርቲያ ታኣም ዒፄኔ።<verse eid="PSA 88:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 88:16"/>ኔ ጎሪንታ ዑፆ ታኣኮ ካንቄኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:16">ዱማ ዱማ ባይዛ ባካኣ ታና ኩርሴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 88:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 88:17"/>ሮኦሮ ጉቤ ዓዳ ዲጲጉዲ ታና ማንጌኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:17">ጋፒ ታና ዬይ ዔኤዼኔ።<verse eid="PSA 88:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 88:18"/>ታኣኮ ዒጊኖንታ ላጎንታ ኔኤኒ ታ ኮራፓ ሃኪሴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:18">ዹሚ ሌሊ ታኣኮ ላጌ ማዒ ዓቴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 88:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 88"/>
  <chapter number="89" style="c" sid="PSA 89"/>
  <para style="s1">ዒዝራዔኤሌ ዓሢ ዔታኔኮ ካላሎ</para>
  <para style="d">ሜቶ ዎዴና ዓይናዺንቴ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 89:1"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳኮ ሚጪንቶ ዛሎ ዓይናዼ ጎይሣ ታ ናንጋንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:1">ታ ዻንጎና ኔኤኮ ጉሙርቂንቲፆ ሙካ ሾይንቶም ታ ኬኤዛንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 89:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 89:2"/>ሚጪንቲፃ ኔኤኮ ናንጊና ናንጋያ ማዔሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:2">ጉሙርቂንቲፆዋ ጫሪንጫ ኔ ዶዲሻሢ ታ ኬኤዛንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 89:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 89:3"/>ኔኤኒ ቤርታሲ፦ «ታኣኒ ዶኦሬ ዓሢና ዎላ ጫኣቄኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:3">ታ ዓይላሢ ዳውቴም ታ ሳላዼኔ» ጌዔኔ።<verse eid="PSA 89:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 89:4"/>ኔ ዒዛም ሳላዼ ሳላ፦</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:4">«ኔ ዜርፃፓ ናንጊና ካኣታዻንዳይ ኬስካንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:4">ካኣቱሞ ዖይቶ ታኣኒ ሾይንቲፓ ሾይንቲ ሄላንዳኣና ዶዲሻንዳኔ» ጋዓያኬ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">89፡4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:12-16">2ሳሙ. 7፡12-16</ref>፤ <ref loc="1CH 17:11-14">1ፆኦሲ. ዓሃኬ 17፡11-14</ref>፤ <ref loc="PSA 132:11">ዓይኑ. 132፡11</ref>፤ <ref loc="ACT 2:30">ዳኪ. ማዾ 2፡30</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 89:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 89:5"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ጫሪንጫ ኔኤኮ ዲቃሢ ሄርሺሳ ማዾ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:5">ጉሙርቂንቲፆዋ ኔኤኮ ኔኤም ማዻ ኪኢታንቻ ፔ ቡኪንታ ሄርሾንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 89:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 89:6"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳና ጫሪንጮይዳ ዖኦኒ ቤቃይ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:6">ዒዛኮ ኪኢታንቾይዳፓ ዒዛጉዴይ ዖናዳይ?<verse eid="PSA 89:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 89:7"/>ዒዛም ዱማዼ ኪኢታንቾ ባኣካ ሚርጌና ዒጊጪንታያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:7">ዒዛ ኮራ ዓኣዞንሢዳፓ ቢያ ዑሣ ዒ ዲቃሣያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 89:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 89:8"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ማዔ ዼኤፖ ፆኦዛሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:8">ኔጉዴያ ዖኦኒ ዓኣይ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:8">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ኔኤኒ ዼኤፒኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:8">ኔኤኮ ጉሙርቂንቲፃኣ ኮሮ ማንጊ ዓኣኔ።<verse eid="PSA 89:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 89:9"/>ኔኤኮ ቢታንቶና ባዛ ዓጊፃሢ ኔ ዔቂሳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:9">ባዞ ጉዳሢያ ኔኤኒ ዚቲዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 89:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 89:10"/>ሬዓባ ጌይንታ ቦዓሢ ጳርቂ ኔ ዎዼኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:10">ኔኤኮ ዼኤፖ ዎልቆና ሞርኮ ኔኤኮ ኔ ላኣሌኔ።<verse eid="PSA 89:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 89:11"/>ጫሪንጮንታ ሳዖንታ ኔኤሮኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:11">ዓጮንታ ዒኢካ ዓኣ ባኮ ኔኤኒ ማዤኔ።<verse eid="PSA 89:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 89:12"/>ኬዶ ባንፆንታ ዾኦሎ ባንፆዋ ማዤሢ ኔናኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:12">ታቦኦሬንታ ሄርሞኔ ዹኮንታ ኔ ሱንፆና ዎዛዻኔ።<verse eid="PSA 89:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 89:13"/>ቢታንታ ኔኤኮ ኮሺ ዶዲኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:13">ኩጫኣ ኔኤሲ ዎልቄናኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:13">ሚዛቆ ኩጫኣ ኔኤኮ ዼግ ዼጊ ጌዔያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 89:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 89:14"/>ካኣቱሞ ዖይታ ኔኤኮ ፂሉሞና ፒዜ ዎጌና ዶዲሾናያኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:14">ሚጪንቲፆንታ ጉሙርቂንቲፆንታ ኔኤኮ ቤርታ ቤርታ ዓኣዻኔ።<verse eid="PSA 89:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 89:15"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ዎዛና ዒላሻዞንሢና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:15">ኔኤኮ ፖዓ ናንጋዞንሢ ዓንጂንቴያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 89:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 89:16"/>ሮኦሮ ጉቤ ኔ ሱንፆና ዔያታ ዎዛዻኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:16">ኔ ፂሉሞናኣ ዔያታ ኮሺ ዎዛዻኔ።<verse eid="PSA 89:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 89:17"/>ዔያቶ ዶዱሞኮ ቦንቻሢ ኔናኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:17">ኔ ኮሹሞና ካኣሮ ኑኡኮ ኔኤኒ ዼግ ዼጊዴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 89:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 89:18"/>ኑኡኮ ጊቲማሢ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሮኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:18">ኑኡኮ ካኣቲያ ዒስራዔኤሌኮ ዱማዼ ፆኦዛሢሮኬ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">89፡18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 4:31">1ካኣቶ. ማ 4፡31</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 89:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">ፆኦሲ ዳውቴም ጫኣቄ ጫኣቁሞ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 89:19"/>ኔኤኒ ፔጋሲ ዻዋ ባኮና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:19">ሚና ኔ ናኣቶም ኔ ኬኤዛዖ ሂዚ ጌዔኔ፦</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:19">«ዖሎና ዔርቴሢ ታኣኒ ማኣዴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:19">ዴሮ ባኣካፓ ዶኦሪንቴሢ ታኣኒ ዼግ ዼጊዴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 89:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 89:20"/>ታኣኮ ዓይላሢ ዳውቴ ታ ዴንቄኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:20">ዱማዼ ዛይቶ ቲዦና ታ ዒዛ ቲሽኪ ዶኦሜኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">89፡20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 13:14">1ሳሙ. 13፡14</ref>፤ <ref loc="1SA 16:12">16፡12</ref>፤ <ref loc="ACT 13:22">ዳኪ. ማዾ 13፡22</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 89:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 89:21"/>ታ ኩጫ ኬልቂ ዒዛ ዓርቃንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:21">ቃሳ ታኣኮ ዒዛ ዶዲሻንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 89:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 89:22"/>ዒዛኮ ሞርካ ዒዛ ባሻዓኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:22">ፑርቶ ማዻ ዓሳኣ ሄርቂ ዎይሣዓኬ።<verse eid="PSA 89:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 89:23"/>ሞርኮ ዒዛኮ ታኣኒ ዒዛ ቤርታ ጋኣጫንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:23">ዒዛ ዒፃዞንሢ ታ ሺርኪ ባይዛንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 89:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 89:24"/>ታኣኮ ጉሙርቂንቲፆንታ ሚጪንቲፃኣ ዒዛና ማዓንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:24">ታ ሱንፆና ካኣራ ዒዛኮ ዼግ ዼጊ ጋዓንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 89:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 89:25"/>ዒዚ ዎይሣ ዓጮ ሜዲቴራኒያ ባዞ ሄላንዳኣና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:25">ዒዛ ዓጮኮ ዛጶ ፄግሮሴና ዔፕራፂሴ ዎሮ ሄላንዳኣና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:25">ታኣኒ ዳልጊሻንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 89:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 89:26"/>ዒዚ ታና፦ ‹ኔ ታኣኮ ዓዶኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:26">ኔ ታኣኮ ፆኦዛሢና ዻቂንቶ ላላሢናኬ› ጋዓንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 89:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 89:27"/>ታኣኒ ዒዛ ታኣኮ ናኣዚ ቶይዲ ማሃንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:27">ዓጮ ካኣቶይዳፓ ዑሣ ዼጊ ዒ ጋዓንዳኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">89፡27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 1:5">ዮሃ. ፆፔዻ 1፡5</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 89:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 89:28"/>ሚጪንቲፆ ታኣኮ ናንጊና ዒዛም ታ ማሃንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:28">ታ ዒዛና ጫኣቄ ጫኣቁማ ዶዲ ናንጋንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 89:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 89:29"/>ዒዛኮ ዜርፆ ናንጊና ታኣኒ ናንጊሻንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:29">ካኣቱሞዋ ጫሪንጫ ናንጋማ ጎይፆ ታ ዶዲሻንዳኔ።»<verse eid="PSA 89:29"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 89:30"/>«ጋዓንቴ ዜርፃ ዒዛኮ ታ ዎጎ ዑሣ ዓኣዼቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:30">ታ ዳምቦና ዔያታ ናንጊባኣያታቴ፥<verse eid="PSA 89:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 89:31"/>ታኣኒ ቱኬ ዳምቦ ዑሣ ዔያታ ኬስኬቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:31">ታኣኮ ዓይሢፆዋ ካፒባኣቴ፥<verse eid="PSA 89:31"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 89:32"/>ዔያቶኮ ጎሞሮ ታ ዔያቶ ኮኦሎና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:32">ዻቢንቶሮዋ ታ ዔያቶ ዢራፓና ጳርቃንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 89:32"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 89:33"/>ሂዴያታቴያ ሚጪንቲፆ ታኣኮ ታ ዒዛይዳፓ ሺኢሻዓኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:33">ታ ጉሙርቂንቲፆዋ ታ ዒዛም ፓጪሳዓኬ።<verse eid="PSA 89:33"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 89:34"/>ታ ዒዛና ጫኣቄ ጫኣቁሞ ሻሃዓኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:34">ታ ዻንጋፓ ታ ኬሴ ባኮዋ ማሃዓኬ።»<verse eid="PSA 89:34"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 89:35"/>«ፔቴና ታኣኮ ጌኤሹሞና ታ ጫኣቄኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:35">ዳውቴም ታኣኒ ሉኡቃዓኬ።<verse eid="PSA 89:35"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 89:36"/>ዒዛኮ ዜርፆ ናንጊና ታኣኒ ናንጊሻንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:36">ካኣቱማኣ ዒዛኮ ዓቢ ናንጋማጉዲ ታ ቤርታ ዶዲ ናንጋንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 89:36"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 89:37"/>ጫሪንጮይዳ ጉሙርቂንታ ማርካ ማዒ ናንጋ ዓጊኒጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:37">ዒዛኮ ካኣቱማ ናንጊና ዶዲ ዴዓያ ማዓንዳኔ።»<verse eid="PSA 89:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">ካኣቲ ዳውቴ ባሺንቴሢሮ ሄሌ ዖዪሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 89:38"/>ሃሢ ኔ ጋዓንቴ ዒዛ ቶኦቺ ሃሼኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:38">ኔኤኒ ዶኦሚ ካታሤሢያ ሚርጌና ጎሬኔ።<verse eid="PSA 89:38"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 89:39"/>ኔ ዓይላሢና ኔ ጫኣቄ ጫኣቁሞዋ ሻሄኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:39">ቦንቾሮ ቶኦካ ዓጎ ባኮዋ ሲላላ ኔ ኬኤሬኔ።<verse eid="PSA 89:39"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 89:40"/>ዒዛኮ ኬኤሎ ዲፆ ቢያ ኔ ሻሄኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:40">ዋርዲዮ ቤዞዋ ዶይሲ ኔ ባይዜኔ።<verse eid="PSA 89:40"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 89:41"/>ዒኢና ቱሮ ሊካ ዓኣዻሢያ ቢያ ዒዛ ቡሬኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:41">ዒዛኮ ዓሺኖማኣ ዓማሊ ዒ ማዔኔ።<verse eid="PSA 89:41"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 89:42"/>ዒዛ ሞርኮኮ ሚዛቆ ኩጮ ኔ ዼግ ዼጊዴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:42">ዒዛ ዒፃ ዓሶ ቢያ ኔ ዎዛሴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 89:42"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 89:43"/>ዒዛ ጬንቾ ዓፓሮኮ ዓጪፆ ኔ ቱኒሴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:43">ዖሎ ዎዶና ኔ ዒዛ ማኣዲባኣሴ።<verse eid="PSA 89:43"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 89:44"/>ዓሶ ዒዛኮ ዲቃሣ ዼኤፑሞ ኔ ባይዜኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:44">ካኣቱሞ ዖይቶዋ ኔኤኒ ሳዓ ኬኤሬኔ።<verse eid="PSA 89:44"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 89:45"/>ኔ ዒዛኮ ዼጋቶ ዎዶ ቃሚሤኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:45">ቦርሲሲያ ኔ ዒዛ ዴይሤኔ።<verse eid="PSA 89:45"/></para>
  <para style="s1">ዻቂንታሮ ሺኢቂንቴ ሺኢጲሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 89:46"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:46">ኔ ኑም ፔጋዹዋዖ ናንጊና ናናንጋኒዳ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:46">ዻጋ ኔኤኮ ታሚጉዲ ዔኤታሢ ዓይዲ ሄላንዳኣናዳይ?<verse eid="PSA 89:46"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 89:47"/>ታኣኮ ናንጎ ሌዓ ዎዚ ቃሚሢታቴያ ሂንዳ ማሌ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:47">ዓሲ ኔ ማዤሢ ዔኤቢ ጉሪ ባኣዚምዳ?<verse eid="PSA 89:47"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 89:48"/>ሃይቢ ሃይቁዋዖ ናንጋንዳ ዓሲ ዓኣ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:48">ፔ ቶኦኮ ዱኡፒፓ ዓውሳንዳይ ዖናዳይ?<verse eid="PSA 89:48"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="PSA 89:49"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:49">ዳውቴም ኔኤኮ ጉሙርቂንቲፆና ኔ ጫኣቄሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:49">ኔኤኮ ሚናኣ ሚጪንቲፃ ዎካ ዓኣይ?<verse eid="PSA 89:49"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="PSA 89:50"/>ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:50">ዓይላሢ ኔኤኮ ዎማይዲ ቶኦቺንቴቴያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:50">ሚርጌ ዓሶኮ ቦሂፆ ዒዚ ዔኤዼሢያ ማሌ።<verse eid="PSA 89:50"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="PSA 89:51"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:51">ሞርካ ኔኤኮ ዒዛ ሚኢጬሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:51">ኔኤኒ ካኣታሤ ዓሢኮ ሄፆ ዔያታ ቶኦቼሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:51">ሂንዳ ማሌ።<verse eid="PSA 89:51"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="PSA 89:52"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ጋላቲንቴ ጎይሣ ዴዖም!</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 89:52"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:52">ዓኣሜን! ዓኣሜን!<verse eid="PSA 89:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 89"/>
  <chapter number="90" style="c" sid="PSA 90"/>
  <para style="ms">ዖይዳሳ ፖቂፆ</para>
  <para style="mr">(ዓይኑ. ማፃ ዓይ. 90—106)</para>
  <para style="d">ፆኦሲ ዓሢ ሙሴኮ ሺኢጲፆ</para>
  <para style="s1">ፆኦሲና ዓሲናኮ ናንጎ ሌዖ ዱሙሞ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 90:1"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:1">ኔኤኒ ሾይንቲፓ ሾይንቲ ሄላንዳኣና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:1">ኑኡኮ ፑኖ ካያሢኬ።<verse eid="PSA 90:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 90:2"/>ዹኮ ማዻንዳሢና ዓጮዋ ኔ ማዣንዳሢኮ ቤርታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:2">ኔኤኒ ናኣናና ናናንጋ ፆኦሲኬ።<verse eid="PSA 90:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 90:3"/>ዓሶ ኔኤኒ ሳዖ ባንሢ ማሃኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:3">«ዓሲዮቴ! ዒንሢ ቤዞ ማዑዋቴ!» ጋዓኔ።<verse eid="PSA 90:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 90:4"/>ሺያ ሌዔ ኔኤም ካሪ ዓኣዼ ዚጊናኣ ኬሊጉዲኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:4">ዻካ ዴዓዖ ካራ ዹሚጉዲኬ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">90፡4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 3:8">2ጴፂ. 3፡8</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 90:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 90:5"/>ዲጲጉዲ ፒፂ ኔ ዔያቶ ዔኪ ዓኣዻኣና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:5">ዓውቲጉዲ ዔያታ ማዓንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:5">ጉቶ ጉቶ ባቃላ ማኣቲጉዲ ዔያታ ዋርቃኔ።<verse eid="PSA 90:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 90:6"/>ማኣታ ጉቶ ባቃላዖ ዓኣዓኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:6">ዓቦ ጌሎ ሹሊ ሜላኔ።<verse eid="PSA 90:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 90:7"/>ኔኤኮ ጎሪንታ ኑና ኩርሴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:7">ዱማ ዱማ ዎዻ ባኮናኣ ኑ ዲቃቴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 90:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 90:8"/>ጎሞ ኑኡሲ ኔ ቤርታ ኔ ጌሣኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:8">ኑኡኮ ዓኣሺንቴ ዻቢንቶ ኔኤም ጴዻ ቤስካ ኔኤኒ ዴይሣኔ።<verse eid="PSA 90:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 90:9"/>ኑኡኮ ናንጎ ዎዳ ቢያ ኔ ጎሪንቶና ጋፔኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:9">ናንጎ ኑኡሲ ኑ ጎኦሺንቴ ጎይሣ ጋፒሳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 90:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 90:10"/>ናንጎ ሌዓ ኑኡኮ ላንካይታሚ ሌዔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:10">ሚርጌኔ ጌዔያታቴ ሳሊታሚ ሌዔኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:10">ዬካፓ ዑሣ ዓኣዼያ ማዔቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:10">ላቢሢና ሜቶና ሌሊ ማዓያኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:10">ናንጋ ኑኡኮ ዑኬ ጋፓኔ፥ ኑኡኒ ዓዓኣዻኔ።<verse eid="PSA 90:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 90:11"/>ኔኤኮ ዻጎ ዎልቆ ዖኦኒ ዔራይ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:11">ዱማ ዱማ ዎዻ ባካ ኔኤኮ ዒጊቺፆጉዴያ ዼኤፒኬ።<verse eid="PSA 90:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 90:12"/>ኑኡኮ ናንጎ ሌዖንሢዳ ዔራቶና ኑ ናንጋንዳጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:12">ዔራቶ ዓኣ ዒኔ ኑም ዒንጌ።<verse eid="PSA 90:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 90:13"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ኔኤኒ ማዔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:13">ሃይ ዓይዲ ሄላንዳኣና ሃኣዺ ማዓንዳይ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:13">ኔኤኮ ማዻ ዓይሎም ሚጪንቴ።<verse eid="PSA 90:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 90:14"/>ኑኡኮ ናንጎ ዎዶይዳ ቢያ ኑ ዎዛዻንዳጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:14">ኔኤኮ ሚጪንቲፆ ጉቴና ጉቴና ዺቢሺ ዻዌ።<verse eid="PSA 90:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 90:15"/>ሜታሢ ኔ ኑና ዻዌ ሌዖጉዴያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:15">ፑርቶ ባኮዋ ኑ ዛጌ ሌዖጉዴያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:15">ኑና ዎዛሴ።<verse eid="PSA 90:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 90:16"/>ማዻ ኔኤኮ ኔ ዓይሎም</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:16">ቦንቻኣ ዔያቶኮ ናኣቶም ፔጋዺ ጴዾም።<verse eid="PSA 90:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 90:17"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ማዔ ኑ ፆኦዛሢኮ ኮሹማ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:17">ኑ ዑፃ ማዖም!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:17">ኑ ማዻ ባኮዋ ኑኡም ዓንጄ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:17">ሂዮ ኑኡም ዓኣፒሴ።<verse eid="PSA 90:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 90"/>
  <chapter number="91" style="c" sid="PSA 91"/>
  <para style="s1">ፆኦሲኮ ካፒፆ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 91:1"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ፑኖ ካይዚ ማሂ ናንጋ ዓሲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:1">ቢያ ባኮ ዳንዳዓ ፆኦዛሢ ሺባ ዎርቃኔ።<verse eid="PSA 91:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 91:2"/>ታኣኒ ዒዛ፦ «ታኣኮ ፑኖ ካያሢ፥ ዋርዲዮ ቤዛሢ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:2">ጊንሣ ሃሣ ጉሙርቆ ፆኦዛሢ ጋዓኔ።<verse eid="PSA 91:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 91:3"/>ዒዚ ዓኣቺንቴ ፒራሢና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:3">ዎዻኒ ዳንዳዓ ዶርዓሢናይዳፓ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:3">ኔና ካፓኔ።<verse eid="PSA 91:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 91:4"/>ዒዚ ፔ ጋፓኖና ኔና ዓኣቻንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:4">ዒዛኮ ጋኣዞ ዴማ ዓኣሺንቶ ቤሲ ኔ ዴንቃንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:4">ጉሙርቂንቲፃ ዒዛሲ ጊቲማጉዲ ኔና ቃዛያ ማዓንዳኔ።»<verse eid="PSA 91:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 91:5"/>«ዹሞኮ ዲቃሢፆይዳፓ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:5">ሮኦሮናኣ ዱኮ ሂኢዦ ኔ ዒጊጫዓኬ።<verse eid="PSA 91:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 91:6"/>ዹሚና ሃንታ ፑርታ ባኣዚዳፓ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:6">ዓቢ ሮኦሪ ሙካ ባይሲንታኣ ኔ ሂርጋዓኬ።»<verse eid="PSA 91:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 91:7"/>«ኮይሎይዳ ኔኤኮ ሺያ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:7">ሚዛቆ ዛሎና ታጶ ሺያ ሎኦማንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:7">ጋዓንቴ ዬይ ኔ ባንሢ ዑካዓኬ።<verse eid="PSA 91:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 91:8"/>ኔኤኒ ኔኤኮ ዓኣፖና ሌሊ ዬያ ዛጋንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:8">ፑርቶ ዓሳ ሜታሢ ዔካሢ ዛጊ ኔ ዛጋንዳኔ።»<verse eid="PSA 91:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 91:9"/>«ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ኔኤኮ ዓኣሺንቶ ቤዛሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:9">ዼኤፖ ፆኦዛሢያ ፑኖ ካያሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:9">ኔኤኒ ማሄኔ።<verse eid="PSA 91:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 91:10"/>ዬያሮ ፑርታ ባኣዚ ኔና ሄላዓኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:10">ባይዛ ሃይቢያ ኔ ማኣሪ ጌላዓኬ።<verse eid="PSA 91:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 91:11"/>ኔ ሃንታ ጎይፃ ቢያ ኔና ዒ ካፓንዳጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:11">ኪኢታንቾ ዒዚ ኔኤም ጌዒ ዓይሣንዳኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">91፡11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:6">ማቲ. 4፡6</ref>፤ <ref loc="LUK 4:10">ሉቃ. 4፡10</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 91:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 91:12"/>ቶካ ኔኤኮ ሹጮይዳ ዹቂንቱዋጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:12">ዔያታ ፔኤኮ ኩጮና ኔና ኬዲ ዓርቃንዳኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">91፡12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:6">ማቲ. 4፡6</ref>፤ <ref loc="LUK 4:11">ሉቃ. 4፡11</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 91:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 91:13"/>ዞቦንታ ዶርቦ ሾኦዦንታይዳ ኔ ሄርቃንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:13">ሃጊ ዔቃ ዓዶ ዞቦንታ ቃራሢያ ኔኤኒ ዒማይዳንዳኔ።» <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">91፡13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:19">ሉቃ. 10፡19</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 91:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 91:14"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ሂዚ ጋዓኔ፦</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:14">«ታና ዒ ናሽኬሢሮ ታ ዒዛ ሄሊ ዓውሳንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:14">ታ ሱንፆ ዒዚ ዔሬሢሮ ታ ዒዛ ጎኦቢ ዓይሳንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 91:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 91:15"/>ዒዚ ታና ዔኤላኣና ታ ዋይዛንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:15">ዒዛኮ ሜታሢ ዎዶና ዒዛና ማዓንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:15">ታ ዒዛ ዓውሳንዳኔ፥ ቦንቻንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 91:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 91:16"/>ሚርጌ ሌዔ ዒዛ ታ ናንጊሻንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:16">ታኣኮ ዓውሲፆዋ ዒዛም ዻዋንዳኔ።»<verse eid="PSA 91:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 91"/>
  <chapter number="92" style="c" sid="PSA 92"/>
  <para style="s1">ዓይሁዶኮ ሃውሾ ኬሎና ዓይናዺንታ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="d">ጋላታ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 92:1"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ጋላቲሢ ኮሺኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:1">ዼኤፖ ፆኦዛሢዮ! ኔ ሱንፆም ዓይናዺሢያ ቃራኬ።<verse eid="PSA 92:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 92:2"/>ሚጪንቲፆ ኔኤሲ ጉቴ ጉቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:2">ጉሙርቂንቲፆዋ ዋንታ ዋንታ ኬኤዚፃ ኮሺኬ።<verse eid="PSA 92:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 92:3"/>ታጶ ሻዦ ዴንሢ ዋርቆ ጎኦሎና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:3">ዬያጉዴ ዓይኑሞ ዓንጎና ዓይናዺ ኬኤዚፃ ቃራኬ።<verse eid="PSA 92:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 92:4"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:4">ኔኤኮ ማዾና ታ ዎዛዼሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:4">ኔ ኩጮና ኔ ማዼ ማዾሮ ዎዛና ታ ዓይናዻኔ።<verse eid="PSA 92:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 92:5"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:5">ማዻ ኔኤኮ ዎዚ ዼኤፒዳይ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:5">ማሊፃኣ ኔኤኮ ዎዚጉዴ ሄሊንቱዋያዳይ!<verse eid="PSA 92:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 92:6"/>ቦኦዛ ዓሲ ዔራኒ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:6">ዔኤያ ዓሲያ ማሊ ጶቂሣኒ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:6">ዬያ ዳንዳዑዋሴ።<verse eid="PSA 92:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 92:7"/>ፑርቶ ማዻ ዓሳ ማኣቲጉዲ ባቃላያ ማዔቴያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:7">ጌኔ ማዻ ዓሳ ቡኔቴያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:7">ናንጊና ዔያታ ባይቃንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 92:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 92:8"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:8">ኔኤኒ ጋዓንቴ ዼኤፒ ማዒ ናንጋያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 92:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 92:9"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ሞርካ ኔኤኮ ባይቃንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:9">ፑርቶ ማዻዞንሢያ ቢያ ላኣሊንታንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 92:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 92:10"/>ታኣኮ ካኣሮ ጋዓንቴ ዖሶ ካኣሪጉዲ ኔ ዼጊሴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:10">ሃጊ ጊሲንቴ ዛይቴና ኔኤኒ ታና ቲሽኬኔ።<verse eid="PSA 92:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 92:11"/>ታ ሞርኮኮ ሎኦሚፆ ዓኣፓ ታኣኮ ዛጌኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:11">ዋያ ታኣኮ ፑርቶ ሞርኮኮ ባሺንቲፆ ዋይዜኔ።<verse eid="PSA 92:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 92:12"/>ፂሎ ዓሳ ዓዳ ሜኤፄጉዲ ጋምፒንታኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:12">ሊባኖኦሴ ሚፆጉዲያኣ ዑጋኔ።<verse eid="PSA 92:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 92:13"/>ዔያታ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ማኣራ ቱኪንቴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:13">ዓሳ ቡካ ጶኦካኣ ጋምፒንታንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 92:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 92:14"/>ጋርቼ ዎዶናታዖ ዔያታ ዓኣፓንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:14">ዓኣዓያ ማዒ ዶዴ ጎይሣ ናንጋንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 92:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 92:15"/>«ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ፒዜኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:15">ዒዚ ታኣኮ ላላሢኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:15">ዒዛኮ ዻቢንቲ ባኣያኬ» ዔያታ ጋዓንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 92:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 92"/>
  <chapter number="93" style="c" sid="PSA 93"/>
  <para style="s1">ፆኦሲ ካኣቲ ማዔሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 93:1"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ካኣቲኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 93:1">ዒዚ ዲቃሣ ዼኤፑሞ ማይንቴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 93:1">ዶዱሞዋ ቱኡቶ ባኣዚጉዲ ቱኡቴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 93:1">ሳዓ ዓጊፁዋጉዲ ዒ ዶዲሼኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 93:1">ዖኦኒያ ዬያ ዓጊሡዋሴ።<verse eid="PSA 93:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 93:2"/>ኔኤኮ ካኣቱሞ ዖይታ ሚናፓ ዓርቃዖ ዶዲኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 93:2">ኔኤኒ ናኣናና ዓኣያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 93:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 93:3"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ዎራ ዑኡዞ ዼጊዴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 93:3">ዋኣፃ ዼጊ ጌዒ ጉኡሜኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 93:3">ዎራ ጉኡማ ጉዳሢ ዢባሮኮ ዑኡዞ ማኣሚሴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 93:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 93:4"/>ሚርጌ ጉኡማ ዋኣፆይዳፓ ባሼ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 93:4">ባዞ ጉዳሢ ዢባራፓ ዑሣ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 93:4">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳኮ ዎልቃ ዼጊ ጌዔያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 93:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 93:5"/>ዳምባ ኔኤሲ ዶዴያኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 93:5">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 93:5">ጌኤዦ ማኣራ ኔኤኮ ዱማዼያና ሚዛጳያ ማዒ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 93:5">ናኣናና ናናንጋያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 93:5"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 93"/>
  <chapter number="94" style="c" sid="PSA 94"/>
  <para style="s1">ፆኦሲ ቢያሢም ዎጋያ ማዔሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 94:1"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ማዔ ኮሜ ኮፃ ፆኦዛሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:1">ኮሜ ኮፃ ፆኦዛሢዮ! ፖዒ ፔጋዺ ጴዼ።<verse eid="PSA 94:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 94:2"/>ሳዖይዳ ዎጋያ ማዔሦ ዔቄ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:2">ዖቶርቃ ዓሶም ዔያቶ ማዾጉዴያ ዒንጌ።<verse eid="PSA 94:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 94:3"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:3">ፑርቶ ማዻ ዓሳ ዓይዲ ሄላንዳኣናዳይ ፂካንዳሢ?<verse eid="PSA 94:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 94:4"/>ዔያታ ሄርሺንቲ ዑኡሲ ሚርጊሻኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:4">ፑርቶ ዓሳ ሆኦሊንቲ ዺቢሻኔ።<verse eid="PSA 94:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 94:5"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:5">ዔያታ ዴሮ ኔኤኮ ላቢሳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:5">ዓሶ ኔኤሲያ ዋኣዪሳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 94:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 94:6"/>ዜኤሮይንዶንሢና ቤዛባኣ ዓሶዋ ዔያታ ዎዻኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:6">ዜኤሮ ናኣቶኮዋ ሼምፓሢ ባይዛኔ።<verse eid="PSA 94:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 94:7"/>ዬያይዳዖ ዔያታ፦</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:7">«ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ኑና ዴንቁዋሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:7">ያይቆኦቤ ፆኦዛሢ ዬያ ዔሩዋሴ» ጋዓኔ።<verse eid="PSA 94:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 94:8"/>ዒንሢ ዒዛ ዴሮ ባኣካ ዓኣ ማሉዋ ዓሳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:8">ሂንዳ ኮሺ ማሉዋቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:8">ዒንሢ ዔኤዮ ዓሳ ዔራ ዒንሢ ማዓንዳሢ ዓይዲዳይ?<verse eid="PSA 94:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 94:9"/>ዋዮ ዾቄሢ ፔኤሮ ዋይዙዋያዳ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:9">ዓኣፖ ማዤሢያ ዛጉዋዓዳ?<verse eid="PSA 94:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 94:10"/>ዴሮ ጎሪ ዞሪ ፔ ጎይፆ ባንሢ ማሃሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:10">ዔራቶ ዓሲም ዒንጋሢ ሜቶ ዓጋዓዳ?<verse eid="PSA 94:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 94:11"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዓሲኮ ማሊሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:11">ዔኤቢ ፓሡዋያ ጉሪ ማዔሢ ዔራኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">94፡11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 3:20">1ቆሮ. 3፡20</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 94:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 94:12"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ኔኤኒ ጎሪ ዞራ ዓሲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:12">ኔ ዎጎዋ ኔ ዔርዛ ዓሲ ዓንጂንቴያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 94:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 94:13"/>ጎሞ ዓሳ ሎኦማንዳ ዔቴ ቦኦኪንታንዳያ ሄላንዳኣና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:13">ኔኤኒ ዒዛ ፑርታ ሜቶፓ ሃውሺሳንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 94:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 94:14"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዴሮ ፔኤሲ ኬኤሩዋሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:14">ፔ ዓሶዋ ሃሹዋሴ።<verse eid="PSA 94:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 94:15"/>ዎጌ ጊንሣ ፒዜ ጎይሢና ዎጊንታንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:15">ዒኖ ፒዜ ዓሳ ቢያ ዬያ ጊንፆ ዓኣዻንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 94:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 94:16"/>ፑርቶ ዓሶ ታኣም ቃዛንዳያ ዖናዳይ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:16">ፑርቶ ማዻ ዓሶና ታ ዛሎ ሞኦቲንታንዳያ ዖናዳይ?<verse eid="PSA 94:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 94:17"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዎንዴ ታና ማኣዲባኣያታቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:17">ቤዞና ታ ሄኤዶ ሃይቄ ዓሶ ሳዖ ኬዴያ ናንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 94:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 94:18"/>ታኣኒ «ታና ሃሊፄኔ» ጌዔ ዎዶና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:18">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:18">ኔኤኮ ሚጪንቲፃ ላባዒ ታና ዓርቄኔ።<verse eid="PSA 94:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 94:19"/>ማሊፃ ታኣኮ ሚርጌ ጎይፆ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:19">ኔኤኮ ዶዲሺፃ ሼምፓሢ ታኣኮ ዎዛሳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 94:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 94:20"/>ዎጌ ሱንሢና ጊኢጊሺንቴ ጌኔ ማዾና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:20">ዎቢሲ ዎጊንቴ ዎጌና ፔቴ ኔ ማዓንዳ?<verse eid="PSA 94:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 94:21"/>ፂሎ ዓሶ ዑፃ ጌኔ ጌስቲ ዔያታ ኬስካኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:21">ጌኤዦ ዓሳ ሃይቃንዳጉዲ ዔያታ ዎጋኔ።<verse eid="PSA 94:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 94:22"/>ታኣም ጋዓንቴ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዋርዲዬ ቤሲ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:22">ታኣኮ ፆኦዛሢያ ፑኖ ካይዚ ማዔኔ።<verse eid="PSA 94:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 94:23"/>ዒዚ ዻቢንቶ ዔያቶሲ ዔያቶም ማሃንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:23">ዔያቶ ፑርቱሞሮ ዒ ባይዛንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:23">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ማዔ ኑ ፆኦዛሢ ዔያቶ ጋጋፒሳንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 94:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 94"/>
  <chapter number="95" style="c" sid="PSA 95"/>
  <para style="s1">ጋላታ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 95:1"/>ሃኒ ሙኩዋቴ፤ ዎዛና ኑ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳም ዓይናዾም!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:1">ኑኡኮ ዻቂንቶ ላላሢም ኑ ዒላሾም!<verse eid="PSA 95:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 95:2"/>ዒዛም ማዓ ጋላታ ዓይኑሞ ዔኪ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:2">ኑ ዒዛ ቤርቶ ሺኢኮም!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:2">ዓይኑሞና ኑ ዒዛ ሄርሾም፤<verse eid="PSA 95:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 95:3"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዼኤፒ ፆኦሲታሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:3">ሜሌ ፆኦዛፓ ዑሣ ዒ ዼኤፒ ካኣቲታሢሮ።<verse eid="PSA 95:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 95:4"/>ሳዖ ዴማኣ ቢያ ዒዛ ኩጮ ጋራኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:4">ዹኮኮ ቶኦካኣ ዒዛሲኬ።<verse eid="PSA 95:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 95:5"/>ዒዚ ማዤሢሮ ባዛ ዒዛሮኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:5">ኩጫ ዒዛኮ ሳዖ ኮሼኔ።<verse eid="PSA 95:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 95:6"/>ሃኒ ሙኩዋቴ፤ ኑ ዒዛ ካኣሽኪ ዚጎም!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:6">ኑና ማዤ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ቤርታ ኑ ጉምዓቶም።<verse eid="PSA 95:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 95:7"/>ዒዚ ኑኡኮ ፆኦዛሢኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:7">ኑ ዒዛ ኩጮ ካፒፆ ዴማ ዓኣ ማራቶ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:7">ኑና ዒ ሄንቃ ዒዛኮ ዴሮኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:7">ዬያሮ ዒዚ ሃኖ ሂዚ ጌዒ ኬኤዛሢ ዋይዙዋቴ፦<verse eid="PSA 95:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 95:8"/>«ዬያ ዓሳ ናንጉዋ ዳውላ ሜሪባና ማሳ ጌይንታ ቤዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:8">ዒንሢኮ ቤርታኣ ዓዶንሢ ማዼሢጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:8">ዒንሢያ ዋይዚ ዒፃያ ማዒፖቴ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">95፡8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 3:15">ዔብ. 3፡15</ref>፤ <ref loc="HEB 4:7">4፡7</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 95:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 95:9"/>ዔያታ ማዾ ታኣሲ ዛጌያ ማዔያታቴያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:9">‹ታ ዎይታቴያ› ጌዒ ታና ዔያታ ዛጌኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:9">ማሂ ማሂ ታና ዔያታ ዎይታቴያ ዛጌኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">95፡9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 17:1-7">ኬሲ. ማፃ 17፡1-7</ref>፤ <ref loc="NUM 20:2-13">ፓይ. ማፃ 20፡2-13</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 95:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 95:10"/>ዬኖ ሾይንቶ ዖይዲታሚ ሌዔ ጉቤ ታኣኒ ሻኣኪንቴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:10">ዒማና ታኣኒያ፦ ‹ዒና ዔያቶኮ ታና ሃሼ ዴሬኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:10">ጎይፆዋ ታኣሲ ዔያታ ዔሩዋሴ› ጌዔኔ።<verse eid="PSA 95:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 95:11"/>ዬያሮ፦ ‹ፔቴታዖ ታኣኮ ሃውሾይዳ ዔያታ ጌላዓኬ›</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:11">ጌዒ ታኣኮ ዻጎና ታ ጫኣቄኔ።» <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">95፡11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:20-23">ፓይ. ማፃ 14፡20-23</ref>፤ <ref loc="DEU 1:34-36">ላሚ. ዎማ 1፡34-36</ref>፤ <ref loc="DEU 12:9-10">12፡9-10</ref>፤ <ref loc="HEB 4:3-5">ዔብ. 4፡3-5</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 95:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 95"/>
  <chapter number="96" style="c" sid="PSA 96"/>
  <para style="s1">ፆኦሲ ቢያሢኮ ዑፃ ማዔሢ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 16:23-33">1ፆኦሲ. ዓሃኬ 16፡23-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 96:1"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳም ዓኪ ዓይኑሞ ዓይናዹዋቴ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:1">ዓጫ ቢያ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳም ዓይናዹዋቴ!<verse eid="PSA 96:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 96:2"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳም ዓይናዹዋቴ፥ ዒዛኮ ሱንፆ ዓንጁዋቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:2">ዒዛኮ ዓውሲፆ ጉቴ ጉቴ ኬኤዙዋቴ።<verse eid="PSA 96:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 96:3"/>ቦንቾ ዒዛኮ ዴሮ ባኣካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:3">ዲቃሢ ሄርሺሳ ማዾዋ ዓሲ ቢያ ቤርታ ኬኤዙዋቴ!<verse eid="PSA 96:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 96:4"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዼኤፒኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:4">ዒዛ ሄርሻኒያ ኮይሳያኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:4">ሜሌ ካኣሽኮ ፆኦዛፓ ቢያ ዑሣ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:4">ዒዚ ዒጊጪንታንዳያ ኮይሳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 96:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 96:5"/>ሜሌ ዴሮ ፆኦዛ ቢያ ፃላሄሮኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:5">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ጋዓንቴ ጫሪንጮ ማዤኔ።<verse eid="PSA 96:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 96:6"/>ቦንቾና ዼኤፑሞዋ ዒዛ ኮራኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:6">ዒዛኮ ጌኤዦ ማኣራ ዶዱሞና ሚዛጱሞና ዓኣኔ።<verse eid="PSA 96:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 96:7"/>ሳዖይዳ ናንጋ ዴራ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ጋላቱዋቴ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:7">ዒዛኮ ቦንቾና ዎልቆናሮ ዒዛ ጋላቱዋቴ።<verse eid="PSA 96:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 96:8"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ሱንፆም ቦንቾ ዒንጉዋቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:8">ዒንጎ ባኣዚ ዓርቂ ዒዛኮ ዓሳ ቡካ ጶኦኮ ጌሉዋቴ።<verse eid="PSA 96:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 96:9"/>ዒዛኮ ዱማዼያ ማዔ ዼኤፑሞሮ ዒዛም ዚጉዋቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:9">ሳዓ ቢያ ዒዛ ቤርታ ጎጋይቁዋቴ።<verse eid="PSA 96:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 96:10"/>ዴሮ ቢያሢ ባኣካ፦ «ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ካኣታዼኔ!» ጎዑዋቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:10">ሳዔላ ዶዲና ማዢንቴሢሮ ዓጊፃዓኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:10">ዓሲም ቢያ ዒ ፒዙሞና ዎጋኔ።<verse eid="PSA 96:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 96:11"/>ጫሪንጫ ዎዛዹዋቴ! ሳዔሌ ኔኤኒያ ዎዛዼ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:11">ባዞንታ ዬያይዳ ዓኣ ባካ ቢያ ዑኡዞ ዋይዚሱዋቴ።<verse eid="PSA 96:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 96:12"/>ጎዦንታ ጊዳ ዓኣ ባካኣ ቢያ ፂኩዋቴ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:12">ያዺ ማዓዛ ካዮ ሚፃ ቢያ ዎዛና ዓይናዻንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 96:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 96:13"/>ዒዚ ሙካንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:13">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ቤርታ ዔያታ ዓይናዻንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:13">ሳዖይዳ ዎጋኒ ዒ ሙካንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:13">ሳዖይዳ ፂሉሞና ዴሮ ዑፃ ጎኑሞና ዎጋንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 96:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 96"/>
  <chapter number="97" style="c" sid="PSA 97"/>
  <para style="s1">ፆኦሲ ቢያፓ ዑሣ ማዒፆ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 97:1"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ካኣቲኬ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:1">ሳዔሌ ኔኤኒ ዎዛዼ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:1">ዒንሢ ባዞ ሳዛ ዓኣ ዓጫ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:1">ቢያ ዎዛዹዋቴ!<verse eid="PSA 97:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 97:2"/>ዒዛኮ ኮሮ ሻኣሬንታ ዹሜ ቃኣዮንታ ካንቂ ዓኣኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:2">ካኣቱሞ ዖይታ ፂሉሞና ፒዜ ዎጌና ጌሢንቴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 97:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 97:3"/>ዒዛኮ ቤርታ ታሚ ዓኣዻኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:3">ኮይሎ ዒዛኮ ማንጊ ዓኣ ሞርኮዋ ሚቻኔ።<verse eid="PSA 97:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 97:4"/>ዜኤሊንፃ ዒዛኮ ዓጮ ፖዓኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:4">ሳዓ ዬያ ዛጋዖ ጎጋይቃኔ።<verse eid="PSA 97:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 97:5"/>ዹካ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ቤርታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:5">ሳዓኣ ቢያ ዓዳ ሾፒጉዲ ዓልቄኔ።<verse eid="PSA 97:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 97:6"/>ጫሪንጫ ፂሉሞ ዒዛሲ ኬኤዛኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:6">ዴሬ ቢያ ቦንቾ ዒዛሲ ዛጋኔ።<verse eid="PSA 97:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 97:7"/>ዓርሲ ኮሾና ማላቶም ዚጋዞንሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:7">ሜሌ ካኣሽኮ ፆኦዞና ሄርሺንታዞንሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:7">ቢያ ቦርሲንቶንጎ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:7">ዒንሢ ሃይ ሜሌ ፆኦዛ ዒዛም ዚጉዋቴ።<verse eid="PSA 97:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 97:8"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:8">ዎጋ ኔኤሲ ፒዜ ማዔሢሮ ፂዮኔ ዴራ ዋይዚ ዎዛዼኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:8">ዪሁዳ ዓጮ ካታማኣ ሚርጌና ዎዛዼኔ።<verse eid="PSA 97:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 97:9"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ኔኤኒ ሳዖይዳ ቢያ ዼኤፒኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:9">ሜሌ ፆኦዞፓ ቢያ ኮሺ ኔኤኒ ዼጊ ጋዓያኬ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">97፡9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 29:1-2">ዓይኑ. 29፡1-2</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 97:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 97:10"/>ዒንሢ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ናሽካ ዓሳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:10">ፑርታ ባኣዚ ሻኣኪንቱዋቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:10">ጉሙርቂንታዞንሢኮ ዒዚ ሼምፓሢ ካፓሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:10">ዋይዞ ዒፃ ዓሶ ኩጫፓ ሄሊ ዒ ዔያቶ ዓውሳንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 97:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 97:11"/>ፖዓ ፂሎ ዓሶም</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:11">ዎዛኣ ዒና ፒዜ ማዔዞንሢም ኬስኪ ጴዻኔ።<verse eid="PSA 97:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 97:12"/>ዒንሢ ፂሎ ዓሳ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳና ዎዛዹዋቴ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:12">ዒዛኮ ዱማዼ ሱንፆዋ ጋላቱዋቴ።<verse eid="PSA 97:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 97"/>
  <chapter number="98" style="c" sid="PSA 98"/>
  <para style="s1">ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="d">ፆኦሲ ዓጮ ዎይሣያ ማዔሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 98:1"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳም ዓኪ ዓይኑሞ ሺኢሹዋቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:1">ፆኦሲ ፔ ዎልቄና ማዺንታ ዓኪ ባኣዚ ማዼኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:1">ዒዛኮ ሚዛቆ ኩጮንታ ዱማዼ ቃሳኣ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:1">ዻቂንታ ዔኪ ሙኬኔ።<verse eid="PSA 98:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 98:2"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዻቂሺፆ ፔኤሲ ዔርዜኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:2">ፂሉሞ ፔኤሲ ዴሮ ቤርታ ፔጋሴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 98:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 98:3"/>ዒስራዔኤሌ ዓሶም ፔኤኮ ሚጪንቲፆ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:3">ጉሙርቂንታያ ማዒፆዋ ማሌኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:3">ዓጫ ማዓ ካሮና ቢያ ኑ ፆኦዛሢኮ ዓውሲፆ ዛጌኔ።<verse eid="PSA 98:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 98:4"/>ሳዓ ናንጋ ዴራ ቢያ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳም ዒላሹዋቴ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:4">ሄርሺሢያ ዒዛም ሚርጊሹዋቴ፥ ዎዛና ዓይናዺ ጋላቱዋቴ።<verse eid="PSA 98:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 98:5"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳም</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:5">ሚርጌ ሻዦ ዴንሢ ዋርቆ ጎኦሎና ዓይናዹዋቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:5">ዓይኑሞ ዓንጋሞና ዑኡሲ ኬሲ ዒዛም ዓይናዹዋቴ።<verse eid="PSA 98:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 98:6"/>ዲንኮና ዛዬ ዑኡሲና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:6">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ማዔ ካኣታሢ ቤርታ ዒላሹዋቴ።<verse eid="PSA 98:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 98:7"/>ባዞንታ ዬያይዳ ዓኣ ባካ ቢያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:7">ሳዖንታ ዒኢካ ናንጋ ባካ ቢያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:7">ዑኡዞ ዋይዚሱዋቴ!<verse eid="PSA 98:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 98:8"/>ዎራ ኩጮ ፔኤኮ ባዖንጎ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:8">ዹካኣ ዎሊ ዑፃ ዓይናዾንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 98:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 98:9"/>ዬያታ ፆኦዛሢ ቤርታ ዓይናዾንጎ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:9">ዒዚ ሳዖይዳ ዎጋኒ ሙካንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:9">ዓጮ ዑፃ ዒዚ ፂሉሞና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:9">ዴሮ ዑፃኣ ጎኑሞና ዎጋንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 98:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 98"/>
  <chapter number="99" style="c" sid="PSA 99"/>
  <para style="s1">ፆኦሲ ዼኤፒ ካኣቲ ማዔሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 99:1"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ካኣታዼኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:1">ዴራ ጎጋይቆንጎ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:1">ዒዚ ኪሩቤኤሎ ዑፃ ዓኣ ካኣቱሞ ዖይታ ዴዔኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:1">ሳዓኣ ዓጊፆንጎ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">99፡1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:22">ኬሲ. ማፃ 25፡22</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 99:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 99:2"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ፂዮኔይዳ ዼኤፒኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:2">ዴሮኮ ቢያ ዑሣ ዒ ዼግ ዼጊ ጌዔኔ።<verse eid="PSA 99:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 99:3"/>ኔኤኮ ዔያታ ዼኤፑሞና ዒጊቻ ሱንፆና ሄርሾንጎ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:3">ዒዚ ዱማዼያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 99:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 99:4"/>ፒዜ ዎጌ ናሽካ ዎልቆ ካኣቲዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:4">ኔኤኒ ፒዜ ባኣዚ ማዺንታንዳጉዲ ማሄኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:4">ፒዜ ዎጊሢና ፂሉሞና ያይቆኦቤ ዓሶም ዔኪ ሙኬኔ።<verse eid="PSA 99:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 99:5"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ማዔ ኑ ፆኦዛሢ ዼግ ዼጊዱዋቴ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:5">ቶካ ዒዛኮ ሄርቃ ሳዖይዳ ዚጉዋቴ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:5">ዒዚ ዱማዼያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 99:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 99:6"/>ዒዛም ቄኤሶ ማዔዞንሢ ባኣካ ሙሴና ዓኣሮኔና ዓኣኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:6">ሃሣ ዒዛ ሺኢቄዞንሢ ባኣካፓ ሳሙዔኤሌ ፔቴሢኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:6">ዔያታ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዔኤላዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:6">ዒዚ ዔያቶም ማሂ ዬሄኔ።<verse eid="PSA 99:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 99:7"/>ቱርቱሮጉዲ ዔቄ ሻኣሮ ባኣኮይዳ ዒ ጌስቴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:7">ዔያታኣ ዒዚ ዔያቶም ዒንጌ ዳምቦና ዎጎና ካፔኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">99፡7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 33:9">ኬሲ. ማፃ 33፡9</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 99:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 99:8"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ማዔ ኑ ፆኦዛሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:8">ኔኤኒያ ዔያቶም ዬሄኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:8">ኔ ዔያቶኮ ዻቢንቶሮ ኮሜ ኮፃያ ማዔቴያ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:8">ኔኤኒ ዔያቶም ዓቶንጎ ጋዓ ፆኦሲኬ።<verse eid="PSA 99:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 99:9"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ማዔ ኑ ፆኦዛሢ ዼግ ዼጊዱዋቴ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:9">ዒዛኮ ዱማዼ ዹካ ዒዛም ዚጉዋቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:9">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ማዔ ኑ ፆኦዛሢ ዱማዼያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 99:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 99"/>
  <chapter number="100" style="c" sid="PSA 100"/>
  <para style="s1">ጋላታ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 100:1"/>ሳዓ ቢያ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳም ዒላሹዋቴ!<verse eid="PSA 100:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 100:2"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳም ዎዛና ማዹዋቴ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 100:2">ዎዛ ዓይኑሞ ዓይናዺሢና ዒዛ ቤርቶ ሺኢኩዋቴ።<verse eid="PSA 100:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 100:3"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ፆኦሲ ማዔሢ ዔሩዋቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 100:3">ኑና ማዤሢ ዒዛኬ፥ ኑኡኒ ዒዛሮኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 100:3">ኑኡኒ ዒዛ ዴሮ፥ ዒዚ ሄንቃ ማራቶኬ።<verse eid="PSA 100:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 100:4"/>ጋላታና ዒዛ ካሮ ባንሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 100:4">ሄርሺሢና ዓሳ ቡካ ጶኦኮዋ ጌሉዋቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 100:4">ጋላቱዋቴ፥ ሱንፆዋ ዒዛሲ ዓንጁዋቴ።<verse eid="PSA 100:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 100:5"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ኮሺ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 100:5">ሚጪንቲፃኣ ዒዛኮ ናንጊና ናንጋያኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 100:5">ዒዛኮ ጉሙርቂንቲፃ ሾይንቲፓ ሾይንቲ ሄላኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">100፡5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 16:34">1ፆኦሲ. ዓሃኬ 16፡34</ref>፤ <ref loc="2CH 5:13">2ፆኦሲ. ዓሃኬ 5፡13</ref>፤ <ref loc="2CH 7:3">7፡3</ref>፤ <ref loc="EZR 3:11">ዒዝ. 3፡11</ref>፤ <ref loc="PSA 106:1">ዓይኑ. 106፡1</ref>፤ <ref loc="PSA 107:1">107፡1</ref>፤ <ref loc="PSA 118:1">118፡1</ref>፤ <ref loc="PSA 136:1">136፡1</ref>፤ <ref loc="JER 33:11">ዔር. 33፡11</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 100:5"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 100"/>
  <chapter number="101" style="c" sid="PSA 101"/>
  <para style="s1">ዳውቴ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="d">ካኣታ ፆኦሲም ጫኣቃ ጫኣቁሞ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 101:1"/>ኔኤኮ ሚጪንቲፆና ፒዜ ዎጊፆና ዛሎ ታ ዓይናዻኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:1">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ጋላታ ዓይኑሞ ታ ኔኤም ሺኢሻኔ።<verse eid="PSA 101:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 101:2"/>ዻቢንቲባኣ ጎይፄሎ ዶዲሺ ታ ዓርቃንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:2">ኔኤኒ ታ ኮራ ዓይዲ ዬዓንዳይ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:2">ታ ማኣሮ ዓሶና ዎላ ፒዜ ዒኔና ታ ናንጋንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 101:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 101:3"/>ፑርታ ባኣዚ ማዺንቴም ታ ዛጊ ዚቲ ጋዓዓኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:3">ፆኦሲዳፓ ሃኬ ዓሳ ማዻ ባኮ ቢያ ታ ዒፃኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:3">ፔቴታዖ ታ ዔያቶና ዎላ ካኣማዓኬ።<verse eid="PSA 101:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 101:4"/>ዎቦ ዒና ዓኣ ዓሳ ታ ኮራፓ ሺኢኮንጎ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:4">ፑርቱሞና ዎላ ታኣኮ ፔቱሞ ባኣሴ።<verse eid="PSA 101:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 101:5"/>ፔ ላጋሢ ካሽካሺ ዾንካሢ ታ ጎራኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:5">ዖቶርቃ ዓኣፒና ሄርሺንታ ዒኔያ ዓኣ ዓሢ ታ ቲኢሩዋሴ።<verse eid="PSA 101:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 101:6"/>ታኣና ዎላ ናንጋንዳጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:6">ታኣኮ ዓኣፓ ሳዖይዳ ጉሙርቂንታዞንሢዳኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:6">ጌኤሺ ጎይሢና ሃንታሢ ዒዚ ታኣም ማዻንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 101:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 101:7"/>ጌሻያ ማዔ ዓይጎ ዓሲያ ታ ማኣሮይዳ ናንጋዓኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:7">ሉኡዙሞ ጌስታሢያ ታ ቤርታ ፒዝ ጌዒ ዔቃዓኬ።<verse eid="PSA 101:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 101:8"/>ሳዖይዳ ፑርቶ ማዻ ዓሶ ቢያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:8">ጉቴ ጉቴ ታ ባይዛንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:8">ፑርቶ ማዻ ዓሶ ቢያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:8">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ካታማፓ ታ ጋፒሳንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 101:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 101"/>
  <chapter number="102" style="c" sid="PSA 102"/>
  <para style="s1">ሜታዼ ዓሲ ዖዪሢና ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ሺኢቃ ሺኢጲሢ</para>
  <para style="d">ሜታዼ ዓሲ ሺኢቃ ሺኢጲሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 102:1"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ሺኢጲፆ ታኣሲ ዋይዜ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:1">ታኣኒ ዒላታ ዒላታ ኔ ኮራ ሄሎንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 102:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 102:2"/>ታኣኒ ሜታዼ ኬሎና ዓኣፖ ኔኤሲ ታ ጊዳፓ ማሂፖ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:2">ዋዮ ኔኤኮ ታ ባንሢ ማሄ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:2">ታኣኒ ኔና ዔኤላ ኬሎና ሩኡሪና ታኣም ዬሄ።<verse eid="PSA 102:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 102:3"/>ናንጎ ዎዳ ታኣኮ ጩቢጉዲ ዴንዲ ጋፓኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:3">ሜጌፃ ታኣኮ ዓዳ ናኣቦጉዲ ዖይዼኔ።<verse eid="PSA 102:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 102:4"/>ዒና ታኣኮ ቃኣያ ዎዼ ማኣቲጉዲ ሜሌኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:4">ካሣ ሙኡዚያ ታ ዋሌኔ።<verse eid="PSA 102:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 102:5"/>ታኣኮ ዒላታፓ ዔቄያና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:5">ዑፃ ታኣኮ ሜሊ ዓቴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 102:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 102:6"/>ዓሳ ናንጉዋ ዳውሎይዳ ዓኣ ሙኡታሌ ታ ማሌኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:6">ዶዔ ባዓ ቤስካ ዓኣ ኩኩቴ ማዔኔ።<verse eid="PSA 102:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 102:7"/>ጊንዓ ባኣያ ታ ዎርቃኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:7">ማኣሮኮ ሄላሢዳ ፔኤሮ ዓኣ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:7">ሚኢሻካፒ ታ ማዔኔ።<verse eid="PSA 102:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 102:8"/>ሞርካ ታኣኮ ሮኦሮ ጉቤ ታና ሚኢጫኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:8">ታና ፑርቲሳ ዓሳ ሱንፆ ታኣኮ ጋዳንቂንቴያ ማሂ ዛጋኔ።<verse eid="PSA 102:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 102:9"/>ዲቢንሢ ታኣኒ ዺኢሊጉዲ ኩኡሌኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:9">ዑዦ ታኣኮ ታኣኒ ዓቢፆና ሲኢሬኔ።<verse eid="PSA 102:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 102:10"/>ኔኤኮ ጎሪንቶና ዻጎናፓ ዔቄያና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:10">ሌካ ታና ኔ ኬሴ ቤዛፓ ሊካ ኬኤሬኔ።<verse eid="PSA 102:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 102:11"/>ናንጎ ሌዓ ታኣኮ ዓቢ ጌሊ ዔኤዤጉዲኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:11">ታኣኒያ ማኣቲጉዲ ሹሌኔ።<verse eid="PSA 102:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 102:12"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:12">ኔኤኒ ጋዓንቴ ናንጊና ኔኤኮ ካኣቱሞ ዖይታ ዴዔኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:12">ሱንፃ ኔኤኮ ሾይቲፓ ሾይንቲ ሄላንዳኣና ናንጋኔ።<verse eid="PSA 102:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 102:13"/>ኔ ዔቃንዳኔ፥ ፂዮኔያ ሚጪንታ ዓኣፒና ዛጋንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:13">ዒዞም ኔኤኒ ኮሹሞ ኔኤሲ ዻዋ ዎዶ ማዔሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:13">ኔ ጌዔ ዎዳ ሄሌኔ።<verse eid="PSA 102:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 102:14"/>ኔኤኮ ዓይላ ሹጮ ዒዞኮ ዛጊ ዎዛዻንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:14">ሳዖ ዓጮማኣ ሚጪንታንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 102:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 102:15"/>ዴራ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢ ሱንፆ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:15">ሳዖ ካኣታኣ ቢያ ቦንቾ ኔኤሲ ዒጊጫንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 102:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 102:16"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ፂዮኔ ጊንሣ ማሂ ማዣንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:16">ፔኤኮ ቦንቾና ፔጋዺ ጴዻንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 102:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 102:17"/>ዒዚ ማንቆ ዓሶ ሺኢጲፆ ባንሢ ዛጋንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:17">ዔያታ ሺኢቃ ሺኢጲፆ ዒ ቦሃዓኬ።<verse eid="PSA 102:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 102:18"/>ሃጊ ሾይንቲባኣ ዓሳ ዒዛ ጋላታንዳንጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:18">ሃያ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ማዼ ዲቃሢ ሄርሺሳ ባኮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:18">ሙካ ሾይንቶም ፃኣፑዋቴ።<verse eid="PSA 102:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 102:19"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዼጌ ቤዛ ዓኣ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:19">ናንጎ ማኣራፓ ሊካ ዛጌኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:19">ጫሪንጮይዳ ዓኣዖ ሳዖ ዛጌኔ።<verse eid="PSA 102:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 102:20"/>ዬያ ዒ ማዼሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:20">ቱኡቴ ዓሶኮ ዒላቶ ዋይዛኒ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:20">ሃይቆም ዎጊንቴ ዓሶዋ ዓውሳኒኬ።<verse eid="PSA 102:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 102:21"/>ዬያሮ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳኮ ሱንፃ ፂዮኔይዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:21">ጋላታኣ ዬሩሳላሜይዳ ኬኤዚንታንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 102:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 102:22"/>ዬይያ ዴሮንታ ካኣቶንታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:22">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ካኣሽካኒ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:22">ፔቱሞና ቡኪንታኣና ማዓንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 102:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 102:23"/>ዶዱሞ ታኣኮ ጎይፃ ዓይሴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:23">ናንጎ ታኣኮ ዒ ዑኬና ጋፒሴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 102:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 102:24"/>ዬካፓ ታኣኒያ፦ «ፆኦሲዮ ኔኤኒ ናንጋሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:24">ሾይንቲፓ ሾይንቲ ሄላንዳኣናታሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:24">ናንጎ ታኣሲ ታኣኒ ጋፒሲባኣንቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:24">ታ ናንጋ ሃጊ ዓኣ ጎይሣ ዓኣንቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:24">ታና ዔኪፖ» ጌዔኔ።<verse eid="PSA 102:24"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 102:25"/>ኔኤኒ ሚና ቤርታ ሳዖ ማዤኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:25">ጫሪንጫኣ ኔ ማዤሢኬ።<verse eid="PSA 102:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 102:26"/>ዔያታ ባይቃንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:26">ኔኤኒ ጋዓንቴ ዶዲ ናንጋንዳኔ።</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:26">ዬይ ቢያሢ ማኣዖጉዲ ጪንቃንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:26">ዓፒላጉዲያኣ ኔ ዔያቶ ላኣማንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:26">ዔያታ ቤዞና ኬኤሪንታንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 102:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 102:27"/>ኔኤኒ ጋዓንቴ ኔናኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:27">ሌዓኣ ኔኤኮ ፔቴታዖ ጋፑዋሴ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">102፡27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 1:10-12">ዔብ. 1፡10-12</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 102:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 102:28"/>ኔ ዓይሎኮ ናኣታ ዔያቶም ጊኢጌም ናንጋንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:28">ዜርፃ ዔያቶኮ ኔ ቤርታ ዶዲ ዴዓንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 102:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 102"/>
  <chapter number="103" style="c" sid="PSA 103"/>
  <para style="s1">ዳውቴ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="d">ፆኦሲ ናሹሞ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 103:1"/>ታኣኮ ሼምፔሌ! ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዓንጄ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:1">ታኣኮ ጋሮ ዑፃኣ ቢያ ዒዛኮ ዱማዼ ሱንፆ ጋላቱዋቴ።<verse eid="PSA 103:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 103:2"/>ታኣኮ ሼምፔሌ! ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዓንጄ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:2">ኔኤም ዒ ማዼ ባኮ ቢያ ዋሊፖ።<verse eid="PSA 103:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 103:3"/>ጎሞ ቢያ ኔኤኮ ዓቶም ጋዓሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:3">ሃርጎ ኔኤኮ ቢያ ፓሣሢ፥<verse eid="PSA 103:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 103:4"/>ናንጎ ኔኤኮ ባይሲንቶ ዔቶፓ ዓውሳሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:4">ፔኤኮ ሚጪንቲፆና ኮሹሞና ኔና ጎኦባሢ፥<verse eid="PSA 103:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 103:5"/>ጋርቼ ዎልቆ ኔኤኮ ዓዳ ኮኦኬ ጎይሢ ዓካሳሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:5">ኔኤኒ ማላ ባኮ ፔ ኮሹሞና ኩንሣሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:5">ኔኤም ዒዛኬ።<verse eid="PSA 103:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 103:6"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ሄርቂንቲ ዎርቃዞንሢም ቢያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:6">ፒዜ ዎጌ ዎጋኔ።<verse eid="PSA 103:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 103:7"/>ጎይፆ ፔኤሲ ሙሴም</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:7">ማዾዋ ፔኤሲ ዒስራዔኤሌ ዓሶም ዒ ቤኤዜኔ።<verse eid="PSA 103:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 103:8"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ሚጪንታያና ዓቶም ጋዓያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:8">ዻጋዻኒ ሩኡሩዋያና ናሹማኣ ሚርጌያኬ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">103፡8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 5:11">ያይ. 5፡11</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 103:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 103:9"/>ዒዚ ቢያ ዎዴ ዻቢንቲ ሙሪ ሃንቱዋሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:9">ዻጋዼ ጎይሣኣ ዴዑዋሴ።<verse eid="PSA 103:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 103:10"/>ዒዚ ኑም ኑኡኮ ጎሞጉዴያ ማሂ ዒንጊባኣሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:10">ኑ ዻቢንቶጉዴያኣ ጪጊባኣሴ።<verse eid="PSA 103:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 103:11"/>ጫሪንጫ ሳዓፓ ሌካ ዼጋሢጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:11">ዒዛኮ ሚጪንቲፃ ዒዛ ዒጊጫ ዓሶም ዼኤፒኬ።<verse eid="PSA 103:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 103:12"/>ዓባ ኬስካ ባንፃ ጌላ ባንፃፓ ሃካሢጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:12">ዻቢንቶ ኑኡሲ ኑፓ ዒ ሃኪሴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 103:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 103:13"/>ዓዴ ፔኤኮ ናኣቶ ሚጪንታሢጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:13">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዒዛ ዒጊጫዞንሢ ሚጪንታኔ።<verse eid="PSA 103:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 103:14"/>ዒዚ ኑኡኮ ማዢንቶ ዔዔራኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:14">ኑኡኒ ሲላሊ ማዔሢያ ማላኔ።<verse eid="PSA 103:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 103:15"/>ዓሲኮ ናንጎ ዎዳ ማኣቲጉዴያኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:15">ካይዚዳ ዑጊ ቡና ቡኒጉዲኬ።<verse eid="PSA 103:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 103:16"/>ካይዚ ቡኒ ዢባሬ ዢባርሻ ዎዶና ቤዞና ዲኢኒ ባይቃኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:16">ዬይ ዎንዴ ዒኢካ ዓኣያ ማዔሢያ ዔርቱዋሴ።<verse eid="PSA 103:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 103:17"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳኮ ሚጪንቲፃ ጋዓንቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:17">ናኣናና ዒዛ ዒጊጫዞንሢምኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:17">ዒዛኮ ፂሉማኣ ናዖኮ ናዖ ሄላንዳኣናኬ።<verse eid="PSA 103:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 103:18"/>ዒዚ ዬያ ማዻሢ ጫኣቁሞ ካፓዞንሢና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:18">ዓይሢፆዋ ዶዲ ካፓዞንሢምኬ።<verse eid="PSA 103:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 103:19"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳኮ ካኣቱሞ ዖይታ ጫሪንጫ ዶዴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:19">ካኣቱማኣ ዒዛሲ ቢያሢ ዎይሣኔ።<verse eid="PSA 103:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 103:20"/>ዒንሢ ዒዛኮ ቃኣሎም ዓይሢንታ ኪኢታንቻ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:20">ዒዛኮ ዓይሢፆ ማዺ ኩንሣ ዎልቆሮንሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:20">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዓንጁዋቴ።<verse eid="PSA 103:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 103:21"/>ዒንሢ ዒዛኮ ማሊፆ ማዺ ኩንሣ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:21">ጫሪንጫ ዓኣ ማዢንታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:21">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዓንጁዋቴ።<verse eid="PSA 103:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 103:22"/>ዒንሢ ዒዚ ዎይሣ ዓጫ ናንጋ ዓሳ ቢያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:22">ማዢንታኣ ቢያ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዓንጁዋቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:22">ታ ሼምፔሌ! ዒዛ ዓንጄ።<verse eid="PSA 103:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 103"/>
  <chapter number="104" style="c" sid="PSA 104"/>
  <para style="s1">ማዤ ፆኦዛሢም ሺኢኬ ጋላታ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 104:1"/>ታ ሼምፔሌ! ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዓንጄ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:1">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ማዔ ታ ፆኦዛሢዮ! ኔኤኒ ኮሺ ዼኤፒኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:1">ቦንቾና ዼኤፑሞና ኔ ማይንቴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 104:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 104:2"/>ኔ ኔና ፖዒና ካንቄኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:2">ጫሪንጮ ኔኤኒ ዓፒላጉዲ ዳሬኔ።<verse eid="PSA 104:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 104:3"/>ማኣሮ ኔኤሲ ኔኤኒ ሎ ዋኣፆ ዑፃ ማዤኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:3">ሻኣሮ ኔኤኮ ሳርጌሎ ዖይቶ ማሄኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:3">ዢባራ ኔኤኮ ጋኣሲ ማዔም ኔ ባራናኔ።<verse eid="PSA 104:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 104:4"/>ኪኢታንቾ ኔኤኮ ኔ ዢባሬ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:4">ዓይሎ ኔኤሲ ታሚ ሎስቴ ኔኤኒ ማሄኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">104፡4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 1:7">ዔብ. 1፡7</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 104:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 104:5"/>ናንጊና ዓጊፁዋጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:5">ሳዖ ማዢንቴ ቤዛ ዶዲሺ ኔ ዴይሤኔ።<verse eid="PSA 104:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 104:6"/>ባዞና ዓፒላጉዲ ሳዖ ኔ ካንቄኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:6">ዋኣፃ ዹኮኮ ቶኦኪና ማዔኔ።<verse eid="PSA 104:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 104:7"/>ዔያቶ ኔ ጎሬ ዎዶና ጋዓንቴ ቤዞና ሺኢኬኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:7">ኔኤኮ ጉጉንፆ ዑኡዞ ዔያታ ዋይዛዖ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:7">ጳሽኪ ፑኔኔ።<verse eid="PSA 104:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 104:8"/>ዹኮኮ ዑፃ ዔያታ ላኣሊንቴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:8">ኔኤኒ ዔያቶም ጊኢጊሼ፥ ዶኦጫዼ ጊንፆ ዎቴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 104:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 104:9"/>ጊንሣ ዔያታ ሳዖ ዔኤዺ ባይዙዋጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:9">ዑሣ ኬስኪያ ላኣሊንቱዋጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:9">ጌዲ ኔ ጌሤኔ።<verse eid="PSA 104:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 104:10"/>ዓልቃ ዋኣፃ ዶኦጫዼ ጊንፆ ዎታንዳጉዲ ኔ ማሄኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:10">ዹኮኮዋ ባኣኮና ዔያታ ዎታኔ።<verse eid="PSA 104:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 104:11"/>ካዮ ቦዓ ዒኢካፓ ዑሽካኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:11">ኪርሞላ ዒኢካፓ ዼኤቦ ፔኤሲ ዛኣራኔ።<verse eid="PSA 104:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 104:12"/>ካፓ ማኣሮ ፔኤኮ ዎሮ ዓጫ ማዣኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:12">ሚፆ ካኣፖ ባኣካኣ ዱላኔ።<verse eid="PSA 104:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 104:13"/>ኔኤኒ ሎ ኔ ማኣራፓ ዹኮ ዑሻኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:13">ሳዓኣ ኔ ማዾ ዓኣፖ ሙይ ሚሽካኔ።<verse eid="PSA 104:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 104:14"/>ቆልሞም ሳዓፓ ማኣቲ ኔ ባቃልሳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:14">ዓሲም ሙኡዚ ማኣዳንዳ ዱማ ዱማ ባኣዚ ኔ ኬሳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 104:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 104:15"/>ዓሲ ዎዛሳ ዎይኔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:15">ዓኣፖ ካሮዋ ዓኣዒሳ ዛይቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:15">ዎልቄ ዒንጊ ዶዲሻ ሃኣኮዋ ዒኢፓ ጴዻኔ።<verse eid="PSA 104:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 104:16"/>ዬያጉዲ ሃሣ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳኮ ሚፃ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:16">ዒዚ ቱኬ ሊባኖኦሴ ሚፃ ዋኣፆ ዑሽኪ ሚሽካኔ።<verse eid="PSA 104:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 104:17"/>ካፓ ፔኤኮ ማኣሮ ዒኢካ ማዣኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:17">ቦኦካሢ ዚቢቆ ባኣካ ዎርቆ ቤሲ ዴንቃኔ።<verse eid="PSA 104:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 104:18"/>ዖዶዞ ዹካ ዎሻ ናንጋ ቤሲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:18">ላሎ ቆኦፓኣ ሾኦና ጌላ ቤሲኬ።<verse eid="PSA 104:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 104:19"/>ዓጊና ዎዶ ዱማሳንዳጉዲ ኔ ማዼኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:19">ዓባኣ ፔ ጌላ ዎዶ ዔዔራኔ።<verse eid="PSA 104:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 104:20"/>ሳዓ ኔ ዓሚሻዛ ዹሚ ማዓኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:20">ዒማና ካዮ ቦዓ ቢያ ኬስኪ ዲርጊ ሺራኔ።<verse eid="PSA 104:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 104:21"/>ሃጊ ዔቃ ዞባ ሙዖ ኮይ ጉዻኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:21">ሙዖንዶ ባኮዋ ፆኦሲዳፓ ኮዓኔ።<verse eid="PSA 104:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 104:22"/>ዓባ ፆርቃኣና ዓኣሺንቲ ካዮ ጌላኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:22">ፔኤኮ ቡኡላ ቡኡላ ጌሊ ላሃኔ።<verse eid="PSA 104:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 104:23"/>ዬካፓ ዓሳ ማዾይዳ ሶኦፓኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:23">ሳዓ ዓማንዳያ ሄላንዳኣና ፔኤቃኔ።<verse eid="PSA 104:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 104:24"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:24">ማዻ ኔኤኮ ዎዚ ሚርጋይ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:24">ዬያ ቢያ ኔኤኒ ኔ ቢታንቶና ኮሼኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:24">ሳዓ ኔኤኒ ማዤ ማዢንቶና ኩሜኔ።<verse eid="PSA 104:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 104:25"/>ሃይ ዼኤፖ ባዛ ዳልጊና ሚጪንቴያኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:25">ዼኤፒንታ ዻካ ቦዖንታ ፓይዲባኣ ዓጊፃ ባኣዚ ዒኢካ ዓኣኔ።<verse eid="PSA 104:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 104:26"/>ዋኣፆ ካኣሚላ ዒኢካ ዑፃ ሃንታኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:26">ኔኤኒ ማዤ ሌዋታኔያ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">104፡26 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ሌዋታኔ </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ሌዋታኔ ጌይንታ ቦዓሢ ጉርጉሮጉዴያ ዼኤፒ ቦዖ ዋኣሢዳ ናንጋያኬ። </char></note> ዒኢካ ዴማ ዓማላኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">104፡26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 41:1">ዒዮ. 41፡1</ref>፤ <ref loc="PSA 74:14">ዓይኑ. 74፡14</ref>፤ <ref loc="ISA 27:1">ዒሲ. 27፡1</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 104:26"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 104:27"/>ዔያታ ሙዓንዳ ባኮ ዎዶና ኔ ዔያቶም ዒንጋኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:27">ዬይ ቢያ ዎዛና ኔና ካፓኔ።<verse eid="PSA 104:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 104:28"/>ኔኤኒ ዔያቶም ዒንጋ ዎዶና ዬያ ዔያታ ቡኩሳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:28">ኔኤኮ ኩጮ ኔ ቡላ ዎዶና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:28">ኮሺ ባኣዚ ሙዒ ዔያታ ሚሽካኔ።<verse eid="PSA 104:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 104:29"/>ዔያቶይዳፓ ዓኣፖ ካሮ ኔኤኮ ኔ ሺርሻዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:29">ዲቃቲሢ ሌሊ ዔያታ ሚርጋኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:29">ሼምፓሢ ኔ ዔያቶኮ ዔካዛ ሃሃይቃኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:29">ኬስኬ ዓጮ ባንሢያ ማዓኔ።<verse eid="PSA 104:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 104:30"/>ኔኤኮ ዓያኖ ኔ ዳካዛ ዔያታ ማማዢንታኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:30">ሳዖዋ ኔኤኒ ዓኪ ማሃኔ።<verse eid="PSA 104:30"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 104:31"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳኮ ቦንቻ ናንጊና ዶዲ ናንጎም፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:31">ዒዚ ፔኤኮ ማዼ ማዾና ዎዛዾንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 104:31"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 104:32"/>ሳዖ ዒዚ ዛጋዛ ዓዓጊፃኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:32">ዹኮዋ ካኣማዛ ጩጩባኔ።<verse eid="PSA 104:32"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 104:33"/>ታኣኒ ሼምፔና ዓኣና ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳም ዓይናዻንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:33">ዔቂ ታ ሃንታ ዎዳ ዒዛ ታ ዓኣሣንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 104:33"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 104:34"/>ታኣኒ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳና ዎዛዻሢጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:34">ታ ማሊፃ ዒዛ ዎዛሶንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 104:34"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 104:35"/>ጎሞ ዓሳ ሳዓፓ ባይቆንጎ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:35">ዋይዞ ዒፃ ዓሳ ማይ ሃይፓ ሴካ ጴዾፓ!</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 104:35"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:35">ታ ሼምፔሌ! ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዓንጄ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:35">ጋላቲያ ዒዛ ጋላቴ።<verse eid="PSA 104:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 104"/>
  <chapter number="105" style="c" sid="PSA 105"/>
  <para style="s1">ፆኦሲና ዒዛኮ ዴሮና</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 16:8-22">1ፆኦሲ. ዓሃኬ 16፡8-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 105:1"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ጋላቱዋቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:1">ሱንፆ ዒዛኮ ዔኤሉዋቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:1">ማዾዋ ዒዛሲ ዴሮ ባኣካ ፔጋሲ ዻውዋቴ።<verse eid="PSA 105:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 105:2"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳም ጋላታ ዓይኑሞ ዓይናዹዋቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:2">ዒዛኮ ዲቃሢ ሄርሺሳ ማዾዋ ቢያ ኬኤዙዋቴ።<verse eid="PSA 105:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 105:3"/>ዱማዼ ሱንፆ ዒዛኮ ሄርሹዋቴ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:3">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ኮዓ ዓሳ ቢያ ዎዛዾንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 105:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 105:4"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳንታ ዶዱሞዋ ዒዛኮ ኮዑዋቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:4">ቢያ ዎዴ ዓኣፖ ካሮ ዒዛሲ ኮዑዋቴ።<verse eid="PSA 105:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5-6" style="v" sid="PSA 105:5-6"/>ፆኦሲ ዓይላሢ ዓብራሃሜ ናይዮቴ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:5-6">ዒንሢ ያይቆኦቤ ናኣታ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:5-6">ፆኦሲ ማዼ ዲቃሢ ሄርሺሳ ባኮንታ ዒዚ ዒንጌ ዎጎንታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:5-6">ዒ ማዼ ዲቃሢ ሄርሺሳ ባኮዋ ማሊ ጶቂሡዋቴ።<verse eid="PSA 105:5-6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 105:7"/>ዒዚ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ማዔ ፆኦዛሢኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:7">ዎጋ ዒዛሲ ዓጮ ቢያይዳኬ።<verse eid="PSA 105:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 105:8"/>ዒ ጫኣቄ ጫኣቁሞ ዒዛሲ ናንጊና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:8">ዒ ዓይሤ ቃኣሎዋ ሺያ ሾይንቲ ሄላንዳኣና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:8">ማሌ ጎይሣኬ።<verse eid="PSA 105:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 105:9"/>ዓብራሃሜና ዒዚ ጫኣቄ ጫኣቁሞ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:9">ዪሳኣቄም ሳላዺ ዒ ዒንጌ ዎዞ ዋሉዋሴ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">105፡9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:7">ማዢ. ማፃ 12፡7</ref>፤ <ref loc="GEN 17:8">17፡8</ref>፤ <ref loc="GEN 26:3">26፡3</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 105:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 105:10"/>ያይቆኦቤም ዒ ዬያ ዳምቤ ማሂ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:10">ዒስራዔኤሌማኣ ናንጊና ጫኣቄያ ማሂ ዶዲሼኔ።<verse eid="PSA 105:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 105:11"/>ዒማና ዒዚ፦ «ኔ ዴኔ ማሂ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:11">ካኣናኔ ታ ኔኤም ዒንጋንዳኔ» ጌዔኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">105፡11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:13">ማዢ. ማፃ 28፡13</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 105:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 105:12"/>ዬይ ያዼ ማዔሢ ዔያቶኮ ፓይዳ ሚርጊባኣንቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:12">ዬኖ ዓጬሎም ዔያታ ሾኦቺ ማዒ ዓኣንቴኬ።<verse eid="PSA 105:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 105:13"/>ዬያ ዴሮ ኮራፓ ሜሌ ዴሬ ባንሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:13">ፔቴ ዓጮፓ ሜሌ ዓጪ ባንሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:13">ቤቲ ቤቲ ዔያታ ሜታዼኔ።<verse eid="PSA 105:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 105:14"/>ዖኦኒያ ጌኔ ማዾ ዔያቶ ዑፃ ማዻንዳጉዲ ዒ ሃሺባኣሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:14">ዔያቶ ዛሎሮ፦<verse eid="PSA 105:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 105:15"/>«ታ ዶኦሜዞንሢ ሄሊፖቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:15">ታ ማሊፆ ኬኤዛዚንሢ ዑፃ ፑርታ ማዺፖቴ» ጌዒ ካኣቶ ጎሬኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">105፡15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 20:3-7">ማዢ. ማፃ 20፡3-7</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 105:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 105:16"/>ዓጮይዳ ዒ ናይዚ ዔኤሌኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:16">ሃኣኮ ጎዖ ባኣዚያ ቢያ ባይዜኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">105፡16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 41:53-57">ማዢ. ማፃ 41፡53-57</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 105:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 105:17"/>ዓይሌ ማዒ ሻንቺንቴ ዓሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:17">ዮሴፔ ዔያቶኮ ቤርታሲ ዳኬኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">105፡17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 37:28">ማዢ. ማፃ 37፡28</ref>፤ <ref loc="GEN 45:5">45፡5</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 105:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 105:18"/>ዒማና ቶካ ዒዛኮ ዓንጊ ዱፄና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:18">ዒዛኮ ዑፃኣ ዓንጊና ቱኡቴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 105:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 105:19"/>ዒዛም ሎንሢንቴ ቃኣላ ኩማንዳያ ሄላንዳኣና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:19">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳኮ ቃኣላ ዮሴፔ ዎይታቴያ ጌዒ ዛጌኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">105፡19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 39:20-40:23">ማዢ. ማፃ 39፡20—40፡23</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 105:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 105:20"/>ዬካፓ ካኣቲ ዓሲ ዳኪ ዒዛ ቡሊሴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:20">ዓሶ ዎይሣሢያ ዒዛ ኬሴኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">105፡20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 41:14">ማዢ. ማፃ 41፡14</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 105:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 105:21"/>ማኣሮኮ ዓዳሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:21">ፔኤኮ ዓኣ ባኮ ቢያ ዎይሣያ ዒዛ ማሄኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">105፡21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 41:39-41">ማዢ. ማፃ 41፡39-41</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 105:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 105:22"/>ዬይያ ሱኡጎ ዒ ፔ ዔራ ጎይፆ ማዺሻንዳጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:22">ዼኤፖ ዓሶዋ ዔራቶ ዔርዛንዳጉዲኬ።<verse eid="PSA 105:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 105:23"/>ዒስራዔኤሌ ጊብፄ ዓኣዼኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:23">ያይቆኦቤያ ካኣሜ ዓጫ ሙኬ ዓሲ ማዒ ናንጌኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">105፡23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 46:6">ማዢ. ማፃ 46፡6</ref>፤ <ref loc="GEN 47:11">47፡11</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 105:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 105:24"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዴሮ ፔኤሲ ኮሺ ሚርጊሼኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:24">ዔያቶኮ ሞርኮይዳፓ ባሼ ዶዲ ማሄኔ።<verse eid="PSA 105:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 105:25"/>ፔኤኮ ዴሮ ዬይ ዓሳ ዒፃንዳጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:25">ዒዛ ዓሶ ዑፃ ፑርቱሞ ማላንዳጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:25">ዒኖ ዔያቶኮ ዱማሴኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">105፡25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 1:7-14">ኬሲ. ማፃ 1፡7-14</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 105:25"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 105:26"/>ዒዛኮ ዓይላሢ ሙሴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:26">ዒዚ ዶኦሬ ዓኣሮኔያ ዳኬኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">105፡26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:1-4:17">ኬሲ. ማፃ 3፡1—4፡17</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 105:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 105:27"/>ዔያታ ፆኦሲ ፔ ዎልቆና ማዻ ማላቶ ዬያቶ ባኣካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:27">ዲቃሢ ሄርሺሳ ባኮዋ ካኣሜ ዓጮይዳ ማዼኔ።<verse eid="PSA 105:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 105:28"/>ፆኦሲ ሳዖ ዹማንዳጉዲ ማሂ ዹሚሼኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:28">ያዺ ማዔቴያ ጊብፄ ዓሳ ዓይሢፆ ዒዛሲ ኩንሢባኣሴ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">105፡28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 10:21-23">ኬሲ. ማፃ 10፡21-23</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 105:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 105:29"/>ዋኣፆ ዔያቶኮ ዒ ሱጉሢ ማሄኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:29">ሞላሢያ ዎዼኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">105፡29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 7:17-21">ኬሲ. ማፃ 7፡17-21</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 105:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 105:30"/>ዔያቶኮ ዓጮንታ ካኣቲ ማኣራኣ ዓቱዋንቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:30">ፓንቃ ኩሚ ካራ ባይዜኔ፤ <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">105፡30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 8:1-6">ኬሲ. ማፃ 8፡1-6</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 105:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 105:31"/>ፆኦሲ ዓይሣዛ፥ ዉፃሌ ሻኣሬጉዴያ ሙኬኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:31">ጉኡኔያ ዓጮ ዔያቶኮ ባይዜኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">105፡31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 8:16-17">ኬሲ. ማፃ 8፡16-17</ref>፤ <ref loc="EXO 20:24">20፡24</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 105:31"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 105:32"/>ዒሮ ዔያቶኮ ዒ ሻቺ ማሄኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:32">ሳዖ ዔያቶሲ ቢያ ጉጉንሢ ዱኬኔ።<verse eid="PSA 105:32"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 105:33"/>ዎይኖ ሚፆንታ ቤሌሶዋ ባይዜኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:33">ዓጫ ዓኣ ሚፆ ሜንሢ ዒ ጋኣጬኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">105፡33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 9:22-25">ኬሲ. ማፃ 9፡22-25</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 105:33"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 105:34"/>ፆኦሲ ዓይሣዛ ዓቢሢ ሙኬኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:34">ሃይማኬ ጌይንቱዋ ማካ ቤዞና ዬዔኔ።<verse eid="PSA 105:34"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 105:35"/>ሳዖይዳ ባቃሌ ባኮ ቢያ ሙዔኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:35">ዔያቶኮ ጎሽኮና ጎዦዋ ፒፂ ባይቄኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">105፡35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 10:12-15">ኬሲ. ማፃ 10፡12-15</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 105:35"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 105:36"/>ዔያቶኮ ዓጮይዳ ዓኣ ቆልሞኮ ቤርቶ ናኣቶንታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:36">ዓሶኮዋ ቶይዶ ናኣቶ ቢያ ዎዼኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">105፡36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:29">ኬሲ. ማፃ 12፡29</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 105:36"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 105:37"/>ዒማና ዒስራዔኤሌ ዓሳ ቢሮንታ ዎርቆንታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:37">ጫኣኒ ዔኪ ኬስካንዳጉዲ ዒ ማዼኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:37">ዔያቶ ዜርፃፓ ፔቴታዖ ጊንሢም ዓቲባኣሴ።<verse eid="PSA 105:37"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 105:38"/>ጊብፄ ዓሳ ዔያቶ ሚርጌና ዒጊጬሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:38">ኬስኪ ዔያታ ዓኣዻኣና ዎዛዼኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">105፡38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:33-36">ኬሲ. ማፃ 12፡33-36</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 105:38"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 105:39"/>ሻኣሮ ዔያቶም ጎኦቦ ዓቢላጉዲ ጌሤኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:39">ዋንቶ ታሚ ዔያቶም ዒ ፖዒሴኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">105፡39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:21-22">ኬሲ. ማፃ 13፡21-22</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 105:39"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 105:40"/>ዔያታ ዒዛ ዖኦጫዛ ፑሮ ዔያቶም ዒ ዳኬኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:40">ጫሪንጮ ካሦዋ ሙኡዚ ሚሼኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">105፡40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 16:2-15">ኬሲ. ማፃ 16፡2-15</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 105:40"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 105:41"/>ላሎ ዒ ዳርዜም ዋኣሢ ጎዔኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:41">ዓሲ ናንጉዋ ዳውሎይዳ ዎርዚጉዲ ዎቴኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">105፡41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 17:1-7">ኬሲ. ማፃ 17፡1-7</ref>፤ <ref loc="NUM 20:2-13">ፓይ. ማፃ 20፡2-13</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 105:41"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 105:42"/>ፔኤኮ ዓይላሢ ዓብራሃሜም ዒ ዒንጌ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:42">ዱማዼ ዎዞ ቃኣሎ ማሌኔ።<verse eid="PSA 105:42"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 105:43"/>ዴሮ ፔኤኮ ዎዛና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:43">ዒ ዶኦሬዞንሢያ ዒላሺሲ ኬሴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 105:43"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 105:44"/>ሜሌ ዴሮ ዓጮ ዔያቶም ዒንጌኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:44">ዬያታ ላቤ ላቢፆ ሃኣታ ዔኬኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">105፡44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 11:16-23">ዒያ. 11፡16-23</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 105:44"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 105:45"/>ዬይያ ዳምቦ ዒዛኮ ዔያታ ካፓንዳጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:45">ዎጎ ዒዛሲያ ማዺ ኩንሣንዳጉዲኬ።</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 105:45"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:45">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳም ጋላታ!<verse eid="PSA 105:45"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 105"/>
  <chapter number="106" style="c" sid="PSA 106"/>
  <para style="s1">ፆኦሲ ፔ ዴሮም ኮሽካ ኮሹሞ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 106:1"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ጋላቱዋቴ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:1">ዒዚ ኮሺታሢሮና ናሹማኣ ናንጊና ናንጋያታሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:1">ዒዛ ጋላቱዋቴ! <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">106፡1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 16:34">1ፆኦሲ. ዓሃኬ 16፡34</ref>፤ <ref loc="2CH 5:13">2ፆኦሲ. ዓሃኬ 5፡13</ref>፤ <ref loc="EZR 3:11">ዒዝ. 3፡11</ref>፤ <ref loc="PSA 100:5">ዓይኑ. 100፡5</ref>፤ <ref loc="PSA 107:1">107፡1</ref>፤ <ref loc="PSA 118:1">118፡1</ref>፤ <ref loc="PSA 136:1">136፡1</ref>፤ <ref loc="JER 33:11">ዔር. 33፡11</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 106:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 106:2"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ማዻ ዼኤፖ ማዾ ዛሎ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:2">ዖኦኒ ኬኤዛኒ ዳንዳዓይ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:2">ዒዛም ማዓ ጋላቶዋ ቢያ ዖ ኬኤዚ ጋፒሳንዳይ?<verse eid="PSA 106:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 106:3"/>ፒዜ ዎጌ ዎቡዋጉዲ ካፓዞንሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:3">ቢያ ዎዴ ፂሎ ማዔዞንሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:3">ዓንጂንቴያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 106:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 106:4"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:4">ኔኤኮ ዴሮ ኔ ማኣዳ ዎዶና ማሊ ጶቂሤ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:4">ዔያቶ ኔ ዓውሳ ዎዶና ታና ማሌ።<verse eid="PSA 106:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 106:5"/>ዬይያ ኔኤኒ ዶኦሬዞንሢኮ ዖርጎቹሞ ታ ዛጋኒ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:5">ኔ ዴሮ ዎዞና ታ ዎዛዻኒ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:5">ኔ ዓሶና ዎላ ታ ኔና ሄርሻንዳጉዲኬ።<verse eid="PSA 106:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 106:6"/>ኑኡኒ ኑ ዓዶንሢጉዲ ጎሜ ማዼኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:6">ኑ ዻቢንቴኔ፥ ፑርታ ማዼኔ።<verse eid="PSA 106:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 106:7"/>ኑኡኮ ዓዶንሢ ጊብፄ ዓጫ ዓኣዖ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:7">ኔ ዎልቆና ማዺንታ ዓኮ ባኮ ማሊ ጶቂሢባኣሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:7">ኔኤኮ ሚጪንቲፆ ሚርጉሞዋ ዔያታ ማሊባኣሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:7">ዞቄ ባዞ ዓጫ ዋይዚ ኔኤም ዒፄኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">106፡7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 14:10-12">ኬሲ. ማፃ 14፡10-12</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 106:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 106:8"/>ዒዚ ጋዓንቴ ፔ ዎልቆኮ ዼኤፑሞ ቤኤዛኒ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:8">ፔ ሱንፆሮ ዔያቶ ዒ ዓውሴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 106:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 106:9"/>ዞቄ ባዞ ዒ ጎሬኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:9">ባዛኣ ሚጬኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:9">ዓሲ ናንጉዋ ዳውሌ ቦኦሊና ዓኣዾሢጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:9">ዋኣፆ ዔቶኮ ባኣኪና ዔኪ ዔያቶ ዒ ዓኣዼኔ።<verse eid="PSA 106:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 106:10"/>ዔያቶ ዒፃ ዓሶ ኩጫፓ ዒ ዓውሴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:10">ሞርኮ ኩጫፓኣ ዒ ሄሊ ዓይሴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 106:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 106:11"/>ሞርኮ ዔያቶኮ ዋኣፃ ሙዔኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:11">ዬያ ሞርኮይዳፓ ፔቴታዖ ቶሊ ዓቲባኣሴ።<verse eid="PSA 106:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 106:12"/>ዬካፓ ዔያታ ዔያቶም ኬኤዞና ቃኣሎ ጉሙርቄኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:12">ዓይኑሞናኣ ዒዛ ጋላቴኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">106፡12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 14:31">ኬሲ. ማፃ 14፡31</ref>።</char></note> <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">106፡12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 15:1-21">ኬሲ. ማፃ 15፡1-21</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 106:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 106:13"/>ጋዓንቴ ዔያታ ዒ ማዼ ባኮ ቤዞና ዋሌኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:13">ዒዛኮ ዞሮና ዓኣዻኒ ጊቢ ዳንዳዒባኣሴ።<verse eid="PSA 106:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 106:14"/>ዓሳ ናንጉዋ ዳውሎይዳ ሱኡካዺሢ ዔያታ ዓርቄኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:14">ዒኢካ ፆኦሲ ዎይታቴያ ጌዒ ዒዛ ዛጌኔ።<verse eid="PSA 106:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 106:15"/>ዒዚ ዔያታ ዒዛ ዖኦጬሢ ዔያቶም ዒንጌኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:15">ጋዓንቴ ዔያቶ ዖኦፒሳ ዶርዓ ዳኪንቴኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">106፡15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 11:4-34">ፓይ. ማፃ 11፡4-34</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 106:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 106:16"/>ጉርዶይዳ ዔያታ ዓኣዖ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:16">ሙሴንታ ፆኦሲም ዱማዼ ዓኣሮኔንታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:16">ማዻ ማዾ ዛጊ «ዬይ ዔያቶም ሌሊ ዓይጋ ማዔይ» ጌዒ ማሌኔ።<verse eid="PSA 106:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 106:17"/>ሳዓ ዳርዒ ዳኣታኔ ጎዖሢ ዔኤዼኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:17">ዓቤሮኔንታ ዒዛኮ ማኣሮ ዓሶዋ ጉኡፔኔ።<verse eid="PSA 106:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 106:18"/>ዔያቶኮ ቡኪንቶ ባኣካ ታሚ ዔኤቴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:18">ሎስታሢ ፑርቶ ዓሶ ሚቺ ባይዜኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">106፡18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 16:1-35">ፓይ. ማፃ 16፡1-35</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 106:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 106:19"/>ዔያታ ኮሬቤ ጌይንታ ቤዛ ዓኣዖ ዎርቄና ናኣሪ ኮሼኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:19">ዬያ ዓንጎ ሼኤሺ ማዦና ፆኦዞም ዚጌኔ።<verse eid="PSA 106:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 106:20"/>ዔያቶኮ ቦንቾ ማዔ ፆኦዛሢ ዔያታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:20">ማኣቶ ሄንቃ ቆልሞ ማላ ባኮና ላኣሜኔ።<verse eid="PSA 106:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 106:21"/>ጊብፄ ዓጮይዳ ዼኤፒ ባኣዚ ማዺ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:21">ዔያቶ ዓውሴ ፆኦዛሢ ዔያታ ዋሌኔ።<verse eid="PSA 106:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 106:22"/>ዒዚ ጋዓንቴ ካኣሜ ዓጮይዳ ዲቃሣ ማዾ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:22">ዞቄ ባዞይዳኣ ዲቃሢ ሄርሺሳ ባኣዚ ማዼኔ።<verse eid="PSA 106:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 106:23"/>ዬያሮ ዱማ ዱማ ዎዻ ባኮና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:23">ዔያቶ ዒ ባይዙዋጉዲ ማዻኒ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:23">ዒዚ ዶኦሬ ሙሴ ፆኦሲንታ ዔያቶንታ ባኣኮ ጌሊ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:23">ዒዛኮ ቤርታ ዔቂባኣያታቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:23">ዔያቶ ዒ ባይዛንዳሢ ኬኤዜያኬ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">106፡23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:1-14">ኬሲ. ማፃ 32፡1-14</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 106:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 106:24"/>ዬካፓ ዔያታ ኮዦ ዓጬሎ ቶኦቼኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:24">ዒዚ ዔያቶም ዒንጌ ዎዞ ቃኣሎዋ ጉሙርቂባኣሴ።<verse eid="PSA 106:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 106:25"/>ዔያታ ዓፒሎና ማዢንቴ ፔ ማኣራ ማኣራ ጉንዱሜኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:25">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢ ዑኡዞዋ ዋይዚባኣሴ።<verse eid="PSA 106:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 106:26"/>ዓሳ ናንጉዋ ዳውሎ ቦኦላ ዔያቶ ኬኤራኒ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:26">ኩጮ ፔኤሲ ዔቂሲ ዒ ጫኣቄኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">106፡26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:1-35">ፓይ. ማፃ 14፡1-35</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 106:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 106:27"/>ዜርፆ ዔያቶኮ ዒ ሜሌ ዴሮ ባኣካ ሃሻኒ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:27">ዱማ ዱማ ዓጮ ዔያቶ ላኣላኒ ጫኣቄኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">106፡27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:33">ሌዊ. ዓኬ 26፡33</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 106:27"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 106:28"/>ዔያታ ፔና ቢዔልፔጎሬና ዎላ ፔቴ ማሄኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:28">ሼምፓባኣ ፆኦዞም ሹኮና ዓሽኮዋ ሙዔኔ።<verse eid="PSA 106:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 106:29"/>ዔያታ ፔ ማዾና ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዻጋሴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:29">ዱማ ዱማ ባይዛ ባካ ዔያቶ ሄሌኔ።<verse eid="PSA 106:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 106:30"/>ጋዓንቴ ፒንሃሴ ዔቂ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:30">ዻቢንቶ ማዼ ዓሶ ዎዼ ዎዶና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:30">ዱማ ዱማ ዎዻ ባካ ዎዺፆ ሃሼኔ።<verse eid="PSA 106:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 106:31"/>ዬይያ ሾይንቲፓ ሾይንቲ ሄላንዳኣና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:31">ናንጊና ዒዛም ፂሉሞ ማዒ ፓይዲንቴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 106:31"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 106:32"/>ዬያጉዲ ሃሣ ሜሪባ ጌይንታ ዋኣፆ ዓጫ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:32">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዔያታ ዻጋሴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:32">ሙሴያ ዬያ ዛሎና ሜቶይዳ ኬዴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 106:32"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 106:33"/>ሙሴ ዔያታ ዻጋሴሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:33">ዒዚ ኮይሱዋ ዑኡሲ ፔ ዻንጋፓ ኬሴኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">106፡33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 20:2-13">ፓይ. ማፃ 20፡2-13</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 106:33"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 106:34"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዔያቶ ዓይሤ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:34">ሜሌ ዴሮ ባይዚፆ ዔያታ ሃሼኔ።<verse eid="PSA 106:34"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 106:35"/>ዔያታ ሜሌ ዴሮና ዎላ ሲኢሪንቴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:35">ዬይ ዓሳ ማዺ ሃንታ ባኮ ዔያታኣ ዔሬኔ።<verse eid="PSA 106:35"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 106:36"/>ዬያቶኮ ካኣሽኮ ፆኦዞዋ ዔያታ ካኣሽኬኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:36">ዬይ ዔያቶም ፒሮ ማዔኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">106፡36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 2:1-3">ሱኡጎ. ማፃ 2፡1-3</ref>፤ <ref loc="JDG 3:5-6">3፡5-6</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 106:36"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 106:37"/>ዔያቶኮ ዓቲንቆንታ ዉዱሮ ናኣቶንታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:37">ፑርቶ ዓያኖም ዔያታ ሹኬኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">106፡37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 17:17">2ካኣቶ. ማ 17፡17</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 106:37"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 106:38"/>ዔያቶኮ ዓቲንቆንታ ዉዱሮ ናኣቶንታኮ ጌኤዦ ሱጉፆ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:38">ሜሌ ካኣናኔ ፆኦዞም ላኣሊፆና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:38">ሳዔሎ ሱጉሢ ሳዓ ማሂ ዔያታ ዒኢሴኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">106፡38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 35:33">ፓይ. ማፃ 35፡33</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 106:38"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 106:39"/>ዔያታ ፔ ማዾና ዒኢቴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:39">ዞኦስካ ኮኦማ ላኣሊጉዲ ፔ ፆኦዛሢም ዔያታ ጉሙርቂንቲባኣሴ።<verse eid="PSA 106:39"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 106:40"/>ዬያሮ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳኮ ዻጋ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:40">ዒዛ ዴሮ ዑፃ ዔኤቴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:40">ፔ ዓሶዋ ዒ ሻኣኪንቴኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">106፡40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 2:14-18">ሱኡጎ. ማፃ 2፡14-18</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 106:40"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 106:41"/>ዔያቶ ዒዚ ሜሌ ዴሮም ዓኣሢ ዒንጌኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:41">ሞርካ ዔያቶኮ ዔያቶ ዎይሣያ ማዔኔ።<verse eid="PSA 106:41"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 106:42"/>ሞርካ ሄርቂ ዔያቶ ዎሣያ ማዔኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:42">ፔ ቢታንቶኮ ዴማ ማሄኔ።<verse eid="PSA 106:42"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 106:43"/>ዒዚ ሚርጌ ዎዴና ዔያቶ ሄሊ ዓውሴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:43">ዔያታ ጋዓንቴ ዋይዚ ዒፂሢ «ኑ ሃሻዓኬ» ጌዔኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:43">ፔ ጎሞና ዔያታ ዻውሲንቴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 106:43"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 106:44"/>ጋዓንቴ ዒላቶ ዔያቶኮ ዒ ዋይዜ ዎዶና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:44">ሜታሢ ዔያቶኮ ዛጌኔ።<verse eid="PSA 106:44"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 106:45"/>ዔያቶሮ ጌይጋፓ ጫኣቄ ጫኣቁሞ ዒ ማሌኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:45">ዒዛኮ ዓኣ ሚጪንቲፆ ሚርጉሞጉዴያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:45">ዻጋፓ ዒ ማዔኔ።<verse eid="PSA 106:45"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 106:46"/>ዔያቶ ዲዒ ዔኬ ዓሳ ቢያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:46">ሚጪንታንዳጉዲ ዒ ማዼኔ።<verse eid="PSA 106:46"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 106:47"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ማዔ ኑ ፆኦዛሢዮ! ዓውሴ ኑና፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:47">ኔኤኮ ዱማዼ ሱንፆም ጋላታ ኑ ሺኢሻንዳጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:47">ኔና ኑ ኬኤዚ ሄርሻንዳጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:47">ዴሮ ባኣካፓ ቡኩሲ ኑና ኔ ዔኪ ዬዔኔ።<verse eid="PSA 106:47"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 106:48"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ማዔ ዒስራዔኤሌ ፆኦዛሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:48">ናንጊፓ ናንጊ ሄላንዳኣና ዓንጂንቶንጎ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:48">ዴራ ቢያ ዓኣሜን ጎዖንጎ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:48">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ጋላቱዋቴ! <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">106፡48 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 16:35-36">1ፆኦሲ. ዓሃኬ 16፡35-36</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 106:48"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter eid="PSA 106"/>
  <chapter number="107" style="c" sid="PSA 107"/>
  <para style="ms">ዶንጋሳ ፓቂፆ</para>
  <para style="mr">(ዓይኑ. ማፃ ዓይ. 107—150)</para>
  <para style="s1">ፆኦሲ ኮሹሞ ዛሎ ጋላቲንቴ ጋላታ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 107:1"/>ኮሺ ማዔሢሮ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ጋላቱዋቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:1">ሚጪንቲፃ ዒዛኮ ናንጊና ናንጋያኬ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">107፡1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 16:34">1ፆኦሲ. ዓሃኬ 16፡34</ref>፤ <ref loc="2CH 5:13">2ፆኦሲ. ዓሃኬ 5፡13</ref>፤ <ref loc="2CH 7:3">7፡3</ref>፤ <ref loc="EZR 3:11">ዒዝ. 3፡11</ref>፤ <ref loc="PSA 100:5">ዓይኑ. 100፡5</ref>፤ <ref loc="PSA 106:1">106፡1</ref>፤ <ref loc="PSA 118:1">118፡1</ref>፤ <ref loc="PSA 136:1">136፡1</ref>፤ <ref loc="JER 33:11">ዔር. 33፡11</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 107:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 107:2"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ማሂ ሻንቂ ዓውሴ ዓሳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:2">ዒዚ ሞርኮ ኩጫፓ ሄሊ ዓውሴ ዓሳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:2">ሂዚ ጎዖንጎ፦<verse eid="PSA 107:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 107:3"/>ዓባ ኬስካ ባንፃፓ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:3">ጌላ ባንፃፓ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:3">ኬዶ ዛሎና ዾኦሎ ዛሎናይዳፓ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:3">ዓጮ ቢያይዳፓ ቡኬ ዓሳ ሂዚ ጎዖንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 107:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 107:4"/>ፔቴ ፔቴዞንሢ ዓሲ ናንጉዋ ዳውላ ዣኣሊ ሃንቴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:4">ዔያታ ናንጋ ካታሞ ሄሊሳ ጎይፆዋ ባይዜኔ።<verse eid="PSA 107:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 107:5"/>ናይዺንቴኔ፥ ዼኤቢንቴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:5">ማሊፃኣ ዔያቶኮ ላቤኔ።<verse eid="PSA 107:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 107:6"/>ዔያታ ሜታዼ ዎዶና ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ባንሢ ዒላቴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:6">ዒዚያ ሜታሢዳፓ ዔያቶ ዓውሴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 107:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 107:7"/>ዔያታ ናንጋ ካታሞ ባንሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:7">ፒዜ ጎይሢና ዔኪ ዓኣዼኔ።<verse eid="PSA 107:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 107:8"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳኮ ሚጪንቲፆ ዛሎሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:8">ዓሶማኣ ዒ ማዼ ዲቃሢ ሄርሺሳ ማዾሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:8">ዒዛ ጋላቶንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 107:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 107:9"/>ዒዚ ዼኤቢንቴ ዓሶኮ ዼኤቦ ማሃኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:9">ናይዺንቴ ዓሶዋ ኮሺ ባኣዚ ሙኡዚ ሚሻኔ።<verse eid="PSA 107:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 107:10"/>ፔቴ ፔቴ ዓሳ ካኒ ቢራታና ቱኡቲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:10">ሄርቂንቲያ ሜታዺ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:10">ሻኔ ዹሚዳኣ ዴዔኔ።<verse eid="PSA 107:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 107:11"/>ፆኦሲ ቃኣሎ ዋይዞ ዒፂፆና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:11">ዼኤፖ ፆኦዛሢኮ ዞሮ ዔያታ ቶኦቼኔ።<verse eid="PSA 107:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 107:12"/>ዬያሮ ዎልቄ ማዾ ማዺሲሢና ዒኖ ዔያቶኮ ዒ ላቢሴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:12">ጋፒ ዔያታ ላቤኔ፥ ማኣዳያ ጴዺባኣሴ።<verse eid="PSA 107:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 107:13"/>ዔያታ ሜታዼ ዎዶና ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ባንሢ ዒላቴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:13">ዒዚያ ሜታሢዳፓ ዔያቶ ዓውሴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 107:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 107:14"/>ሻኔ ዹሞይዳፓ ዔያቶ ዒ ኬሴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:14">ቱኮና ካኖ ቢራቶዋ ሜንሤኔ።<verse eid="PSA 107:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 107:15"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዒዛኮ ጋፑዋ ሚጪንቲፆሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:15">ዓሶማኣ ዒ ማዼ ዲቃሢ ሄርሺሳ ማዾሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:15">ዔያታ ዒዛ ጋላቶንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 107:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 107:16"/>ዒዚ ሞኦኖ ዓንጎና ዎዾና ካሮ ሜንሤኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:16">ዓንጎ ጋጋርዞዋ ሾኦሌኔ።<verse eid="PSA 107:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 107:17"/>ፔቴ ፔቴ ዓሳ ዋይዞ ዒፂፃፓ ዔቄያና ዔኤያ ማዔኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:17">ዻቢንታፓ ዔቄያናኣ ሜቶይዳ ኬዴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 107:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 107:18"/>ዑፃ ዔያቶኮ ዱማ ዱማ ሙዖ ሻኣኪንቴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:18">ሃይቃኒ ዔያታ ዑኬኔ።<verse eid="PSA 107:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 107:19"/>ዔያታ ሜታዼ ዎዶና ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ባንሢ ዒላቴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:19">ዒዚያ ዔያቶ ሜታሢዳፓ ዓውሴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 107:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 107:20"/>ዒዚ ፔ ቃኣሎ ዳኪ ዔያቶ ፓሤኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:20">ዱኡካኒ ዔኪ ዓኣዾንቴያ ዓውሴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 107:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 107:21"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዒዛኮ ጋፑዋ ሚጪንቲፆሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:21">ዓሶማኣ ዒ ማዼ ዲቃሢ ሄርሺሳ ማዾሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:21">ዔያታ ጋላቶንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 107:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 107:22"/>ጋላታ ዒዛም ዒንጎ ባኣዚ ማሂ ዔያታ ሺኢሾንጎ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:22">ማዾ ዒዛኮ ዎዛሳ ዓይኑሞና ፔጋሲ ዔርዞንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 107:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 107:23"/>ፔቴ ፔቴ ዓሳ ዋኣፆ ካኣሚሎና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:23">ባዞ ባንሢ ኬዴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:23">ዼኤፖ ዋኣፆ ዑፃኣ ፔ ማዾ ማዼኔ።<verse eid="PSA 107:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 107:24"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳኮ ማዾ ዒኢካ ዔያታ ዛጌኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:24">ዒዛኮ ዲቃሢ ሄርሺሳ ማዾ ዼኤፖ ዋኣፆይዳ ዴንቄኔ።<verse eid="PSA 107:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 107:25"/>ዒዚ ዓይሢ ዓልጎ ዢባሮ ዢባርሺሴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:25">ዢባራኣ ዋኣፆ ዓጊሢ ዴቼኔ።<verse eid="PSA 107:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 107:26"/>ሌካ ጫሪንጮ ኬስኬኔ፥ ሊካ ዴሞዋ ኬዴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:26">ሜታሢዳፓ ዔቄያና ጎጳ ዔያቶኮ ዋኣፄኔ።<verse eid="PSA 107:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 107:27"/>ዓዳ ማሢንቴ ዓሲጉዲ ዓኣፓ ሺሬም</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:27">ሴካ ሃንጋ ዔያታ ቡኡዲንቴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:27">ጎዖንዶ ጎይፆንታ ማዾንዶሢኮዋ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:27">ካራ ዔያቶም ባይቄኔ።<verse eid="PSA 107:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 107:28"/>ዔያታ ሜታዼ ዎዶና ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ባንሢ ዒላቴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:28">ዒዚያ ሜታሢዳፓ ዔያቶ ዓውሴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 107:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 107:29"/>ዓልጋሢ ዢባሮ ዒ ዚቲዴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:29">ባዞ ጉዳሢያ ዓጊፆ ላኣጌኔ።<verse eid="PSA 107:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 107:30"/>ዬይ ዚቲዮ ጌዔሢሮ ዔያታ ዎዛዼኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:30">ዔያታ ዔቂሳኒ ማሌ ዋኣፆ ካኣሚሎ ቤዞ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:30">ዒ ዔያቶ ሄሊሴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 107:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 107:31"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዒዛኮ ጋፑዋ ሚጪንቲፆሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:31">ዓሶማኣ ዒዚ ማዼ ዲቃሢ ሄርሺሳ ማዾሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:31">ዔያታ ዒዛ ጋላቶንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 107:31"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 107:32"/>ዴራ ቡኪንታ ቤዛ ዒዛ ዼግ ዼጊዶንጎ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:32">ጋርቾ ዓሶ ቡኪንቶይዳኣ ዒዛ ሄርሾንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 107:32"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 107:33"/>ዎሮ ዒዚ ዓሳ ናንጉዋ ዳውሎ ባንሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:33">ዓልቃ ዋኣፆዋ ዶዲ ሳዓ ማሄኔ።<verse eid="PSA 107:33"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 107:34"/>ዒኢካ ናንጋ ዓሶኮ ፑርቱማፓ ዔቄያና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:34">ኮዦ ዓጬሎ ሶኦጌና ሲኢሪንቴያ ዒ ማሄኔ።<verse eid="PSA 107:34"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 107:35"/>ዓሲ ናንጉዋ ዳውሎ ቦኦሎ ዋኣሢ ዴዓያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:35">ሜሎ ሳዖዋ ዓልቃ ዋኣሢ ዒ ማሄኔ።<verse eid="PSA 107:35"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 107:36"/>ናይዺንቴ ዓሶ ዒ ዒኢካ ጌሤኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:36">ዔያታ ናንጋ ካታማኣ ማዤኔ።<verse eid="PSA 107:36"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 107:37"/>ጎዦይዳ ዔያታ ዜርቄኔ፥ ዎይኔያ ቱኬኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:37">ሚርጌ ባኣዚያ ካፂሴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 107:37"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 107:38"/>ዔያቶ ዒ ዓንጄኔ፥ ኮሺያ ዔያታ ሚርጌኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:38">ዔያቶኮ ባኣቶ ፓይዶዋ ዒ ዻኪሲባኣሴ።<verse eid="PSA 107:38"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 107:39"/>ካራ ዔያታ ባይዚ ሜታዺ ዖዪሢና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:39">ፓይዳ ዔያቶኮ ዻኬም ቦርሲንቴኔ፤<verse eid="PSA 107:39"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 107:40"/>ቢቶ ዓሶ ፆኦሲ ዻውሲሴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:40">ዓሳ ናንጉዋ ዳውሎ ማኣሻሎይዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:40">ሜታዺ ሃንታንዳጉዲ ማዼኔ።<verse eid="PSA 107:40"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 107:41"/>ሜታዼ ዓሶ ጋዓንቴ ሜታሢዳፓ ጎቺ ዒ ኬሴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:41">ዔያቶኮ ማኣሮ ዓሶዋ ማራይጉዲ ሚርጊሼኔ።<verse eid="PSA 107:41"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 107:42"/>ዒኖ ፒዜ ዓሳ ዬያ ዛጊ ዎዛዻኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:42">ፑርቶ ማዻ ዓሳ ጋዓንቴ ቦርሲንቲ ዚቲ ጋዓኔ።<verse eid="PSA 107:42"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 107:43"/>ዓካሪ ዖኦኒያ ጪንጫ ማዔቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:43">ሃያ ባኮ ዒና ዔኮንጎ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:43">ዬያይዳሢ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳኮ ሚጪንቲፆ ማሊ ጶቂሦንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 107:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 107"/>
  <chapter number="108" style="c" sid="PSA 108"/>
  <para style="s1">ዳውቴኮ ጋላቶ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="d">ፆኦሲዳፓ ማኣዶ ዴንቃኒ ሺኢቂንቴ ሺኢጲሢ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="PSA 57:7-11">ዓይኑ. 57፡7-11</ref>፤ <ref loc="PSA 60:5-12">60፡5-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 108:1"/>ፆኦሲዮ! ዒና ታኣኮ ኔና ጉሙርቂ ሂርጉዋሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:1">ታኣኒ ዓይናዻንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:1">ጎኔ ዒናፓኣ ታ ዓይናዻንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 108:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 108:2"/>ሚርጌ ሻዦ ዴንሢ ዋርቆ ጎኦሎንታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:2">ሜሌ ዓይኑሞ ዓንጋማኣ ዔቁዋቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:2">ታኣኒያ ሚኢሪ ዔቃንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 108:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 108:3"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ዴሮ ባኣካ ታ ኔና ጋላታኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:3">ዓሶ ባኣካኣ ታ ኔኤም ዓይናዻኔ።<verse eid="PSA 108:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 108:4"/>ሚጪንቲፃ ኔኤኮ ጫሪንጫፓ ዑሣ ዼኤፒኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:4">ጉሙርቂንቲፃኣ ሌካ ሻኣሮ ሄላኔ።<verse eid="PSA 108:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 108:5"/>ፆኦሲዮ! ኔኤኒ ጫሪንጫፓ ዑሣ ሌካ ዼግ ዼጊ ጌዔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:5">ቦንቻ ኔኤሲ ሳዖ ዑፃ ቢያ ማዖንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 108:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 108:6"/>ኔ ናሽካ ዴራ ዻቃንዳጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:6">ኔኤኮ ሚዛቆ ኩጮና ታና ዓውሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:6">ታኣም ዋይዜ።<verse eid="PSA 108:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 108:7"/>ፆኦሲ ፔኤኮ ዱማዼ ማኣራፓ ሂዚ ጌዔኔ፦</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:7">«ታኣኒ ባሺ ሴኬሜ ዶኦጮ ፓቃንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:7">ሱኩቴ ዶኦጮዋ ታ ዴሮም ታ ጊሽካንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 108:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 108:8"/>ጌሌዓዴንታ ሚናሴንታ ታኣሮኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:8">ዔፕሬኤሜ ታኣኮ ዖሎሮ ቶኦካ ዓጎ ዓንጎ ቆኦባሢኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:8">ዪሁዳ ታኣኮ ካኣቱሞ ኮኦሎኬ።<verse eid="PSA 108:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 108:9"/>ሞዓኣቤ ታኣኮ ዋኣፆ ማስቶ ጎንጎኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:9">ዔዶኦሜይዳ ታ ዱርዞ ታኣኒ ኬሲ ጌሣንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:9">ፒሊስፄኤሜ ዓሶ ባሺ ታኣኒ ሜርታንዳኔ።»<verse eid="PSA 108:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 108:10"/>ኬልቂ ዲርቆና ካታሜሎ ባንሢ ዖ ታና ዔኪ ዓኣዻንዳይ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:10">ዔዶኦሜያ ዖ ታና ሄሊሳንዳይ?<verse eid="PSA 108:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 108:11"/>ፆኦሲዮ! ኬኤሪ ታና ሃሼሢ ኔናቱዋዓዳ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:11">ኑኡኮ ዖላ ዓሶና ዎላ ኬዞ ኔ ዒፄኔ።<verse eid="PSA 108:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 108:12"/>ሃሢያ ዓሲ ዓሲ ዓውሳኔ ጎዖሢ ጉሪኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:12">ኑ ሞርኮ ኑ ባሻንዳጉዲ ኔ ኑና ማኣዴ።<verse eid="PSA 108:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 108:13"/>ፆኦሲ ኑና ማኣዳዛ ዶዲ ኑ ማዓንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:13">ኑ ሞርኮ ኑ ቶኮ ዴማ ሄርቂሳንዳሢ ዒዛኬ።<verse eid="PSA 108:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 108"/>
  <chapter number="109" style="c" sid="PSA 109"/>
  <para style="s1">ዓይኑሞ ሱኡጋሢ ዓይሣ ጎይፆ ዓይናዺንታ ዳውቴ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="d">ሜቶይዳ ዓኣ ዓሲ ሺኢቃ ሺኢጲሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 109:1"/>ታ ኔና ጋላታ፥ ፆኦዛሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:1">ሃዳራ ዚቲዮ ጌዒፖ።<verse eid="PSA 109:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 109:2"/>ፑርቶ ዓሶና ጌሻ ዓሶና ታና ማኬኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:2">ታ ጊዳ ሉኡዙሞና ጌስታኔ።<verse eid="PSA 109:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 109:3"/>ዔያታ ታና ዒፃ ዑኡሲና ማንጌኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:3">ታ ማዼ ባኣዚ ባኣንቴ ታና ዔያታ ዖሌኔ።<verse eid="PSA 109:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 109:4"/>ታ ዔያቶ ናሽኬቴያ ዔያታ ታና ፑርታ ማሃኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:4">ታኣኒ ጋዓንቴ ዔያቶም ሺኢቄኔ።<verse eid="PSA 109:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 109:5"/>ታ ዔያቶም ኮሺ ማዼሢሮ ፑርታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:5">ታኣኒ ናሽኬሢሮ ዒፂ ታና ዔያታ ዒፄኔ።<verse eid="PSA 109:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 109:6"/>ዒዛም ዎጋንዳያ ፑርታ ዓሲ ጌሤ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:6">ዓሲ ዒዛ ዎጌና ዓይሢሳንዳጉዲ ማዼ።<verse eid="PSA 109:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 109:7"/>ዎጎና ጌስቶ ቤዛ ዻቢንቴያ ማዒ ዒ ጴዾንጎ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:7">ዒዚ ሺኢቃ ሺኢጲፃኣ ዒዛ ዎጋያ ማዖንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 109:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 109:8"/>ናንጎ ዎዳ ዒዛኮ ቃሚቆንጎ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:8">ሱኡጋቶ ዒዛሲ ሜሌ ዔኮንጎ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">109፡8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:20">ዳኪ. ማዾ 1፡20</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 109:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 109:9"/>ናኣታ ዒዛኮ ዓዴ ባኣያ ማዒ ዓቶንጎ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:9">ማቻኣ ዜኤሪንዶ ማዖንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 109:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 109:10"/>ናኣታ ዒዛሲ ካራ ባይዚ ሜታዾንጎ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:10">ሺኢቂ ሃንታያ ማዖንጎ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:10">ዔያቶኮ ሻሂንቴ ማኣራፓ ዳውሲንቲ ባይቆንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 109:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 109:11"/>ዒዛ ባኮ ቢያ ጋሌ ዓኣ ዓሲ ዔኮንጎ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:11">ዒዚ ላቢ ዴንቄ ባኮ ፃንጎ ዓሲ ቡሮንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 109:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 109:12"/>ዖኦኒያ ዒዛም ሚጪንቶፓ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:12">ዒዛኮ ዜኤሮ ናኣቶም ዓይጎ ዓሲያ ማሎፓ።<verse eid="PSA 109:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 109:13"/>ዜርፃ ዒዛሲ ዱማዺ ባይቆንጎ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:13">ሱንፃ ዔያቶሲ ሙካ ሾይንቶ ባኣካፓ ዲርካቺንቶንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 109:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 109:14"/>ዒዛኮ ዓዶንሢ ዻቢንቶ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:14">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዓርቃያ ማዖንጎ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:14">ዒንዶ ጎማኣ ባይቆፓ።<verse eid="PSA 109:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 109:15"/>ሳዓፓ ዜርሢ ዔያቶኮ ባይዛኒ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:15">ጎማ ዔያቶሲ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ቤርታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:15">ዔርቴያ ማዒ ዴዖንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 109:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 109:16"/>ዓይጎሮ ጌዔቴ ዒዚ ሜታዼ ዓሶንታ ማንቆ ዓሶንታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:16">ሃሣ ዒና ሜቄ ዓሶዋ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:16">ሃይቃንዳያ ሄላንዳኣና ዳውሳንዳኣፓ ዓቴም ሚጪንቲባኣሴ።<verse eid="PSA 109:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 109:17"/>ጋዳማ ዒዚ ናሽኬሢሮ ዒዛ ባንሢ ሙኬኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:17">ዓንጆ ናሽኪባኣሢሮ ዒዛፓ ሃኬኔ።<verse eid="PSA 109:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 109:18"/>ጋዳማ ዓዳ ማኣዖጉዲ ዒ ማይንቴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:18">ዬይ ዋኣሢጉዲ ዒዛኮ ዑፆ ጋሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:18">ዛይቴጉዲያ ዒዛኮ ሜጌፆና ዓኣዼኔ።<verse eid="PSA 109:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 109:19"/>ዑፆ ዒዛኮ ዒ ዓኣቻ ማኣዓሢጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:19">ቢያ ዎዴ ዒ ቱኡታ ቃልሾጉዲ ዬይ ማዖንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 109:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 109:20"/>ታና ፑርታ ማሃ ዓሶም</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:20">ታ ሼምፓሢዳ ፑርታ ጌስታዞንሢም</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:20">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ጪጋንዳ ባካ ዬያ ማዖም።<verse eid="PSA 109:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 109:21"/>ኔኤኒ ጋዓንቴ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:21">ኔ ሱንፆሮ ጌዒ ኮሹሞና ታና ዛጌ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:21">ሚጪንቲፃ ኔኤኮ ዼኤፒታሢሮ ታና ዓውሴ።<verse eid="PSA 109:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 109:22"/>ታኣኒ ማንቆ፥ ሜታዼ ዓሲኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:22">ጋሮ ዒና ታኣኮ ኪፃዼኔ፤<verse eid="PSA 109:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 109:23"/>ዋኣንታኣ ዔኤዤጉዲ ታ ዛጋማፓ ሺሬኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:23">ታኣኒ ዓቢሢጉዲ ሃርፒንቴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 109:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 109:24"/>ሙዖ ሃሺፆ ዳምቦና ዎልቃ ታኣኮ ላቤኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:24">ዑፃኣ ታኣኮ ዖኦፒ ዲቢንሢ ማዔኔ።<verse eid="PSA 109:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 109:25"/>ታ ዔያቶኮ ሚኢቺ ማዔኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:25">ታና ዔያታ ዛጋዖ ቦሂ ቶኦኪ ዓጊሣኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">109፡25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:39">ማቲ. 27፡39</ref>፤ <ref loc="MRK 15:29">ማር. 15፡29</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 109:25"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 109:26"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ማዔ ታ ፆኦዛሢዮ! ታና ማኣዴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:26">ኔ ሚጪንቲፆና ታና ዓውሴ።<verse eid="PSA 109:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 109:27"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ኔ ኩጮኬ ሃያይዴሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:27">ኔኤኒ ማዼያ ማዔሢ ዔያታ ዔሮንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 109:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 109:28"/>ዔያታ ጋጋዳንቃኔ፥ ኔ ጋዓንቴ ዓንጃኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:28">ዔያታ ዔቃዖ ዻውሲንታኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:28">ኔኤኮ ዓይላሢ ጋዓንቴ ዎዛዻኔ።<verse eid="PSA 109:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 109:29"/>ታና ፑርታ ማሃ ዓሳ ዻውሲንቶንጎ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:29">ቦርሲንቲና ዔያታ ቦኦሪ ዴዖንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 109:29"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 109:30"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ታ ዻንጎና ታኣኒ ጋላታኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:30">ሚርጌ ዓሶ ባኣካ ታ ዒዛ ሄርሻኔ።<verse eid="PSA 109:30"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 109:31"/>ዓይጎሮ ጌዔቴ ዎዻኒ ዎጋ ዓሶይዳፓ ዓውሳኒ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:31">ዬያ ሜታዼ ዓሢኮ ሚዛቆ ዛላ ዒ ዔቃሢሮኬ።<verse eid="PSA 109:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 109"/>
  <chapter number="110" style="c" sid="PSA 110"/>
  <para style="s1">ዳውቴ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="d">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዶኦሬ ካኣቲ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 110:1"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ታ ጎዳሢም (ሜሲሄም)</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:1">«ኔ ሞርኮ ኔኤኒ ቶኪና ሄርቃንዳጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:1">ታ ኔኤም ማሃንዳ ሄላንዳኣና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:1">ሚዛቆ ዛላ ታኣኮ ዴዔ» ጌዔኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">110፡1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 22:44">ማቲ. 22፡44</ref>፤ <ref loc="MRK 12:36">ማር. 12፡36</ref>፤ <ref loc="LUK 20:42-43">ሉቃ. 20፡42-43</ref>፤ <ref loc="ACT 2:34-35">ዳኪ. ማዾ 2፡34-35</ref>፤ <ref loc="1CO 15:25">1ቆሮ. 15፡25</ref>፤ <ref loc="EPH 1:20-22">ዔፕ. 1፡20-22</ref>፤ <ref loc="COL 3:1">ቆላ. 3፡1</ref>፤ <ref loc="HEB 1:13">ዔብ. 1፡13</ref>፤ <ref loc="HEB 8:1">8፡1</ref>፤ <ref loc="HEB 10:12-13">10፡12-13</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 110:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 110:2"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ኔኤኮ ዶዶ ካኣቱሞ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:2">ፂዮኔይዳፓ ኬስኪ ዙሎ ሄላንዳኣና ዳልጊሻንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:2">ዒዚ፦ «ኔ ሞርኮ ኔ ዴማ ማሂ ዎይሤ» ጋዓንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 110:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 110:3"/>ዖልዚ ዖላኒ ኔ ኬስካ ዎዶና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:3">ኔኤኮ ዖሎ ዓሳ ናሽኪ ኔኤና ኬስካንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:3">ካሪፆ ዑፃ ኔ ሙኪ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:3">ኔኤኮ ዲቃሢ ሄርሺሳ ዒጊቺፆና ፖዓኣና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:3">ዖሎ ዼጌሢ ዓዳ ፆፆርቃ ዓቢጉዲ ማዒ ሙካንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 110:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 110:4"/>«ኔኤኒ ሜልኬ ፃዲቄጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:4">ናንጊና ቄኤሴ ማዒ ናንጋንዳኔ» ጌዒ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:4">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ጫኣቄኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:4">ዒዚ ፔኤኮ ማሌ ማሊፆ ሺርሹዋሴ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">110፡4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 5:6">ዔብ. 5፡6</ref>፤ <ref loc="HEB 6:20">6፡20</ref>፤ <ref loc="HEB 7:17">7፡17</ref>፤<ref loc="HEB 7:21">21</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 110:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 110:5"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ኔኤኮ ሚዛቃኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:5">ፔኤኮ ጎሪንቶ ዓቦና ካኣቶ ዒ ጋኣጫንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 110:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 110:6"/>ዴሮ ባኣካ ዒዚ ዎጋንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:6">ዖሎ ቤዞዋ ሌሲ ሌሊ ማሃንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:6">ሳዖይዳ ዓኣ ካኣታ ቢያ ጋፒ ባይቃንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 110:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 110:7"/>ዒዚ ጎይፆ ዓጫ ዓኣ ዓልቃ ዋኣፆ ዑሽካንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:7">ዬያሮ ዒዚ ዼግ ዼጊ ጋዓንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 110:7"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 110"/>
  <chapter number="111" style="c" sid="PSA 111"/>
  <para style="s1">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ጋላቶና ጋላታ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 111:1"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳም ጋላታ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:1">ፒዜ ዓሳ ቡኪንታ ቤዞይዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:1">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ታኣኒ ጉቤ ዒናፓ ጋላታንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 111:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 111:2"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳኮ ማዻ ዼኤፒኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:2">ዬያና ዎዛዻ ዓሳ ቢያ ዬያ ማላኔ።<verse eid="PSA 111:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 111:3"/>ማዻ ዒዛሲ ቦንቺንታያና ዲቃሢ ሄርሺሳያናኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:3">ፂሉማ ዒዛኮ ዶዲ ናንጋያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 111:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 111:4"/>ዲቃሢ ሄርሺሳ ዓኮ ማዻ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:4">ማሊንቲ ናንጋንዳጉዲ ዒ ማዼኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:4">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ኮሺ፥ ሃሣ ሚጪንታያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 111:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 111:5"/>ዒዛ ሚጪንታዞንሢም ሙኡዚ ዒ ዒንጋኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:5">ዒዚ ዔያቶም ጫኣቄ ጫኣቁሞ ዋሉዋሴ።<verse eid="PSA 111:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 111:6"/>ዒዚ ፔ ዴሮም ሜሌ ዴሮ ዴኖ ዒንጊሢና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:6">ፔ ማዾኮ ዶዱሞ ቤኤዜኔ።<verse eid="PSA 111:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 111:7"/>ማዻ ዒዛኮ ጎኔ፥ ሃሣ ፒዜኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:7">ዳምባ ዒዛሲ ቢያ ጉሙርቂንታያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 111:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 111:8"/>ዬይ ናኣናና ዶዲ ዴዓያኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:8">ጎኑሞና ፒዙሞና ማዺንቴያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 111:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 111:9"/>ፔ ዴሮም ዻቂንታ ዒዚ ዳኬኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:9">ናንጊና ዶዲ ዴዓ ጫኣቁሞ ዒ ጫኣቄኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:9">ሱንፃ ዒዛሲ ዱማዼያና ዒጊጪንታያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 111:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 111:10"/>ዔራቶኮ ካራ ማዓ ባኣዚ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:10">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዒጊጪሢኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:10">ዓይሢፆ ዒዛሲ ማዺ ኩንሣዞንሢኮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:10">ማሊ ጶቂሣ ዒኔ ዓኣያ ማዓኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:10">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ጋላቲንቴ ጎይሣ ናንጋንዳኔ! <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">111፡10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 28:28">ዒዮ. 28፡28</ref>፤ <ref loc="PRO 1:7">ኮኦኪ. 1፡7</ref>፤ <ref loc="PRO 9:10">9፡10</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 111:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 111"/>
  <chapter number="112" style="c" sid="PSA 112"/>
  <para style="s1">ኮሺ ዓሲኮ ዎዛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 112:1"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳም ጋላታ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:1">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዒጊጫያና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:1">ዓይሢፆ ዒዛኮ ኩንሢፆና ዎዛዻሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:1">ዎዚ ዓንጂንቴያዳይ!<verse eid="PSA 112:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 112:2"/>ዬያ ዓሢኮ ዜርፃ ሳዓ ዼኤፒ ማዓንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:2">ፒዜ ዓሶ ሾይንታ ዓንጂንታንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 112:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 112:3"/>ቆሎንታ ዖርጎቹሞንታ ማኣሮ ዒዛኮ ኩማንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:3">ፂሉማ ዒዛኮ ናንጊና ናንጋንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 112:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 112:4"/>ዒዚ ኮሺ፥ ሚጪንታያ፤ ሃሣ ፂሎ ማዔ ጎይፆና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:4">ፒዜ ዓሲም ዹሞይዳ ፖዒ ፖዓኔ።<verse eid="PSA 112:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 112:5"/>ዔኤቢ ዒንጋያና ሂርጉዋ ታልዓያም</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:5">ማዾ ፔኤሲ ፒዜ ማዻሢም</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:5">ኮሺ ባኣዚ ማዓንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 112:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 112:6"/>ዬይ ዓሢ ናንጊና ዓጊፃዓኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:6">ፂሎ ዓሲኮ ማዻ ማሊንቴ ጎይሣ ዴዓንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 112:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 112:7"/>ፑርታ ሃይሴ ዒዛ ዲቃሡዋሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:7">ዒና ዒዛኮ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ጉሙርቂ ዶዴያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 112:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 112:8"/>ዒና ዒዛኮ ዶዲኬ፥ ፔቴታዖ ዒጊጩዋሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:8">ጋፒንፆይዳ ሞርካ ዒዛኮ ሎኦማሢ ዒ ዛጋንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 112:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 112:9"/>ማንቆ ዓሶም ፔ ሼኔና ዒዚ ዒንጌኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:9">ፂሉማ ዒዛሲ ናንጊና ናንጋንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:9">ዒዚ ቦንቺንቲ ዎልቄና ዼግ ዼጊ ጋዓንዳኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">112፡9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 9:9">2ቆሮ. 9፡9</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 112:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 112:10"/>ፑርቶ ዓሳ ዬያ ዛጋዖ ሮኦጋዻንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:10">ዓቺ ዻይ፥ ዖኦፒ ዖኦፒ ዓኣዻንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:10">ዬያ ዓሶኮ ማሊፃ ጉሪ ማዓንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 112:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 112"/>
  <chapter number="113" style="c" sid="PSA 113"/>
  <para style="s1">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳኮ ኮሹሞ ዔርዛ ጋላታ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 113:1"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳም ጋላታ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 113:1">ዒንሢ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዓይላ ጋላቱዋቴ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 113:1">ሱንፆ ዒዛኮ ሄርሹዋቴ።<verse eid="PSA 113:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 113:2"/>ሃናፓ ዓርቃዖ ናንጊና ናንጊ ሄላንዳኣና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 113:2">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳኮ ሱንፃ ጋላቲንቶንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 113:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 113:3"/>ዓባ ፆርቃ ካራፓ ጌላ ካሮ ሄላንዳኣና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 113:3">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳኮ ሱንፃ ጋላቲንቴያ ማዖም!<verse eid="PSA 113:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 113:4"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዴራፓ ዑሣ ዼግ ጌዔያኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 113:4">ዒዛኮ ቦንቻ ጫሪንጮኮ ዑሣኬ።<verse eid="PSA 113:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 113:5"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ማዔ ኑ ፆኦዛሢጉዲ ዖኦኒያ ባኣሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 113:5">ዒዛኮ ካኣቱሞ ዖይታ ቢያፓ ባሼኬ።<verse eid="PSA 113:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 113:6"/>ጫሪንጮና ሳዖናይዳ ዓኣዞንሢ ዛጋኒ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 113:6">ፔ ቶኦኮ ሂርኪዳይ ዖናዳይ?<verse eid="PSA 113:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 113:7"/>ዒዚ ማንቆ ዓሶ ሳዖ ሲላላፓ ዔቂሳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 113:7">ሜታዼሢያ ዲቢንሢፓ ዼግ ዼጊዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 113:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 113:8"/>ቦንቺንታ ዓሶና ዎላ ሄኮ ማሃኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 113:8">ዴሮኮ ሱኡጎና ዎላ ዒዛ ዴይሣኔ።<verse eid="PSA 113:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 113:9"/>ዞኦኮ ላኣሎዋ ማኣሪንዶ ማሂ ዴይሣኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 113:9">ዎዛዻያ፥ ሃሣ ናይንዶዋ ማሃኔ።</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 113:9"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:9">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳም ጋላታ!<verse eid="PSA 113:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 113"/>
  <chapter number="114" style="c" sid="PSA 114"/>
  <para style="s1">ዑሣ ዓኣዺፆ ቦንቾ ኬሎ ማሊ ዓይናዺንቴ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 114:1"/>ዒስራዔኤሌ ዴራ ጊብፄ ዓጫፓ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 114:1">ያይቆኦቤ ማኣራ ፃንጎ ማዔ ሜሌ ዴሮ ባኣካፓ ኬስኬያና፥ <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">114፡1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:51">ኬሲ. ማፃ 12፡51</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 114:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 114:2"/>ዪሁዳ ዴራ ፆኦሲኮ ዱማዼ ማኣሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 114:2">ዒስራዔኤሌያ ዒዛ ዴማ ዎርቃያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 114:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 114:3"/>ባዛ ዒዛ ዛጋዖ ጊንሢም ፑኒ ጳሽኬኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 114:3">ዮርዳኖሴ ዎራኣ ጊንሢም ማዔኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">114፡3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 14:21">ኬሲ. ማፃ 14፡21</ref>፤ <ref loc="JOS 3:16">ዒያ. 3፡16</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 114:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 114:4"/>ዹካ ዓዳ ዓዴ ማራይጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 114:4">ጌሜራኣ ዓዴ ማራናይጉዲ ፂኬኔ።<verse eid="PSA 114:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 114:5"/>ባዚዮ! ዓይጋ ኔ ፑኒ ጳሽኬይ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 114:5">ዮርዳኖሴ ዓይጋ ኔ ጊንሢም ማዔይ?<verse eid="PSA 114:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 114:6"/>ዒንሢ ዹካ ዓዴ ማራይጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 114:6">ጌሜራኣ ዓዴ ማራናይጉዲ ዓይጋ ፂኬይ?<verse eid="PSA 114:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 114:7"/>ዔዞ ሃይ ሳዓ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 114:7">ጎዳ ቤርታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 114:7">ያይቆኦቤ ፆኦዛሢ ቤርታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 114:7">ዒጊቹሞና ጎጋይቄ።<verse eid="PSA 114:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 114:8"/>ዒዚ ላሎ ዴዔ ዋኣሢ ባንሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 114:8">ዼኤፖ ሹጮዋ ዓልቃ ዋኣሢ ባንሢ ማሄኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">114፡8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 17:1-7">ኬሲ. ማፃ 17፡1-7</ref>፤ <ref loc="NUM 20:2-13">ፓይ. ማፃ 20፡2-13</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 114:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 114"/>
  <chapter number="115" style="c" sid="PSA 115"/>
  <para style="s1">ፆኦሲም ኮይሳ ጋላታ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 115:1"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:1">ኑጋይቴቱዋንቴ ኔኤኮ ናንጊና ናንጋ ናሹሞና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:1">ጉሙርቂንቲፆናሮ ሱንፆ ኔኤሲ ቦንቼ።<verse eid="PSA 115:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 115:2"/>ሜሌ ዴራ፦</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:2">«ዔያቶ ፆኦዛሢ ዎካ ዓኣዖ?» ዓይጋ ጋዓንዳይ?<verse eid="PSA 115:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 115:3"/>ኑ ፆኦዛሢ ጫሪንጫኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:3">ዒዚ ፔና ዎዛሳ ባኣዚ ማማዻኔ።<verse eid="PSA 115:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 115:4"/>ዔያቶኮ ካኣሽኮ ፆኦዛ ጋዓንቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:4">ዓሲ ኩቻ ቢራና ዎርቄናፓ ኮሺንቴያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 115:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 115:5"/>ዻንጋ ዔያቶኮ ዓኣኔ፥ ጌስቲ ጌስቱዋሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:5">ዓኣፒያ ናንጊኬ፥ ጋዓንቴ ዛጉዋሴ፤<verse eid="PSA 115:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 115:6"/>ዋይዚ ዓኣኔ፥ ዋይዛያቱዋሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:6">ሲኢዺ ናንጊታዖ ዼሁዋያኬ፤<verse eid="PSA 115:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 115:7"/>ኩቺያ ናንጊኬ፥ ጋዓንቴ ሄሊ ዓርቁዋሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:7">ቶኪ ናንጊታዖ ሃንቲ ሃንቱዋሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:7">ፔ ጎርዦና ዑኡሲያ ዔያታ ኬሳኒ ዳንዳዑዋሴ።<verse eid="PSA 115:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 115:8"/>ዬያጉዴ ባኮ ኮሻ ዓሳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:8">ዬያቶ ጉሙርቃ ዓሳኣ ቢያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:8">ዔያቶጉዴያ ማዖንጎ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">115፡8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 135:15-18">ዓይኑ. 135፡15-18</ref>፤ <ref loc="REV 9:20">ዮሃ. ፆፔዻ 9፡20</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 115:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 115:9"/>ዒስራዔኤሌ ዓሲዮቴ! ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ጉሙርቁዋቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:9">ዒንሢ ማኣዳሢና ጊቲማሢያ ዒንሢኮ ዒዛኬ።<verse eid="PSA 115:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 115:10"/>ዓኣሮኔ ዓሲዮቴ! ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ጉሙርቁዋቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:10">ዒንሢ ማኣዳሢና ጊቲማሢያ ዒንሢኮ ዒዛኬ።<verse eid="PSA 115:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 115:11"/>ዒንሢ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዒጊጫ ዓሳ ዒዛ ጉሙርቁዋቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:11">ዒንሢ ማኣዳሢና ጊቲማሢያ ዒንሢኮ ዒዛኬ።<verse eid="PSA 115:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 115:12"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ኑም ማላኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:12">ዓንጂያ ኑና ዓንጃንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:12">ዒዚ ዓኣሮኔንታ ዒስራዔኤሌንታ ማኣሮ ዓንጃንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 115:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 115:13"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዒዛ ዒጊጫዞንሢ ቢያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:13">ዼኤፖንታ ዻኮንታ ዓንጃንዳኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">115፡13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 11:18">ዮሃ. ፆፔዻ 11፡18</ref>፤ <ref loc="REV 19:5">19፡5</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 115:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 115:14"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዒንሢንታ ዒንሢኮ ናኣቶንታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:14">ዓንጂ ዒዚ ዒንሢ ሚርጊሾንጎ!<verse eid="PSA 115:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 115:15"/>ጫሪንጮንታ ሳዖንታ ማዤ፥ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:15">ዒንሢ ዓንጆንጎ!<verse eid="PSA 115:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 115:16"/>ጫሪንጮኮ ጫሪንጫ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሮኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:16">ሳዖ ጋዓንቴ ዓሲም ዒዚ ዒንጌኔ።<verse eid="PSA 115:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 115:17"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ጋላታዞንሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:17">ሃይቄ ዓሶቱዋሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:17">ዚቲዮ ጌዔ፥ ዱኡፖ ጌሌ ዓሶዋቱዋሴ።<verse eid="PSA 115:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 115:18"/>ሃናፓ ዓርቃዖ ዒዛ ዓንጃንዳዞንሢ ኑናኬ።</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 115:18"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:18">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳም ጋላታ!<verse eid="PSA 115:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 115"/>
  <chapter number="116" style="c" sid="PSA 116"/>
  <para style="s1">ሃይቢፓ ዓቴ ዓሲ ፆኦሲም ጋላቴ ጋላታ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 116:1"/>ታኣኮ ዒላቶንታ ሺኢጲፆዋ ዋይዜሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:1">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ታ ናሽካኔ።<verse eid="PSA 116:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 116:2"/>ዋዮ ፔኤሲ ዒ ታ ባንሢ ማሄሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:2">ታ ናንጎ ዎዶ ቢያይዳ ታ ዒዛ ባንሢ ዒላታንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 116:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 116:3"/>ሃይቢ ፒራ ታና ዓርቄኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:3">ዱኡፖኮ ዒጊቺፃ ታና ሜታሴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:3">ዖዪሢንታ ሜቶንታ ታና ባሼኔ።<verse eid="PSA 116:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 116:4"/>ታኣኒ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ሱንፆ ዔኤላዖ፦</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:4">«ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ታኣኮ ሼምፓሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:4">ኔ ዓውሳንዳጉዲ ታ ሺኢቃኔ» ጌዔኔ።<verse eid="PSA 116:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 116:5"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ኮሺ፥ ሃሣ ፂሎኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:5">ኑ ፆኦዛሢ ሚጪንታያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 116:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 116:6"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዒና ሼሌዔዞንሢ ካፓኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:6">ታኣኒ ሚርጌና ሜታዺ ዓኣንቴ ዒ ታና ዓውሴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 116:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 116:7"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ኮሺ ባኣዚ ኔኤም ማዼሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:7">ታ ሼምፔሌ! ኔኤኮ ሃውሾሢ ባንሢ ማዔ።<verse eid="PSA 116:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 116:8"/>ዒዚ ሼምፓሢ ታኣኮ ሃይቢፓ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:8">ዓኣፖዋ ታኣኮ ዓቢሢዳፓ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:8">ቶኮ ታኣኮ ዹቆይዳፓ ዓይሴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 116:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 116:9"/>ዬያሮ ሼምፔና ዓኣ ዓሳ ናንጋ ቤዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:9">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ኮራ ታ ናንጋንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 116:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 116:10"/>«ኮሺ ታ ሜታዼኔ» ጌዔ ዎዶናታዖ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:10">ኔና ጉሙርቂፆ ታ ሃሺባኣሴ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">116፡10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 4:13">2ቆሮ. 4፡13</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 116:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 116:11"/>ካራ ታኣም ባይቄ ዎዶና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:11">«ዓሲ ቢያ ሉኡዚኬ» ታ ጌዔኔ።<verse eid="PSA 116:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 116:12"/>ዒዚ ታኣም ማዼ ኮዦ ባኮሮ ቢያ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:12">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳም ታ ዓይጎ ጪጋንዳይ?<verse eid="PSA 116:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 116:13"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ታና ዓውሴሢሮ ጋላታንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:13">ዎይኖ ዑዦ ዒንጊሢ ማሂ ታ ዒዛም ሺኢሻንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 116:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 116:14"/>ቡኬ ዴሮ ቢያሢ ቤርታ ኬስኪ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:14">ታ ናኣቤ ናኣቦ ኩንሣንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 116:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 116:15"/>ፆኦሲም ዱማዼ ዓሶኮ ሃይባ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:15">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ቤርታ ቦንቺንቴያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 116:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 116:16"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ታኣኒ ኔኤኮ ዓይላሢኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:16">ታ ኔ ዓይሌሎ ናኣዚ፥ ኔኤም ማዻሢኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:16">ታኣኮ ቱኡዛፓ ኔ ታና ቡሌኔ።<verse eid="PSA 116:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 116:17"/>ታ ኔኤም ዒንጎ ባኣዚ ማሂ ጋላታ ሺኢሻኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:17">ሱንፆዋ ኔኤኮ ታ ዔኤላኔ።<verse eid="PSA 116:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 116:18"/>ቡኬ ዴሮ ቢያሢ ቤርታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:18">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳም ታ ናኣቤ ናኣቦ ኩንሣንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 116:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 116:19"/>ዬሩሳላሜ! ታኣኒ ኔ ጋራ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:19">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ማኣሮኮ ዓሳ ቡካ ጶኦካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:19">ዬያ ማዻንዳኔ።</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 116:19"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:19">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳም ጋላታ!<verse eid="PSA 116:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 116"/>
  <chapter number="117" style="c" sid="PSA 117"/>
  <para style="s1">ፆኦሲ ጋላቶና ጋላታ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 117:1"/>ዒንሢ ሜሌ ዴራ ቢያሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 117:1">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ጋላቱዋቴ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 117:1">ዴራ ቢያ ዒዛ ጋላታና ዼግ ዼጊዱዋቴ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">117፡1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 15:11">ሮሜ 15፡11</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 117:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 117:2"/>ዒዚ ኑና ናሽካ ናሹማ ዶዲኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 117:2">ጉሙርቂንቲፃኣ ዒዛኮ ጋፑዋያኬ።</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 117:2"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 117:2">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳም ጋላታ!<verse eid="PSA 117:2"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 117"/>
  <chapter number="118" style="c" sid="PSA 118"/>
  <para style="s1">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ቢያ ዎዴ ሚጪንታያ ማዔሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 118:1"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ኮሺ ማዔሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:1">ዒዛ ጋላቱዋቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:1">ሚጪንቲፃ ዒዛኮ ናንጊና ዶዲ ናንጋኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">118፡1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 16:34">1ፆኦሲ. ዓሃኬ 16፡34</ref>፤ <ref loc="2CH 5:13">2ፆኦሲ. ዓሃኬ 5፡13</ref>፤ <ref loc="2CH 7:3">7፡3</ref>፤ <ref loc="EZR 3:11">ዒዝ. 3፡11</ref>፤ <ref loc="PSA 100:5">ዓይኑ. 100፡5</ref>፤ <ref loc="PSA 106:1">106፡1</ref>፤ <ref loc="PSA 107:1">107፡1</ref>፤ <ref loc="PSA 136:1">136፡1</ref>፤ <ref loc="JER 33:11">ዔር. 33፡11</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 118:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 118:2"/>ዒስራዔኤሌ ዴራ ቢያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:2">«ሚጪንቲፃ ዒዛኮ ናንጊና ናንጋያኬ» ጎዖንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 118:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 118:3"/>ዓኣሮኔ ማኣሮ ዓሳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:3">«ሚጪንቲፃ ዒዛኮ ናንጊና ናንጋያኬ» ጎዖንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 118:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 118:4"/>ዒዛ ዒጊጫ ዓሳ ቢያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:4">«ሚጪንቲፃ ዒዛኮ ናንጊና ናንጋያኬ» ጎዖንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 118:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 118:5"/>ታኣኒ ሜታዼ ዎዶና ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዔኤሌኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:5">ዒዚያ ታኣም ማሂ ዬሄኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:5">ኩንዒንቲፃፓ ዒ ታና ኬሴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 118:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 118:6"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ታኣና ዎላኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:6">ታኣኒ ዒጊጫዓኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:6">ዓሲ ታና ዓይጎ ዎኦታንዳይ? <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">118፡6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 13:6">ዔብ. 13፡6</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 118:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 118:7"/>ታና ማኣዳኒ ዒዚ ታኣና ዎላኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:7">ታ ሞርካ ሎኦማሢ ታ ዛጋንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 118:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 118:8"/>ዓሲዳ ጌኤቂንቲሢዳፓ ባሼ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:8">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ፑኖ ካይዚ ማሂሢ ቃራኬ።<verse eid="PSA 118:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 118:9"/>ዎይሣ ዓሶ ጉሙርቂፆይዳፓ ባሼ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:9">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ፑኖ ካይዚ ማሂፃ ቃራኬ።<verse eid="PSA 118:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 118:10"/>ዴራ ቢያ ታና ማንጌኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:10">ጋዓንቴ ታ ዔያቶ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ሱንፆና ባይዜኔ።<verse eid="PSA 118:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 118:11"/>ማንጊፆ ዔያታ ቢያ ዛሎና ታና ማንጌኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:11">ጋዓንቴ ታ ዔያቶ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ሱንፆና ባሼኔ።<verse eid="PSA 118:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 118:12"/>ዓዳ ማሢጉዲ ዔያታ ታ ዑፃ ቁንዴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:12">ጋዓንቴ ዓንጊሢ ታሚዳ ዔኤታሢጉዲ ዔያታ ጋፔኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:12">ጎኔና ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ሱንፆና ታ ዔያቶ ባይዜኔ።<verse eid="PSA 118:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 118:13"/>ሂዖም ሎኦማኒ ታ ጋኣዲንቴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:13">ጋዓንቴ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ታና ማኣዴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 118:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 118:14"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ታኣኮ ዶዱማሢና ዓይናዾሢናኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:14">ዒዚ ታኣኮ ታና ዓውሳሢኬ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">118፡14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 15:2">ኬሲ. ማፃ 15፡2</ref>፤ <ref loc="ISA 12:2">ዒሲ. 12፡2</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 118:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 118:15"/>ፂሎ ዓሶኮ ማኣራ ዒላሺሢና ሶራይቲና ዋይዚንታኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:15">ዑኡዛ ሂዚ ጋዓኔ፦</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:15">«ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳኮ ዎልቃ ዶዲ ማዾ ማዼኔ!»<verse eid="PSA 118:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 118:16"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳኮ ሚዛቆ ኩጫ ዼግ ዼጊ ጌዔኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:16">ዬይ ኩጫ ዶዲ ማዾ ማዼኔ።<verse eid="PSA 118:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 118:17"/>ቶሊ ዓቲ ሼምፔና ናንጋንዳኣፓ ዓቴም ታ ሃይቂንዱዋሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:17">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳኮ ማዾ ታ ሃጋኣ ኬኤዛንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 118:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 118:18"/>ጎሪፆ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ታና ኮሺ ጎሬኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:18">ጋዓንቴ ሃይቢም ዓኣሢ ታና ዒዚ ዒንጊባኣሴ።<verse eid="PSA 118:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 118:19"/>ፂሉሞኮ ካራ ታኣም ቡሉዋቴ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">118፡19 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ፂሉሞኮ ካራ ታኣም ቡሉዋቴ </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ጋዓዛ ዔብሬ ዓሶ ሙኡጮ ማፃኣፖይዳ ዒማዺ ጋዓያ ማዓዛ ማሊፆ ዛጎዛ ጌኤዦ ማኣሮኮ ካሮ ታኣም ቡሉዋቴ ጋዓያ ማላኔ።</char></note>፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:19">ዬያና ጌሊ ታ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ጋላታንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 118:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 118:20"/>ዬና ካሬላ ዒዛ ካራኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:20">ፂሎ ዓሳ ዒዞና ጌላኔ።<verse eid="PSA 118:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 118:21"/>ዋይዚ ኔ ታኣም ማሄኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:21">ታና ኔ ዓውሳሢ ማዔሢሮዋ ታ ኔና ጋላታኔ።<verse eid="PSA 118:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 118:22"/>ማኣሮ ሹጮና ማዣ ዓሳ ቶኦቼ ሹጫሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:22">ማኣሮኮ ሄላሢ ማዔኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">118፡22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 20:17">ሉቃ. 20፡17</ref>፤ <ref loc="ACT 4:11">ዳኪ. ማዾ 4፡11</ref>፤ <ref loc="1PE 2:7">1ጴፂ. 2፡7</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 118:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 118:23"/>ዬያ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ማዼኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:23">ዬይ ኑ ዓኣፖም ዲቃሣያኬ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">118፡23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 21:42">ማቲ. 21፡42</ref>፤ <ref loc="MRK 12:10-11">ማር. 12፡10-11</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 118:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 118:24"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ማዤ ኬሌላ ሃኖኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:24">ዬያሮ ኮሺ ኑ ዎዛዾም!<verse eid="PSA 118:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 118:25"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ሃዳራ ኑና ዓውሴ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:25">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ሃዳራ ኑኡም ጊኢጊሼ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">118፡25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 21:9">ማቲ. 21፡9</ref>፤ <ref loc="MRK 11:9">ማር. 11፡9</ref>፤ <ref loc="JHN 12:3">ዮሃ. 12፡3</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 118:25"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 118:26"/>ፆኦሲ ሱንፆና ሙካሢ ዓንጂንቴያኬ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:26">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ማኣራፓ ኑ ዒንሢ ዓንጄኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">118፡26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 21:9">ማቲ. 21፡9</ref>፤ <ref loc="MAT 23:39">23፡39</ref>፤ <ref loc="MRK 11:9">ማር. 11፡9</ref>፤ <ref loc="LUK 13:35">ሉቃ. 13፡35</ref>፤ <ref loc="LUK 19:38">19፡38</ref>፤ <ref loc="JHN 12:13">ዮሃ. 12፡13</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 118:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 118:27"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ፆኦሲኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:27">ፔኤኮ ፖዖ ዒ ኑ ዑፃ ፖዔኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:27">ዒንሢ ቦንቾ ኬሎሮ ዔኪ ሙካ ባኮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:27">ዒንጊፆ ሺኢሾ ባኮኮ ጉራኖና ዓይሢ ቱኩዋቴ።<verse eid="PSA 118:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 118:28"/>ኔኤኒ ታኣኮ ፆኦሲኬ፥ ታ ኔና ጋላታኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:28">ኔኤኒ ታኣኮ ፆኦሲኬ፥ ታ ኔና ዼግ ዼጊዳንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 118:28"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 118:29"/>ዒዚ ኮሺ ማዔሢሮ ዒዛ ጋላቱዋቴ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:29">ሚጪንቲፃ ዒዛኮ ናንጊና ዶዲ ናንጋያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 118:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 118"/>
  <chapter number="119" style="c" sid="PSA 119"/>
  <para style="s1">ፆኦሲ ዎጌ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 119:1"/>ናንጋ ናንጎና ዔኤቢ ቦሂሳ ባኣዚ ባኣዞንሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:1">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዎጎና ሃንታዞንሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:1">ዓንጂንቴያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 119:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 119:2"/>ዒዛኮ ዓይሢፆ ካፓዞንሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:2">ፔኤኮ ጎኔ ዒናፓ ኮዓዞንሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:2">ዓንጂንቴያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 119:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 119:3"/>ዻቢንቲ ባኣዚ ዔያታ ማዹዋሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:3">ጋዓንቴ ዒዛ ጎይፆና ዓኣዻኔ።<verse eid="PSA 119:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 119:4"/>ዛጊ ኑ ካፓንዳጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:4">ዳምቦ ኔኤኮ ኔ ኑና ዓይሤኔ።<verse eid="PSA 119:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 119:5"/>ዳምቦ ኔኤኮ ኑ ካፓንዳጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:5">ጎይፃ ታኣሲ ዶዲ ታኣም ማዔቴ ዓይጎ!<verse eid="PSA 119:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 119:6"/>ኔ ዓይሢፆ ባንሢ ታ ዛጋኣና ቦርሲንቱዋሴ።<verse eid="PSA 119:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 119:7"/>ኔኤኮ ፂሉሞ ዎጎ ታ ዔራ ዎዶና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:7">ፒዜ ዒኔና ጋላታ ታ ኔኤም ሺኢሻንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 119:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 119:8"/>ዎጎ ኔኤሲ ታ ካፓንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:8">ኔኤኒ ታና ጋፒ ሃሺፖ።<verse eid="PSA 119:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">ፆኦሲ ዎጎም ዓይሢንቲሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 119:9"/>ዼጌሢ ጎይፆ ፔኤሲ ዎማይዲ ጌኤሻንዳይ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:9">ኔኤኮ ቃኣላ ጋዓ ጎይፆ ናንጊሢናኬ።<verse eid="PSA 119:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 119:10"/>ታኣኒ ጉቤ ዒናፓ ኔና ኮዔኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:10">ኔ ዓይሢፃፓ ታ ዓጊፁዋጉዲ ታና ካፔ።<verse eid="PSA 119:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 119:11"/>ታ ኔኤም ዋይዞ ዒፂ ዻቢንቱዋጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:11">ቃኣሎ ኔኤሲ ታ ዒና ታኣኒ ዓኣቼኔ።<verse eid="PSA 119:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 119:12"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ኔኤኒ ዓንጂንቴያኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:12">ዳምቦ ኔኤሲ ኔ ታና ዔርዜ።<verse eid="PSA 119:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 119:13"/>ኔ ዻንጋፓ ኬስካ ዎጎ ቢያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:13">ታ ዻንጎና ታኣኒ ኬኤዛንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 119:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 119:14"/>ዓሲ ፔ ቆሎና ዎዛዻሢጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:14">ኔ ዓይሢፆጉዴያ ሃንቲፃ ታና ዎዎዛሳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 119:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 119:15"/>ኔኤኮ ዳምቦ ታኣኒ ታ ዒኖና ማላኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:15">ዒኖ ታኣሲ ታኣኒ ኔ ጎይፃ ማሄኔ።<verse eid="PSA 119:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 119:16"/>ዳምባ ኔኤሲ ታና ዎዛሳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:16">ቃኣሎዋ ኔኤኮ ታ ዋሉዋሴ።<verse eid="PSA 119:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">ፆኦሲ ዎጋፓ ጴዻ ዎዛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 119:17"/>ናንጊና ናንጋኒ ቃኣሎ ኔኤኮ ታ ካፓንዳንጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:17">ታና ኔኤኮ ዓይላሢም ኮሺ ማዼ።<verse eid="PSA 119:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 119:18"/>ኔኤኮ ዎጋፓ ዲቃሢ ሄርሺሳ ባኣዚ ታ ዛጋንዳጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:18">ዓኣፖ ታኣሲ ቡሌ።<verse eid="PSA 119:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 119:19"/>ታኣኮ ሳዖይዳ ቤሲባኣ ዓሲኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:19">ኔኤኮ ዓይሢፆ ታ ጊዳፓ ዓኣቺፖ።<verse eid="PSA 119:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 119:20"/>ቢያ ዎዴ ዎጎ ኔኤኮ ጶቂሥሢና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:20">ሼምፓሢ ታኣኮ ኮሺ ዶጬኔ።<verse eid="PSA 119:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 119:21"/>ኔኤኮ ዓይሢፆይዳፓ ዻቢንቴዞንሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:21">ሄርሺንታዞንሢና ጋዳንቂንቴዞንሢና ኔ ጎራኔ።<verse eid="PSA 119:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 119:22"/>ኔኤኮ ዓይሢፆ ታ ካፔሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:22">ዔያቶኮ ጫዦና ቶኦቺፆና ታኣፓ ሺኢሼ።<verse eid="PSA 119:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 119:23"/>ዎይሣ ዓሳ ዴዒ ታና ባይዛኒ ዞርቴያታቴያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:23">ኔኤኮ ዓይላሢ ዳምቦ ኔኤሲ ዒኖና ማላኔ።<verse eid="PSA 119:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 119:24"/>ዓይሢፃ ኔኤኮ ታኣም ዎዛኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:24">ዞሪያ ታና ዞራያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 119:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">ፆኦሲ ዎጎ ማዺ ኩንሣኒ ዔቂሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 119:25"/>ታኣኒ ሳዖ ዓጮና ፔቴ ማዒ ዓዺንቴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:25">ኔኤኮ ቃኣሎ ጉዴያ ሼምፔና ማሂ ታና ጌሤ።<verse eid="PSA 119:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 119:26"/>ታ ናንጎ ጎይፆ ታ ኔኤም ኬኤዜኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:26">ኔኤኒ ታኣሲ ዋይዜኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:26">ዳምቦ ኔኤኮ ታና ዔርዜ።<verse eid="PSA 119:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 119:27"/>ኔ ዳምቦ ማሊ ታ ጶቂሣንዳጉዲ ታና ማሄ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:27">ታኣኒያ ኔኤኮ ዲቃሢ ሄርሺሳ ማዾ ማላኔ።<verse eid="PSA 119:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 119:28"/>ማሊፃፓ ዔቄያና ዒና ታኣኮ ላቤኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:28">ኔ ቃኣሎ ጉዴያ ታና ዶዲሼ።<verse eid="PSA 119:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 119:29"/>ሉኡዙሞ ታ ጊዳፓ ሺኢሼ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:29">ኔ ኮሹሞና ዎጎ ኔኤሲ ታና ዔርዜ።<verse eid="PSA 119:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 119:30"/>ታኣኒ ጉሙርቂንታያ ማዓኒና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:30">ዎጎዋ ኔኤሲ ካፓኒ ጋፒ ታ ዔቄኔ።<verse eid="PSA 119:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 119:31"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:31">ኔ ዎጎ ታኣኒ ዶዲሺ ዓርቄኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:31">ሃዳራ ታና ቦርሲሲፖ።<verse eid="PSA 119:31"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 119:32"/>ታ ዒኖ ዓርቃ ባኣዚፓ ኔ ኬሴሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:32">ኔ ዓይሤ ጎይፆና ታ ጳሽካንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 119:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">ማሊ ጶቂሥሢ ዴንቃኒ ሺኢቂንቴ ሺኢጲሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 119:33"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ኔ ዎጎ ጎይፆ ታና ዔርዜ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:33">ታኣኒያ ጋፒንፆ ሄላንዳኣና ካፓንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 119:33"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 119:34"/>ዎጎ ኔኤሲ ታ ካፓንዳጉዲና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:34">ጉቤ ዒናፓ ታ ዓይሢንታንዳጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:34">ማሊ ጶቂሥሢ ኔ ታኣም ዒንጌ።<verse eid="PSA 119:34"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 119:35"/>ዬያና ታ ዎዛዻሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:35">ኔ ዓይሢፆ ጎይፆ ዔኪ ታና ዓኣዼ።<verse eid="PSA 119:35"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 119:36"/>ታኣም ኮይሳ ባኣዚዳ ጎጋይቂሢዳፓ ባሼ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:36">ዒኖ ታኣሲ ኔ ዓይሢፆ ባንሢ ማሄ።<verse eid="PSA 119:36"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 119:37"/>ዔኤቢ ፓሡዋ ባኣዚ ዛጊሢፓ ዓኣፖ ታኣሲ ማሄ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:37">ኔኤኮ ቃኣሎ ጉዴያ ናንጎ ታኣኮ ዓካሴ።<verse eid="PSA 119:37"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 119:38"/>ኔ ዒጊጪንታያ ማዓንዳጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:38">ታና ኔ ዓይላሢም ኔ ዒንጌ ዎዞ ቃኣሎ ማዺ ኩንሤ።<verse eid="PSA 119:38"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 119:39"/>ዎጋ ኔኤሲ ፒዜ ማዔሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:39">ታ ዒጊጫ ዻውሲንታፓ ታና ካፔ።<verse eid="PSA 119:39"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 119:40"/>ዓይሢፆ ታ ኔኤኮ ካፓኒ ኮዓኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:40">ኔኤኒ ፂሎ ማዔሢሮ ናንጎ ታኣኮ ዓካሴ።<verse eid="PSA 119:40"/></para>
  <para style="s1">ፆኦሲ ዎጎና ጌኤቂንቲሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 119:41"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ሚጪንቲፃ ኔኤኮ ታ ባንሢ ሙኮንጎ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:41">ኔኤኮ ዓውሲፃኣ ኔ ቃኣሎጉዴያ ታኣም ዳኪንቶንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 119:41"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 119:42"/>ኔ ቃኣሎ ታ ጉሙርቃሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:42">ታና ጫሽካ ዓሶም ማሂ ታ ኬኤዛንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 119:42"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 119:43"/>ዎጎ ኔኤኮ ታ ጉሙርቃኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:43">ጎኑሞ ሃይሴ ታ ዻንጋፓ ፔቴታዖ ሺኢሺፖ።<verse eid="PSA 119:43"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 119:44"/>ናኣናና ናንጊ ሄላንዳኣና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:44">ቢያ ዎዴ ዎጎ ታ ኔኤሲ ካፓንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 119:44"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 119:45"/>ዳምቦ ታ ኔኤኮ ኮዓኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:45">ታ ሼኖጉዴያ ሃንጋ ሴካ ታ ሃንታንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 119:45"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 119:46"/>ዓይሢፆ ኔኤኮ ታኣኒ ካኣቶም ኬኤዛንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:46">ዬያ ታ ማዼሢሮ ቦርሲሳ ባኣዚ ታና ባኣሴ።<verse eid="PSA 119:46"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 119:47"/>ታ ኮሺ ናሽካ ኔ ዓይሢፆና ዎዛዻኔ።<verse eid="PSA 119:47"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 119:48"/>ኩጮ ታኣሲ ታኣኒ ናሽካ ኔ ዓይሢፆ ባንሢ ዔቂሳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:48">ዳምቦዋ ኔኤሲ ማሊ ታ ጶቂሣኔ።<verse eid="PSA 119:48"/></para>
  <para style="s1">ፆኦሲ ዎጎና ጉሙርቂንቲሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="PSA 119:49"/>ሃጋኣ ዎዛ ታ ማሃሢ ዬያይዳ ማዔሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:49">ታና ኔኤኮ ዓይላሢም ኔ ዒንጌ ቃኣሎ ማሌ።<verse eid="PSA 119:49"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="PSA 119:50"/>ኔኤኮ ቃኣላ ታና ናንጋያ ማሃኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:50">ዬይ ታኣኮ ሜታሢ ዎዶና ዶዱሞ ማዓያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 119:50"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="PSA 119:51"/>ዖቶርቃ ዓሳ ሚርጌና ታና ሚኢጬኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:51">ታኣኒ ጋዓንቴ ኔኤኮ ዎጋፓ ዓጊፃዓኬ።<verse eid="PSA 119:51"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="PSA 119:52"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:52">ሚናፓ ዓኣ ዎጎ ኔኤኮ ታ ማሌኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:52">ዬያና ታኣኒ ታና ዶዲሼኔ።<verse eid="PSA 119:52"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="PSA 119:53"/>ዎጎ ኔኤሲ ሃሼ ፑርቶ ዓሶይዳፓ ዔቄያና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:53">ዻጋሲ ታና ዻጋሳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 119:53"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="PSA 119:54"/>ታኣኮ ሾኦቹሞ ዓጫ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:54">ዳምባ ኔኤሲ ታኣኮ ዓይኑሞኬ።<verse eid="PSA 119:54"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="PSA 119:55"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:55">ዋንቶና ሱንፆ ኔኤኮ ታ ማላኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:55">ዎጎ ኔኤሲያ ታ ካፓኔ።<verse eid="PSA 119:55"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="PSA 119:56"/>ኔ ዳምቦ ጎይፆ ታ ሃንታኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:56">ዬይ ታኣኮ ማዾ ማዔኔ።<verse eid="PSA 119:56"/></para>
  <para style="s1">ፆኦሲ ዎጎም ዓይሢንቲሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="PSA 119:57"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ታኣኒ ኮዓሢ ኔና ሌሊኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:57">ኔኤኮ ዎጎዋ ካፓኒ ታ ጫኣቃኔ።<verse eid="PSA 119:57"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="PSA 119:58"/>ጉቤ ዒናፓ ታ ኔ ዓኣፖ ካሮ ኮዔኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:58">ኔኤኮ ቃኣሎጉዴያ ኮሹሞ ኔኤሲ ታና ዻዌ።<verse eid="PSA 119:58"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="PSA 119:59"/>ታኣኒ ጎይፆ ታኣሲ ዛጌኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:59">ታ ሃንቲፆዋ ኔ ዓይሢፆ ባንሢ ታ ማሄኔ።<verse eid="PSA 119:59"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="PSA 119:60"/>ኔ ዓይሢፆ ታኣኒ ካፓኒ ሩኡሬኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:60">ኔጊያ ታ ኔጉዋሴ።<verse eid="PSA 119:60"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="PSA 119:61"/>ፑርቶ ዓሶኮ ሱዛ ታና ማሬኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:61">ታኣኒ ጋዓንቴ ዎጎ ኔኤሲ ዋሊባኣሴ።<verse eid="PSA 119:61"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="PSA 119:62"/>ኔኤኮ ፂሎ ዎጎ ዛሎሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:62">ሳዖኮ ጊዲሚዣ ኔና ጋላታኒ ታ ዔቃኔ።<verse eid="PSA 119:62"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="PSA 119:63"/>ታኣኒ ኔና ዒጊጫዞንሢም ቢያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:63">ዳምቦዋ ኔኤሲ ካፓዞንሢኮ ታ ላጌኬ።<verse eid="PSA 119:63"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="PSA 119:64"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ሳዓ ኔኤኮ ሚጪንቲፆና ኩሜኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:64">ዳምቦዋ ኔኤሲ ታና ኔ ዔርዜ።<verse eid="PSA 119:64"/></para>
  <para style="s1">ፆኦሲ ዎጋ ቦንቺንቴያ ማዒፆ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="PSA 119:65"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ኔኤኮ ቃኣሎጉዴያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:65">ኔ ዓይላሢም ኮሺ ባኣዚ ኔ ማዼኔ።<verse eid="PSA 119:65"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="PSA 119:66"/>ኔኤኮ ዓይሢፆ ታ ጉሙርቃኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:66">ኮሺ ማሊሢንታ ዔራቶዋ ታና ዔርዜ።<verse eid="PSA 119:66"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="PSA 119:67"/>ኔ ታ ጊዳ ሜቶ ዓጋንዳሢኮ ቤርታ ጎይፆ ዻቢ ታ ዓኣዼኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:67">ሃሢ ጋዓንቴ ቃኣሎ ኔኤኮ ታ ካፓኔ።<verse eid="PSA 119:67"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="PSA 119:68"/>ኔኤኒ ኮሺኬ፥ ኔ ማዻ ባካኣ ኮሺኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:68">ዬያሮ ዳምቦ ኔኤሲ ታና ዔርዜ።<verse eid="PSA 119:68"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="PSA 119:69"/>ዖቶርቃ ዓሳ ሱንፆ ታኣኮ ሉኡዙሞና ፑርቲሴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:69">ታኣኒ ጋዓንቴ ዓይሢፆ ኔኤኮ ጉቤ ዒናፓ ካፓኔ።<verse eid="PSA 119:69"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="PSA 119:70"/>ዒና ዔያቶኮ ባይቂ ዶጬያኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:70">ታኣኒ ጋዓንቴ ኔ ዎጎና ዎዛዻኔ።<verse eid="PSA 119:70"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="PSA 119:71"/>ዳምቦ ኔኤሲ ታ ዔራንዳንጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:71">ሜታሢዴና ኬዛ ታኣም ኮሺ ማዔኔ።<verse eid="PSA 119:71"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="PSA 119:72"/>ፓይዲባኣ ቢራና ዎርቄናይዳፓ ባሼ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:72">ኔ ዻንጋፓ ኬስካ ዎጋ ታኣም ኮሺኬ።<verse eid="PSA 119:72"/></para>
  <para style="s1">ፆኦሲ ዎጎኮ ፒዙሞ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="PSA 119:73"/>ኔ ኩጫ ታና ማዤኔ፥ ኮሺያ ታና ኮሼኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:73">ኔኤኮ ዓይሢፆ ታ ዔራንዳጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:73">ማሊ ጶቂሥሢ ታኣም ዒንጌ።<verse eid="PSA 119:73"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="PSA 119:74"/>ኔኤኮ ቃኣሎ ሃጋኣ ዎዛ ማሂ ታ ጌሤሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:74">ኔና ዒጊጫዞንሢ ታና ዛጊ ዎዛዾንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 119:74"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="PSA 119:75"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ኔ ዎጋ ፂሎ ዎጌኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:75">ኔ ታና ሜታሴሢያ ኔኤኮ ጉሙርቂንቲፆናታሢ ታ ዔሬኔ።<verse eid="PSA 119:75"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="PSA 119:76"/>ታና ኔኤኮ ዓይላሢም ኔ ጫኣቄ ጎይፆና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:76">ኔ ሚጪንቲፃ ታና ዶዲሻያ ማዖንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 119:76"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="PSA 119:77"/>ኔኤኮ ዎጋ ታኣኮ ዎዞኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:77">ሼምፔና ታ ናንጋንዳጉዲ ኮሹማ ኔኤሲ ታኣም ሙኮንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 119:77"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="PSA 119:78"/>ዖቶርቃ ዓሳ ሉኡዙሞና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:78">ታና ሜቶይዳ ጌልዜሢሮ ቦርሲንቶንጎ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:78">ታኣኒ ጋዓንቴ ዓይሢፆ ኔኤሲ ማላኔ።<verse eid="PSA 119:78"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="PSA 119:79"/>ኔና ዒጊጫዞንሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:79">ዓይሢፆዋ ኔኤሲ ዔራዞንሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:79">ሃንጋ ታ ባንሢ ሙኮንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 119:79"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="PSA 119:80"/>ታኣኒ ቦርሲንቱዋጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:80">ዒና ታኣኮ ኔ ዎጎ ካፒፆና ፒዜ ማዖንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 119:80"/></para>
  <para style="s1">ዻቂንታ ዴንቃኒ ሺኢቂንቴ ሺኢጲሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="81" style="v" sid="PSA 119:81"/>ታ ሼምፓሢ ኔ ዻቂሺፆ ሚርጌና ኮዔኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:81">ቃኣሎ ኔኤኮ ታኣኒ ሃጋኣ ዎዛ ማሃንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 119:81"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="82" style="v" sid="PSA 119:82"/>«ዓይዲ ኔ ታና ዶዲሻንዳይ?» ጌዒ ጌዒ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:82">ዓኣፓ ታኣኮ ኔ ቃኣሎ ካፒፆና ላቤኔ።<verse eid="PSA 119:82"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="83" style="v" sid="PSA 119:83"/>ታኣኒ ጩቢዳ ሱፂንቴ ዎይኔ ዓርሦ ሱርባጉዲ ማዔያታቴያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:83">ዳምቦ ኔኤኮ ታ ዋሊባኣሴ።<verse eid="PSA 119:83"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="84" style="v" sid="PSA 119:84"/>ኔ ዓይላሢ ዎማ ሄላንዳኣና ሜታዺ ዴዓንዳይ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:84">ታና ዳውሳዞንሢዳ ሜቶ ኔ ዓጋንዳሢ ዓይዲዳይ?<verse eid="PSA 119:84"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="85" style="v" sid="PSA 119:85"/>ኔኤኮ ዎጋ ጋዓ ጎይፆ ዓኣዹዋያታዖ ዖቶርቃዞንሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:85">ዔቴ ታኣም ቦኦኬኔ።<verse eid="PSA 119:85"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="86" style="v" sid="PSA 119:86"/>ዓይሢፃ ቢያ ኔኤኮ ጉሙርቂንታያኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:86">ዓሳ ታና ታ ማዼ ባኣዚ ባኣንቴ ዳውሳሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:86">ኔኤኒ ታና ማኣዴ።<verse eid="PSA 119:86"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="87" style="v" sid="PSA 119:87"/>ሳዖይዳፓ ዔያታ ታና ባይዛኒ ዻካ ዓቴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:87">ታኣኒ ጋዓንቴ ዓይሢፆ ኔኤሲ ሃሺባኣሴ።<verse eid="PSA 119:87"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="88" style="v" sid="PSA 119:88"/>ኔ ሚጪንቲፆጉዴያ ጊንሣ ማሂ ታና ሼምፔና ጌሤ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:88">ታኣኒያ ኔ ዓይሢፆ ካፓንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 119:88"/></para>
  <para style="s1">ፆኦሲ ዎጎና ጉሙርቂንቲሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="89" style="v" sid="PSA 119:89"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ቃኣላ ኔኤኮ ጫሪንጮይዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:89">ናኣናና ዶዲ ናንጋያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 119:89"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="90" style="v" sid="PSA 119:90"/>ኔኤኮ ጉሙርቂንቲፃ ሾይንቲፓ ሾይንቲ ሄላንዳኣና ናንጋኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:90">ሳዖ ኔ ማዤኔ፥ ዬይ ዶዲ ናንጋኔ።<verse eid="PSA 119:90"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="91" style="v" sid="PSA 119:91"/>ቢያሢ ኔ ዓይሌ ማዔሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:91">ኔ ዎጋ ሃኖ ሄላንዳኣና ዶዲ ናንጋኔ።<verse eid="PSA 119:91"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="92" style="v" sid="PSA 119:92"/>ዎጋ ኔኤሲ ታኣኮ ዎዛ ማዒባኣያታቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:92">ሜታሢ ዎዶና ታ ሄኤዶ ባይቄያ ናንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 119:92"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="93" style="v" sid="PSA 119:93"/>ዬያና ኔ ታና ሼምፔና ማሄሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:93">ኔ ዓይሢፆ ፔቴታዖ ታኣኒ ዋላዓኬ።<verse eid="PSA 119:93"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="94" style="v" sid="PSA 119:94"/>ታኣኒ ኔኤሮታሢሮ ሃዳራ ታና ዓውሴ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:94">ኔኤኮ ዎጎዋ ታኣኒ ኮዔኔ።<verse eid="PSA 119:94"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="95" style="v" sid="PSA 119:95"/>ፑርቶ ዓሳ ታና ባይዛኒ ካቴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:95">ታኣኒ ጋዓንቴ ዎጎ ኔኤሲ ማሌኔ።<verse eid="PSA 119:95"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="96" style="v" sid="PSA 119:96"/>ፒዙሞኮ ቢያ ዛጲ ዓኣሢ ታ ዛጌኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:96">ዓይሢፃ ጋዓንቴ ኔኤሲ ኮሺ ዳልጊኬ።<verse eid="PSA 119:96"/></para>
  <para style="s1">ፆኦሲ ዎጎ ናሽኪሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="97" style="v" sid="PSA 119:97"/>ዎጎ ኔኤሲ ታ ኮሺ ናሽካኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:97">ሮኦሮ ጉቤያ ታኣኒ ማላኔ።<verse eid="PSA 119:97"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="98" style="v" sid="PSA 119:98"/>ኔኤኮ ዓይሢፃ ዓይጎ ዎዴናኣ ታኣፓ ዱማዹዋኣሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:98">ታ ሞርኮይዳፓ ባሼ ታና ኔ ማሊ ጶቂሣያ ማሄኔ።<verse eid="PSA 119:98"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="99" style="v" sid="PSA 119:99"/>ኔ ዎጎ ታኣኒ ማላሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:99">ታና ዔርዛ ዓሶይዳፓ ባሼ ማሊ ጶቂሣ ዒኔ ታ ዔኬኔ።<verse eid="PSA 119:99"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="100" style="v" sid="PSA 119:100"/>ኔኤኒ ኬሴ ዎጎ ጊንፆ ታ ዓኣዻሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:100">ጋርቼ ዓሶይዳፓ ባሼ ታኣኒ ዔራ ማዔኔ።<verse eid="PSA 119:100"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="101" style="v" sid="PSA 119:101"/>ኔኤኮ ቃኣሎ ታኣኒ ካፓኒ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:101">ቶኮ ታኣኮ ታ ፑርታ ጎይሢዳፓ ቃዜኔ።<verse eid="PSA 119:101"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="102" style="v" sid="PSA 119:102"/>ኔኤኒ ኔኤሮ ታና ዔርዜሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:102">ኔ ዎጎይዳፓ ታ ኬስኪባኣሴ።<verse eid="PSA 119:102"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="103" style="v" sid="PSA 119:103"/>ቃኣላ ኔኤሲ ዎዚ ዓኣፃይ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:103">ፆሎሊ ዔኤሲዳፓኣ ባሼ ዓኣፃኔ።<verse eid="PSA 119:103"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="104" style="v" sid="PSA 119:104"/>ኔ ዎጎይዳፓ ማሊ ጶቂሥሢ ታኣኒ ዴንቄኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:104">ዬያሮ ሉኡዙሞ ጎይፆ ቢያ ታኣኒ ዒፄኔ።<verse eid="PSA 119:104"/></para>
  <para style="s1">ፆኦሲ ዎጋፓ ጴዻ ፖዒ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="105" style="v" sid="PSA 119:105"/>ቃኣላ ኔኤሲ ታ ቶኮኮ ፆምፔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:105">ታ ጎይፆኮዋ ፖዔኬ።<verse eid="PSA 119:105"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="106" style="v" sid="PSA 119:106"/>ኔኤኮ ፂሎ ዎጎ ታኣኒ ካፓኒ ጫኣቄሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:106">ዬያ ታኣኒ ዶዲሺ ዓርቃንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 119:106"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="107" style="v" sid="PSA 119:107"/>ሚርጌና ታ ሜታዼኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:107">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ኔ ቃኣሎጉዴያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:107">ጊንሣ ማሂ ሼምፔና ታና ጌሤ።<verse eid="PSA 119:107"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="108" style="v" sid="PSA 119:108"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ታ ሼኔና ታ ኔኤም ሺኢሼ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:108">ታኣኮ ጋላቶ ዒንጊፆ ኔ ዔኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:108">ኔኤኮ ዎጎዋ ታና ዔርዜ።<verse eid="PSA 119:108"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="109" style="v" sid="PSA 119:109"/>ሼምፔላ ታኣኮ ቢያ ዎዴ ሜቶይዳኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:109">ጋዓንቴ ታ ኔኤኮ ዎጎ ዋሊባኣሴ።<verse eid="PSA 119:109"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="110" style="v" sid="PSA 119:110"/>ፑርቶ ዓሳ ቡኡዶ ፒሮ ታኣም ፒሬኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:110">ታኣኒ ጋዓንቴ ዳምቦኮ ዑሣ ዓኣዺባኣሴ።<verse eid="PSA 119:110"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="111" style="v" sid="PSA 119:111"/>ኔ ዎጋ ናንጊና ታኣኮ ዻካሊ ባኣዚ ማዔኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:111">ዬያና ዒና ታኣኮ ሚርጌና ዎዛዻኔ።<verse eid="PSA 119:111"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="112" style="v" sid="PSA 119:112"/>ዓይሢፆ ኔኤሲ ናንጊና ናንጊ ሄላንዳኣና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:112">ማዺ ታ ኩንሣኒ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:112">ዒኖ ታኣሲ ዬያ ባንሢ ማሄኔ።<verse eid="PSA 119:112"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="113" style="v" sid="PSA 119:113"/>ላምዖ ማሊሢና ዓኣ ዓሶ ታ ዒፃኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:113">ታኣኒ ጋዓንቴ ኔ ዎጎ ናሽኬኔ።<verse eid="PSA 119:113"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="114" style="v" sid="PSA 119:114"/>ኔኤኒ ታኣኮ ፑኖ ካያሢና ጊቲማሢናኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:114">ቃኣሎ ኔኤሲ ታ ዎዛና ካፓኔ።<verse eid="PSA 119:114"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="115" style="v" sid="PSA 119:115"/>ታ ፆኦዛሢኮ ዎጎ ታኣኒ ካፓንዳጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:115">ዒንሢ ፑርቶ ዓሳ ታ ኮራፓ ሃኩዋቴ።<verse eid="PSA 119:115"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="116" style="v" sid="PSA 119:116"/>ኔኤኮ ቃኣሎጉዴያ ታና ኬልቂ ዓርቄ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:116">ታኣኒ ሼምፔና ናንጋንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:116">ዎዛ ታኣኮ ጉሪ ማዔም ታ ቦርሲንቱዋጉዲ።<verse eid="PSA 119:116"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="117" style="v" sid="PSA 119:117"/>ሂርጋ ባኣያ ታ ናንጋንዳጉዲ ኬልቂ ታና ዓርቄ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:117">ኔ ዳምቦዋ ቢያ ዎዴ ታ ዛጋንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 119:117"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="118" style="v" sid="PSA 119:118"/>ማሊፃ ዔያቶኮ ጌኔና ሉኡዙሞና ኩሜያ ማዔሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:118">ኔ ዎጋፓ ዒፂ ኬስካዞንሢ ቢያ ኔያ ዒፃንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 119:118"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="119" style="v" sid="PSA 119:119"/>ሳዖይዳ ፑርቶ ዓሶ ቢያ ቡኡራጉዲ ኔ ሺኢሼኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:119">ዬያሮ ታ ኔኤኮ ዳምቦ ናሽኬኔ።<verse eid="PSA 119:119"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="120" style="v" sid="PSA 119:120"/>ዑፃ ታኣኮ ኔና ዒጊቹሞና ጎጋይቃኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:120">ኔ ዎጎዋ ሚርጌና ታ ዒጊጬኔ።<verse eid="PSA 119:120"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="121" style="v" sid="PSA 119:121"/>ፒዙሞና ፂሉሞና ዓኣ ባኣዚ ታ ማዼኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:121">ሄርቂ ዎይሣ ዓሶም ዓኣሢ ታና ዒንጊፖ።<verse eid="PSA 119:121"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="122" style="v" sid="PSA 119:122"/>ታና ኔ ዓይላሢኮ ዻቂንቶ ጎናሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:122">ዖቶርቃዞንሢ ታና ሄርቂ ዎይሣንዳጉዲ ማሂፖ።<verse eid="PSA 119:122"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="123" style="v" sid="PSA 119:123"/>ዓኣፓ ታኣኮ ኔ ዓውሲፆንታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:123">ፂሉሞ ቃኣሎዋ ካፒሢና ላቤኔ።<verse eid="PSA 119:123"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="124" style="v" sid="PSA 119:124"/>ታና ኔ ዓይላሢም ናሹሞ ኔኤሲ ቤኤዜ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:124">ኔ ዎጎዋ ታና ዔርዜ።<verse eid="PSA 119:124"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="125" style="v" sid="PSA 119:125"/>ታኣኒ ኔ ዓይላሢኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:125">ኔ ዳምቦ ዔራንዳጉዲ ታና ማሄ።<verse eid="PSA 119:125"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="126" style="v" sid="PSA 119:126"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:126">ዎጋ ኔኤሲ ሃሺንቲዳ ዓኣሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:126">ኔኤኒ ማዾ ማዻንዳ ዎዳ ሃሢኬ።<verse eid="PSA 119:126"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="127" style="v" sid="PSA 119:127"/>ዓይሢፆ ኔኤሲ ዎርቄይዳፓ ባሼ ታ ናሽካኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:127">ጎኔኬ ጌኤሺ ዎርቄይዳፓኣ ባሼ ሚጪንታኔ።<verse eid="PSA 119:127"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="128" style="v" sid="PSA 119:128"/>ኔ ዓይሢፃ ቦሂሳ ባኣዚ ባኣያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:128">ፒዜኬ ታ ጋዓኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:128">ዬያሮ ሉኡዙሞ ጎይፆ ታ ዒዒፃኔ።<verse eid="PSA 119:128"/></para>
  <para style="s1">ፆኦሲ ዎጎ ቦንቻኒ ናሽኪሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="129" style="v" sid="PSA 119:129"/>ዳምባ ኔኤኮ ዲቃሢ ሄርሺሳያኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:129">ዬያሮ ታ ሼምፓሢ ዬያ ካፓኔ።<verse eid="PSA 119:129"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="130" style="v" sid="PSA 119:130"/>ኔ ቃኣሎኮ ቡሊፃ ፖፖዓኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:130">ዔሩዋ ዓሶ ማሊ ጶቂሣያ ማሃኔ።<verse eid="PSA 119:130"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="131" style="v" sid="PSA 119:131"/>ዓይሢፆ ታ ኔኤኮ ኮሺ ናሽካሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:131">ሱኡኮና ታ ዻንጎ ታ ዋሊ ዴዓኔ።<verse eid="PSA 119:131"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="132" style="v" sid="PSA 119:132"/>ሱንፆ ኔኤኮ ናሽካዞንሢም ቢያ ኔ ማዻ ጎይፆ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:132">ታ ባንሢ ማዒጋፓ ታኣም ሚጪንቴ።<verse eid="PSA 119:132"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="133" style="v" sid="PSA 119:133"/>ሃንቲፆ ታኣኮ ኔ ቃኣሎጉዴያ ፒዚሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:133">ጎሜ ታና ዎይሣንዳጉዲ ሃሺፖ።<verse eid="PSA 119:133"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="134" style="v" sid="PSA 119:134"/>ኔ ዓይሢፆ ታ ካፓኒ ዳንዳዓንዳጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:134">ዓሲ ታና ማኣሳንሣያይዳፓ ዓውሴ።<verse eid="PSA 119:134"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="135" style="v" sid="PSA 119:135"/>ታና ኔኤኮ ዓይላሢም ዓኣፖ ካሮ ኔኤኮ ፖዒሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:135">ዳምቦዋ ኔኤኮ ታና ዔርዜ።<verse eid="PSA 119:135"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="136" style="v" sid="PSA 119:136"/>ዎጋ ኔኤኮ ቦንቺንቲባኣሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:136">ዓቢፃ ታኣኮ ዋኣሢጉዲ ዎታኔ።<verse eid="PSA 119:136"/></para>
  <para style="s1">ፆኦሲ ዎጋ ፒዜ ማዔሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="137" style="v" sid="PSA 119:137"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ኔኤኒ ፂሎኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:137">ዎጊፃኣ ኔኤኮ ፒዜኬ።<verse eid="PSA 119:137"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="138" style="v" sid="PSA 119:138"/>ኔ ዓይሢፆ ኔኤኒ ፂሉሞና ኬሴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:138">ዬይያ ኮሺ ጉሙርሳያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 119:138"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="139" style="v" sid="PSA 119:139"/>ታ ሞርካ ቃኣሎ ኔኤሲ ዔኪባኣሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:139">ኮሺ ታና ሮኦጋሳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 119:139"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="140" style="v" sid="PSA 119:140"/>ቃኣላ ኔኤኮ ኮሺ ጊሶናያኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:140">ታኣኒ ኔ ዓይላሢ ዬያ ናሽኬኔ።<verse eid="PSA 119:140"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="141" style="v" sid="PSA 119:141"/>ታኣኒ ፓሡዋያና ቶኦቺንቴያናኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:141">ጋዓንቴ ታ ኔኤኮ ዓይሢፆ ዋሊባኣሴ።<verse eid="PSA 119:141"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="142" style="v" sid="PSA 119:142"/>ፂሉማ ኔኤኮ ናንጊና ናንጋያኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:142">ዎጋኣ ኔኤሲ ጎኔኬ።<verse eid="PSA 119:142"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="143" style="v" sid="PSA 119:143"/>ሜቶና ዋኣዪሢና ታና ሄሌኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:143">ጋዓንቴ ኔ ዓይሢፃ ታኣኮ ዎዛኬ።<verse eid="PSA 119:143"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="144" style="v" sid="PSA 119:144"/>ዓይሢፃ ኔኤሲ ናንጊና ፂሉሞ ዓይሥሢኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:144">ሼምፔና ታ ናንጋንዳጉዲ ማሊ ጶቂሥሢ ታኣም ዒንጌ።<verse eid="PSA 119:144"/></para>
  <para style="s1">ሞርኬ ኩሽካፓ ዻቃኒ ሺኢቂንቴ ሺኢጲሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="145" style="v" sid="PSA 119:145"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ጉቤ ዒናፓ ታ ዒላታኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:145">ኔ ታኣም ዋይዜ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:145">ዳምቦዋ ኔኤኮ ታ ካፓንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 119:145"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="146" style="v" sid="PSA 119:146"/>ታ ኔ ባንሢ ዒላታሢሮ ታና ዓውሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:146">ዓይሢፆዋ ታ ኔኤኮ ካፓንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 119:146"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="147" style="v" sid="PSA 119:147"/>ኔ ታና ማኣዳንዳጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:147">ዓባ ፆርቁዋንቴ ጴጪ ታ ዒላታኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:147">ኔ ቃኣሎዋ ሃጋኣ ዎዛ ማሂ ታ ጌሣኔ።<verse eid="PSA 119:147"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="148" style="v" sid="PSA 119:148"/>ኔኤኮ ቃኣሎ ታ ማላኒ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:148">ዓኣፓ ታኣኮ ዋንቶ ጉቤ ዱኡሚንቱዋዖ ዎርቃኔ።<verse eid="PSA 119:148"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="149" style="v" sid="PSA 119:149"/>ኔ ኮሹሞጉዴያ ዑኡዞ ታኣሲ ዋይዜ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:149">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ኔ ዎጎጉዴያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:149">ጊንሣ ማሂ ታና ሼምፔና ናንጋያ ማሄ።<verse eid="PSA 119:149"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="150" style="v" sid="PSA 119:150"/>ፑርታ ባኣዚ ታኣም ቱካ ዓሳ ታ ባንሢ ዑኬኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:150">ጋዓንቴ ዔያታ ኔ ዎጎኮ ዙላኬ።<verse eid="PSA 119:150"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="151" style="v" sid="PSA 119:151"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:151">ኔኤኒ ጋዓንቴ ዑኬኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:151">ዓይሢፃኣ ኔኤሲ ቢያ ጎኔኬ።<verse eid="PSA 119:151"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="152" style="v" sid="PSA 119:152"/>ናንጊና ኔኤኒ ዬያ ኔ ዎጎ ዶዲሺ ኬሴያ ማዔሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:152">ሚርጌ ዎዴኮ ቤርታፓ ታ ዔሬኔ።<verse eid="PSA 119:152"/></para>
  <para style="s1">ፆኦሲ ሺኢጲሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="153" style="v" sid="PSA 119:153"/>ታኣኒ ዎጎ ኔኤኮ ዋሊባኣሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:153">ዋኣዪፆ ታኣኮ ዛጌ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:153">ሄሊያኣ ታና ዓውሴ።<verse eid="PSA 119:153"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="154" style="v" sid="PSA 119:154"/>ታ ዛሎ ኔ ሞኦቲንቴ፥ ታና ዓይሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:154">ኔ ቃኣሎ ጎይፆ ሼምፔና ታና ናንጊሼ።<verse eid="PSA 119:154"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="155" style="v" sid="PSA 119:155"/>ዳምቦ ኔኤሲ ዔያታ ኮዑዋኣሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:155">ዻቂንታ ፑርቶ ዓሶይዳፓ ሃኬኬ።<verse eid="PSA 119:155"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="156" style="v" sid="PSA 119:156"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ሚጪንታ ኔኤኮ ዼኤፒኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:156">ኔ ዎጎጉዴያ ሼምፔና ታና ናንጊሼ።<verse eid="PSA 119:156"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="157" style="v" sid="PSA 119:157"/>ታና ዳውሳ ሞርካ ሚርጌኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:157">ታኣኒ ጋዓንቴ ኔኤኮ ዓይሢፃፓ ሺኢኪባኣሴ።<verse eid="PSA 119:157"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="158" style="v" sid="PSA 119:158"/>ዔያታ ቃኣሎ ኔኤሲ ካፑዋሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:158">ዬያሮ ጉሙርቂንቱዋ ዓሶ ዛጊ ታ ሻኣኪንቴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 119:158"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="159" style="v" sid="PSA 119:159"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:159">ኔኤኮ ዓይሢፆ ታ ናሽካያ ማዔሢ ዛጌ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:159">ኔኤኮ ናንጊና ናንጋ ናሹሞና ሼምፔና ታና ጌሤ።<verse eid="PSA 119:159"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="160" style="v" sid="PSA 119:160"/>ኔኤኮ ቃኣላ ጉቤና ጎኔኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:160">ኔኤኮ ፂሎ ማዔ ዎጋኣ ናንጊና ናንጋያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 119:160"/></para>
  <para style="s1">ፆኦሲ ዎጎም ዓይሢንቲሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="161" style="v" sid="PSA 119:161"/>ሱኡጋ ታኣኒ ዔኤቢ ማዺባኣንቴ ዳውሴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:161">ታ ጋዓንቴ ቃኣሎ ኔኤኮ ዒጊቹሞና ቦንቻኔ።<verse eid="PSA 119:161"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="162" style="v" sid="PSA 119:162"/>ዔኤቢ ሚርጌ ዲዒ ዔኬ ዓሲጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:162">ቃኣላ ኔኤኮ ታና ዎዛሴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 119:162"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="163" style="v" sid="PSA 119:163"/>ሉኡዙሞ ታ ዒፃኔ፥ ሻሻኣኪንታኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:163">ዎጎ ኔኤሲ ጋዓንቴ ናሽካኔ።<verse eid="PSA 119:163"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="164" style="v" sid="PSA 119:164"/>ኔኤኮ ፂሎ ማዔ ዎጎ ዛሎ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:164">ፔቴ ኬሊዳ ላንካይ ማይንቲ ታ ኔና ጋላታኔ።<verse eid="PSA 119:164"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="165" style="v" sid="PSA 119:165"/>ኔኤኮ ዎጎ ናሽካ ዓሶም ሚርጌ ኮሹሞ ዓኣኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:165">ዹቃ ባኣዚያ ዔያቶ ባኣሴ።<verse eid="PSA 119:165"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="166" style="v" sid="PSA 119:166"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ዓውሲፆ ኔኤሲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:166">ዎዛ ጌሢ ታ ካፓኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:166">ኔ ዓይሢፆዋ ማዺ ታ ኩንሣንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 119:166"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="167" style="v" sid="PSA 119:167"/>ሼምፓሢ ታኣኮ ኔ ዓይሢፆ ካፓኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:167">ሚርጌና ዬያ ታ ናሽካኔ።<verse eid="PSA 119:167"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="168" style="v" sid="PSA 119:168"/>ጎይፃ ታኣኮ ጉቤ ኔ ቤርታ ፔጋኣኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:168">ዬያሮ ኔኤኮ ዎጎንታ ዓይሢፆንታ ታ ካፓኔ።<verse eid="PSA 119:168"/></para>
  <para style="s1">ማኣዶ ዴንቃኒ ሺኢቂንቴ ሺኢጲሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="169" style="v" sid="PSA 119:169"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ታ ዒላታ ኔ ቤርቶ ሄሎንጎ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:169">ኔ ቃኣሎጉዴያ ማሊ ጶቂሥሢ ታኣም ዒንጌ።<verse eid="PSA 119:169"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="170" style="v" sid="PSA 119:170"/>ሺኢጲፃ ታኣሲ ኔ ቤርቶ ሄሎንጎ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:170">ኔ ቃኣሎጉዴያ ሄሊ ታና ዓውሴ።<verse eid="PSA 119:170"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="171" style="v" sid="PSA 119:171"/>ኔ ዎጎ ኔ ታና ዔርዜሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:171">ዻንጋ ታኣሲ ጋላታ ዓልቂሳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 119:171"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="172" style="v" sid="PSA 119:172"/>ዓይሢፃ ኔኤሲ ቢያ ፂሉሞ ዓይሥሢታሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:172">ዒንዲርዛ ታኣሲ ኔ ቃኣሎ ዛሎ ዓይናዾንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 119:172"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="173" style="v" sid="PSA 119:173"/>ኔኤኮ ዓይሢፆ ታ ዶኦሬሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:173">ኩጫ ኔኤሲ ታና ማኣዳኒ ጊኢጌያ ማዖንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 119:173"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="174" style="v" sid="PSA 119:174"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ዓውሲፆ ታ ኔኤሲ ኮዔኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:174">ኔኤኮ ዎጋ ታና ዎዛሳያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 119:174"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="175" style="v" sid="PSA 119:175"/>ታ ኔና ጋላታኒ ሼምፔና ናንጎም!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:175">ኔ ዎጋኣ ታና ማኣዶንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 119:175"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="176" style="v" sid="PSA 119:176"/>ዓዳ ዣኣሌ ማራይጉዲ ታ ማዔኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:176">ዓይሢፆ ታ ኔኤሲ ዋሊባኣሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:176">ታና ኔ ዓይላሢ ኔኤኒ ኮዔ።<verse eid="PSA 119:176"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 119"/>
  <chapter number="120" style="c" sid="PSA 120"/>
  <para style="s1">ፂዮኔ ኬዞ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="d">ሉኡቃ ዓሲና ጌሻ ዓሲናፓ ቶላኒ ሺኢቂንታ ሺኢጲሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 120:1"/>ሜታዺ ካራ ታኣኒ ባይዛዖ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 120:1">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ባንሢ ዒላቴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 120:1">ዒዚያኣ ታኣኮ ሺኢጲፆ ዋይዜኔ።<verse eid="PSA 120:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 120:2"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 120:2">ሉኡቃ ዓሶና ጌሻ ዓሶናፓ ታና ዓውሴ።<verse eid="PSA 120:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 120:3"/>ዒንሢ ጌሺ ማልታ ዓሳ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 120:3">ፆኦሲ ዒንሢ ዎዎዴቴ ኮሺኬ ጎዖንዶይ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 120:3">ዎዚጉዴ ሜቶ ዒንሢዳ ቃሴቴ ታኣም ጊኢጋንዳይ?<verse eid="PSA 120:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 120:4"/>ዒዚ ዒንሢ ዓጬ ሂኢዦና ዱካንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 120:4">ታሚ ቄንሢናኣ ዒንሢ ዒ ሚቻንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 120:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 120:5"/>ቄዳሬ ዓጮ ዴሮ ባኣካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 120:5">ጊንሣ ሃሣ ሜሼኬ ዴሮ ባኣካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 120:5">ሙፒ ዓሲ ማዒ ታ ናንጌሢሮ ታና ባዴዔ!<verse eid="PSA 120:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 120:6"/>ኮሹሞ ዒፃ ዴሬና ዎላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 120:6">ሚርጌ ሌዔ ታኣኒ ናንጌኔ።<verse eid="PSA 120:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 120:7"/>ታኣኒ ኮሹሞ ኮኮዓኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 120:7">ታኣኒ ኮሹሞ ዛላ ጌስታኣና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 120:7">ዔያታ ዖልዚ ሃይሴ ሌሊ ዔካኔ።<verse eid="PSA 120:7"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 120"/>
  <chapter number="121" style="c" sid="PSA 121"/>
  <para style="s1">ፂዮኔ ኬዞ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="d">ፆኦሲ ኑና ፑርታፓ ካፓያ ማዒፆ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 121:1"/>ታ ሌካ ዼኤፖ ዹኮ ባንሢ ዛጋኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 121:1">ሃንጎሾ፥ ታኣኒ ማኣዶ ዓንካፓ ዴንቃንዳዖ?<verse eid="PSA 121:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 121:2"/>ማኣዳ ታኣም ሙካሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 121:2">ጫሪንጮና ሳዖና ማዤ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳፓኬ።<verse eid="PSA 121:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 121:3"/>ኔና ካፓሢ ቢያ ዎዴ ጴቺ ዴይ ካፓሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 121:3">ቶኮ ኔኤኮ ሃርቻቼ ዔኪ ኔና ሎንሣዓኬ።<verse eid="PSA 121:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 121:4"/>ዒስራዔኤሌ ካፓሢ ፔቴታዖ ጊንዑዋሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 121:4">ሃውሻኒ ጌይያኣ ላሁዋሴ።<verse eid="PSA 121:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 121:5"/>ኔና ካፓሢ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 121:5">ኔኤኮ ሚዛቆ ዛላ ዒ ሺቢ ማዒ ዓኣኔ።<verse eid="PSA 121:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 121:6"/>ሮኦሮና ዓባ ኔና ሚቻዓኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 121:6">ዒባኖናኣ ዓጊና ፔቴታዖ ፑርታ ባኣዚ ሄሊሳዓኬ።<verse eid="PSA 121:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 121:7"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ፑርታ ባኣዚ ቢያይዳፓ ኔና ካፓንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 121:7">ኔኤኮ ሼምፓሢ ኮሺና ዒዚ ካፓያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 121:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 121:8"/>ኔ ማኣራፓ ኬስኪ ኔኤኒ ዴንዳኣና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 121:8">ጊንሣ ኔኤኒ ዬካፓ ማዓኣና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 121:8">ሃኖዋ ማዖም ሃጊያ ናንጊና ዒ ኔና ካፓንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 121:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 121"/>
  <chapter number="122" style="c" sid="PSA 122"/>
  <para style="s1">ፂዮኔ ኬዞ ዓይኑሞ ዳውቴ ዓይናዼሢ</para>
  <para style="d">ዬሩሳላሜ ሄርሺ ዓይናዺንቴ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 122:1"/>«ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢ ማኣሪ ኑ ዓኣዾም!» ዔያታ ጋዓኣና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 122:1">ሚርጌና ታና ዎዛሴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 122:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 122:2"/>ዬሩሳላሜ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 122:2">ካሮና ኔኤኮ ኑኡኒ ጌሊ ጋራ ዔቄኔ።<verse eid="PSA 122:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 122:3"/>ዬሩሳላሜ ካታማ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 122:3">ዎላ ካንሢ ጋጋሦናጉዲ ዶዲሺ ማዢንቴ ካታማኬ።<verse eid="PSA 122:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 122:4"/>ዒስራዔኤሌም ዒንጊንቴ ዳምቦ ጎይፆጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 122:4">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢም ጋላታ ሺኢሻኒ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:4">ፆኦሲ ፃጳ ቢያ ቡካሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 122:4">ሃኖ ካታሜሎይዳኬ።<verse eid="PSA 122:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 122:5"/>ዳውቴ ፃጳፓ ካኣታዼ ካኣታ ቢያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 122:5">ፔኤኮ ዴሮም ዎጎ ዎጋኒ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 122:5">ሃኖ ካታሜሎይዳ ዴዓኔ።<verse eid="PSA 122:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 122:6"/>ዬሩሳላሜ ካታሞይዳ ኮሹሞ ዓኣያ ማዓንዳጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 122:6">ሂዚ ጌይ ፆኦሲ ሺኢቁዋቴ፦</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 122:6">«ኔና ናሽካ ዓሳ ቢያ ጊኢጎንጎ፤<verse eid="PSA 122:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 122:7"/>ኔኤኮ ኬኤሎ ዲፃ ቢያ ኮሺ ማዒ ዴዖንጎ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 122:7">ኔኤኮ ካኣቶ ማኣራ ሜታ ባኣያ ኮሺ ናንጎንጎ።»<verse eid="PSA 122:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 122:8"/>ታኣኮ ዒጊኖንታ ታ ላጎንታሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 122:8">«ዬሩሳላሜ! ኮሹሞ ኔኤም ማዖንጎ!» ታኣኒ ጋዓንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 122:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 122:9"/>ዬሩሳላሜ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 122:9">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ማዔ ኑ ፆኦዛሢ ማኣሮ ዛሎሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 122:9">ኔኤም ኮሺ ሙካንዳጉዲ ታ ኮዓኔ።<verse eid="PSA 122:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 122"/>
  <chapter number="123" style="c" sid="PSA 123"/>
  <para style="s1">ፂዮኔ ኬዞ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="d">ፆኦሲ ሚጪንቲ ማኣዳንዳጉዲ ሺኢቂንቴ ሺኢጲሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 123:1"/>ጫሪንጫ ካኣቱሞ ዖይታ ዴዒ ዓኣሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 123:1">ኔ ባንሢ ታኣኒ ዛጋኔ።<verse eid="PSA 123:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 123:2"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ማዔ ኑ ፆኦዛሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 123:2">ዓይሎ ማዒ ማዻ ዓቲንቃ ማኣሮ ዓዶ ኩጮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 123:2">ላኣላ ጊንሣ ማኣሮ ዒንዶ ኩጮ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 123:2">ዛጋሢጉዲ ኔኤኒ ኑና ሚጪንቲ ማኣዳንዳያ ሄላንዳኣና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 123:2">ኔ ማኣዳሢ ሙካንዳ ጎይፆማ ኑ ካፓኔ።<verse eid="PSA 123:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 123:3"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ሚርጌና ኑ ጫሽኪንቴሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 123:3">ሃዳራ ኑና ሚጪንቲ ማኣዴ።<verse eid="PSA 123:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 123:4"/>ዖቶሮ ዓሳ ኑና ቦሃ ቦሂፃ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 123:4">ዖርጎጮ ዓሳ ኑና ቶኦቻ ቶኦቺፃ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 123:4">ሚሺ ኑና ቴኤቄኔ።<verse eid="PSA 123:4"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 123"/>
  <chapter number="124" style="c" sid="PSA 124"/>
  <para style="s1">ፂዮኔ ኬዞ ዓይኑሞ ዳውቴ ዓይናዼሢ</para>
  <para style="d">ፆኦሲ ፔ ዓሶ ካፓያ ማዒፆ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 124:1"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ኑኡና ዎላ ማዒባኣቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 124:1">ኑ ዎዎይታንዳዖ ዓቴይ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 124:1">ዒስራዔኤሌ ሂዚ ጎዖንጎ፦<verse eid="PSA 124:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 124:2"/>«ዎንዴ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢ ኑኡና ማዒባኣቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 124:2">ኑኡኮ ሞርካ ኑና ባይዛኒ ሙኬያና፥<verse eid="PSA 124:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 124:3"/>ዼኤፖ ዻጎና ኑጊዳ ዔያታ ዔቄያና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 124:3">ሼምፔና ዔቂ ዓኣንቴ ኑና ዔያታ ዔዔኤዼዖ ዓቴኔ፤<verse eid="PSA 124:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 124:4"/>ዲጳ ኑና ዔኤዺ ጋፔያታንቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 124:4">ዬይ ሴኤሊንቲ ዴንዳ ዋኣፃ ኑና ሙይ ጋፔያታንቴኬ፤<verse eid="PSA 124:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 124:5"/>ሩኡሪና ዴንዳ ዲጳ ፒፂ ኑና ዔኪ ዴንዴናንዳንቴኬ።»<verse eid="PSA 124:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 124:6"/>ኑኡኮ ሞርካ ዓጮና ኑና ዻይ ሾኦሉዋጉዲ ካፔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 124:6">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢ ጋላቲንቶም።<verse eid="PSA 124:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 124:7"/>ኑኡኒ ካፒጉዲ ኑኡም ፒሮና ፒራስካፓ ቶሌኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 124:7">ዬይ ፒራሢ ሜቄም፥ ኑኡኒ ዓዺንቱዋዖ ዓቴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 124:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 124:8"/>ዬያይዲ ኑና ማኣዴሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 124:8">ጫሪንጮና ሳዖና ማዤ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ሱንፆኬ።<verse eid="PSA 124:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 124"/>
  <chapter number="125" style="c" sid="PSA 125"/>
  <para style="s1">ፂዮኔ ኬዞ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="d">ፆኦሲ ፔ ዓሶ ጉሙርሳያ ማዒ ካፓ ካፒሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 125:1"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ጉሙርቃ ዓሳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 125:1">ፔቴታዖ ዓጊፁዋዖ ናኣናና ናንጋ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 125:1">ፂዮኔ ዹኮጉዲ ዶዲ ዴዓያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 125:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 125:2"/>ዹካ ዬሩሳላሜኮ ኮይሎ ቢያ ዲርቂ ዓኣሢጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 125:2">ሃናኣፓ ዓርቃዖ ዴንዲ ናንጊና ናንጋንዳያና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 125:2">ፆኦሲ ፔ ዴሮኮ ኮይሎ ዲርቂ ዓኣኔ።<verse eid="PSA 125:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 125:3"/>ፂሎ ዓሳ ፑርታ ባኣዚ ማዺ ዓርቁዋጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 125:3">ፑርቶ ዓሳ ፂሎ ዓሶ ሳዖይዳ ዴይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 125:3">ዎይሣንዳሢ ሚርጌ ናንጋዓኬ።<verse eid="PSA 125:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 125:4"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 125:4">ኔኤኮ ዓይሢፆ ካፒ ኩንሣ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 125:4">ኮዦ ዓሶም ኮሺ ባኣዚ ማዼ።<verse eid="PSA 125:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 125:5"/>ዎቦ ጎይፆ ባንሢ ጊንሣ ማዓ ዓሶ ጋዓንቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 125:5">ፑርቶ ማዻ ዓሶና ዎላ ፆኦሲ ባይዛንዳኔ።</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 125:5"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 125:5">ኮሹሞ ዒስራዔኤሌም ማዖንጎ!<verse eid="PSA 125:5"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 125"/>
  <chapter number="126" style="c" sid="PSA 126"/>
  <para style="s1">ፂዮኔ ኬዞ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="d">ዲዒንቲፓ ማዓዖ ዎዛና ዓይናዺንቴ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 126:1"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ኑና ፂዮኔ ዔኪ ማሄያና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 126:1">ዓውቲ ኑኡም ማሌኔ፥ ጎኔ ባኣዚኬ ኑ ጌይባኣሴ።<verse eid="PSA 126:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 126:2"/>ዻንጋ ኑኡኮ ሚኢቺ ሌሊ ሚኢጫያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 126:2">ዎዛና ዓይኑሞ ሌሊ ዓይናዻያ ማዔኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 126:2">ዬያሮ ሜሌ ዴራ፦</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 126:2">«ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዼኤፒ ባኣዚ ዔያቶም ማዼኔ» ጌዔኔ።<verse eid="PSA 126:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 126:3"/>ጎኔና ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ሚርጌ ዼኤፒ ባኣዚ ኑኡም ማዼኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 126:3">ዬያሮ ሚርጌና ኑኡኒ ዎዛዻኔ።<verse eid="PSA 126:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 126:4"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 126:4">ዒራ ዋርቃዛ ዾኦሎ ዛሎይዳ ዓኣ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 126:4">ዓሲ ናንጉዋ ዳውሎም ዲጶ ዋኣፆ ዔኪ ሙካ ዎሮጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 126:4">ኑ ባኮ ኑኡም ማሂ ዒንጊ ዎንዴ ኑ ዓኣ ጎይፆ ማሄ።<verse eid="PSA 126:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 126:5"/>ዬኤኪ ዬኤኪ ዜርቄ ዓሳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 126:5">ዎዛና ዒላሺ ዒላሺ ማኣሎ ቡራንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 126:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 126:6"/>ዜርፆ ዔኪ ዴንዳኣና ዬኤኬ ዓሳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 126:6">ናኣሮ ኬዲ ዎዛና ማዒ ሙካንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 126:6"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 126"/>
  <chapter number="127" style="c" sid="PSA 127"/>
  <para style="s1">ፂዮኔ ኬዞ ዓይኑሞ ሴሎሞኔ ዓይናዼሢ</para>
  <para style="d">ፆኦሲኮ ኮሹሞሮ ጋላቲንቴ ጋላታ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 127:1"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ኬኤሢ ማዢባኣንቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 127:1">ማኣሮ ማዣኔ ጋዓ ዓሳ ላባሢ ጉሪኬ።</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:1">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ካታሞ ካፒባኣንቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 127:1">ካታሞ ካፓኔ ጋዓ ዓሳ ጉሪ ላባኔ።<verse eid="PSA 127:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 127:2"/>ጉቴ ዹቡርታ ዔቂ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 127:2">ጊንሣ ሃሣ ዒባኒ ላሆንዶ ዎዶ ዓኣሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 127:2">ሳዖይዳ ዓኣ ናንጎሮ ላቢፃ ጉሪኬ።</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:2">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 127:2">ዒዚ ናሽካ ዓሶም ሃውሾ ዒንጋኔ።<verse eid="PSA 127:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 127:3"/>ናይ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዒንጋ ባኣዚኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 127:3">ጎኔ ፒዜ ማዔ ዓንጆኬ።<verse eid="PSA 127:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 127:4"/>ዓሲ ዼጌ ዓኣዖ ሾዓ ዓቲንቄ ናይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 127:4">ዖልዚ ዓሲኮ ኩሽካ ዓኣ ሂኢሺጉዴያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 127:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 127:5"/>ካቲላ ዬያጉዴ ሂኢዦና ኩሜ ዓሲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 127:5">ጎኔና ባሊቲ ዓኣ ዓሲኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:5">ፔ ሞርኮና ዎላ ካታሞ ጌሎ ካራ ማርማኣና</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:5">ባሺንቲ ቦርሲንቱዋያኬ። <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">127፡5 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ዬኖ ዎዶና ማዺንታ ጎይፆ፦ ዬይ ዺቦ ዓቲንቆ ናኣታ ዓዶና ዎላ ዓዶ ዛሎ ማርማኒ ሙካያ ማዒፆ ዔርዛያኬ።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 127:5"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 127"/>
  <chapter number="128" style="c" sid="PSA 128"/>
  <para style="s1">ፂዮኔ ኬዞ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="d">ፆኦሲም ዓይሢንቲና ጴዻ ዓንጆ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 128:1"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዒጊጫዞንሢና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 128:1">ዓይሢፆዋ ካፓዞንሢ ዓንጂንቴያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 128:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 128:2"/>ኔ ማዺ ላቤ ጮጋጮ ኔኤሲ ኔኤኒ ሙዓንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 128:2">ኔ ዓንጂንታንዳኔ፥ ዔኤቢ ቢያ ኔኤም ጊኢጋንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 128:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 128:3"/>ኔኤኮ ላኣሌላ ማኣሮይዳ ዓሚ ካፃ ዎይኔ ማዓንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 128:3">ኔኤኮ ናኣታኣ ካሦ ሙዖ ጎንጎ ዓጮይዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 128:3">ፑሪ ኬስኬ ዛይቶ ሪሚቶ ናኣቶጉዲ ማዓንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 128:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 128:4"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ቦንቺ ዒጊጫ ዓሲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 128:4">ያዺ ዓንጂንታያ ማዓንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 128:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 128:5"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ፂዮኔፓ ኔና ዓንጆንጎ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 128:5">ዬሩሳላሜኮ ዖርጎቹሞ ኔ ናንጋ ዎዶ ቢያይዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 128:5">ኔና ዻዎንጎ!<verse eid="PSA 128:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 128:6"/>ኔ ናኣቶኮ ናኣቶ ሄላንዳኣና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 128:6">ኔና ዒዚ ዛጊሶንጎ!</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 128:6"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 128:6">ኮሹሞ ዒስራዔኤሌም ማዖም!<verse eid="PSA 128:6"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 128"/>
  <chapter number="129" style="c" sid="PSA 129"/>
  <para style="s1">ፂዮኔ ኬዞ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="d">ዒስራዔኤሌኮ ሞርኮፓ ቶላኒ ሺኢቂንቴ ሺኢጲሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 129:1"/>ናኣቶፓ ዓርቃዖ ፑርታ ባኣዚ ታና ሄሌኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 129:1">ዒስራዔኤሌ ዓሳ ሂዚ ጎዖንጎ፦<verse eid="PSA 129:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 129:2"/>«ታኣኒ ናኣቶ ዓኣንቴ ዓርቃዖ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 129:2">ታኣኮ ሞርካ ታና ሚጪንቲቃይዶ ዳውሳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 129:2">ጋዓንቴ ታና ዔያታ ባሺባኣሴ።<verse eid="PSA 129:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 129:3"/>ታኣኮ ዙሎ ዔያታ ዢራፓና ጳርቂ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 129:3">ጎሺ ጎሽኮማጉዲ ሹኬኔ።<verse eid="PSA 129:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 129:4"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ቢያ ዎዴ ፒዜኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 129:4">ዬያቶ ሚጪንቱዋ ፑርቶ ዓሶ ቱኡዛፓ ታና ዒ ቡሌኔ።»<verse eid="PSA 129:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 129:5"/>ፂዮኔ ዒፃ ዓሲ ቢያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 129:5">ቦርሲንቲ ጊንሢም ማዖም።<verse eid="PSA 129:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 129:6"/>ማኣሪ ዑሢዳ ባቃሌ ማኣቲጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 129:6">ሃጊ ዑጉዋዖ ሹሊ ባይቃያ ማዖም።<verse eid="PSA 129:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 129:7"/>ዬያጉዴ ማኣታ ዎዻ ዓሲኮ ኩጮ ኩሙዋያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 129:7">ጌኤቴ ማሂ ቱካኒ ጋዓሢማኣ ኮኦማ ኩሙዋያ ማዖም።<verse eid="PSA 129:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 129:8"/>ዔያቶኮ ኮይሊና ዴንዳ ዓሲ ቢያ ፂዮኔኮ ሞርኮ፦</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 129:8">«ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዒንሢ ዓንጆንጎ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 129:8">ኑኡኒያ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ሱንፆና ዒንሢ ዓንጃኔ!»</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 129:8">ዔያቶ ጋዓዓኬ።<verse eid="PSA 129:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 129"/>
  <chapter number="130" style="c" sid="PSA 130"/>
  <para style="s1">ፂዮኔ ኬዞ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="d">ፆኦሲ ማኣዳንዳጉዲ ሺኢቂንቴ ሺኢጲሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 130:1"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ዼኤፒ ዖዪሢዳ ዓኣዖ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 130:1">ኔ ታና ማኣዳንዳጉዲ ኔ ባንሢ ታ ዒላታኔ።<verse eid="PSA 130:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 130:2"/>ጎዳሢዮ! ታ ሺኢቃ ሺኢጲፆ ዋይዜ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 130:2">ኔ ዋያ ታኣኮ ዒላቶ ዋይዛያ ማዖም።<verse eid="PSA 130:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 130:3"/>ኔኤኒ ኑኡኮ ጎሞ ኮጲሳያ ማዔቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 130:3">ዖኦኒ ፒዜ ማዒ ሜቶ ዔኩዋ ዓታንዳይ?<verse eid="PSA 130:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 130:4"/>ጋዓንቴ ኔና ኑ ቦንቻንዳጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 130:4">ኑኡኮ ጎሞ ኔኤኒ ዓቶም ጋዓኔ።<verse eid="PSA 130:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 130:5"/>ታኣኒ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ጶቂሢ ካፓኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 130:5">ታ ሼምፓሢያ ዒዛ ጊቢ ካፓኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 130:5">ዒዛኮ ቃኣሎዋ ታ ጉሙርቃኔ።<verse eid="PSA 130:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 130:6"/>ዛቤ ካፓ ዓሲ ሳዓ ካራንዳጉዲ ኮዓያይዳፓ ባሼ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 130:6">ታኣኒ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ጶቂሢ ካፓኔ።<verse eid="PSA 130:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 130:7"/>ዒስራዔኤሌ! ዒዛኮ ናሹማ ናንጊና ናንጋያ ማዔሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 130:7">ዓሲ ዓውሳኒያ ዎልቄ ዓኣያ ማዔሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 130:7">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳይዳ ሃጋ ዎዛ ጌሢ ጉሙርቄ።<verse eid="PSA 130:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 130:8"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ፔኤኮ ዴሮ ዒስራዔኤሌ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 130:8">ዔያቶኮ ጎሞ ቢያይዳፓ ዓውሳያኬ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">130፡8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 1:21">ማቲ. 1፡21</ref>፤ <ref loc="TIT 2:14">ቲቶ 2፡14</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 130:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 130"/>
  <chapter number="131" style="c" sid="PSA 131"/>
  <para style="s1">ፂዮኔ ኬዞ ዓይኑሞ ዳውቴ ዓይናዼሢ</para>
  <para style="d">ፆኦሲ ጉሙርቂሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 131:1"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ታ ዒኖይዳ ዖቶርሙሞ ባኣሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 131:1">ዓኣፓ ታኣኮ ዖቶርሙሞና ዛጌ ጎይሢ ባኣሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 131:1">ዒና ታኣኮ ኮይሱዋ ዼኤፓቶ ኮዒባኣሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 131:1">ታኣም ሃናኑዋ ባኣዚ ሄላኒ ታ ጪኢዺንቲባኣሴ።<verse eid="PSA 131:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 131:2"/>ዻንሢፓ ጉኡጴ ናይ ዒንዶኮ ዳዳ ሊች ጌይ ዴዓሢጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 131:2">ታኣኒ ዔኤቢያ ጎዑዋዖ ዚቲ ጌዔኔ።<verse eid="PSA 131:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 131:3"/>ዒስራዔኤሌ! ሃሢፓ ዓርቃዖ ናንጊና ናንጊ ሄላንዳኣና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 131:3">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢ ጉሙርቂ ናንጌ!<verse eid="PSA 131:3"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 131"/>
  <chapter number="132" style="c" sid="PSA 132"/>
  <para style="s1">ፂዮኔ ኬዞ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="d">ጌኤዦ ማኣሮ ዛሎ ዓይናዺንቴ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 132:1"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:1">ታና ዳውቴያ ማሊ ጶቂሣዎ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:1">ዒዚ ሜታዺ ዓኣሤ ሜቶዋ ቢያ ሃዳራ ዋሊፖ።<verse eid="PSA 132:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 132:2"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ኔኤና ዎላ ዒ ጫኣቄ ጫኣቁሞና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:2">ቢያ ባኮ ዳንዳዓ፥ ያይቆኦቤ ፆኦዛሢ፥ ኔኤም</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:2">ሂዚ ጌይ ዒ ጫኣቂ ናኣቤ ናኣቦ ማሊ ጶቂሤ፦<verse eid="PSA 132:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3-5" style="v" sid="PSA 132:3-5"/>«ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢም ኬኤሢ ታኣኒ ማዣንዳኣና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:3-5">ቢያ ባኮ ዳንዳዓ ያይቆኦቤ ፆኦሲም ማኣሪ ታ ኮሻንዳኣና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:3-5">ታ ኬኤፆ ታኣኒ ጌላዓኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:3-5">ታ ዓርሶይዳኣ ታኣኒ ላሃዓኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:3-5">ሃውሺ ጊንዖ ጋዓ ባኣዚያ ታ ጊንዓዓኬ።»<verse eid="PSA 132:3-5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 132:6"/>ዔፕራታይዳ ኑ ዓኣዖ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:6">ዒዚ ጫኣቁሞ ጫኣቄ ሳኣፂኖ ዛሎ ኑ ዋይዜኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:6">ቂሪያትይዓሪሜይዳ ዬያ ሳኣፂኖ ኑኡኒ ዴንቄኔ።<verse eid="PSA 132:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 132:7"/>ዬካፓ ኑኡኒ፦ «ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢኮ ማኣሪ ኑ ዓኣዾም፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:7">ቶካ ዒዛኮ ሄርቃ ሳዖይዳ ሂርኪ ጌይ ኑ ዒዛም ዚጎም» ጌዔኔ።<verse eid="PSA 132:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 132:8"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:8">ኔኤኮ ዎልቆ ፔጋሲ ዔርዛያ ማዔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:8">ጫኣቁሞ ሳኣፂኖና ዎላ ኔኤኒ ሃውሻ ቤዞ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:8">ኔኤኮ ጌኤዦ ማኣሮ ጌሌ።<verse eid="PSA 132:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 132:9"/>ኔኤም ማዻ ቄኤሳ ፂሎ ማዾ ማዾም!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:9">ኔኤም ጉሙርቂንታያ ማዔዞንሢ ዎዛና ኔና ቦንቺ ዓይናዾም!<verse eid="PSA 132:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 132:10"/>ኔ ዓይላሢ ዳውቴ ጋይቴ ጌይጋፓ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:10">ኔኤኒ ካኣታሣኒ ቲሽኪ ዶኦሜሢ ሃሺፖ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">132፡10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 6:41-42">2ፆኦሲ. ዓሃኬ 6፡41-42</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 132:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 132:11"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዳውቴም</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:11">ሂዚ ጌይ ላኣሚንቱዋ ጫኣቁሞ ጫኣቄኔ፦</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:11">«ኔ ናኣቶፓ ፔቴሢ ታኣኒ ካኣታሣንዳኔ፤ <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">132፡11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:12-16">2ሳሙ. 7፡12-16</ref>፤ <ref loc="1CH 17:11-14">1ፆኦሲ. ዓሃኬ 17፡11-14</ref>፤ <ref loc="PSA 89:3-4">ዓይኑ. 89፡3-4</ref>፤ <ref loc="ACT 2:30">ዳኪ. ማዾ 2፡30</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 132:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 132:12"/>ኔኤኮ ናኣታ ታኣኒ ዔያቶም ጫኣቄ ጫኣቁሞንታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:12">ታ ዔያቶ ዓይሤ ባኮንታ ካፒ ኩንሣያ ማዔቴ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:12">ዔያቶኮ ናኣታ ሃሣ ኔና ሄሊሲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:12">ናንጊና ካኣታዺ ናንጋያ ማዓንዳኔ።»<verse eid="PSA 132:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 132:13"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ፂዮኔ ፔኤም ማሂ ዶኦሬኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:13">ዒኢካ ማኣሪ ማሂ ናንጋኒያ ኮዔኔ።<verse eid="PSA 132:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 132:14"/>ሃና ታኣኮ ናንጊና ሃውሺ ናንጎ ቤሲኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:14">ሃይካ ታኣኒ ናንጋኒ ሚርጌ ኮዔያታሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:14">ሃኖ ቤዞ ታ ማኣሪ ታኣኒ ማሄኔ።<verse eid="PSA 132:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 132:15"/>ፂዮኔ ታ ኮሺ ዑሣ ዓኣሢ ዓንጃንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:15">ማንቆ ዓሶ ሙኡዚ ታኣኒ ሚሻንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 132:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 132:16"/>ቄኤሶ ታኣኒ ዻቂንታ ማኣዖጉዲ ማይሳንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:16">ዒኢካ ናንጋ፥ ጉሙርቂንታ ዓሳኣ ዎዛና ዓይናዻንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 132:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 132:17"/>ዳውቴ ዜርፃፓ ካኣቲ ማዓያ ታኣኒ ኬሳንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:17">ታኣኒ ዶኦሚ ካኣታሤሢም ዼኤፒ ዎልቄ ታ ዒንጋንዳኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">132፡17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 11:36">1ካኣቶ. ማ 11፡36</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 132:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 132:18"/>ዒዛኮ ሞርኮ ታኣኒ ቦርሲንቲ ዓፒላንቲኖ ማይሳንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:18">ጋዓንቴ ዒዛኮ ቶኦካ ታኣኒ ዓጋንዳ ቦንቾ ባካ ዓኣፓ ዱካያ ማዓንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 132:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 132"/>
  <chapter number="133" style="c" sid="PSA 133"/>
  <para style="s1">ፂዮኔ ኬዞ ዓይኑሞ ዳውቴ ዓይናዼሢ</para>
  <para style="d">ፔቱሞና ናሽኪንቲ ናንጊሢ ዛላ ዓይናዺንቴ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 133:1"/>ፆኦሲ ዓሳ ዎላ ፔቱሞና ናንጋዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 133:1">ሚርጌና ኮሺኬ፥ ዎዛሳያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 133:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 133:2"/>ዓኣሮኔኮ ቶኦካ ዋሆዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 133:2">ቡኡጮ ባኣፆና ጌይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 133:2">ዓፒሎ ማጫሮ ሄላኒ ሻኣዺ ዴንዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 133:2">ኮሺ ሳውሞ ዓኣ ሪሚቶ ዛይቶ ጉዴያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 133:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 133:3"/>ዬያጉዲ ሃሣ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 133:3">ሄርሞኔ ዹካፓ ፂዮኔ ጌሜሮ ጎኦባ ፆዻ ዖልኮጉዲኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 133:3">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢ ባይቁዋያ ማዒ ናንጋ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 133:3">ኮሺ ናንጊንታ ዓንጆንታ ዒኢካ ማዓንዳጉዲ ዓይሤኔ።<verse eid="PSA 133:3"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 133"/>
  <chapter number="134" style="c" sid="PSA 134"/>
  <para style="s1">ፂዮኔ ኬዞ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="d">ፆኦሲ ጋላታኒ ዓይናዺንታ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 134:1"/>ዒንሢ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳም ማዻ ዓይላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 134:1">ዹሞና ጌኤዦ ማኣራ ዔቂ ዒዛም ማዻ ዓሳ ቢያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 134:1">ሃኒ ዬይ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ጋላቱዋቴ።<verse eid="PSA 134:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 134:2"/>ጌኤዦ ማኣሮይዳ ኩጮ ዒንሢኮ ሌካ ዔቂሲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 134:2">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢ ጋላቱዋቴ።<verse eid="PSA 134:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 134:3"/>ጫሪንጮና ሳዖና ማዤ፥ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 134:3">ፂዮኔፓ ዒንሢ ዓንጆንጎ!<verse eid="PSA 134:3"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 134"/>
  <chapter number="135" style="c" sid="PSA 135"/>
  <para style="s1">ጋላታ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 135:1"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ጋላቱዋቴ!</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 135:1"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:1">ዒንሢ፥ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳኮ ዓይላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:1">ዒዛኮ ሱንፆ ቦንቺ ጋላቱዋቴ።<verse eid="PSA 135:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 135:2"/>ኑ ፆኦዛሢኮ ጌኤዦ ማኣሮይዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:2">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳኮ ማኣሮ ጋሮይዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:2">ሙኪ ዔቂ ማዾ ማዻ ዓሳ ዒዛ ጋላቱዋቴ።<verse eid="PSA 135:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 135:3"/>ዒዚ ኮሺ ማዔሢሮ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ጋላቱዋቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:3">ዒዚ ሚጪንታያ ማዔሢሮዋ ሱንፆ ዒዛሲ ቦንቺ ዓይናዹዋቴ።<verse eid="PSA 135:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 135:4"/>ዒዚ ያይቆኦቤ ፔኤም ማሂ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:4">ዒስራዔኤሌ ፔ ሚኢሼ ማሂ ዶኦሬኔ።<verse eid="PSA 135:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 135:5"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዼኤፒታሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:5">ኑ ጎዳ ሜሌ ፆኦዞፓ ቢያ ባሻያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:5">ዼኤፒ ፆኦሲ ማዔሢ ታ ዔራኔ።<verse eid="PSA 135:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 135:6"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ጫሪንጮይዳ ሳዖይዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:6">ዬያጉዲ ዼኤፖ ባዞይዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:6">ኮይሴ ባኣዚ ቢያ ዒ ማማዻያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 135:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 135:7"/>ዒርዚና ዓኣ ሻኣሬ ሳዖኮ ጋፓፓ ዔኪ ዬዓኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:7">ዒራ ዋርቃኣና ዜኤሊንሢ ዒዚ ዜኤሊንሢሳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:7">ዢባሮዋ ፔ ኮናፓ ኬሲ ዳካኔ።<verse eid="PSA 135:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 135:8"/>ጊብፄ ዓጮይዳ ዓሶንታ ቆሎንታኮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:8">ቶይዶ ናኣቶ ዎዼሢ ዒዛኬ።<verse eid="PSA 135:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 135:9"/>ጊብፄ! ኔ ጊዳ ኔኤኮ ካኣቲንታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:9">ዒዛም ማዻ ዓሶ ቢያሢዳ ሜቶ ዓጋኒ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:9">ፔ ዎልቆና ማዺንታ ባኣዚንታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:9">ዲቃሢ ሄርሺሳ ባኣዚ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዳኬኔ።<verse eid="PSA 135:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 135:10"/>ዒዚ ሜሌ ሚርጌ ዴሬ ዎዺ ኩርሴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:10">ዼኤፖ ዼኤፖ ካኣቶዋ ዎዼኔ።<verse eid="PSA 135:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 135:11"/>ዓሞራ ዓሶ ካኣቲ ሲሆኔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:11">ባኣሳኣኔ ዓሶ ካኣቲ ዖኦጌ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:11">ካኣናኔ ዓጮ ካኣቶዋ ቢያ ዒዚ ዎዼኔ።<verse eid="PSA 135:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 135:12"/>ዬያቶ ዓሶኮ ሳዖ ፔ ዴሮ ዒስራዔኤሌም</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:12">ዴኔ ማሂ ዒዚ ዒንጌኔ።<verse eid="PSA 135:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 135:13"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ሱንፃ ኔኤኮ ናንጊና ናንጋያኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:13">ዎዶና ዎዶና ኬስካ ዓሳ ቢያ ኔና ዋሉዋ ጶቂሣንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 135:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 135:14"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ፔ ዴሮም ፒዜ ዎጌ ዎጋኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:14">ዒዛም ማዻ ዓይሎማኣ ሚጪንታኔ።<verse eid="PSA 135:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 135:15"/>ሜሌ ዴሮኮ ፆኦዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:15">ቢራ ዓንጊና ዎርቄናይዳፓ ዹይ ኮሾናያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 135:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 135:16"/>ዬያ ፆኦዞኮ ዻንጋ ዓኣዖ ጌስቱዋያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:16">ዓኣፒ ዓኣዖዋ ዴንቁዋያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 135:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 135:17"/>ዋይዚያ ዓኣኔ፥ ጋዓንቴ ዋይዙዋሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:17">ፔ ሲኢዾና ዑኡሲ ዔካኒ ዳንዳዑዋያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 135:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 135:18"/>ዬያቶ ኮሼ ዓሶንታ ጉሙርቃ ዓሳኣ ቢያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:18">ዬያቶ ፆኦዞጉዲ ማዒ ዓቶንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 135:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 135:19"/>ዒስራዔኤሌ ዴሬዮቴ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:19">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ጋላቱዋቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:19">ዒንሢ፥ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳም ማዻ ቄኤሳ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:19">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢ ጋላቱዋቴ።<verse eid="PSA 135:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 135:20"/>ዒንሢ ሌዊ ፃጶ ማዔ ዓሳ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:20">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ጋላቱዋቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:20">ዒንሢ፥ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢ ቦንቻ ዓሳ ቢያ ዒዛ ጋላቱዋቴ።<verse eid="PSA 135:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 135:21"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ፂዮኔይዳ ጋላቱዋቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:21">ዒዚ ናንጋ፥ ዬሩሳላሜይዳኣ ጋላቱዋቴ።</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 135:21"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:21">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ጋላቱዋቴ!<verse eid="PSA 135:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 135"/>
  <chapter number="136" style="c" sid="PSA 136"/>
  <para style="s1">ጋላታ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 136:1"/>ዒዚ ኮሺ ማዔሢሮ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ጋላቱዋቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:1">ዒዛኮ ሚጪንቲፃ ናንጊና ናንጋያኬ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">136፡1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 16:34">1ፆኦሲ. ዓሃኬ 16፡34</ref>፤ <ref loc="2CH 5:13">2ፆኦሲ. ዓሃኬ 5፡13</ref>፤ <ref loc="2CH 7:3">7፡3</ref>፤ <ref loc="EZR 3:11">ዒዝ. 3፡11</ref>፤ <ref loc="PSA 100:5">ዓይኑ. 100፡5</ref>፤ <ref loc="PSA 106:1">106፡1</ref>፤ <ref loc="PSA 107:1">107፡1</ref>፤ <ref loc="PSA 118:1">118፡1</ref>፤ <ref loc="JER 33:11">ዔር. 33፡11</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 136:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 136:2"/>ፆኦዞኬ ጌይ ካኣሽኮ ባኮይዳፓ ቢያ ባሼ ማዔ ፆኦዛሢ ጋላቱዋቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:2">ዒዛኮ ሚጪንቲፃ ናንጊና ናንጋያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 136:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 136:3"/>ጎዳቶኮ ቢያ ጎዳ ማዔ ፆኦዛሢ ጋላቱዋቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:3">ዒዛኮ ሚጪንቲፃ ናንጊና ናንጋያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 136:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 136:4"/>ዒዚ ፔኤሮ ሌሊ ዼኤፒ ዲቃሢ ሄርሺሳ ባኣዚ ማዻኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:4">ዒዛኮ ሚጪንቲፃ ናንጊና ናንጋያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 136:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 136:5"/>ዒ ፔ ዔራቶና ጫሪንጮ ማዤኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:5">ሚጪንቲፃ ዒዛኮ ናንጊና ናንጋያኬ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">136፡5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:1">ማዢ. ማፃ 1፡1</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 136:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 136:6"/>ዼኤፖ ዋኣፆይዳ ሳዖ ቦኦኮልቂ ዒዚ ዾቄኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:6">ሚጪንቲፃ ዒዛኮ ናንጊና ናንጋያኬ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">136፡6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:2">ማዢ. ማፃ 1፡2</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 136:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 136:7"/>ዼኤፖ ዼኤፖ ጫሪንጮ ፖዖ ዒ ማዤኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:7">ሚጪንቲፃ ዒዛኮ ናንጊና ናንጋያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 136:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 136:8"/>ዓቢ ሮኦራ ፖዓንዳጉዲ ዓይሤኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:8">ሚጪንቲፃ ዒዛኮ ናንጊና ናንጋያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 136:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 136:9"/>ዓጊኖንታ ዦኦጋሢንታ ዹማ ፖዓንዳጉዲ ዓይሤኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:9">ሚጪንቲፃ ዒዛኮ ናንጊና ናንጋያኬ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">136፡9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:16">ማዢ. ማፃ 1፡16</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 136:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 136:10"/>ጊብፄ ዓጮ ዓሶኮ ቶይዶ ናኣቶ ዒ ዎዼኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:10">ሚጪንቲፃ ዒዛኮ ናንጊና ናንጋያኬ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">136፡10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:29">ኬሲ. ማፃ 12፡29</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 136:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 136:11"/>ዒስራዔኤሌ ዴሮ ጊብፄ ዓጫፓ ዒዚ ዔኪ ኬሴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:11">ሚጪንቲፃ ዒዛኮ ናንጊና ናንጋያኬ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">136፡11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:51">ኬሲ. ማፃ 12፡51</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 136:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 136:12"/>ዒዛኮ ዎልቄ ዓኣያ፥ ሃሣ ቢታንቶ ዓኣያ ማዒፆና ዬያይዴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:12">ሚጪንቲፃ ዒዛኮ ናንጊና ናንጋያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 136:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 136:13"/>ዞቄ ባዞ ዒዚ ፓቄኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:13">ሚጪንቲፃ ዒዛኮ ናንጊና ናንጋያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 136:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 136:14"/>ዒስራዔኤሌ ዓሶ ባዞኮ ባኣኪና ዳኬኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:14">ሚጪንቲፃ ዒዛኮ ናንጊና ናንጋያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 136:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 136:15"/>ጊብፄ ካኣቲንታ ዖሎ ዓሶንታ ዞቄ ባዛ ዱኡኬኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:15">ሚጪንቲፃ ዒዛኮ ናንጊና ናንጋያኬ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">136፡15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 14:21-29">ኬሲ. ማፃ 14፡21-29</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 136:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 136:16"/>ፔኤኮ ዴሮ ዓሲ ናንጉዋ ዳውላ ዔኪ ሃንቴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:16">ሚጪንቲፃ ዒዛኮ ናንጊና ናንጋያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 136:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 136:17"/>ዼኤፖ ዼኤፖ ካኣቶ ዒ ዎዼኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:17">ሚጪንቲፃ ዒዛኮ ናንጊና ናንጋያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 136:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 136:18"/>ዎልቆና ዓኣ ካኣቶ ዲርካቺ ባይዜኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:18">ሚጪንቲፃ ዒዛኮ ናንጊና ናንጋያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 136:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 136:19"/>ዓሞራ ዓሶ ካኣቲ፥ ሲሆኔ ዒዚ ዎዼኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:19">ሚጪንቲፃ ዒዛኮ ናንጊና ናንጋያኬ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">136፡19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:21-30">ፓይ. ማፃ 21፡21-30</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 136:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 136:20"/>ባኣሳኔ ዓሶ ካኣቲ፥ ዖኦጌ ዒ ዎዼኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:20">ሚጪንቲፃ ዒዛኮ ናንጊና ናንጋያኬ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">136፡20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:31-35">ፓይ. ማፃ 21፡31-35</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 136:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 136:21"/>ዬያ ዓሶኮ ሳዖ ቢያ ፔ ዴሮም ዴኔ ማሂ ዒንጌኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:21">ሚጪንቲፃ ዒዛኮ ናንጊና ናንጋያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 136:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 136:22"/>ፔ ዓይላሢ ዒስራዔኤሌ ዒዚ ዻካልሴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:22">ሚጪንቲፃ ዒዛኮ ናንጊና ናንጋያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 136:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 136:23"/>ዖሎና ኑ ባሺንቴያና ኑና ዒ ዋሊ ሃሺባኣሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:23">ሚጪንቲፃ ዒዛኮ ናንጊና ናንጋያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 136:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 136:24"/>ኑ ሞርኮ ኩጫፓ ቶሊሲ ኑና ዒዚ ዓውሴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:24">ሚጪንቲፃ ዒዛኮ ናንጊና ናንጋያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 136:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 136:25"/>ማዢንቲም ቢያ ሙኡዚ ዒዚ ዒንጋኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:25">ሚጪንቲፃ ዒዛኮ ናንጊና ናንጋያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 136:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 136:26"/>ጫሪንጮ ፆኦዛሢ ጋላቱዋቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:26">ሚጪንቲፃ ዒዛኮ ናንጊና ናንጋያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 136:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 136"/>
  <chapter number="137" style="c" sid="PSA 137"/>
  <para style="s1">ዲዒንቲ ዴንዲ ዓኣ ዒስራዔኤሌ ዓሶኮ ዬኤፖ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 137:1"/>ኑኡኒ ባብሎኔ ዎሮ ዓጫ ዴዒ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:1">ፂዮኔ ማሊ ጶቂሣዖ ዬኤኬኔ።<verse eid="PSA 137:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 137:2"/>ዒኢካ ዓሃይያ ጌይንታ ሚፆ ዑፃ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:2">ጎኦሎ ኑኡኮ ኑ ሱፂ ሃሼኔ።<verse eid="PSA 137:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 137:3"/>ኑና ዲዒ ዔኪ ዴንዲ ሜታሳ ዓሳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:3">ዓይኑሞ ዓይናዺ ኑ ዔያቶ ዎዛሳንዳጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:3">«ፂዮኔይዳ ዒንሢ ዓይናዻ ዓይኑሞፓ ፔቴ ሂንዳ ዓይናዹዋቴ» ጌዔኔ።<verse eid="PSA 137:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 137:4"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ቦንቺ ዓይናዾ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:4">ዓሲ ዓጪዳ ዴይ ዎይቲ ኑ ዓይናዻንዳይ?<verse eid="PSA 137:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 137:5"/>ዬሩሳላሜ! ኔና ታ ዋሌያ ማዔቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:5">ታኣኮ ጎኦሎ ዋርቃ ሚዛቆ ኩጫ ዞዲ ዓቶም።<verse eid="PSA 137:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 137:6"/>ዬሩሳላሜ! ታ ኔና ጶቂሡዋዖ ዓቲ፥ ጊንሣ ሃሣ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:6">ታና ጋፒንሢ ዎዛሳያ ማዓሢ ኔና ማሂ ታ ዔኪባኣቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:6">ዒንዲርዛ ታኣኮ ሆንጎላሢና ዎላ ዓዺንቶም።<verse eid="PSA 137:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 137:7"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ዬሩሳላሜ ዓዺንቴ ዓቦና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:7">ዔዶኦሜ ዓሳ ማዼ ባኮ ማሊ ጶቂሤ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:7">«ሹጮና ኬልቆና ዲፆ ፃጳፓ ቱጊ ዶይሱዋቴ!» ጌይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:7">ዔያታ ዒላቴ ዒላቶ ጶቂሤ።<verse eid="PSA 137:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 137:8"/>ባብሎኔ! ኔኤኒ ሻሂንቲ ባይቃንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:8">ኔኤኒ ኑጊዳ ማዼ ጌኖ ማዾ ቢያሢ ዛሎ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:8">ኮሞ ኮፃሢ ጋላቲንቴያኬ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">137፡8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 18:6">ዮሃ. ፆፔዻ 18፡6</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 137:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 137:9"/>ኔኤኮ ናኣቶ ዔኪ ዔኪ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:9">ላሎ ሹጮይዳ ጳዺሲ ዳኣፃሢ ጋላቲንቴያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 137:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 137"/>
  <chapter number="138" style="c" sid="PSA 138"/>
  <para style="s1">ዳውቴ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="d">ጋላታ ሺኢጲሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 138:1"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ጉቤ ዒኔፓ ታ ኔና ጋላታኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:1">ሜሌ ፆኦዛ ዛጋንቴ ኔኤም ታኣኒ ጋላታ ዓይኑሞ ዓይናዻኔ።<verse eid="PSA 138:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 138:2"/>ኔኤኮ ናንጊና ናንጋ ናሹሞንታ ፒዙሞንታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:2">ኔኤኮ ሱንፆ ዼኤፑሞንታ፥ ሃሣ ኔ ዓይሢፆ ፑኡፑሞንታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:2">ፔጋሲ ኔኤኒ ታኣም ዻዌሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:2">ኔኤም ዱማዼ ኔኤኮ ጌኤዦ ማኣሮ ባንሢ ሺሪ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:2">ሂርኪ ጌይ ዚጊ ዚጊ ታ ኔና ጋላታኔ።<verse eid="PSA 138:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 138:3"/>ታ ኔና ዔኤላዛ ኔ ታኣኮ ሺኢጲፆ ዋይዜኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:3">ኔ ዶዱሞና ኔኤኒ ታና ዶዲሼኔ።<verse eid="PSA 138:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 138:4"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:4">ኔ ጌዔ ቃኣሎ ዔያታ ዋይዜሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:4">ዓጮ ካኣታ ቢያ ኔና ጋላታኔ።<verse eid="PSA 138:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 138:5"/>ኔ ማዼ ባኮ ቢያሢንታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:5">ኔኤኮ ዼኤፖ ቦንቾንታሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:5">ዓይናዺ ዔያታ ዼኤፒሳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 138:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 138:6"/>ኔኤኒ ሌካ ዼጌ ቤዛ ዓኣያ ማዔቴያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:6">ሂርኬ ማዔ ቦሂንቴዞንሢ ኔ ዛጋኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:6">ዖቶሮ ዓሶ ሃኬ ዓኣ ቤዛ ዓኣዖ ኔኤኒ ዔራኔ።<verse eid="PSA 138:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 138:7"/>ታኣኒ ሜቶኮ ባኣኮ ጌሌቴያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:7">ኔኤኒ ሼምፔና ታና ጌሣኔ።</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:7">ዻጋዺ ታጊዳ ዔቄ ሞርኮ ኔኤኒ ማካኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:7">ኔኤኮ ዼኤፖ ዎልቆና ኔ ታና ዓውሳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 138:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 138:8"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ታኣም ማሌ ማሊፆ ኩንሣንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:8">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ኔኤኮ ናሹማ ናንጊና ናንጋያኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:8">ኔ ኩጮና ኔኤኒ ማዤሢ ዋሊ ሃሺፖ።<verse eid="PSA 138:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 138"/>
  <chapter number="139" style="c" sid="PSA 139"/>
  <para style="s1">ዓይኑሞ ሱኡጋሢ ዓይሣ ጎይፆ ዓይናዺንታ ዳውቴ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="d">ፆኦሲ ቢያ ዎዴ ዑኬ ማዒፆ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 139:1"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ኔ ታና ሙሪ ዛጊ ዔሬኔ።<verse eid="PSA 139:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 139:2"/>ታኣኒ ዴዓኣና ማዖም ዔቃኣና ኔ ታና ዔራኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:2">ታኣኮ ማሊፆ ሃኬ ዓኣዖ ኔኤኒ ዔዔራኔ።<verse eid="PSA 139:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 139:3"/>ታ ሃንታ ቤዞንታ ዴይ ሃውሻ ቤዞ ኔ ዋሉዋሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:3">ታ ማዺ ሃንታ ባኮ ቢያ ኔ ዔራኔ።<verse eid="PSA 139:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 139:4"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ታኣኒ ሃጊ ኬኤዛንዳሢኮ ቤርታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:4">ታ ዎዚ ጋዓኒ ጋዓቴያ ኔ ዔራኔ።<verse eid="PSA 139:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 139:5"/>ታ ኮይሎይዳ ቢያ ኔኤኒ ዓኣኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:5">ኔ ኩጮና ጎኦቢ ፑርታፓ ኔ ታና ካፓኔ።<verse eid="PSA 139:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 139:6"/>ኔኤኮ ዔራታ ኮሺ ጪሊል ጋዓያኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:6">ታኣኒ ማሊ ጶቂሢ ዔራንዳሢኮ ዑሣኬ።<verse eid="PSA 139:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 139:7"/>ዓንኮዋ ታ ዓኣዺ ኔኤፓ ቶላኒ ዳንዳዑዋሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:7">ኔ ቤርታፓ ዓንኮዋ ታ ዴንዲ ፑናንዳ ቤሲ ባኣሴ።<verse eid="PSA 139:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 139:8"/>ጫሪንጮ ታ ኬስኬቶ ኔኤኒ ዒኢካ ዓኣኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:8">ሳዖ ዴሞ ዓሶ ኮይላ ታኣኒ ጌሌቴያ ኔ ዒኢካኬ።<verse eid="PSA 139:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 139:9"/>ዓባ ኬስካ ባንፆ ታኣኒ ባራኒ ዴንዴቴያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:9">ባዞ ዼኤፖ ሶፒ ዴንዲ ታ ናንጌቴያ፥<verse eid="PSA 139:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 139:10"/>ዒኢካ ኔ ዓኣያ ማዒ ኔ ኩቻ ኔ ታና ጎቺ ሃንቲሳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:10">ኔኤኮ ሚዛቆ ኩጮና ኔ ታና ዶዲሺ ዓርቃኔ።<verse eid="PSA 139:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 139:11"/>ታኣኒ፦ «ዹማ ታና ዓኣቺ ዓይሳንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:11">ታ ኮይላ ዓኣ ፖዓ ዹሞንጎ» ጌዔቴያ፥<verse eid="PSA 139:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 139:12"/>ዹማ ኔኤኮ ዓኣፖ ዴንቂ ላኣጉዋሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:12">ዹማ ኔ ኮይላ ሮኦሪጉዲ ፖዓኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:12">ኔ ኮይላ ዹሚንታ ሮኦሪንታ ዱማዹዋያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 139:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 139:13"/>ታና ጉቤና ማዤሢ ኔናኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:13">ታ ዒንዶ ጎጳ ታ ዑፆ ዎላ ካንሢ ማዤሢ ኔናኬ።<verse eid="PSA 139:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 139:14"/>ዲቃሢ ሄርሺሳ ጎይሢና ታ ማዢንቴሢሮ ታ ኔና ጋላታኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:14">ኔኤኮ ማዻ ቢያ ሄርሺሲ ዲቃሣያ ማዔሢ ጋፒ ታኣኒ ዔራኔ።<verse eid="PSA 139:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 139:15"/>ጴዹዋያ ማዔ ዓኣሺንቴ ቤዛ ታ ማዢንቴያና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:15">ሳዖ ዴሞ ማዔ ቤዞይዳኣ ታ ዑፃ ፔቴይዳ ዎላ ካንሢንቴያና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:15">ታ ዑፃ ኔ ዓኣፓፓ ዓኣቺንቲ ማዢንቴያቱዋሴ።<verse eid="PSA 139:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 139:16"/>ታ ዒንዶ ጎጳ ታኣኒ ሱጉሢ ዓኣንቴ ኔ ታና ዴንቄኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:16">ታኣም ጎዖና ኬላ ሃጊ ፔቴ ጌይ ዓርቂንቱዋንቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:16">ኔኤኮ ማዝጋቦይዳ ፃኣፒንቲ ዴዔኔ።<verse eid="PSA 139:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 139:17"/>ፆኦሲዮ! ኔ ታኣም ማላ ማሊፃ ኮሺ ዼኤፒኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:17">ፓይዳኣ ኮሺ ዺባያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 139:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 139:18"/>ኔ ታኣም ማላ ማሊፃ ፓይዲንቴቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:18">ባዚ ዓቺ ማኣሻላፓ ባሻያኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:18">ታኣኒ ጊንዒ፥ ጊንሣ ጴጫኣናኣ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:18">ሃይሾ ኔ ታ ኮይላ ዓኣ ጎይሣኬ።<verse eid="PSA 139:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 139:19"/>ፆኦሲዮ! ፑርቶ ዓሶ ባይዜቴራ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:19">ዒንሢ ሃይ፥ ሱጉፆ ዼኤቤ ዓሳ ታ ኮይላፓ ባይቁዋቴ!<verse eid="PSA 139:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 139:20"/>ዔያታ ኔኤም ፑርታ ጌኤሲ ጌስታኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:20">ኔኤኮ ሞርኬ ማዒ ኔ ሱንፆ ፑርቲሲ ዔያታ ዾንካኔ።<verse eid="PSA 139:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 139:21"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ኔና ዒፃ ዓሶ ዒናፓ ታ ዒፃዓዳ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:21">ኔኤም ጌኤታዻ ዓሶ ኮሺ ታኣኒ ሻኣኪንታዓዳ?<verse eid="PSA 139:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 139:22"/>ጉቤ ዒናፓ ጋፒ ታ ዔያቶ ዒፃኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:22">ታ ሞርኬ ማሂ ታ ዔያቶ ዛጋኔ።<verse eid="PSA 139:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 139:23"/>ፆኦሲዮ! ታና ሙሪ ዛጊ፥ ታ ዒኖ ዴንቄ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:23">ታ ዎዚምታቴያ ዛጊ፥ ታ ሜታዺ ማላ ማሊፆ ዔሬ።<verse eid="PSA 139:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 139:24"/>ፑርታ ጎይሢ ማላ ዒኔ ታኣኮ ዓኣቴ ዛጊ ዴንቄ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:24">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎይፆ ታ ዓኣዻንዳጉዲ ታና ዻዌ።<verse eid="PSA 139:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 139"/>
  <chapter number="140" style="c" sid="PSA 140"/>
  <para style="s1">ዓይኑሞ ሱኡጋሢ ዓይሣ ጎይፆ ዓይናዺንታ ዳውቴ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="d">ፆኦሲ ማኣዳንዳጉዲ ሺኢቂንታ ሺኢጲሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 140:1"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ፑርቶ ዓሶፓ ታና ዓውሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:1">ጌኖ ማዻ ዓሶ ኩጫፓኣ ታና ቶሊሴ።<verse eid="PSA 140:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 140:2"/>ዔያቶኮ ዒና ፑርታ ማዾንዳያ ማሊ ቱካኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:2">ቢያ ዎዴ ዑራ ሌሊ ዔያታ ማዣኔ።<verse eid="PSA 140:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 140:3"/>ዔያቶኮ ዒንዲርዛ ፑርታ ሾኦሺጉዲ ዻዻዓያኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:3">ዔያታ ዻንጋፓ ኬሳ ባካ ዶርባ ሾኦሺ ማርዜኬ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">140፡3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 3:13">ሮሜ 3፡13</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 140:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 140:4"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ፑርቶ ዓሶ ኩጫፓ ታና ዓውሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:4">ታኣኮ ቶኮ ቡኡዳኒ ማላ ጌኖ ዓሶፓ ቶሊሴ።<verse eid="PSA 140:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 140:5"/>ዖቶሮ ዓሳ ፒሮ ታኣም ዓኣቺ ፒሬኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:5">ፒሮ ሱሲ ታና ቡኡዳኒ ዔያታ ታ ቤርታ ዋሄኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:5">ፒራሢና ታና ዓይሣኒ ታኣኒ ሃንታ ጎይፃ ዔያታ ፒሬኔ።<verse eid="PSA 140:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 140:6"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢ፥ «ታኣኮ ኔኤኒ ፆኦሲኬ» ታ ጋዓኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:6">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ታ ኔና ሺኢቂ ዒላታ ዒላቶ ዋይዜ።<verse eid="PSA 140:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 140:7"/>ዎልቄና ዓኣያ ማዒ ታና ዓውሳ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:7">ናንጊና ናንጋ ታ ጎዳ ማዔ ፆኦዛሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:7">ዖሎ ዓቦና ጊቲማ ማዒ ሂኢዣ ታና ዓይዱዋጉዲ ቃዜ።<verse eid="PSA 140:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 140:8"/>ፑርቶ ዓሶም ዔያታ ኮዓ ባኮ ዒንጊፖ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:8">ዔያታ ማሊ ቱካ ቱኡዞ ዔያቶም ሃኒሲፖ።<verse eid="PSA 140:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 140:9"/>ታና ማንጌ ታ ሞርካ ታና ባሻንዳጉዲ ማሂፖ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:9">ዔያታ ማዻኒ ማላ ጌኖ ማዾ ዔያቶ ባንሢ ሺርሼ።<verse eid="PSA 140:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 140:10"/>ታሚ ቄንሢ ዔያቶ ዑፃ ኬዶም፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:10">ዬካፓ ዔያታ ቶሊ ኬስኩዋጉዲ ታሚዳ ዓጊንቶም፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:10">ኮሺ ዔታዻያ ቶርጴ ዓኣ ዔቴይዳ ኬኤሪንቶም።<verse eid="PSA 140:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 140:11"/>ሉኡዙሞና ዓሲ ፑሽኪ ሃንታ ዓሲ ሳዖይዳ ናንጎፓ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:11">ጌኔ ማዻ ፑርቶ ዓሶ ፑርታ ባኣዚ ኬሚ ባባይዞም።<verse eid="PSA 140:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 140:12"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ማንቆ ዓሶም ፒዜ ዎጌ ኔ ዎጋሢንታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:12">ሄርቂንቲ ዎይሢፆና ሜታዻ ዓሶ ዛሎ ኔ ሞኦታሢ ታ ዔራኔ።<verse eid="PSA 140:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 140:13"/>ኮዦ ዓሳ ጎኔና ኔና ጋላታኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:13">ኔ ዓኣ ቤዞይዳ ኔኤና ዎላ ዶዲ ዔያታ ናንጋንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 140:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 140"/>
  <chapter number="141" style="c" sid="PSA 141"/>
  <para style="s1">ዳውቴ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="d">ፆኦሲ ዓውሳንዳጉዲ ሺኢቂንታ ሺኢጲሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 141:1"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ታ ኔ ዋይዞም ዒላታኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:1">ኔጉዋዖ ዑኬና ታና ማኣዴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:1">ታኣኒ ኔ ዋይዞም ዒላታሢ ዋይዜ።<verse eid="PSA 141:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 141:2"/>ታኣኒ ሺኢቃ ሺኢጲፃ ዑንጄ ኔኤም ጩቢሾያጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:2">ኔ ባንሢ ዔቂሳ ኩጫኣ ዒባናኣና ዒንጎ ዒንጊፆጉዲ ማዖም። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">141፡2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 5:8">ዮሃ. ፆፔዻ 5፡8</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 141:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 141:3"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ታ ዻንጎ ካፓ ዓሲ ጌሤ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:3">ታ ሙሱሮዋ ቃዛንዳ ዓሲ ዔቂሴ።<verse eid="PSA 141:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 141:4"/>ፑርቶ ዓሶና ዎላ ፑርታ ማዾ ታ ማዹዋጉዱ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:4">ታኣኮ ዒኖ ፑርቱሞ ባንሢ ማሊሲፖ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:4">ዔያቶና ዎላ ዴይ ሙዎ ሙኡዚያ ታና ሙዒሲፖ።<verse eid="PSA 141:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 141:5"/>ፂሎ ዓሲ ታና ፁንቆንጎ፥ ዬይ ታና ሚጪንቲሢኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:5">ዒዚ ታና ጎሮንጎ፥ ዬይ ታ ቶኦኮ ዖይሲና ቲሽኪሢኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:5">ጋዓንቴ ታ ቢያ ዎዴ ፑርቶ ዓሶ ማዾ ማኪ ማኪ ሺኢቃኔ።<verse eid="PSA 141:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 141:6"/>ሱኡጋ ዔያቶኮ ዼኤፖ ላሎ ማጋ ኬኤሪንታኣና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:6">ታ ጋዓ ባካ ጎኔታሢ ዔያታ ዔራንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 141:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 141:7"/>ሳዓ ጎሽኪንታኣና ቦኪ ቡርሺንታሢጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:7">ዔያቶኮ ሜጌፃ ዱኡፖ ካራ ካራ ዜርቂንታንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 141:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 141:8"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ማዔ ታ ፆኦዛሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:8">ታኣኒ ጋዓንቴ ኔና ጉሙርቂፆ ሃሻዓኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:8">ኔ ታና ዓኣቻንዳጉዲ ታ ኮዓሢሮ ሃይቆም ጌይ ታና ሃሺፖ።<verse eid="PSA 141:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 141:9"/>ዔያታ ዓኣቺ ፒሬ ፒራስካፓ ታና ቶሊሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:9">ፑርቶ ማዻ ዓሶኮ ዹቃስካፓ ታና ዓይሴ።<verse eid="PSA 141:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 141:10"/>ታኣኒ ኮሺና ዖኦኪ ዴንዳዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:10">ፑርቶ ዓሳ ዔያታ ፒሬ ፒራስካ ፔኤሮ ዓዺንቶንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 141:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 141"/>
  <chapter number="142" style="c" sid="PSA 142"/>
  <para style="s1">ዳውቴ ዴኖ ዔቶይዳ ዓኣ ዎዶና ዔራቶና ካላሌ ካላሎ</para>
  <para style="d">ፆኦሲ ማኣዳንዳጉዲ ሺኢቆ ሺኢጲሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 142:1"/>ዑኡዞ ታኣኒ ዼጊዲ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዋይዞም ዒላታኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:1">ታና ዒዚ ሚጪንታንዳጉዲ ታ ሺኢቃኔ።<verse eid="PSA 142:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 142:2"/>ታ ዒዛ ሃዳርሳ ባኮ ቢያ ዒዛ ቤርቶ ሺኢሻኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:2">ሜቶዋ ታኣኮ ቢያ ታ ዒዛም ኬኤዛኔ።<verse eid="PSA 142:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 142:3"/>ዒና ታኣኮ ጋፒ ዖያኒ ዑካኣና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:3">ታኣኒ ዓይጎ ዎዳኒ ኮይሳቴያ ዒዚ ዔዔራኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:3">ታኣኒ ዴንዳ ጎይፆይዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:3">ሞርካ ታኣም ፒሮ ዓኣቺ ፒሬኔ።<verse eid="PSA 142:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 142:4"/>ኮይሎ ታ ሺሪ ዛጋንቴ ታና ዓኣቻንዳ ካይዚ ባይቄኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:4">ፔቴታዖ ታና ማኣዳ ዓሲ ባኣያ ማዔኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:4">ታና ካፓያና ታ ዛሎ ሂርጋ ዓሲያኣ ባኣሴ።<verse eid="PSA 142:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 142:5"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ኔኤኒ ታና ማኣዳንዳጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:5">ታኣኒ ኔ ባንሢ ዒላታኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:5">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ኔኤኒ ታኣኮ ፑኖ ካያሢኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:5">ሼምፖና ዓኣ ዓሳ ናንጋ ዓጮይዳ ታኣኮ ዓኣያ ማዔሢ ኔናኬ።<verse eid="PSA 142:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 142:6"/>ታኣኒ ጋፒ ዎዛ ቲቂ ዴዔሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:6">ኔ ታና ማኣዳንዳጉዲ ኔ ባንሢ ታ ዒላታሢ ዋይዜ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:6">ዑሣ ዓኣዼ ታኣም ዔያታ ዎልቃዼሢሮ ታ ሞርኮፓ ታና ዓውሴ።<verse eid="PSA 142:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 142:7"/>ታኣኒ ኔና ጋላታንዳጉዲ ሃያ ቱኡዛፓ ታና ቡሌ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:7">ኔኤኒ ታኣም ማዼ ኔኤኮ ኮሹሞ ማዾ ዛጋዖ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:7">ፂሎ ዓሳ ሙኪ ታ ኮይላ ቡካንዳኔ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">142፡7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 22:1">1ሳሙ. 22፡1</ref>፤ <ref loc="1SA 24:3">24፡3</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 142:7"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 142"/>
  <chapter number="143" style="c" sid="PSA 143"/>
  <para style="s1">ዳውቴ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="d">ፆኦሲፓ ማኣዶ ዴንቃኒ ሺኢቆ ሺኢጲሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 143:1"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ሺኢጲፆ ታኣኮ ዋይዜ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:1">ታኣኒ ኔና ሺኢቃ ሺኢጲፆ ባንሢ ዋይዚ ጌሤ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:1">ኔኤኒ ጉሙርቂንታያ፥ ሃሣ ፒዜ ማዔ ጎይፆና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:1">ታ ሺኢቃ ባኮ ታኣም ዒንጌ።<verse eid="PSA 143:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 143:2"/>ኔ ቤርታ ፔቴታዖ ፂሎ ማዓ ዓሲ ባኣሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:2">ታና ኔ ዓይላሢ ዎጌሮ ኔ ቤርቶ ዔኪ ሺኢሺፖ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">143፡2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 3:20">ሮሜ 3፡20</ref>፤ <ref loc="GAL 2:16">ጋላ. 2፡16</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 143:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 143:3"/>ታ ሞርካሢ ታና ዎዻኒ ዳውሳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:3">ዹሚዳ ጌልዚ ቱኪ ታኣኮ ካራ ባይዜኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:3">ሚርጌ ዎዴኮ ቤርታ ሃይቂ ዱኡቴ ዓሶጉዲ ታኣኒ ማዔኔ።<verse eid="PSA 143:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 143:4"/>ታኣኮ ጋሮይዳ ዓኣ ሼምፓሢ ባኣያ ማዔኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:4">ዒና ዲቃቴም ካራ ታኣኮ ባይቄኔ።<verse eid="PSA 143:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 143:5"/>ታኣኒ ሚናኣ ዎዶ ጶቂሢ ማሌኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:5">ኔኤኒ ማዼ ማዾዋ ሺርሺ ሺርሺ ታ ማሌኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:5">ኔ ዎልቆና ኔ ማዼ ባኮዋ ቢያ ታ ጶቂሴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 143:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 143:6"/>ታ ኩጮ ኔና ሺኢቂ፥ ኔ ባንሢ ታ ዔቂሴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:6">ዳውሌ ዓጪዳ ዋኣሢ ዼኤባሢጉዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:6">ታኣኮ ሼምፔላ ዒማዺ ኔና ዼኤቤኔ።<verse eid="PSA 143:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 143:7"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ሼምፓሢ ታኣኮ ላቤሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:7">ኔጉዋዖ ታ ሺኢቃ ባኮ ታኣም ዒንጌ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:7">ኔ ዓኣፖ ካሮ ታ ባንፃፓ ሺርሺፖ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:7">ኔ ዬያይዴቴ ሳዖ ዴሞ ኬዳ ዓሶጉዲ ታኣኒ ማዓንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 143:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 143:8"/>ታኣኒ ጉሙርቃሢ ኔና ማዔሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:8">ኬላ ኬላ ኔኤኮ ናንጊና ናንጋ ናሹሞ ታና ዔርዜ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:8">ታ ሼምፓሢ ሃዳርሲ ታ ኔኤም ዒንጌሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:8">ታኣኒ ዴንዳንዳ ጎይፆ ታና ዻዌ።<verse eid="PSA 143:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 143:9"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ታኣኒ ኔና ፑኖ ካያሢ ማሄሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:9">ታኣኮ ሞርኮይዳፓ ታና ማኣዲ ዓውሴ።<verse eid="PSA 143:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 143:10"/>ኔኤኒ ታኣኮ ፆኦዛሢኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:10">ኔ ጋዓ ባኮ ታኣኒ ማዺ ኩንሣንጉዲ ታና ዔርዜ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:10">ኔኤኮ ኮዦ ዓያኖና ኮሺ ጎይሢ ታኣም ዻዌ።<verse eid="PSA 143:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 143:11"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ኔ ቦንቾም ጌይ ታ ሼምፓሢ ካፔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:11">ኔኤኮ ፒዙሞ ማዾና ታኣኮ ሜቶይዳፓ ቢያ ታና ኬሴ።<verse eid="PSA 143:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 143:12"/>ኔኤኮ ናንጊና ናንጋ ናሹሞ ፔጋሲ ታኣም ዻዋኒ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:12">ታኣኮ ሞርኮ ዎዺ ባይዜ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:12">ታኣኒ ኔኤኮ ዓይላሢታሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:12">ታኣም ፑርታ ባኣዚ ማዻ ዓሶ ቢያ ኩርሴ።<verse eid="PSA 143:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 143"/>
  <chapter number="144" style="c" sid="PSA 144"/>
  <para style="s1">ዳውቴ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="d">ባሺሢ ዴንቃዖ ዓይናዾ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 144:1"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ማዔ ታኣኮ ላላሢ ጋላቲንቶንጎ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:1">ዒዚ ታና ዖልዚ ዖሎ ጎይሢ ዔርዚ፥ ዖልዚም ጊኢጊሻኔ።<verse eid="PSA 144:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 144:2"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ታና ካፓያ ታኣኮ ጊቲማኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:2">ታኣኮ ፑኖ ካያሢ፥ ሃሣ ታና ዓውሳሢኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:2">ታኣኒ ዒዛ ጉሙርቂ ኮሺ ናንጋኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:2">ዴራኣ ታኣም ዓይሢንታንዳጉዲ ማሃሢ ዒዛኬ።<verse eid="PSA 144:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 144:3"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:3">ዓሲንሢ ዓይጎኬ ጌይ ኔ ሃያይዲ ቶኦኮ ዛጋይ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:3">ሃያይዲ ኔ ሂርጊ ዔያቶም ማላሢ ዓይጎኬ ጌይዳይ? <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">144፡3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 7:17-18">ዒዮ. 7፡17-18</ref>፤ <ref loc="PSA 8:4">ዓይኑ. 8፡4</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 144:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 144:4"/>ዓሲ ዢባሬጉዴ ባኣዚኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:4">ናንጋ ዎዳኣ ዔኤዤ ሺቢጉዴ ዴንዲ ባይቃያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 144:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 144:5"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ! ጫሪንጮ ዳርዚ ሊካ ኬዴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:5">ዹኮ ኔ ኩጮና ካኣሚ ጩቢሼ።<verse eid="PSA 144:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 144:6"/>ኔኤኮ ዜኤሊንፆ ዜኤሊንሢ ኔ ሞርኮ ዳውሲ ባይዜ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:6">ኔኤኮ ሂኢዦና ዔያቶ ዱኪ ዳውሴ።<verse eid="PSA 144:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 144:7"/>ኔ ኩጮ ሎኦፓ ሊካ ዳኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:7">ዼኤፖ ዋኣፆ ዴማፓ ታና ጎቺ ኬሲ፥ ዓውሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:7">ፃንጎ ማዔ ሜሌ ዓጮ ዓሶፓ ታና ዓይሴ።<verse eid="PSA 144:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 144:8"/>ዔያታ ፔቴታዖ ጎኔ ባኣዚ ጌስቱዋሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:8">ሚዛቆ ኩጮ ዔያታ ዔቂሲ ሉኡዙሞና ጫኣቃኔ።<verse eid="PSA 144:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 144:9"/>ፆኦሲዮ! ዓኪ ዓይኑሞ ኔና ቦንቺ ታ ዓይናዻንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:9">ታጶ ሻሺ ዴንሢንታ ጎኦሎዋ ዋርቂ ታኣኒ ዓይናዻንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 144:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 144:10"/>ዖልዚና ባሻንዳጉዲ ካኣቶም ኔኤኒ ዎልቄ ዒንጋኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:10">ኔ ዓይላሢ ዳውቴያ ጬንቾ ዓራፖ ዓጬሢፓ ኔ ዓውሳያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 144:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 144:11"/>ፃንጎ ማዔ ሜሌ ዓጮ ሞርኮይዳፓ ታና ዓውሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:11">ዔያቶኮ ዻንጋ ሉኡዚ ባኣዚ ጌስታያኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:11">ሚዛቆ ኩጮ ዔያታ ሉኡዙሞ ጫኣቁሞሮ ዔዔቂሳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 144:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 144:12"/>ኑኡኮ ዼጌ ናኣታ ሃጊ ዔቃኣና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:12">ሃጊ ባቃሊ ዑጊ ዴንዳ ሚሢጉዲ ማዖንጎ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:12">ኑኡኮ ዉዱሮ ናኣታ ካኣቱሞ ማኣሮኮ ጎንጃሢ ዎላ ካኣማ ካሮይዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:12">ዾቂንቲ ኬኤፆ ሚዛጲሳ፥ ዓርሲ ኮሾና ፒዜ ቱርቱሮጉዲ ማዖንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 144:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 144:13"/>ኮና ኑኡኮ ዱማ ዱማ ቶኦኪ ሃኣኮና ኩሜያ ማዖንጎ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:13">ሄንፆሮ ዞኦዞ ኬስኬ ኑኡኮ ማራታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:13">ሚርጌ ሺያና ፓይዲንታ ማሪናይ ሾይ ዺቦንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 144:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 144:14"/>ባኣታ ኑኡኮ ካኣሽኮንጎ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:14">ቡሉዋዖ ሾይ ሾይ ዺቦንጎ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:14">ኑና ዲዒ ዔኪ ዴንዳ ባኣዚ ባይቆንጎ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:14">ኑ ካታሞኮ ሳዞ ጎይፆ ዼኤፖይዳ ዬኤፒ ዑኡሲ ዋይዚንቶፓ።<verse eid="PSA 144:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 144:15"/>ዬያጉዴ ዓንጆ ዒንጊንቴ ዴሬ ጋላቲንቴያኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:15">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዔያቶኮ ፆኦሲ ማዔ ዴሬ ዓንጂንቴያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 144:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 144"/>
  <chapter number="145" style="c" sid="PSA 145"/>
  <para style="s1">ዳውቴ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="d">ጋላታ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 145:1"/>ታ ፆኦዛሦ፥ ታ ካኣቲዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:1">ታ ኔኤኮ ዼኤፑሞ ሄርሺ ኬኤዛንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:1">ናንጊና ታ ኔ ሱንፆ ጋላቴ ጎይሣ ናንጋንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 145:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 145:2"/>ቢያ ኬላ ኬላ ታ ኔና ጋላታንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:2">ናንጊና ታ ኔኤኮ ሱንፆ ቦንቼ ጎይሣ ናንጋንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 145:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 145:3"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዼኤፒኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:3">ፑኡፒ ጋላታ ዒዛም ኮይሳያኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:3">ዒዛኮ ዼኤፑማ ዓሲ ዔራኒ ዳንዳዓያይዳፓ ዑሣኬ።<verse eid="PSA 145:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 145:4"/>ዎዶና ዎዶና ኬስካ ዓሳ ኔኤኮ ማዾ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:4">ሄሊሲ ሙካ ዓሶም ኬኤዚ ዔርዛንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:4">ኔኤኮ ዲቃሢ ሄርሺሳ ማዾዋ ፔጋሲ ዔያታ ኬኤዛንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 145:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 145:5"/>ዴራ ኔኤኮ ቦንቾንታ ቦንቺንቶኮዋ ዼኤፑሞ ኬኤዛንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:5">ታኣኒያ ኔኤኮ ዲቃሢ ሄርሺሳ ማዾ ማሊ ማሊ ናንጋንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 145:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 145:6"/>ዴራ ኔኤኮ ዲቃሢ ሄርሺሳ ዼኤፖ ማዾ ዛሎ ኬኤዛንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:6">ታኣኒያ ኔኤኮ ዼኤፖ ማዾ ሄርሺ ዼጊዲ ኬኤዛንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 145:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 145:7"/>ዔያታ ኔኤኮ ኮሹሞ ሚርጊፆ ኬኤዛንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:7">ኔኤኮ ፂሉሞ ዎልቆ ዛሎ ዼግ ጌዔ ዑኡሲና ዓይናዻንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 145:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 145:8"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ኮሺ፥ ሃሣ ሚጪንታያኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:8">ዻጋዻኒ ሩኡሩዋያ፥ ናሹማኣ ናንጊና ጋፑዋያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 145:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 145:9"/>ዒዚ ቢያ ባኮም ኮሺኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:9">ዒ ማዤ ባኮ ቢያ ሚጪንታያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 145:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 145:10"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:10">ኔ ማዤ ባካ ቢያ ኔና ጋላታንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:10">ኔኤም ዱማዼ ኔ ዴራ ቢያ ኔና ዼኤፒሲ ሄርሻንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 145:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 145:11"/>ኔኤኮ ካኣቱሞ ቦንቾ ዛሎ ኬኤዛንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:11">ኔኤኮ ዎልቆ ዛሎዋ ሄርሺ ጌስታንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 145:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 145:12"/>ዬያይዲ፥ ዓሲ ቢያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:12">ኔ ዎልቆና ኔኤኒ ማዼ ዼኤፖ ማዾንታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:12">ጊንሣ ሃሣ ኔኤኮ ካኣቱሞ ቦንቾ ዼኤፑሞዋ ዔራንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 145:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 145:13"/>ኬስካ ዎዶ ቢያይዳ ዎይሣ ካኣታሢ ኔናኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:13">ኔኤኮ ካኣቱማ ናንጊና ባይቁዋያኬ።</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 145:13"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:13">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ጋዓ ባኮ ጉሙርቂንቲ ኩንሣያኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:13">ዒዚ ማዻ ባካ ቢያ ኮሺኬ።<verse eid="PSA 145:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 145:14"/>ሎኦማኒ ቡኡዲንታ ዓሶ ዒ ኬኤሊንቃኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:14">ሳዓ ሎኦሚ ዓኣ ዓሶዋ ዔቂሳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 145:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 145:15"/>ቢያሢ ጉሙርቂ ኔና ዛጋኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:15">ኔኤኒያ ዔያቶም ኮይሳ ዎዶና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:15">ዔያታ ሙዓንዳ ሙዖ ዒንጋኔ።<verse eid="PSA 145:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 145:16"/>ኔኤኒ ኔኤኮ ኩጮ ቡሊ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:16">ፔቴ ፔቴ ሼምፔና ዓኣ ባኮም</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:16">ኮይሳ ባኮ ዒንጊ ዒኖ ዔያቶኮ ሃውሺሳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 145:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 145:17"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ማዻ ባኮና ቢያ ፂሎኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:17">ጊንሣ ሃሣ ኮሺኬ።<verse eid="PSA 145:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 145:18"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዒዛ ሺኢቃዞንሢም ቢያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:18">ጎኔ ዒኔፓ ሺኢቃዞንሢም ቢያ ዒ ዑኬኬ።<verse eid="PSA 145:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 145:19"/>ቦንቺ ዒዛ ዒጊጫዞንሢም</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:19">ኮይሳ ባኮ ቢያ ዒዚ ዒንጋኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:19">ሜታዺ ዒላታ ዒላቶዋ ዋይዚ ዔያቶ ማኣዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 145:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 145:20"/>ዒዛ ናሽካዞንሢ ቢያ ዒ ፑርታፓ ካፓኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:20">ፑርቶ ዓሶ ጋዓንቴ ዒዚ ዎዺ ባይዛኔ።<verse eid="PSA 145:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 145:21"/>ታኣኒ ቢያ ዎዴ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ጋላታንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:21">ዒዚ ማዤ ባካ ቢያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:21">ዒዛኮ ዱማዼ ጌኤዦ ሱንፆ ሄርሺ ሄርሺ ናንጎንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 145:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 145"/>
  <chapter number="146" style="c" sid="PSA 146"/>
  <para style="s1">ዻቂሻ ፆኦሲም ሺኢካ ጋላታ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 146:1"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳም ጋላታ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:1">ታ ሼምፔሌ! ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ጋላቴ።<verse eid="PSA 146:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 146:2"/>ሼምፔና ዓኣ ዎዶ ቢያይዳ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ታ ጋላታንዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:2">ናንጋ ዎዶ ቢያይዳ ታ ፆኦዛሢ ታኣኒ ቦንቺ ዓይናዻንዳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 146:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 146:3"/>ዻቂሻኒ ዳንዳዑዋ፥ ዓሲ ማዢንቲ ማዔ ዓሶና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:3">ሱኡጎ ማዒ ዎይሣ ዼኤፖ ዓሶ ጉሙርቂፖቴ።<verse eid="PSA 146:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 146:4"/>ዔያታ ሃይቃዖ ሳኣ ዴሚ ጌላኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:4">ዒማ ኬሎይዳ ዔያታ ማዻኒ ማሌ ባካ ቢያ ጉሪ ባይቃኔ።<verse eid="PSA 146:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 146:5"/>ያይቆኦቤ ፆኦሲ ዒዛ ማኣዳያ ማዔ ዓሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:5">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ማዔ ፔ ፆኦዛሢዳ ጌኤቂንቴሢ ዎዛዾንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 146:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 146:6"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ጫሪንጮንታ ሳዖንታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:6">ዼኤፖ ባዞንታ ጊዳ ዓኣ ባኮ ቢያ ማዤሢኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:6">ናንጊና ጉሙርቂንቴ ጎይሣ ናንጋያኬ። <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">146፡6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 4:24">ዳኪ. ማዾ 4፡24</ref>፤ <ref loc="ACT 14:15">14፡15</ref>።</char></note><verse eid="PSA 146:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 146:7"/>ሄርቂንቲ ዎርቃ ዓሶም ፒዜ ዎጌ ዎጋኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:7">ናይዺንቴዞንሢም ሙኡዚ ዒንጋኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:7">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ቱኡቴ ዓሶዋ ቱኡዛፓ ዒ ቡላኔ።<verse eid="PSA 146:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 146:8"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዓኣፓ ባይቄ ዓሶኮ ዓኣፖ ቡላኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:8">ሎኦሚ ዓኣ ዓሶ ሳዓፓ ዔቂሳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:8">ፂሎ ማዔ ዓሶዋ ዒዚ ናሽካኔ።<verse eid="PSA 146:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 146:9"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ሜሌ ዓጪፓ ሙኬ ዓሲ ማዒ ናንጋ ዓሶ ካፓኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:9">ዜኤሪንዶ ማዔ ላኣሎንታ ዜኤሮ ናኣቶዋ ማኣዳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:9">ፑርቶ ዓሶኮ ጌኖ ማሊፆ ጉሪ ማሃኔ።<verse eid="PSA 146:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 146:10"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ካኣቲ ማዒ ናንጋያኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:10">ፂዮኔ! ኔ ፆኦዛሢ ኬስካ ዎዶ ቢያይዳ ካኣታዺ ናንጋኔ።</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 146:10"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:10">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳም ጋላታ!<verse eid="PSA 146:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 146"/>
  <chapter number="147" style="c" sid="PSA 147"/>
  <para style="s1">ቢያ ባኮ ዳንዳዓ ፆኦሲም ሺኢካ ጋላታ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 147:1"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ጋላቱዋቴ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:1">ኑ ፆኦሲ ቦንቺ ጋላታ ዓይኑሞ ዓይናዺሢ ቃራኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:1">ዒዛ ጋላቲፃ ዎዛሳያ፥ ሃሣ ኮይሳያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 147:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 147:2"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዬሩሳላሜ ጊንሣ ዓካሲ ማዣኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:2">ዒስራዔኤሌፓ ዳውሲንቲ ዴንዴ ዓሶ ጊንሣ ዒ ማሃኔ።<verse eid="PSA 147:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 147:3"/>ዒኔ ሜቂ ዖዬ ዓሶ ዒዚ ዶዲሻኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:3">ኪፆዋ ኑኡኮ ዒ ፓሣኒ ማራኔ።<verse eid="PSA 147:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 147:4"/>ዦኦጋሢኮ ሚርጉሞ ዒዚ ፓይዲ ዔራኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:4">ፔቴ ፔቴሢኮዋ ሱንፆ ዒ ጌሣኔ።<verse eid="PSA 147:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 147:5"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ኑ ጎዳሢ ዼኤፒ፥ ሃሣ ዎልቄና ዓኣያኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:5">ዒዚ ዔራ ዔራታ ሃይማኬ ጌይንቱዋያኬ።<verse eid="PSA 147:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 147:6"/>ዒኖ ሼሌዔ ዓሶ ዒዚ ቦንቺሲ ዼጊሳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:6">ፑርቶ ማዻ ዓሶ ጋዓንቴ ሳዓ ኬኤሪ ዻውሲሳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 147:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 147:7"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ቦንቺ ዓይኑሞ ዓይናዹዋቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:7">ጎኦላ ዋርቂ ዋርቂያኣ ኑ ፆኦዛሢ ዓይናዺ ቦንቹዋቴ።<verse eid="PSA 147:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 147:8"/>ዒዚ ሻኣሮ ጫሪንጮይዳ ሚጫኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:8">ሳዖይዳ ዒርዚ ዋርቂሳኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:8">ዹኮይዳ ማኣቲ ኬሲ ዓኣዒሳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 147:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 147:9"/>ካዮ ቦዖንታ ቆሎንታም ቢያ ሙኡዚ ዒንጋኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:9">ሙኡዚ ባይቄም ዒላታ ቁራኮ ናኣቶ ዒ ሙኡዛኔ።<verse eid="PSA 147:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 147:10"/>ዒዚ ዎዛዻሢ ዶዶ ፓራሢንታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:10">ዖሎ ዓሶንታኮ ዎልቆ ዛጊቱዋሴ።<verse eid="PSA 147:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 147:11"/>ዒዛ ዎዛሳሢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:11">ዒዛ ቦንቺ ዒጊጫዞንሢና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:11">ናንጊና ናንጋ ናሹሞ ዒዛኮ ጉሙርቃዞንሢኬ።<verse eid="PSA 147:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 147:12"/>ዬሩሳላሜ! ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ጋላቴ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:12">ፂዮኔ! ኔ ፆኦዛሢ ፑኡፒሲ ዒላሼ!<verse eid="PSA 147:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 147:13"/>ዒዚ ኔኤኮ ማርሾ ካሮኮ ጋጋርዞ ዶዲሺ ካፓኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:13">ኔ ጋራ ዓኣ ዴሮ ዒዚ ዓንጃኔ።<verse eid="PSA 147:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 147:14"/>ዒዚ ኔ ዓጮኮ ዛጶ ኮሺ ማሂ ካፓኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:14">ቃራ ዛርጌ ካፂሲ ኔና ዒ ሚሻኔ።<verse eid="PSA 147:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 147:15"/>ሳዖ ፔ ቢታንቶና ዒዚ ዓይሣኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:15">ዒዚ ጋዓ ባካ ኔጉዋዖ ማዺንቲ ኩማኔ።<verse eid="PSA 147:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 147:16"/>ዼኤፖ ሻጮ ዎዺንቴ ፑኡታጉዲ ሳዓ ዒዚ ሚጫኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:16">ሊኢሎጉዲ ላሃ ዖልኮዋ ዲቢንሢጉዲ ሳዓ ላኣላኔ።<verse eid="PSA 147:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 147:17"/>ሻጮ ቃንፆጉዲ ሳዓ ዒዚ ዲኢኒሻኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:17">ዬያ ኬዳ ሻጮ ቤርታ ዖኦኒያ ጫርቂ ዔቃኒ ዳንዳዑዋሴ።<verse eid="PSA 147:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 147:18"/>ዬካፓ ዒዚ ዓይሥሢ ዓይሣኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:18">ዬይ ላኣዳዺ ዴይ ዓኣ ሻጫ ዓልቃኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:18">ዢባሬ ዒዚ ዢባርሺሴም ዋኣሢ ዒኢፓ ጎዓኔ።<verse eid="PSA 147:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 147:19"/>ፔ ቃኣሎ ያይቆኦቤ ናኣቶም</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:19">ዒዛኮ ዎጎንታ ዳምቦንታ ዒስራዔኤሌም ፔጋሲ ዔርዛኔ።<verse eid="PSA 147:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 147:20"/>ዬያ ቢያ ዒዚ ሜሌ ዓይጎ ዴሬማኣ ማዺባኣሴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:20">ዬያታ ዒዛኮ ዎጎ ዔሩዋሴ።</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 147:20"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:20">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳም ጋላታ!<verse eid="PSA 147:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 147"/>
  <chapter number="148" style="c" sid="PSA 148"/>
  <para style="s1">ማዢንቲ ቢያ ፆኦሲ ጋላታንዳያ ኮይሳሢ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 148:1"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ጫሪንጫፓ ጋላቱዋቴ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:1">ሎ ዼጌ ጫሪንጫ ዓኣ ማዢንታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:1">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢ ጋላቱዋቴ።<verse eid="PSA 148:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 148:2"/>ዒንሢ፥ ዒዛኮ ኪኢታንቻ ዒዛ ጋላቱዋቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:2">ጫሪንጮይዳ ዓኣ ዒዛኮ ዖሎ ዓሳ ቢያ ዒዛ ጋላቱዋቴ።<verse eid="PSA 148:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 148:3"/>ዓቦንታ ዓጊኖንታ ጋላቱዋቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:3">ጫሪንጫ ፖዓ ዦኦጋሢያ ዒዛ ጋላቱዋቴ።<verse eid="PSA 148:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 148:4"/>ሌካ ዼግ ጌይ ዓኣ ጫሪንጫ ዒዛ ጋላቱዋቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:4">ዼጌ ቤዞኮ ዑፃ ዓኣ ዋኣፃኣ ጋላቱዋቴ።<verse eid="PSA 148:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 148:5"/>ቢያ ባካ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ጋላቶንጎ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:5">ዒዚ ዓይሤም ዬይ ባካ ቢያ ማዢንቴኔ።<verse eid="PSA 148:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 148:6"/>ኬስካ ዎዶይዳ ቢያ ላኣሚንቱዋ ዳምቤና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:6">ናንጊና ናንጋንዳጉዲ ማዢ ዶዲሺ ዔያቶ ዒ ጌሤኔ።<verse eid="PSA 148:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 148:7"/>ባዞይዳ ዓኣ ዼኤፖ ቦዖንታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:7">ኮሺ ዔታዻ ቁልቦ ዋኣፃኣ ቢያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:7">ሳዓፓ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ጋላቱዋቴ።<verse eid="PSA 148:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 148:8"/>ዜኤሊንፃ፥ ዻኮ ሻጫ፥ ሻጮ ዼኤፖንታ ሻኣሮንታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:8">ዒዛኮ ዓይሢፆ ማዺ ኩንሣ ዼኤፖ ዓልጋሢ ቢያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:8">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ጋላቱዋቴ።<verse eid="PSA 148:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 148:9"/>ጌሜሮንታ ዹኮንታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:9">ዓኣፓ ሙይንታ ሚፆንታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:9">ዴኤሎ ካያ ዓኣ ሚፃኣ ቢያ ዒዛ ጋላቱዋቴ።<verse eid="PSA 148:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 148:10"/>ካዮ ቦዖንታ ጋራ ዓኣ ቆልሞንታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:10">ሳዖይዳ ጎቺንቲ ሃንታ ባኮንታ ጋኣዞና ባራና ባካ ቢያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:10">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢ ጋላቱዋቴ።<verse eid="PSA 148:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 148:11"/>ካኣቶንታ ሳዖይዳ ዓኣ ዴራ ቢያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:11">ቢታንታ ዓኣ ሱኡጎንታ ዎጎ ዎጋ ዓሳኣ ቢያ ዒዛ ጋላቱዋቴ።<verse eid="PSA 148:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 148:12"/>ዓቲንቆ ዼጌሢንታ ዉዱራሢንታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:12">ጋርቾንታ ናኣቶንታ ቢያ ዒዛ ጋላቱዋቴ።<verse eid="PSA 148:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 148:13"/>ዒዛኮ ሱንፃ ሜሌ ሱንፆ ቢያፓ ባሻሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:13">ዒዛኮ ቦንቻ ሳዖና ጫሪንጮናፓ ባሼ ዼኤፒታሢሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:13">ቢያሢ ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ጋላቶንጎ!<verse eid="PSA 148:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 148:14"/>ዒዛኮ ዒኖና ዎላ ቱኡቴያ ማዔ ዒዛ ዴሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:14">ዒስራዔኤሌ ዒዚ ዼጊዲ ቦንቺሴኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:14">ጋላታ ጋላታንዳጉዲያኣ ዒዚ ዔያቶ ማሄኔ።</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 148:14"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:14">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ጋላቱዋቴ!<verse eid="PSA 148:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 148"/>
  <chapter number="149" style="c" sid="PSA 149"/>
  <para style="s1">ጋላታ ዓይኑሞ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 149:1"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ጋላቱዋቴ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:1">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢም ዓኪ ዓይኑሞ ኬሲ ዓይናዹዋቴ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:1">ፆኦሲ ዓሳ ቡኬ ቤዞይዳ ዒዛ ቦንቾም ዓይናዹዋቴ!<verse eid="PSA 149:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 149:2"/>ዒስራዔኤሌ ማዤ ፆኦሲና ዎዛዾንጎ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:2">ፂዮኔ ዴራኣ ካኣቲሮ ኮኦሚ ዎዛዾንጎ!<verse eid="PSA 149:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 149:3"/>ዒዛ ቦንቾም ዓጊፂ ዓጊፂ ጋላቶንጎ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:3">ካራቤ ባዒ፥ ጎኦላኣ ዋርቂ ዋርቂ ዒዛ ጋላቶንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 149:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 149:4"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ፔ ዴሮ ዛጋዖ ዎዛዻኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:4">ባሺሢ ዒንጊ፥ ዒኖ ሼሌዔ ዓሶ ዒዚ ቦንቺሳኔ።<verse eid="PSA 149:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 149:5"/>ፆኦሲ ዴራ ዬያ ቦንቺንቴ ቦንቾሮ ዎዛዾንጎ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:5">ዋንቶ ላሄ ቤዛ ቢያ ዎዛዺ ዓይናዾንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 149:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 149:6"/>ጬንቻ ዓራፖ ዔያቶኮ ኩጫ ዓኣኔ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:6">ዬያሮ ዔያታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:6">ዒላሺ ዒላሺ፥ ዼግ ጌዔ ዑኡሲና ፆኦሲ ጋላቶንጎ።<verse eid="PSA 149:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 149:7"/>ዔያታ ዬያይዴቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:7">ሜሌ ካኣቶ ባሻኒ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:7">ሜሌ ዴሮይዳ ዼኤፒ ሜቶ ዓጋኒ፥<verse eid="PSA 149:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 149:8"/>ዬያ ዴሮኮ ካኣቶ ካኒ ቢራታና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:8">ዼኤፖ ዼኤፖ ሱኡጎዋ ዱፄና ዓርቂ ቱካኒ፥<verse eid="PSA 149:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 149:9"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ዔያቶይዳ ዎጌ ዎጎ ማዺ ኩንሣኒ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:9">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳኮ ዴራ ባሺሢ ዎልቄ ዴንቃንዳኔ።</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 149:9"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:9">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ጋላቲንቶም!<verse eid="PSA 149:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 149"/>
  <chapter number="150" style="c" sid="PSA 150"/>
  <para style="s1">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ጋላቱዋቴ!</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 150:1"/>ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢ ጋላቱዋቴ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 150:1">ዒዛም ዱማዼ ጌኤዦ ማኣሮይዳ ፆኦሲ ጋላቱዋቴ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 150:1">ዒዛኮ ዲቃሢ ሄርሺሳ ዎልቃ ዓኣ ጫሪንጮይዳኣ ዒዛ ጋላቱዋቴ!<verse eid="PSA 150:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 150:2"/>ዒዚ ማዼ ዲቃሢ ሄርሺሳ ማዾሮ ጋላቱዋቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 150:2">ቤቃያ ባኣያ ማዔ ዼኤፑሞሮ ዒዛ ጋላቱዋቴ።<verse eid="PSA 150:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 150:3"/>ዛዬ ዋርቂ ዒዛ ጋላቱዋቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 150:3">ጎኦላንታ ዺቢ ሻሺና ዴንሢ ዋርቆ ጎኦሎዋ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 150:3">ዋርቂ ዋርቂ ዒዛ ጋላቱዋቴ።<verse eid="PSA 150:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 150:4"/>ካራቤ ባዒ ዒዛ ቦንቾም ዓጊፂ ዓጊፂ ጋላቱዋቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 150:4">ጎኦላንታ ሹሉንጎንታ ዋርቂ ዒዛ ጋላቱዋቴ።<verse eid="PSA 150:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 150:5"/>ዑኡቱቡሎ ዎሺ ዎሺ ዒዛ ጋላቱዋቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 150:5">ዑኡዛ ኮሺ ሚዛጳ ዑኡቱቡሎናኣ ዒዛ ጋላቱዋቴ።<verse eid="PSA 150:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 150:6"/>ሼምፔና ዓኣያ ማዔ ማዢንታ ቢያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 150:6">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ጋላቱዋቴ!</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 150:6"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 150:6">ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ጋላቲንቶም!<verse eid="PSA 150:6"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 150"/>
</usx>
